      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sarith, City of Tides [zone=808]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 91\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 16 23:33:59 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | **Veil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Chef Rolland in Sarith (located at 100, -450, -1 -- inside a building: from inside the front gate, head east -- it's the second building on your left)._\n_Pre-requisites for requesting the task:_\n\\- No tasks\n\\- Level 91\n\\- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Chef Rolland'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'I'm so busy holding down the fort here \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, but I want to help the [rebels] out! Would you mind going out and fishing up what I need to prepare a proper meal for them? If you could, I've got a [list] and could make it worth your time!'\nYou say, 'What list is that?'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'Excellent! I need you to collect squids, salt-water piranha, and king crabs. These can be found in the ocean, but watch out for the giant sea creatures when you're in there.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Meal for the Rebels'.\nChef Rolland wishes to prepare a special meal for the Sarith rebels. The Alaran's tasks at the general store are preventing them from collecting the various fish they need. You've been asked to collect the fish for Rolland.\n\n---\n\nKill 4 large squids 0/4 (Sarith)\nKill 4 salt-water piranhas 0/4 (Sarith)\nKill 2 king crabs 0/2 (Sarith)\nSpeak with Chef Rolland 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Chef Rolland'\nChef Rolland says, in Alaran, 'This would make a delicious meal for the Sarith rebels.'\n_Reward:_\n123pp 3gp 3sp 3cp + experience",
