      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 60\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nMinstrel Eoweril may be found in the Library of Knowledge at 89, 848, -60.\nMinstrel Eoweril says 'Hail and well met, my friend. New Tanaan greets you most warmly and is grateful to have you in our midst. All residents of this great Plane of Knowledge have come together in recent times with the unexpected, though warmly embraced presence of Norrathian visitors. We hope that we might be able to aid you in lending our wisdom and timeless knowledge wherever possible to your cause. I wish I could do more, my friend, but I am but a humble bard and my services may only benefit those of like profession. However, if you believe that my services could be of use, then do not hesitate to peruse my inventory and purchase what you will. If by chance you come across a curious parchment or other arcane item of seemingly unidentifiable purpose, then do not hesitate to bring it to me. Besides having composed many a song in my day, I do know a thing or two regarding mysteries of the planes' magics.'\nEthereal Parchments give level 61 and 62 songs.\nSpectral Parchments give level 63 and 64 songs.\nGlyphed Rune Words give level 65 songs.\nMinstrel Eoweril take [sic] the item from you and begins to humm [sic] softly, the item changes in his hands as the words take form into melody.\nMinstrel Eoweril take the item from you and begins to humm softly, the item changes in his hands as the words take form into melody.\nMinstrel Eoweril take the item from you and begins to humm softly, the item changes in his hands as the words take form into melody.\nMinstrel Eoweril take the item from you and begins to humm softly, the item changes in his hands as the words take form into melody. Rewards:\n- Song: Angstlich's Echo of Terror [Norrath's Keepers]\n- Song: Call of the Banshee [item=16582]\n- Song: Chorus of Marr [item=16581]\n- Song: Dreams of Terris [item=16580]\n- Song: Dreams of Thule [item=16575]\n- Song: Druzzil's Disillusionment [item=16572]\n- Song: Harmony of Sound [item=16586]\n- Song: Lullaby of Morell [item=16585]\n- Song: Melody of Mischief [item=16573]\n- Song: Psalm of Veeshan [item=16578]\n- Song: Requiem of Time [item=16583]\n- Song: Rizlona's Call of Flame [item=16579]\n- Song: Silent Song of Quellious [item=16571]\n- Song: Tuyen's Chant of Fire [item=16584]\n- Song: Tuyen's Chant of Ice [item=16577]\n- Song: Tuyen's Chant of Venom [item=16576]\n- Song: Tuyen's Chant of the Plague [item=29786]\n- Song: Warsong of Zek [item=16574]\n- Song: Wind of Marr [item=22115]\n- Spell: Angstlich's Echo of Terror [Dark Reign]\n[",
