      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis part of Gates of Discord progression follows your having accessed Qvic [quest=7598].\nNote: If you're Level 65+, you have access to Txevu by default. Presented here is the official access quest.\nSplinter of the High Temple\nBy now, you should have a \"Sliver of the High Temple\" (Ikkinz Raid #4) and a \"Fragment of the High Temple\" (Uqua raid). Now, you're in need of a \"Splinter of the High Temple\".\nThis item is rewarded from the Inktu'ta, the Unmasked Chapel [quest=4480] raid expedition (see the link for details). Just hail the Sentinel that spawns at the raid's end, and you'll receive the item.\nThis raid is given out by Aganetti the Keeper in the Trusik caves of Qvic.\nCipher of Txevu\nFind Brevik Kalaner (click for map image), a High Elf found on the topside of the ship in the Abysmal Sea at /loc 700, -230. Hail him.\nHe requires the following items:\n- Sliver of the High Temple (looted in Ikkinz Raid #4)\n- Fragment of the High Temple (obtained from the Specter of Barxt after Uqua completion)\n- Splinter of the High Temple (obtained from An Ancient Sentinel after Inktu'ta completion)\nIf you don't have any of these items when you hail him, you see:\nBrevik Kalaner says 'Greetings. I'd love to chat but I must get back to my studies. I've been learning as much as I can about geomancy and its uses. Good day.'\nIf you have one or two of the three items when you hail him, you see:\nBrevik Kalaner says 'Hello. I see you've been busy. I've heard of your exploits from the scouts in the mountains and it seems you're close to uncovering the mystery of Txevu. Return to me when you have more information.'\nIf you hand him only one of the items, you see:\nBrevik Kalaner says 'You've found a sliver from the high temple deep within the mountains! I'm impressed. Do you have anything else or do you [need this back]?'\nYou say, 'I need this back!'\nBrevik Kalaner says 'Here is your sliver from the high temple.'\nBrevik Kalaner says 'Please keep it safe until you can recover whatever else goes along with it.'\nIf you have all three items in your inventory, you see:\nBrevik Kalaner says 'I've been expecting you. You have all three pieces to complete the mystery of Txevu. Give them to me and I will use what geomantic knowledge I have to form them into a totem of stone that will carry the trusik essence.'\nGive him the three pieces of the High Temple:\nBrevik Kalaner takes the three stone pieces from you and wraps them in a soft hide covered with glyphs. He mutters some strange words and the stones begin to glow and undulate beneath the hide. You see a wind of souls swirl around you and become absorbed in the stone. 'The essence of the trusik has been imbued into this stone. With one touch of this totem, the guardian of Txevu will recognize the spirit of its masters and let you pass.'\nYou receive the \"Cipher of Txevu\", which is the key to Txevu, Lair of the Elite.\nMoving On\nYou can now move onto the next part of Gates of Discord progression: Keying in Txevu & Requesting the Tacvi raid [quest=7680].\nSubmitted by: Saraban Luvanir of Darkwind guildRewards:\n- Cipher of Txevu [item=30340]\n[",
    },
