      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Expedition\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is a single group trial.\nYou say, 'Hail, Projection of Power'\nProjection of Power says 'Halt, Wood Elf, and hear my words.  Your background and your status are of no consequence. All are welcome to participate in the trials to prove their worth, or die trying.  Whosoever approaches me has addressed the embodiment of Power, keeper of the trials of Destruction and Corruption.  The former is a small-scale test, while the latter is large-scale.  My task is to explain the rules and usher hopefuls into the battle arena.  Would you like to hear the rules for [small-scale] or [large-scale] trials, or do you wish to enroll in [Destruction] or [Corruption]?'\nYou say, 'What small-scale trials?'\nProjection of Power says 'Every test has its rules and these trials are no exception.  The following guidelines must be followed to the letter, or else you stand to forfeit or perish.  You are allowed no more than six participants in the battle.  Once the trial has begun, you must remain in the combat area.  Violators of this rule will be warned and then destroyed.  Your progress will be carefully monitored.  If you take too long, you will fail.  These are the rules and they are not negotiable.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about the Destruction trial.'\nProjection of Power says 'To conquer worlds requires the capability to annihilate vast areas.  How much devastation can you inflict in as short a time as possible?  Can you cut a swathe in the ranks of your enemy and destroy them with impunity?  If you have this ability, now is the opportunity to prove your worth!'\nThe direction to the entry to your instanced zone(s) have been marked on your compass.\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Proving Grounds: The Mastery of Destruction.\nYou say, 'Hail, Master of Destruction'\nMaster of Destruction says 'Is that your BREATH..or did something die in here..now go away!'\nYou begin to sneak...\nMaster of Destruction regards you indifferently -- looks kind of dangerous.\nYou say, 'Hail, Master of Destruction'\nMaster of Destruction says 'This is the Mastery of Destruction trial.  You must demonstrate your ability to annihilate your enemies, destroying as many opponents as possible within a given time frame.  Are you ready to [begin]?'\nYou stop sneaking.\nYou say, 'We are ready to begin.'\nThe trial has begun. You cannot bring any additional people into your expedition at this time.\nThis trial is straightforward. It requires massive DPS. You must kill 20 mobs (names?), spawning 1-3 at a time, within 15 minutes. Once you've accomplished that, at 15 minutes, the Master of Destruction will become targetable. Don't waste too much time waiting to pull him, because he gains strength as time goes by. Drop the Master in order to win.\nA Shell of the Master will spawn with the loot.\nNeed all dialogues, all mobs/abilities/levels, items, lockout timers on success/failure, etc.Rewards:\n- Eye of the Lightninglord [item=32167]\n- Glowing Muramite Rune [item=30539]\n- Greater Muramite Rune [item=30538]\n- Horn of Doomcalling [item=31731]\n- Journal of the Prime Disciple [item=35121]\n- Tri-Spined Spaulders of Destruction [item=32166]\n[",
