ct of Power\" (comes with \"a diminutive construct\")\nUpon successful completion, a Shell of the Master spawns with some loot for the raid.\nThis trial results in the Mastery of Realms Rune, one of six pieces needed for Citadel of Anguish access.Submitted by: Saraban, DarkwindRewards:\n- Belt of Inevitable Conversion [item=32693]\n- Boots of Altered Perception [item=32696]\n- Boots of Shifting Time [item=32682]\n- Glowing Muramite Rune [item=30539]\n- Greater Muramite Rune [item=30538]\n- Mastery of Realms Rune [item=33017]\n- Matchless Silvery Claymore [item=32351]\n- Ring of Fluid Perception [item=32694]\n- Sandals of Constant Change [item=32697]\n- Sapphire Choker of Adaptation [item=32683]\n- Seal: Mastery of All [item=33023]\n- Soulskive [item=31586]\n- Supple Slippers of Transformation [item=32698]\n- Veil of Intense Evolution [item=32695]\n- Wand of Twisted Fate [item=32684]\n[",
