      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nClick here for an overview of cultural armor introduced with Dragons of Norrath.\nERUDIN (Paineel Below)\nFind Gorion Telld`Mare in Erudin, found by Soulbinder Altira Mamar and the Priest of Discord.\nItems to return for the Ancestral Erudite Armor book:\nBelt Pouch (bought and dropped off random low level mobs)\nBathide Wristband (dropped in The Warrens)\nBamboo Wakizashi Bo (dropped in The Warrens)\nKobold Finger Bones (dropped in The Warrens)\nTask given for the Journeyman's Book:\n1) Kill 20 Kerrans in Kerra Island\n2) Loot four Catman Skins\n3) Give Catman Skins to Gorion\n4) Kill 10 Kerra Pumas\n5) Loot four Medium Quality Cat pelts\n6) Give Pelts to Gorion\nTask given for Expert's Book:\n1) Kill 50 Highland Tigers in the Stonebrunt Mountains\n2) Loot 20 Low Quality Cat Pelts\n3) Give Pelts to Gorion\n4) Kill five Mature Pandas\n5) Loot one Panda Pelt\n6) Give Pelt to Gorion\nTask given for Master's Book:\n1) Kill 80 Bulthars in Siren's Grotto\n2) Loot 40 Bulthar Trunks\n3) Give Bulthar Trunks to Gorion\n4) Kill five Sirens\n5) Loot one Siren Parts\n6) Give Siren Parts to Gorion\nTask given for Grandmaster's Book:\n1) Kill 120 Denizens of Thundercrest\n2) Loot 80 Fractured Drake Claws\n3) Give Fractured Drake Claws to Gorion\n4) Kill 10 Denizens of Thundercrest\n5) Loot 1 Razor-Sharp Drake Claw\n6) Give the Razor-Sharp Drake Claw to Gorion\n..........................................................................................\nPAINEEL\nFind Korzan Virimove in Paineel in the courtyard at the bottom of building that the elevator is in, across the way from the LDoN NPC.\nYou say, 'Hail, Korzan Virimove'\nKorzan Virimove says 'Hello, _____. If you'll excuse me, I'm trying to study these [inscriptions] and you are blocking my light.\"\nYou say, 'What inscriptions?'\nKorzan Virimove says 'These inscriptions are from a stone tablet that was found in the bottom of the Hole.  They detail a forgotten methodology for making Erudite armor. These patterns were created by our ancestors before our race was divided. It staggers my mind to think what we Erudites could have lost such a legacy. These armor [designs] are unlike anything I've ever seen before.\"\nYou say, 'What designs?'\nKorzan Virimove says 'Yes, it's very difficult to explain without the actual armor patterns to look at.  Would you like a copy of these ancestral armor patterns? I can create a pattern [book] for you, provided you can bring me the necessary ingredients. I may also have some additional armor [patterns] provided you are willing to help me with my research.\"\nYou say, 'What book?'\nKorzan Virimove says 'Very well. I will need a belt pouch for the cover, a bamboo wakizashi bo for the spine, a kobold finger bone for the clasp, and a bathide wristband to grind down and make a salve which will protect and preserve the finished product. I have heard these items can be found in the Warrens. Return with them and the pattern book shall be yours.'\nQuest Items to get your Ancestral Book:\nBelt Pouch (bought and dropped off random low level mobs)\nBathide Wristband (dropped in The Warrens)\nBamboo Wakizashi Bo (dropped in The Warrens)\nKobold Finger Bones (dropped in The Warrens)\nIn Erudin:\nGorion Telld`Mare says 'Excellent work ______. Here are the armor patterns worn by our ancestors. May they serve you well. It will take me some time to decipher the entirety of these patterns. Return to me later and we'll talk of what more can be gleaned from these artifacts.'\nYou receive Ancestral Erudite Armor.\nYou say, 'What patterns?'\nKorzan Virimove says 'The meanings of the more advanced inscriptions continue to elude me. I've long ago exhausted this city's vast libraries. Now, I require a field agent to seek out new information and artifacts. Would you be interested in leading expeditions to [Kerra Isle], the [Stonebrunt], [Siren's Grotto], or the newly discovered [valley] beyond lavastorm mountains? If you are able to revover more information for me, I can further my studies and reward you with more armor patterns drafted by our anscestors. What say you?'\nTask given to get your Journeyman's Book:\n1) Kill 20 Kerrans in Kerra Island\n2) Loot four Catman Skins\n3) Give Catman Skins to Gorion\n4) Kill 10 Kerra Pumas\n5) Loot four Medium Quality Cat pelts\n6) Give Pelts to Gorion\nTask given to get your Expert's Book:\n1) Kill 50 Highland Tigers in the Stonebrunt Mountains\n2) Loot 20 Low Quality Cat Pelts\n3) Give Pelts to Gorion\n4) Kill five Mature Pandas\n5) Loot one Panda Pelt\n6) Give Pelt to Gorion\nTask given to get your Master's Book:\n1) Kill 80 Bulthars in Siren's Grotto\n2) Loot 40 Bulthar Trunks\n3) Give Bulthar Trunks to Gorion\n4) Kill five Sirens\n5) Loot one Siren Parts\n6) Give Siren Parts to Gorion\nTask given to get your Grandmaster's Book:\n1) Kill 120 Denizens of Thundercrest\n2) Loot 80 Fractured Drake Claws\n3) Give Fractured Drake Claws to Gorion\n4) Kill 10 Denizens of Thundercrest\n5) Loot 1 Razor-Sharp Drake Claw\n6) Give the Razor-Sharp Drake Claw to Gorion\nTypes of Armor\nMoonsilver - Enchanter, Magician, Necromancer, Wizard\nSeashine - Cleric, Paladin, ShadowknightRewards:\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Armband [item=45667]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Boots [item=45668]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Breeches [item=45669]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Cap [item=45670]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Gloves [item=45671]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Robes [item=38094]\n- Elaborate Moonsilver Sleeves [item=45672]\n- Elaborate Seashine Armband [item=65041]\n- Elaborate Seashine Boots [item=65039]\n- Elaborate Seashine Cuirass [item=62606]\n- Elaborate Seashine Gloves [item=62609]\n- Elaborate Seashine Greaves [item=62607]\n- Elaborate Seashine Helm [item=62610]\n- Elaborate Seashine Sleeves [item=62608]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Armband [item=71989]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Boots [item=72088]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Breeches [item=70879]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Cap [item=71988]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Gloves [item=70513]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Robes [item=71705]\n- Elegant Moonsilver Sleeves [item=72089]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Armband [item=38500]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Boots [item=38533]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Breeches [item=38532]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Cap [item=45674]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Gloves [item=38093]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Robes [item=38498]\n- Intricate Moonsilver Sleeves [item=38499]\n- Intricate Seashine Armband [item=65040]\n- Intricate Seashine Boots [item=64597]\n- Intricate Seashine Cuirass [item=63397]\n- Intricate Seashine Gloves [item=65042]\n- Intricate Seashine Greaves [item=63398]\n- Intricate Seashine Helm [item=64598]\n- Intricate Seashine Sleeves [item=63777]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Armband [item=38098]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Boots [item=38099]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Breeches [item=38100]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Cap [item=38101]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Gloves [item=38102]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Robes [item=36454]\n- Ornate Moonsilver Sleeves [item=38097]\n- Ornate Seashine Armband [item=37570]\n- Ornate Seashine Boots [item=37571]\n- Ornate Seashine Cuirass [item=37572]\n- Ornate Seashine Gloves [item=37573]\n- Ornate Seashine Greaves [item=37574]\n- Ornate Seashine Helm [item=37575]\n- Ornate Seashine Sleeves [item=37576]\n- Seals of Darkhollow [item=44967]\n- Simple Moonsilver Armband [item=36765]\n- Simple Moonsilver Boots [item=36767]\n- Simple Moonsilver Breeches [item=38095]\n- Simple Moonsilver Cap [item=38096]\n- Simple Moonsilver Gloves [item=36766]\n- Simple Moonsilver Robes [item=45673]\n- Simple Moonsilver Sleeves [item=36768]\n- Simple Seashine Armband [item=37626]\n- Simple Seashine Boots [item=37627]\n- Simple Seashine Cuirass [item=37628]\n- Simple Seashine Gloves [item=37629]\n- Simple Seashine Greaves [item=37630]\n- Simple Seashine Helm [item=3763