      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nClick here for an overview of cultural armor introduced with Dragons of Norrath.\nFind Zermak in Grobb, in the room behind the bar standing near the brew barrel.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zermak'\nZermak says 'Yer looking a might bit uncomfortable dere, ______. Whadda matter? Your [armor] chafing you?'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nZermak says 'Tell me 'bout it. Da only armor we trolls ever get is whats we can pull from our victims. Nothing fits and we're always clatt'ring around. Tell ye what though, the last stint I did was a job for dem dark elves, marching with the armies of Lanys T'Vyl. Vile, that woman is, but I'll say dis for 'er -- she fixed us up with some pretty good battle mail. It's easier to wear dan da trash you're wearin' and it's lighter dan anything one of us could craft. You should fix yourself up with some of dis [design].'\nYou say, 'What design?'\nZermak says 'Heh heh. Before I left Lany's army, I stole da armor patterns made fo' us troll troops. Had to bash dat dark elf artisan good to get him to let go, but I got 'em! Tell you what -- I can't give away my only copy, but if you bring me da [ingredients] to make another pattern book, I can fix you up with a book of yer own. Or mebbe you already got a book and you need sometin [more].'\nYou say, 'What ingredients?'\nZermak says 'Good. Good. First I need a fire beetle carapace for the cover, den a patch of zombie skin for the pages, a golden bandit tooth for the clasp, and a lion tail for the spine. I hear dese ting can be found in the Western Karanas so bring dem to me and I make a pattern book for you, ya?'\nQuest Items to get your Ancestral Book:\nFire Beetle Carapace, Zombie Skin, Golden Bandit Tooth, Lion Tail\nHand in the items:\nZermak says '______, you are one smarts troll to come up with dese tings so quick.  It too bad we can't fight together under Lanys no more.  Me and you could have bashed some elf heads in good, no?  Heh, heh, here's your pattern book.'\nYou say, 'More?'\nZermak says 'Da armor in dat book is nice an' all, but dey could be better. Mebbe I give you patterns for reinforcements if you do some tings to prove yerself. I got some other patterns, but you prolly not ready for all of dem yet. I give you patterns dependin on what you can do in [Highpass], [Lower Guk], [Old Sebilis] an' da [valley] beyond Lavastorm.'\nJourneyman's Book of Troll Culture\nYou say, 'Highpass.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Hotly Contested'.\nZermak says 'Pesky lil gnolls need to be taught a lessin. Dey always chargin' Highpass Keep yelling about the glory of Zek. Den dey get wasted by dem hoomanz and bring shame to the big Zek war face. Wait by the gate and kill dem gnolls before the humans do. . . den bring me back dere rain water.'\nHotly Contested:\n1) Kill 20 Gnolls in Highpass Hold\n2) Loot four Rain Waters\n3) Deliver Rain Waters to Zermak\n4) Kill 10 Smugglers in Highpass Hold\n5) Loot one Human Blood\n6) Deliver Blood to Zermak\nGood. Dat work nicely. You earned yerself some reinforment [sic] patterns.\nYou receive the Journeyman's Book of Troll Culture.\nExpert's Book of Troll Culture\nYou say, 'Lower Guk?'\nZermak says 'I tink you ready to get some revenge on dem froggies. Dey can't kick us out da Grobb and not pay da price! Go to der old city and scout tings out a bit! Sneak in dere amongst de undead ghoul froggies and rip 'em apart. Bring me dey phos-frus. Mebbe when you get back we see if you up for some warrin' with de real live froggies.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Takin' da Fight to da Froggies'.\nTakin' da Fight to da Froggies:\n1) Kill 50 Froglok Ghoul in Lower Guk\n2) Loot 20 Phosphorous Powder\n3) Deliver Phosphorous Powder to Zermak\n4) Kill five Froglok Wan Knights in Lower Guk\n5) Loot one Froglok Meat\n6) Deliver one Froglok Meat to Zermak\nYa! Dem froggies never knew what hit dem! Take dese patterns, dey make yer armer better.\nYou receive the Expert's Book of Troll Culture.\nMaster's Book of Troll Culture\nYou say, 'Old Sebilis.'\nZermak says 'De tuffest froggies are da sebilis froggies. Once you can handle dem, you can handle just bout any kind o froggy. Go deep into da ruins and flatten dem krup froglok good. Bring me back soma dose wax flowers day carry. Day look real pret. . . Um, I mean, day good for luring frogloks into me club. Har Har! Ya know wat I mean. . . Right?'\nTask given to get your Master's Book:\n1) Kill 80 Froglok Krups in Sebilis\n2) Loot 40 Wax Flower\n3) Deliver 40 Wax Flowers to Zermak\n4) Kill five Froglok Ilis Shaman in Old Sebilis\n5) Loot one Nodding Blue Lily\n6) Deliver one Nodding Blue Lily to Zermak\nReceive Master's Book.\nGrandmaster's Book of Troll Culture\nTask given to get your Grandmaster's Book:\n1) Kill 120 Lavaspinners in Lavaspinner's Lair\n2) Loot 80 Arachnid Eye Clusters\n3) Deliver 4 Arachnid Eye Clusters to Zermak\n4) Kill 10 Lavaspinners in Lavaspinner's Lair\n5) Loot 1 Deadly Arachnid Mandibles\n6) Deliver one Deadly Arachnid Mandible to Zermak\nTypes of Armor\nBeastlord - Reaver\nBerserker - Ravager\nShadowknight - Nightkeeper\nShaman - Ravager\nWarrior - NightkeeperRewards:\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Armband [item=39248]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Boots [item=39247]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Cuirass [item=37450]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Gloves [item=56499]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Greaves [item=37451]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Helm [item=37746]\n- Elaborate Nightkeeper Sleeves [item=56500]\n- Elaborate Ravager Armband [item=46274]\n- Elaborate Ravager Boots [item=46275]\n- Elaborate Ravager Cuirass [item=37441]\n- Elaborate Ravager Gloves [item=46276]\n- Elaborate Ravager Greaves [item=46277]\n- Elaborate Ravager Helm [item=46278]\n- Elaborate Ravager Sleeves [item=36779]\n- Elaborate Reaver Armband [item=46289]\n- Elaborate Reaver Boots [item=46290]\n- Elaborate Reaver Cuirass [item=39249]\n- Elaborate Reaver Gloves [item=46291]\n- Elaborate Reaver Greaves [item=46292]\n- Elaborate Reaver Helm [item=46293]\n- Elaborate Reaver Sleeves [item=46294]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Armband [item=71991]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Boots [item=71497]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Cuirass [item=69668]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Gloves [item=72144]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Greaves [item=70930]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Helm [item=72191]\n- Elegant Nightkeeper Sleeves [item=71990]\n- Exalted Book of Troll Culture [item=71091]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Armband [item=62941]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Boots [item=61391]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Cuirass [item=37452]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Gloves [item=59930]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Greaves [item=57051]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Helm [item=60348]\n- Intricate Nightkeeper Sleeves [item=62999]\n- Intricate Ravager Armband [item=46283]\n- Intricate Ravager Boots [item=46284]\n- Intricate Ravager Cuirass [item=38527]\n- Intricate Ravager Gloves [item=46285]\n- Intricate Ravager Greaves [item=46286]\n- Intricate Ravager Helm [item=46287]\n- Intricate Ravager Sleeves [item=46288]\n- Intricate Reaver Armband [item=36979]\n- Intricate Reaver Boots [item=36977]\n- Intricate Reaver Cuirass [item=36975]\n- Intricate Reaver Gloves [item=36980]\n- Intricate Reaver Greaves [item=36976]\n- Intricate Reaver Helm [item=36981]\n- Intricate Reaver Sleeves [item=36978]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Armband [item=37443]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Boots [item=37444]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Cuirass [item=37445]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Gloves [item=37446]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Greaves [item=37447]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Helm [item=37448]\n- Ornate Nightkeeper Sleeves [item=37449]\n- Ornate Ravager Armband [item=36386]\n- Ornate Ravager Boots [item=36388]\n- Ornate Ravager Cuirass [item=36390]\n- Ornate Ravager Gloves [item=36385]\n- Ornate Ravager Greaves [item=36389]\n- Ornate Ravager Helm [item=37516]\n- Ornate Ravager Sleeves [item=36387]\n- Ornate Reaver Armband [item=38109]\n- Ornate Reaver Boots [item=38110]\n- Ornate Reaver Cuirass [item=38111]\n- Ornate Reaver Gloves [item=38112]\n- Ornate Reaver Greaves [item=38113]\n- Ornate Reaver Helm [item=38114]\n- Ornate Reaver Sleeves [item=38115]\n- Seals of Darkhollow [item=44967]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Armband [item=37453]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Boots [item=37454]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Cuirass [item=37455]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Gloves [item=37456]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Greaves [item=37457]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Helm [item=36384]\n- Simple Nightkeeper Sleeves [item=37458]\n- Simple Ravager Armband [item=36928]\n- Simple Ravager Boots [item=36926]\n- Simple Ravager Cuirass [item=46279]\n- Simple Ravager Gloves [item=36927]\n- Simple Ravager Greaves [item=46280]\n- Simple Ravager Helm [item=46281]\n- Simple Ravager Sleeves [item=46282]\n- Simple Reaver Armband [item=38103]\n- Simple Reaver Boots [item=38104]\n- Simple Reaver Cuirass [item=38105]\n- Simple Reaver Gloves [item=38106]\n- Simple Reaver Greaves [item=38107]\n- Simple Reaver Helm [item=46295]\n- Simple Reaver Sleeves [item=38108]\n[",
