      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nClick here for an overview of cultural armor introduced with Dragons of Norrath.\nFind Garth Okken in Oggok at +262, -208 inside the armor shop next to the forge.\nItems required for Ancestral Ogre Armor Book:\n-Cat Skull Cap from A Pickclaw Mindripper (2nd floor of Runnyeye)\n-Fractured Femur from A Pickclaw Bonemender (2nd floor of Runnyeye)\n-Muddite Mud from Muddites (Gorge of King Xrobb)\n-Large Brick of Unrefined Ore\nYou say, 'Hail, Garth Okken'\nGarth Okken says 'Hrmph!  What der you want? A [clubbin]?'\nYou say, 'I want a clubbin'\nGarth Okken says 'You do wants a clubbin! Ha ha! You pass da test den! Anyone who wants a clubbin' from me must be too tuff for a clubbin! Leave me with jusa broken club! How you get to be so tuff, _____? You don't even wear da good [armor]!'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nGarth Okken says 'Aye, ha ha. Da gud armor! Normally ogres not good at making tings, just breakin' tings, ya? But dis one ogre, a crazy war face named Kizrak da Tyrant, he design da gud armor and gave me da [pattern] book. Told me to pass it out to da other tuff ogres. Since you tuff enough to ask me for a clubbin', you tuff enough for dis armor! Mebbe you even tuff enough to earn [medals].'\nYou say, 'What medals?'\nArtisan Garth Okken says 'Yah. If'n you think you ready fer something a lil more challengin', I can send you on many missions.  You take as many as you want.  To prove you good, you make impressions in book.  Da book do da work so you no worry about it.'\nTask given to get your Blessed Book of Ogre Culture: 'Blessed Impressions'\nTask given to get your Revered Book of Ogre Culture: 'Revered Impressions':\nTask given to get your Master's Book:\nDetails needed.\nTask given to get your Grandmaster's Book:\nDetails needed.\nSeals of Darkhollow\nYou say, 'What underground place?'\nGarth Okken says 'Da underground is open. Get me a Purty Geode. I give you new pattern book for seals.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Darkhollow Geode'.\nLoot 1 Large Darkhollow Geode (0/1) - ALL\nFind a Large Darkhollow Geode and bring it back.\n???\nReward:  Seals of Darkhollow\nTypes of Armor\nBeastlord - Bloodpact\nBerserker - Tyrant\nShadowknight - Warborn\nShaman - Tyrant\nWarrior - WarbornRewards:\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Armband [item=36983]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Boots [item=37470]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Cuirass [item=37953]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Gloves [item=36932]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Greaves [item=37954]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Helm [item=36982]\n- Elaborate Bloodpact Sleeves [item=36931]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Armband [item=37471]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Boots [item=37472]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Cuirass [item=36945]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Gloves [item=37473]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Greaves [item=37999]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Helm [item=37474]\n- Elaborate Tyrant Sleeves [item=36946]\n- Elaborate Warborn Armband [item=38198]\n- Elaborate Warborn Boots [item=38199]\n- Elaborate Warborn Cuirass [item=37952]\n- Elaborate Warborn Gloves [item=38200]\n- Elaborate Warborn Greaves [item=38201]\n- Elaborate Warborn Helm [item=38202]\n- Elaborate Warborn Sleeves [item=38203]\n- Elegant Bloodpact Boots [item=71690]\n- Elegant Bloodpact Cuirass [item=71347]\n- Elegant Bloodpact Gloves [item=71618]\n- Elegant Bloodpact Greaves [item=72010]\n- Elegant Bloodpact Helm [item=74166]\n- Elegant Tyrant Armband [item=72546]\n- Elegant Tyrant Boots [item=72290]\n- Elegant Tyrant Cuirass [item=71368]\n- Elegant Tyrant Gloves [item=74177]\n- Elegant Tyrant Greaves [item=70911]\n- Elegant Tyrant Helm [item=71628]\n- Elegant Tyrant Sleeves [item=75060]\n- Elegant Warborn Sleeves [item=74794]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Armband [item=36991]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Boots [item=36992]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Cuirass [item=36993]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Gloves [item=36994]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Greaves [item=36995]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Helm [item=36996]\n- Intricate Bloodpact Sleeves [item=36997]\n- Intricate Tyrant Armband [item=37482]\n- Intricate Tyrant Boots [item=37483]\n- Intricate Tyrant Cuirass [item=37484]\n- Intricate Tyrant Gloves [item=37485]\n- Intricate Tyrant Greaves [item=36855]\n- Intricate Tyrant Helm [item=37486]\n- Intricate Tyrant Sleeves [item=37487]\n- Intricate Warborn Armband [item=38191]\n- Intricate Warborn Boots [item=38192]\n- Intricate Warborn Cuirass [item=38193]\n- Intricate Warborn Gloves [item=38194]\n- Intricate Warborn Greaves [item=38195]\n- Intricate Warborn Helm [item=38196]\n- Intricate Warborn Sleeves [item=38197]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Armband [item=36984]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Boots [item=36985]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Cuirass [item=36986]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Gloves [item=36987]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Greaves [item=36988]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Helm [item=36989]\n- Ornate Bloodpact Sleeves [item=36990]\n- Ornate Tyrant Armband [item=36885]\n- Ornate Tyrant Boots [item=36886]\n- Ornate Tyrant Cuirass [item=36887]\n- Ornate Tyrant Gloves [item=36888]\n- Ornate Tyrant Greaves [item=36889]\n- Ornate Tyrant Helm [item=36890]\n- Ornate Tyrant Sleeves [item=36891]\n- Ornate Warborn Armband [item=37959]\n- Ornate Warborn Boots [item=38185]\n- Ornate Warborn Cuirass [item=38186]\n- Ornate Warborn Gloves [item=38187]\n- Ornate Warborn Greaves [item=38188]\n- Ornate Warborn Helm [item=38189]\n- Ornate Warborn Sleeves [item=38190]\n- Seals of Darkhollow [item=44967]\n- Simple Bloodpact Armband [item=35356]\n- Simple Bloodpact Boots [item=35357]\n- Simple Bloodpact Cuirass [item=35358]\n- Simple Bloodpact Gloves [item=35359]\n- Simple Bloodpact Greaves [item=35360]\n- Simple Bloodpact Helm [item=35361]\n- Simple Bloodpact Sleeves [item=35362]\n- Simple Tyrant Armband [item=37475]\n- Simple Tyrant Boots [item=37476]\n- Simple Tyrant Cuirass [item=37477]\n- Simple Tyrant Gloves [item=37478]\n- Simple T