      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 24\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis raid task begins with Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor (click for map image) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains. It has a 2-day, 20-hour lockout timer.\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Level 69+\n- Minimum 6 players; maximum 24 players\n- Must be high amiable faction with Norrath's Keepers\n- Completion of all Tier 2 tasks and flags\n- Completion of \"Protect the Waters\"\n- Completion of \"The Sacred Scrolls\"\n- Completion of \"Snowfoot Revenge\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor'\nLieutenant Ekiltu Verlor says 'Those faithful to the way of Norrath's Keepers may take on the greatest challenges and prove their worth to Firiona Vie.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Trial of Perseverance'.\nThere are still more parchments and tomes we wish to learn about in Stillmoon Temple. Some of these documents may provide the Dark Reign with the ability to bring ruin to the world. You must use your strength, stamina, and wherewithal to uncover these scrolls and secure them before Dark Reign can get their hands on them.\nTask Steps\nTouch the portal to Stillmoon Temple 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nApproach Osashi 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\nTASK LOCKS HERE\nKill the goblin warlord 0/1 (Stillmoon Temple)\nThe Event\nThe entrance to the instance is a portal in the north-central part of the Broodlands (will be marked on your compass).\nIn the instanced zone, find Osashi close to the zone-in area and speak with him:\nYou say, 'Hail, Osashi'\nOsashi says 'You have come at the goblins' behest?  Very well.  Perseverance is important to all, regardless of what you seek, be it wealth, knowledge, or power.  This trial will show me just how committed you are to obtain your desires.  When you being this trial, several goblins will wait near the gong and attempt to ring it after one minute.  Do not let this happen and you shall prove yourself in this trial.  Are you [ready] to begin?'\nYou say, 'We're ready!'\na Stillmoon goblin says 'Someone ring the bell!  Summon help!'\nOsashi immediately despawns and 4x \"a Stillmoon goblin\" appear around the bell next to him.\nAll goblins in this event must be kept aggro'd. If any goblin is left idle for any longer than 10-15 seconds, it \"rings the bell\". If you allow this to happen, then you get \"an Ancient Stillmoon Guardian\" instead of the goblin warlord. This represents a failure, and you'll have to repeat the event.\nWhen you kill \"a Stillmoon goblin\", another one spawns in its place. These mobs are NOT auto-aggro, and due to line-of-sight, you'll have to keep watch to make sure none are left idle. These goblins hit for a max ~1,100 and are immune to mez and stun.\nAfter a certain number of goblin kills, \"a Stillmoon warlord\" appears. This mob hits for a max ~1,600; AE rampages; and casts \"Gelid Breath\":\nGelid Breath: Targeted AE 20', Cold (-275) (2 minutes)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 1250\n2: Decrease Chance to Hit by 10% with 1H Blunt\n3: Decrease Effective Casting Level by 12\n4: Increase Curse Counter by 50\nCompletion & Loot\nKill the warlord to complete the task:\na Stillmoon warlord has been slain by _____!\na Stillmoon warlord's corpse mutters an ancient curse as you end his life.\nBeyond the wildest dreams and plans of the creatures that call Stillmoon their home, you have defeated the Trial of Perseverance and bested them all!\nIt drops 6x \"Goblin Warlord's Beads\" (progression item) + 1 item from this loot table:\nBracer of the Warriors\nHoop of the Drakeborn\nIcefloe Hammer\nStillmoon Silk Bracer\nTask Rewards:\n13 Radiant Crystals\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction turn-in [quest=3134] item)\nNote: If doing this raid as part of progression, you'll want to check in with some NPCs to make sure your flags are up to date. See this quest entry [quest=3061] for more details.Submitted by: Saraban of DarkwindRewards:\n- Bracer of the Warriors [item=35031]\n- Goblin Warlord's Beads [item=35032]\n- Hoop of the Drakeborn [item=35807]\n- Icefloe Hammer [item=34978]\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]\n- Stillmoon Silk Bracer [item=35526]\n[",
