      walkthrough = "**Time:** 1 Hour\n**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther (click for map image) who may be found at the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of the Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470).\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Level 65+\n- Minimum \"indifferent\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Greed of the Goblins'.\nAs sad as it makes us all, it would seem the Dark Reign has made a bargain with the goblins of the Stillmoon Temple. Whatever the deal that was made, the goblins have been extremely hostile toward Norrath's Keepers. Their numbers are so great that many of our beloved kin have been slaughtered. We need to lessen the threat of the goblins to us all and I believe you are perfect for this task, so please kill 11 Stillmoon laborers.\nKill 11 Stillmoon laborers 0/11 (Stillmoon Temple)\nOnly \"a Stillmoon laborer\" counts toward this kill step. These are found anywhere where goblins can spawn. Upon killing the 11th, you see:\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's KeepersSubmitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Cash, faction\n[",
