      walkthrough = "**Time:** 1 Hour\n**Level:** 67\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis solo task begins with Private Nylaen Kel`Ther (click for map image) in the Norrath's Keepers camp in the caves of Lavastorm Mountains (/loc 3750, 470).\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Level 67+\n- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Norrath's Keepers\n- Completion of all Tier 1 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Private Nylaen Kel`Ther'\nPrivate Nylaen Kel`Ther says 'We all have the opportunity to rise to greatness with Norrath's Keepers and our honorable allies across the lands.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Turn the Tides of the Sand'.\nThe goblins of the Stillmoon Temple are still battling with us, but we believe we may have learned a way to turn the tides of their anger. It is not a pleasant task and may seem counterproductive at first, but do heed my words. Their blood seems to be made partly of earth and with that blood, we can create an enchanted potion and perhaps make them see the error of their ways. Go loot 7 Sandy Goblin Blood so we can once and for all end the danger to the Keepers.\nLoot 7 Sandy Goblin Blood 0/7 (Stillmoon Temple)\nThe Sandy Goblin Blood is an uncommon drop from these goblins in Stillmoon Temple:\na Stillmoon dirt tender\na Stillmoon gravel warden\na Stillmoon laborer\na Stillmoon novice\na Stillmoon witchdoctor\nUpon looting the seventh item, you see:\n--You have looted a Sandy Goblin Blood.--\nYou have completed the task for Norrath's Keepers!\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got worse. (-10)\nExperience\n211 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Norrath's KeepersSubmitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Cash, faction, experience\n[",
