      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 24\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis raid task begins with Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor (click for map image) in the Norrath's Keepers camp of the Lavastorm Mountains.\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Minimum 6 players; maximum 24 players\n- Must be warmly faction with Norrath's Keepers\n- Completion of all Tier 4 tasks and flags (including the raids)\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Ekiltu Verlor'\nLieutenant Ekiltu Verlor says 'Those faithful to the way of Norrath's Keepers may take on the greatest challenges and prove their worth to Firiona Vie.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Curse of Ju`rek'.\nYou must travel into the Nest and learn as much as you can about the corruption of the place. There are a number of drakes in the caverns of the Nest that have been twisted somehow. We want you to look for a drake that has been rumored to be altered so significantly that it has unique magic. Go learn more about it and kill it if you can.\nTask Steps\nTouch the portal to the Nest 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nConfront Ju`rek the Corrupted 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\nTASK LOCKS HERE\nKill Ju`rek the Corrupted 0/1 (The Accursed Nest)\nThe Event\nThe entrance to the instance is in the southeastern part of the Broodlands. Once inside, head east across the bridge and through the doors. Ju`rek's lair is the SE room of east wing.\nJu`rek the Corrupted hits for a max ~2,300; flurries; has ~545,000 hitpoints; and casts two spells:\nDecaying Stench: PB AE 100', Disease (-600)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1800 per tick\n2: Increase Disease Counter by 45\nJu'Ok's Cry: Targeted AE 100', Poison (-550)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1500\n2: Stun (10.00 sec)\nAlso, Ju`rek spawns multiple adds called \"a harsh wind\" in waves as its health goes down. These proc \"Freezing Blast\"; have relatively few hitpoints; and are mezzable, but not stunnable:\nFreezing Blast: PB AE 100', Magic (-300)\n1: Decrease HP when cast by 1000\n2: Decrease Movement by 70%\nCompletion & Loot\nKill Ju`rek the Corrupted to complete the task:\nJu`rek the Corrupted has been slain by ______!\nJu`rek the Corrupted's corpse falls to the ground, its massive wings beating no more.\nYour faction standing with Cursed Drakes got worse.\nYour faction standing with Vishimtar got worse.\nJu`rek has been slain! This is wonderful news. Perhaps with time the evil that lies within may be quelled.\nJu`rek drops 6x \"Diseased Wing Fragment\" (progression item) + 1 item from this loot table:\nBlack Banded Ring of Evisceration\nDark-Touched Mantle\nEarring of Contemplation\nHammer of the Last Clutch\n18 Radiant Crystals\n1x \"Norrath's Keepers Token\" (faction turn-in [quest=3134] item)\nNote: If doing this raid as part of progression, you'll want to check in with some NPCs to make sure your flags are up to date. See this quest entry [quest=3061] for more details.Rewards:\n- Black Banded Ring of Evisceration [item=38559]\n- Dark-Touched Mantle [item=38536]\n- Diseased Wing Fragments [item=34899]\n- Earring of Contemplation [item=37094]\n- Hammer of the Last Clutch [item=34900]\n- Norrath's Keepers Token [item=34991]\n- Radiant Crystal [item=34988]\n[",
