      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis group mission begins with Officer Vacax Rol`Tas (click for map image) in the Dark Reign camp of the Lavastorm Mountains.\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Average group level minimum 68\n- Minimum \"indifferent\" faction with Dark Reign\n- Completion of \"Blood of the Basilisk\"\n- Completion of \"Clearing the Path\"\n- Completion of \"The Burning Poison\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Vacax Rol`Tas'\nOfficer Vacax Rol`Tas laughs, 'These are indeed good days for the will of hate and fear. We will overcome the races of light and prevail. Pledge allegiance to Lanys T`Vyl!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Have Note Will Travel'.\nHm. I'm surprised to see you here. I won't say I'm pleased, but perhaps you may prove useful as I see you have survived other simple tasks thus far. Some believe the goblins in Tirranum's Delve plan to take up arms against us. You must go thwart their efforts. Should you fail, don't dare show your face here again.\nTouch the cave entrance to Tirranum's Delve 0/1 (The Broodlands)\nOnce in the Broodlands, your compass will guide your direction.\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Tirranun's Delve.\nLook for information on the source of the uprising 0/1 (Tirranum's Delve)\nKill goblins (many of them), watching for emotes. After about 20 kills, you'll occasionally see this emote upon death:\nThe goblin falls before being able to sound the alarm.\nKeep killing goblins until you see this:\nAs the Delvian falls to the ground you can hear a siren going off. Your presence has been made known. Quickly find the Goblin Task Master for the information you seek.\nNow, find and kill the Goblin Task Master, located at the northern entrance to the temple. It hits for a max ~1,100; has ~170,000 hitpoints; summons; is immune to stun/mez; and procs \"Goblin Headbutt\" (3-second stun).\nGoblin Task Master has been slain by _____!\nYour faction standing with Minions of Tirranun got worse.\nYour faction standing with Tirranun got worse.\nLoot one Letter from Tirranun 0/1 (Tirranun's Delve)\nLoot this from the task master's corpse.\nDefeat all the goblin guards on your way to the entrance 0/9 (Tirranum's Delve)\nQuickly make your way back to the entrance before you are caught 0/1 (Tirranum's Delve)\nKill 9x \"a Delve guard\" on your way out (you can't really miss them). They spawn in groups of three, but are stunnable and mezzable.\nUpon reaching the entrance, the task completes and you see:\nThe goblins were no match for you, but Dark Reign likely has more dangerous tasks in mind for you.\n39 Ebon Crystals\n1x \"Dark Reign Token\" (faction turn-in [quest=3579] item)Submitted by: Yther OreRewards:\n[",
    },
