      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 67\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFor an overview of the Dragons of Norrath expansion, see this wiki article.\nFor an overview of progression, see quest entries for Norrath's Keepers [quest=3061] and the Dark Reign [quest=3062].\nThis solo task begins with Officer Sirrikis Ryktor (click for map image) at the Dark Reign camp in the caves, /loc 3050, -350.\nPre-requisites for requesting this task:\n- Level 67+\n- Minimum \"amiable\" faction with Dark Reign\n- Completion of all Tier 1 tasks and flags\nYou say, 'Hail, Officer Sirrikis Ryktor'\nOfficer Sirrikis Ryktor says 'Perhaps you will find a path to the higher ranks of the Dark Reign -- a place I'm sure I shall find myself someday... someday.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Reap the Kirin Mind'.\nThose kirins in The Ascent that leads up the mountain into the clouds are truly abhorrent, but may serve a purpose to us. We believe they are highly intelligent if we understand our lore correctly. Should we be able to steal their knowledge, we may be able to use it against the dragons, or better, the light races of Norrath. We shall need a few samples to work on so loot 3 Pristine Kirin Brain.\nLoot 3 Pristine Kirin Brain 0/3 (The Ascent)\nThese drop from kirin mobs in the non-instanced Ascent zone. Upon looting the third item, the task completes and you see:\nYou have completed the task for the Dark Reign!\nYour faction standing with Dark Reign got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Lanys T`Vyl got better. (+10)\nYour faction standing with Firiona Vie got worse. (-10)\nYour faction standing with Norrath's Keepers got worse. (-10)\nExperience\n216 platinum, 5 gold, 6 silver, 2 copper\nFaction with Dark ReignRewards:\n[",
