    {
      id = "3423",
      title = "Black Orb of the Scrykin",
      exp = "11",
      exp_name = "Prophecy of Ro",
      min_lvl = 70,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = 130.0, x = -1040.0, z = 0.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn",
        "What real magic?",
        "real magic",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 48509, name = "Black Orb of Scrykin", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
        { name = "Fledgling Scrykin", change = 100 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo task but obtaining the required items takes a mixture of group and raid tasks, and normal grouping.\nApprentice Mage Sarcrynn may be found near the entrance to Relic at +130, -1040, but paths away to the north. He will return to his original spot after about 5 minutes.\nYou say, 'Hail, Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn'\nApprentice Mage Sarcrynn says 'All day long Ao has us wandering this blasted slope, hunting for spell components. He claims it's part of our training before we can become true mages of Relic. Bah, I think he just wants to keep us busy while he studies the [real magic].'\nYou say, 'What real magic?'\nApprentice Mage Sarcrynn says 'Ah, you want to know about the true power of the Plane of Magic then? Come closer then, let us speak more in hushed voices. I have overheard the Elder Scrykin talking of great things. . .'\nYou are now offered a task selection dialog.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Black Orb of the Scrykin'.\nSacrynn says, \"The original thirteen scrykin were created by Druzzil Ro herself. Because they were created directly by a divine being, they are infused with an extra bit of magic that not present in any of the other scrykin. Over time, this extra magic coagulated in the center of their bodies, forming an orb of concentrated power. If you can find all the orbs of the original thirteen scrykin, I can combine them for you into the Black Orb of the Scrykin, a sphere of untold power.\"\n\"Six of the original thirteen scrykin are still alive. Their black orbs can be extracted only once the elder scrykin is defeated. Speak with Or'Sarro and he will help you find them.\"\nOr`Sarro, the Youngest is located in Arcstone at +205, -975, +410.  He gives out the raid and group tasks for the elder scrykin.\n\"As for the remaining seven orbs, these come from the scrykin that died long ago during the battle with the dragon Skylance. No one knows what has since become of these ancient orbs, but we do know that they have turned grey with the passage of time. They are likely scattered across the Plane of Magic by now, held in the hands of the more powerful denizens of this place.\"\nRecover the Black Orb of Daosheen the First\nRecover the Black Orb of Porthio the Second\nRecover the Gray Orb of Varo the Third\nRecover the Gray Orb of Ao the Fourth\nRecover the Gray Orb of Kallendro the Fifth\nRecover the Gray Orb of Kazzanthar the Sixth\nRecover the Black Orb of Zomm the Seventh\nRecover the Gray Orb of Taroknock the Eighth\nRecover the Black Orb of Sharlash the Ninth\nRecover the Gray Orb of Karkahn the Tenth\nRecover the Black Orb of Thanus the Eleventh\nRecover the Black Orb of Maru the Twelth\nRecover the Gray Orb of Morogone the Thirteenth\nCredit is given for handing in Orbs to Apprentice Mage Sarcrynn, not for obtaining them.  Thus, you can start to gather Orbs before requesting this task.  Upon handing in the last one:\nYour task 'Black Orb of the Scrykin' has been updated.\nThe Black Orb of the Scrykin has been assembled!\nYour faction standing with Fledgling Scrykin has been adjusted by 100.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou have been given: Black Orb of Scrykin\nYou have completed achievement: Black Orb of Scrykin (Raids 65+)\nSubmitted by: Lias Roxx, Defiant, ZekRewards:\n- Black Orb of Scrykin [item=48509]\n[",
