      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 60\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Spirit Hunter Azmaro in Arcstone at location -280, 1670, 5.\nYou say, 'Hail, Spirit Hunter Azmaro'\nSpirit Hunter Azmaro says 'Hail _____.  Don't waste your strength trying to figure out why we all came to be on this magical island together.  Most of the individuals in this camp woke up here after a night of strange dreams.  Others arrived as the result of magical accidents.  It makes no sense.  What matters now is that we are stranded here and must now learn to survive in this strange [territory].'\nYou say, 'What is this strange territory?'\nSpirit Hunter Azmaro says, 'My father, Elijo, and I have already returned from several scouting expeditions across this island.  Now it's your turn.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Arcstone, Isle of Spirits'.\nSpirit Hunter Azmaro says, 'First, you must set out across the isle to find the lair of each of these spirits.  When you study a creature's home, you learn its habits and routines, which gives you power ofer it during the hunt. Scout the lairs of Arcstone's spirits and return to me if you\nsurvive.'\nExplore the Lair of O'Kahn, Hound of Druzzil 0/1 (Arcstone)\nYou will recognize this beast's territory by the twisted briar rising from the ground and the lingering reek of death.\nLocation: 1165, 1110\nExplore the Desolation of Ravenglass, the Undying 0/1 (Arcstone)\nRavenglass is a necromantic spirit that hangs the shields of its fallen opponents in a dead tree, the nexus of its power.\nLocation: 800, 640\nExplore the Bluff of Stillwillow, the Storm's Eye 0/1 (Arcstone)\nStillwillow is a reclusive and silent spirit.  It often wanders a nearby wind swept crag, moving in utter silence.\nLocation: -820, -1000\nExplore the Valley of Xanzerok, the Earth Root 0/1 (Arcstone)\nYou will know this spirit's lair by the writhing vines that rise from the soil. They stand in testament to the creature's command over the plant life of this isle.\nLocation: 1030, -130\nExplore the Lava Field of Oroshar, the Ashcaster 0/1 (Arcstone)\nOroshar is a spirit of fire and earth that lairs on the volcanic spire of Arcstone.\nLocation: -650, 975\nSpeak with Spirit Hunter Azmaro 0/1 (Arcstone)\nYou say, 'Hail, Spirit Hunter Azmaro'\nSpirit Hunter Azmaro says, 'Welcome back, _____.  I see you have survived your encounters with the spirits of Arcstone in one piece. May their strength be with you always.'\nYou gain experience!!\nReward:\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 65)Submitted by: Flewid Hardheart, Prexus ServerRewards:\n- Experience\n[",
