      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is given by various NPCs, depending on who controls the stronghold, unless the drachnids control it (in which case \"an infiltrator\" does not give the task).  The NPC is non-KOS and is located just beyond the door to the stronghold.\nYou may get the task after having looted the items involved. The only step involved in the actual task is delivery.\nDeliver 4 Drachnid Heads (0/4) - Sverag, Stronghold of Rage\nHeads, limbs, flesh!  Bring me whatever it takes to show me that you are willing to fight against our enemy!\nUpon turning in four Drachnid Heads, you receive your class spell:\nBard - Spell:  Arcane Aria\nBeastlord - Skill:  Rake\nBerserker - Skill: Bloodthirst\nCleric - Spell:  Elixir of Divinity\nDruid - Spell:  Barkspur\nEnchanter - Spell:  Ward of Bedazzlement\nMagician - Spell:  Spear of Ro\nMonk - Skill:  Heel of Kanji\nNecromancer - Spell:  Grave Pact\nPaladin - Spell:  Ward of Tunare\nRanger - Spell:  Scorched Earth\nRogue - Skill:  Razorarc\nShadowknight - Spell:  Theft of Agony\nShaman - Spell:  Nectar of Pain\nWarrior - Skill: Mock\nWizard - Spell:  Ice BlockSubmitted by: Saraban, DarkwindRewards:\n- Skill: Bloodthirst [item=48658]\n- Skill: Heel of Kanji [item=48650]\n- Skill: Mock [item=48638]\n- Skill: Razorarc [item=48646]\n- Spell: Arcane Aria [item=48629]\n- Spell: Barkspur [item=48631]\n- Spell: Elixir of Divinity [item=48587]\n- Spell: Grave Pact [item=48630]\n- Spell: Ice Block [item=48628]\n- Spell: Nectar of Pain [item=47712]\n- Spell: Scorched Earth [item=48626]\n- Spell: Spear of Ro [item=48859]\n- Spell: Theft of Agony [item=48584]\n- Spell: Ward of Bedazzlement [item=48639]\n- Spell: Ward of Tunare [item=48632]\n- Tome of Rake [item=47705]\n[",
