        { id = 50802, name = "Dagger of Blazing Fires", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 54\n\nThis raid task becomes available once you have completed the story arc to receive your level 70 spell.\nYour Location is 6882.67, -1351.25, 31.70\nYou say, 'Hail, Tak`Valnakor'\nTak`Valnakor says 'Welcome back ______. While you were away I went and investigated the ruins and found a rotting tree. There was some type of magical [disturbance] there that I think you and a handful of adventurers should investigate.'\nYou say, 'What disturbance?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Suchun, the Blood Warden (Raid)'.\nEnter the Petrified Tree - Ruins of Takish-Hiz\nThe zone-in is located in the Ruins of Takish-Hiz, just north of the portal to South Ro.\nEnter the Blood Warden's inner sanctum - The Root of Ro\nThe event is triggered by getting close to Suchun's platform.\nSlay Suchun and his minions - The Root of Ro\nYou have entered Lair of Suchun.\nDestroy the wall separating you from Suchun's lair, and run inside.\nSuchun shouts, 'FOOLS, MISCREANTS! I have safeguarded the Blood of Ro for ages. Your endeavors shall be in vain!'\nSuchun, Blood Warden of Solusek procs Clutch of Suchun throughout the encounter. If your endurance or mana gets too low, you will get ported to the lava and deathtouched.\nYour first order of business will be to destroy the five Gateways to Solusek Tower which spawn one by one.\nThe room phases briefly as a portal materializes from the Tower of Solusek Ro.\nEach gateway is susceptible to a certain attack, as are the adds it spawns:\n1st = Piercing and Cold-based spells; Mephit adds\n2nd = Hand-to-Hand and Magic-based spells; Efreeti adds\n3rd = Slashing and Magic-based spells; Fire Elemental adds\n4th = Blunt and Magic-based spells; Gargoyle adds\n5th = Ranged and Fire-based spells; Dervish adds\nShortly after the portals are destroyed, Blaze and Char become active.\nBlaze and Char both flicker in and out of this realm briefly. . .\nBlaze procs Blazing Tears and Char procs Charring Touch.\nShortly after Blaze and Char are dead, Suchun becomes active and ressurects the two drakes.\nSuchun breathes life back into Char and Blaze, rising the phoenixes from their ashes.\nSuchun shouts, 'Foolish Mortals, did you believe you could defeat my army? Your attempts to steal the Blood of Ro must be stopped!'\nHe is now at 60% health and needs to be killed. He can hit for ~6000; single-target rampages; summons; enrages; and AEs Doom of the Blood Protector, which if not cured in time, triggers a deathtouch.\nGateways to Solusek Tower also begin spawning again with the same adds.\nYou have slain Suchun, Blood Warden of Solusek!\nSuchun shouts, 'Do you realize what power this blood holds? Your possession of Ro's Blood will seal your demise!'\nYou have slain Char!\nYou have slain Blaze!\nYour task 'Suchun, the Blood Warden (Raid)' has been updated.\nAfter Suchun, Blaze, and Char are killed, the task ends and an ancient chest spawns with loot. Depending where you are in progression, you (and everyone on raid) receives a Vial of Smoldering Blood or a Black Shard of Mana on their cursor, a part of the Deathknell access quest.Submitted by: Saraban, DarkwindRewards:\n- Black Shard of Mana [item=50509]\n- Burning Tree Leaf [item=48970]\n- Cape of Cremation [item=48971]\n- Charred Darkwood Bow [item=48972]\n- Charred Pendant [item=48940]\n- Dagger of Blazing Fires [item=50802]\n- Earring of the Blood Warden [item=48968]\n- Last Blood [item=45215]\n- Pauldrons of the Burning Prince [item=48969]\n- Smoldered Gem of Battle [item=48973]\n- Vial of Smoldering Blood [item=53839]\n- Wand of Centering [item=48974]\n[",
