      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAssistant Avellone may be found at -210, -1690, in a group of quest NPCs in a swamp in the southeast portion of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Avellone'\nAssistant Avellone says, 'Do you have time to look into some [agricultural] technology for me?  If not, I have a few [other tasks] for Vreshnar that I was going to look into today.'\nYou say, 'What other tasks?'\nAssistant Avellone says, 'I need to track down [Prunae] and look into some [pranksters].'\nYou say, 'Who is Prunae?'\nAssistant Avellone says, 'Well I heard Vreshnar muttering about her. You see, she helped him put together the Bixie Illusion spell, but there seems to be something wrong.  She donned an illusion and barged into Stone Hive, and hasn't been seen since.  She seemed furious!  Then yesterday, Vreshnar was stunned by a fellow Wyrmkin.  It shouldn't have even been possible!  We must [find her].'\nYou say, 'I will find her.'\nAssistant Avellone says, 'She may still be in disguise, but I just know something is wrong.  Perhaps she has been trapped.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Jokes on You'.\nPrunae has gone missing, and there are some doubts as to her loyalty to Crescent Reach.  Find her within Stone Hive and determine whether she has been imprisoned, or turned Bixie and is sharing secrets within the hive.\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!!\nExplore the slave hold of Stone Hive (0/1) - Stone Hive\nHead to Stone Hive and into the large, main hive in the middle of the zone.  Go up the stairs in the center room, then through the doorway on the west side.  Turn north and head up the elevator by clicking on it. Then, go through the room on that floor, and you will eventually reach the slave hold to the east.\nFind a clue as to who is telling the truth (0/1) - Stone Hive\nThere you will find either a slavemistress or Slavemistress Hizja. They are very weak and easily soloable by a level 70+ Enchanter with or without a pet.  Once you kill either one of them, they may drop an \"Imposter's Clue\".\nDetermine who the imposter is and kill them! (0/1) - Stone Hive\nOnce you loot this, the Caged Drakkin nearby will turn into a bixie and attack you.  This mob is again easily soloable by at 70.  Once you slay the Caged Drakkin, the quest is over and you will be able to choose your reward:\nOption 1: Devious Drakkin Potion\nMAGIC ITEM NO TRADE\nEXPENDABLE Charges: 1\nPotion Belt Enabled\nEffect: Illusion: Drakkin of Osh`vir (Casting Time: 0.8)\nRecast Delay: 5 seconds\nWT: 0.2 Size: SMALL\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALL\nIllusion: Drakkin of Osh`vir\nSpell Effect: Cloaks you in a shimmering illusion that makes you appear to be a Drakkin.\n-or-\nOption 2: Devious Drakkin Disguise\nMAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM NO TRADE\nLevel Needed: ENC(30)\nSkill: Divination\nMana Cost: 10\nSpell Effect: Cloaks you in a shimmering illusion that makes you appear to be a Drakkin.\nWT: 1.2 Size: TINY\nRace: ALL\nThe Enchanter spell scroll scribes into your spellbook as \"Illusion: Drakkin of Draton`ra\".Submitted by: Amnesiaa Dragonbane, Dragon Council, BertoxxulousRewards:\n- Devious Drakkin Disguise [item=51830]\n- Devious Drakkin Potion [item=51831]\n[",
