      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is the outline for armor tasks offered by Kimem Saydel in Crescent Reach. They can be completed with a single group (even solo if you are of level). These tasks result in armor with stats in the neighborhood of 20-30hp/mana/end. Armor pieces have a required level of 20.\nFind Kimem Saydel in Crescent Reach at location -1030, -1475, +30.25.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kimem Saydel'\nKimem Saydel says 'Vasha, ______. You have the stride of an adventurer about you. They say that an adventurer is only as good as the [armor] they wear.'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nKimem Saydel says 'Fortunately, I may be able to fashion you some protection. Recently, I've seen adventurers returning from the Blightfire Moors and bringing with them [materials] that have picked up a bit of the curse that plagues that land. I've had a chance to study some of it and I believe I can tap into the magic within the [materials] to fashion armor that would protect you on your adventures.'\nYou say, 'What materials?'\nKimem Saydel says 'The materials I need depend upon the piece of armor you want fashioned.'\nThe following tasks are available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive):\nBeastlords:\nRunic Leather Armwraps\nRunic Leather Boots\nRunic Leather Cowl\nRunic Leather Gloves\nRunic Leather Leggings\nRunic Leather Tunic\nRunic Leather Wristguard\nDruids:\nImprinted Leather Armwraps\nImprinted Leather Boots\nImprinted Leather Cowl\nImprinted Leather Gloves\nImprinted Leather Leggings\nImprinted Leather Tunic\nImprinted Leather Wristguard\nMonks:\nFormed Leather Armwraps\nFormed Leather Boots\nFormed Leather Cowl\nFormed Leather Gloves\nFormed Leather Leggings\nFormed Leather Tunic\nFormed Leather Wristguard\nYou have been assigned the task _____.\nKimem Saydel has offered to make you armor if you can bring him the right materials.\nFor the Chest Piece:\n4x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Chest Pattern\nFor the Legs Piece:\n4x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Legging Pattern\nFor the Arms Piece:\n3x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Sleeve Pattern\nFor the Hands Piece:\n2x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Glove Pattern\nFor the Head Piece:\n3x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Helm Pattern\nFor the Boots Piece:\n2x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Boot Pattern\nFor the Wrist Piece:\n1x Blightfire-Infused Thick Hide\nBlightfire Bracer Pattern\nBlightfire-Infused Thick Hides drop from random mobs in Blightfire Moors.\nThe patterns drop from various named mobs in Blightfire Moors.\nGive the required items to Kimem in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task.Rewards:\n- Formed Leather Armwraps [item=53469]\n- Formed Leather Boots [item=53470]\n- Formed Leather Cowl [item=53471]\n- Formed Leather Gloves [item=53472]\n- Formed Leather Leggings [item=53473]\n- Formed Leather Tunic [item=53474]\n- Formed Leather Wristguard [item=53475]\n- Imprinted Leather Armwraps [item=53462]\n- Imprinted Leather Boots [item=53463]\n- Imprinted Leather Cowl [item=53464]\n- Imprinted Leather Gloves [item=53465]\n- Imprinted Leather Leggings [item=53466]\n- Imprinted Leather Tunic [item=53467]\n- Imprinted Leather Wristguard [item=53468]\n- Runic Leather Armwraps [item=53460]\n- Runic Leather Boots [item=52864]\n- Runic Leather Cowl [item=52865]\n- Runic Leather Gloves [item=52866]\n- Runic Leather Leggings [item=53461]\n- Runic Leather Tunic [item=52863]\n- Runic Leather Wristguard [item=54981]\n[",
