      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task does not have a time limit.\nThis task begins with Rokiln the Hunter in Vergalid Mines.\nYou say, 'Hail, Rokiln the Hunter'\nThe spirit speaks slowly, 'Greeetinnngs. . . Though you be not my kindred, you have proven your worth by delivering these noble hunting trophies to honor my grave.  In return for this great service, Troll, I will tell you the [tale] of this tomb.'\nYou say, 'What tale?'\nRokiln the Hunter says 'For many years, my ancestors held these mines, until the dragon men came. . .'\nRokiln now offer his four different tasks...\nRokiln's tomb was once a vestibule for storing artifacts of the giants. The tomb has since been raided and looted by drakkin who have overrun the mines. Among the objects stolen by Dyn'leth's armies was an old giant artifact known as the Shield of the Otherworld. The artifact held special spiritual significance to the giants as it contained the names of all their fallen warriors, heroes, and kings on three interlocking disks. Dyn'leth, realizing this significance, smashed the disk and awarded the broken shards to his various captains and commanders as trophies.\nThe Disk of the Warriors remained in the Vergalid Mines with the followers of Dyn'Leth assigned there.\nReturn the remnants of the Disk of the Warriors to Rokiln at his tomb.\nReturn the First Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nReturn the Second Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nReturn the Third Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nReturn the Fourth Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nReturn the Fifth Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nReturn the Sixth Fragment of the Warrior's Disk to Rokiln's Tomb 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nNeed all dialogues, faction hits if any, /loc of quest mobs.Rewards:\n- Disk of Warriors [item=51939]\n[",
