      walkthrough = "**Level:** 71\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFind Kalim'Kar the Gold, a drakkin NPC just to the right of the door into the fortress.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kalim'Kar the Gold'\nKalim'Kar the Gold says 'Shhh... Speak in hushed tones here, Gnome, lest we both be discovered. Did Keikolin [send] you as well?\nYou say, 'Keikolin.. send me?'\nKalim'Kar the Gold says 'Regardless, this is a dead end. I was charged with spreading the influence of magic by the great gold dragon herself. I've done all that I can, and can continue no [further].'\nYou say, 'Why can't you continue further?'\nKalim'Kar the Gold says 'To venture into Ashengate is suicide, and though I would gladly sacrifice myself to further Keikolin's cause, dying would accomplish nothing and destroy all the [work] I have accomplished thus far.'\nYou say, 'What work is that?'\nKalim'Kar the Gold says 'I can concentrate and improve existing magics, but not without possessing more fragments of arcane knowledge in the form of Glowing Obsidian Runes. They are locked away inside the Reliquary of Ashengate, and I have sensed them in other [places].'\nYou say 'What other places?'\nKalim'Kar the Gold says 'Frostcrypt, the mines of Vergalid, the giant stronghold called Valdeholm, and possibly elsewhere. Seek out the Glowing Obsidian Runes and return them to me, and I should be able to craft magic that you can utilize.'\nFrom certain raid events in The Serpent's Spine, loot a Glowing Obsidian Rune. Bring the rune to Kalim`Kar in exchange for a Rank III spell.\nKalim'Kar the Gold is ecstatic, 'Yes, this is precisely what I required. As Keikolin commands, I bestow upon you a greater magic. Use it wisely.'\nBards:\n- Song:  Erollisi's Cantata Rk. III\n- Song:  Weshlu's Chillsong Aria Rk. III\n- Song:  Performer's Psalm of Pyrotechnics Rk. III\n- Song