      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 54\n\nThis is an overview of the 'Vergalid Mines: Vergalid's End' raid task. For more details, see the individual event listings (linked here and in the sidebar).\nThis raid task begins with Sergeant Kazzar in Sunderock Springs (on a plateau at around -1400, 800 -- in the southern half of the zone). You must have at least six people with you in Sunderock in order to request this task.\nPre-requisites for requesting this task are Captain Zheren's task arc as well as the Into the Leviathan's Lair task, also given by Sergeant Kazzar.\nThere are no prerequisites for participating in the task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sergeant Kazzar'\nSergeant Kazzar says 'Our Crusade struggles to hold a basecamp here on this mesa.  The fight has not been easy.  Our enemies still plot and wait within the [Vergalid mines] to the east.'\nYou say, 'Vergalid mines?'\nSergeant Kazzar says 'You have fought long and hard against our enemies, ______.  You are now ready to lead a strike force against the Dragon Vergalid.  He waits for you, deep in the mines -- If you are ready to [challenge] him, that is. Perhaps you have come to see if that slithering serpent Kellak has returned to his lair? If you are, that could be arranged.. If you are [willing].'\nYou say, 'Challenge?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Vergalid Mines: Vergalid's End'.\nVenture into the Vergalid Mines and kill your way to Vergalid. Once you have confronted him, destroy the beast once and for all.\nNurtha and Vergalid have 3.5 day lockout timers. Goru Uldrock has a 2.5 day lockout timer. If you enter this zone while locked out of Nurtha and/or Goru, the locked out task steps will automatically update once you step into the area where the event NPC is located.\nEnter the Vergalid Mines 0/1 (Sunderock Springs)\nThe entrance is located just north of the wizard spire.\nDestroy Nurtha Frazzlesprocket [quest=4269] 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nNurtha and her contraptions are located in a chamber a short distance from the zone-in.\nBanish Goru Uldrock, the Reincarnate [quest=4270] 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nGoru Uldrock is located in the burial grounds.\nPower the life force feeding Vergalid 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nKill the six Stone Protectors in the shrine room. Be advised they hit quite hard and flurry.\nDestroy Vergalid [quest=4271] 0/1 (Vergalid Mines)\nThis is event is activated when 6+ players approach Vergalid.Rewards:\n- Arachnid Model XII's Protective Hull [item=55136]\n- Box of Everburning Flame [item=55135]\n- Diseased Ring of the Reincarnate [item=54238]\n- Essence of Speed [item=53252]\n- Glowing Obsidian Rune [item=52101]\n- Gnomework Model XVII's Experimental Chestguard [item=55139]\n- Gnomework Model XVII's Experimental Plate Backing [item=55140]\n- Goru's Girdle of the Deceased [item=54240]\n- Goru's Trinket of Fidelity [item=54239]\n- Neckguard of the Reincarnate [item=53849]\n- Nurtha's Leggings of Focus [item=55137]\n- Nurtha's Shoulderpads of Concentration [item=55138]\n- Ring of Breeding Corruption [item=55134]\n- Serric's Blood-Encrusted Anorak [item=52779]\n- Serric's Virulent Augmentation [item=55133]\n- Spaulders of Dooming Exile [item=52778]\n- Vergalid's Blood Mace of Dismemberment [item=55130]\n- Vergalid's Infectious Cloak [item=55131]\n- Vergalid's Leggings of Corruption [item=55132]\n- Vermin Model IV's Diseased Bauble [item=55141]\n- Vermin Model IV's Diseased Harness [item=55142]\n- Warfists of the Reincarnate [item=53850]\n[",
