      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 24\n\nIn order to request this task, you must have completed Intercepted Correspondence, Lost Letter, and Confession, or you must have participated in a successful \"Kill Kangur\" raid previously.\n(Note that if you bypass the first three tasks, you will not be able to request further raid tasks from Fergarin.)\nThis is a 24-person raid task that begins with Fergarin Bardon I in Valdeholm, who is located in the back room behind Wraithguard Heimgul, at +770, -780, -25.\nAt the end of \"Confession,\" Fergarin mentioned a [dangerous threat].\nYou say, 'What dangerous threat?'\nFergarin Bardon I says 'As if we don't have enough problems, what with our own esteemed ancestors climbing the wall trying to kill us, we also have a spider problem. Now obviously this is not an ordinary spider, for it lives in the highest parts of the glacier and fears neither Krithgor nor Shade. She is a massive beast and she comes down to the lake to check on her babies and eat any that grow threateningly large. She also kills dozens of my people while she's at it. If you could [destroy this monstrosity] I would be very grateful.'\nYou say, 'I will destroy this monstrosity.'\nFergarin Bardon I says 'I wish you luck. Perhaps you will be small enough that you can surprise her, though I wouldn't count on it.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Kill Kangur'.\nFergarin has asked you to slay the spider queen known as Kangur Vafta Veor. He believes that she will be on the lake now, eating her young and killing anything that comes near.\nExit the black market area through the Southern Door 0/1 (Valdeholm)\nHead to the instanced zone entrance and click on the door (this will be marked on your compass).\nKill Kangur Vafta Veor 0/1 (Valdeholm)\nKangur Vafta Veor is a spider who spawns on the east side of the ice lake in an instanced version of Valdeholm or can be down below in the valley east of where Frostcrypt would be.  It can drop:\n- Frozen Heart of the Snow Spider Queen\n- Idol of Kangur Vafta Veor\n- Veil of the Snow Spider\nSpeak with Fergarin Bardon I 0/1 (Valdeholm)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fergarin Bardon I'\nYou have defeated the eight-legged snow queen and her young broodlings! Fergarin is so pleased that he asks you to hold on to some important documentation for him. He now believes that you can protect that documentation. He tells you that he thinks you might be just the right person to help him [deal with a traitor] in his own city.\nEveryone in the task receives \"Letters of Evidence\" and a positive faction hit with Wraithguard Leadership (+200).\nCompletion of this task gives a 1.5 day lockout timer and opens up the next raid task from Fergarin, \"Udengar the Traitor.\"Submitted by: JakobeRewards:\n- Frozen Heart of the Snow Spider Queen [item=54241]\n- Idol of Kangur Vafta Veor [item=54242]\n- Letters of Evidence [item=56138]\n- Veil of the Snow Spider [item=54236]\n[",
