      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with a sporali named Trullica in the Foundation. It's located at approximately 225, 1225, -202. It is the third of three solo tasks from Trullica; you must have completed the tasks \"Cliknar Clay\" and \"Feet of Clay\" in order to request this one.\nYou say, 'Hail, Trullica'\nTrullica says 'Hello there. I am Trullica. I am pleased to see others from the [upworld] here. I hope you remain safe during your travels. Please, keep clear of the [clay pits]. They are no longer safe. It is most unfortunate because there are some that are in dire [need] of the clay. And don't get me started about the [Genari].'\nYou say, 'Genari'\nTrullica says 'Since my time here, I've noticed that the Genari have been a [constant].'\nYou say, 'A constant?'\nTrullica says 'Yes... They hold the mountains up and have done so for a very long time. They never [falter]... Never!'\nYou say, 'They never falter?'\nTrullica says 'Something is causing them to waver. A little bit here, little bit there. Surely you've felt the ground [shake]!'\nYou say, 'I've felt it shake...'\nTrullica says 'If a Genari moves, his load shifts. Unfortunately, this is the very bedrock that makes up this place as well as the upworld, so it causes the entire world to [move]. Perhaps those of us that have lived here for so long are more sensitive to the movements.'\nYou say, 'How can we stop that move?'\nTrullica says 'If you can go where the Genari are and see what is causing them to lose focus, I am sure we'd be closer to [helping] them.'\nYou say, 'I'll see about helping them'\nTrullica says 'Thank you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Rock the Worlds'.\nInvestigate the Genari in the northern part of the eastern section 0/1 (The Foundation)\nInvestigate the Genari in the southern part of the eastern section 0/1 (The Foundation)\nInvestigate the Genari near the waterfall east of here 0/1 (The Foundation)\nInvestigate the Genari in the central part of the central section of the east 0/1 (The Foundation)\nThe above four steps update as you walk around the giant statues in the given areas of the zone.\nKill 5 Autarchians 0/1 (The Foundation)\nSeveral autarchian dwarves can be found in the eastern parts of the zone. Kill any five of them for this update.\nReturn to Trullica 0/1 (The Foundation)\nTrullica says 'The Autarchians? Hmm. . . Something tells me that there is more to this. Thank you for your help. I have Dorillis working on some things for me if you'd like to assist.'\nReward:\nExperienceRewards:\n[",
