      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task is the second of three tasks that begin with Mardan Howlinblade in Arthicrex (location: -260, 940, 5 -- outside the entrance to Fungal Forest). It follows his first task, \"Abandon All Hope\".\nYou say, 'Hail, Mardan Howlinblade'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'I am surprised you are still here! With us being at such low [numbers], the Cliknar will surely attack. It is an advantage that I would exploit if I were them.  We must gather reinforcements at once!  We could also use another hand searching for a more recent group of [missing] dwarves that have not returned, since you have shown experience in such matters already.'\nYou say, 'Low numbers?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'It will be very difficult to survive for long without additional help.  I need someone to go to the dwarves of Underfoot and get them to send us more [support].'\nYou say, 'Support?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Find Haeger Stonecracker in Underquarry, Borgar Rompinstomp in Foundation, and Foreman Gronkin in Cooling Chamber. They should be willing to listen to you and be in a position to send us some help.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'For Those Who Have Fallen'.\nSeverely undermanned, Mardan needs you to get the dwarves of the Underfoot to send him some additional men to support his campaign in Arthicrex.\nThe three \"Talk to...\" steps open up immediately. The kill/return steps open up once you've hailed the corresponding NPC.\nTalk to Haeger Stonecracker in Underquarry to gain support for Mardan 0/1 (The Underquarry)\nHaeger Stonecracker is located at the zone-in area of the Underquarry (-15, 150, -193).\nYou say, 'Hail, Haeger Stonecracker'\nHaeger Stonecracker says 'Mardan needs help you say? Hmm... Well, we have much to do here... But if you can help clear some of the problems we are having here, I'll be happy to send some dwarves to assist Mardan.'\nKill 10 burynai 0/10 (The Underquarry)\nReturn to Haeger Stonecracker 0/1 (The Underquarry)\nYou say, 'Hail, Haeger Stonecracker'\nHaeger Stonecracker says 'Ah! So you're back! You've done your part, I'll honor mine. Tell Mardan that I'll send some volunteers as soon as I can.'\nTalk to Borgar Rompinstomp in the Foundation to gain support for Mardan 0/1 (The Foundation)\nBorgar Rompinstomp is located due north of the zone-in to the Foundation from the Underquarry, among numerous gnomes and dwarves.\nYou say, 'Hail, Borgar Rompinstomp'\nBorgar Rompinstomp says 'I told Mardan that it was way too dangerous to go to Arthicrex! Besides, we got too much going on here to deal with that. Perhaps if you helped clear out some of the pests, I may be inclined to help.'\nKill 5 small beetles 0/5 (The Foundation)\nKill 5 large beetles 0/5 (The Foundation)\nReturn to Borgar Rompinstomp 0/1 (The Foundation)\nYou say, 'Hail, Borgar Rompinstomp'\nBorgar Rompinstomp says 'Hmm... Well, I suppose I have to honor my end of the agreement. They are fellow dwarves after all! We'll head out as soon as possible.'\nGo to Foreman Gronkin in Cooling Chamber to gain support for Mardan 0/1 (Cooling Chamber)\nForeman Gronkin is found at location 150, -18, 4.\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Gronkin'\nForeman Gronkin says 'Are you daft?! We've barely enough hands to deal with our own problems let alone bail out Mardan with his! It'd go a long way in me making a decision if you were to help out with the dead mucking about in the lower chambers.'\nKill 5 zombies 0/5 (Cooling Chamber)\nZombies are among the undead mobs found in the southernmost part of the zone.\nReturn to Foreman Gronkin 0/1 (Cooling Chamber)\nYou say, 'Hail, Foreman Gronkin'\nForeman Gronkin says 'You are diligent aren't you? Tell Mardan that Foreman Gronkin has sworn to bail out his dwarven hide yet again! We'll leave as soon as I round up a crew.'\nReturn to Mardan Howlinblade 0/1 (Arthicrex)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mardan Howlinblade'\nThe dwarves have all pledged to send Mardan aid!\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Thank Brell!  Hopefully they arrive soon.  The [news] our scouts have gathered makes me fear that we'll need them before they are able to assist.'\n210 platinum\nExperience (2.2 AAs at Level 85)Rewards:\n[",
