      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 01:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is the third of three tasks that begin with Mardan Howlinblade in Arthicrex (location: -260, 940, 5 -- outside the entrance to Fungal Forest). It follows his first two tasks, \"Abandon All Hope\" and \"For Those Who Have Fallen\").\nThere is a one-hour time limit to finish this task.\nAt the end of the previous task you saw:\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Thank Brell! Hopefully they arrive soon. The [news] our scouts have gathered makes me fear that we'll need them before they are able to assist.'\nYou say, 'What news?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'It appears that some of the Cliknar have discovered our predicament. They must be stopped before they inform the rest of the [hive]!'\nYou say, 'The hive?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Yes, yes... if the Queen becomes [aware of us], we are finished.'\nYou say, 'Aware of us?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'I am surprised they are not already aware. Those foul beasts communicate so quickly, it's as if they share a mind. Perhaps the Queen is [too distracted] right now to hear them.'\nYou say, 'Too distracted?'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'It must be all the overworlders meddling with their farms. Har! I never thought I would praise their arrival to Brell`s home, but they may just save us! Quickly, you and your allies must [ready] yourselves! I can hear the cliknar approaching!'\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Here they come! You must not let them escape, or the hive will learn of our weakness! For the dwarves!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Desperate Deed'.\nOnce you trigger the task, three cliknar spawn near the Fungal Forest teleporter and charge the person who triggered them.\nKeep them aggro'd, otherwise they'll emote and fail the task:\nThose fools have left us... Soon..the queen shall hear us.\nAt last the queen can hear us, Those helpless dwarves can not escape...\nSlay the approaching cliknar agents! 0/3 (Arthicrex)\nKill the first wave (spawns up by the Fungal Forest teleporter).\nTalk to Mardan 0/1 (Arthicrex)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mardan Howlinblade'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'That was a close call...wait! I hear more coming!'\nRepeat for a second wave (spawns east of Mardan's location).\nSlay the approaching cliknar agents! 0/3 (Arthicrex)\nTalk to Mardan 0/1 (Arthicrex)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mardan Howlinblade'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'I'm glad you're on our side _____. I see another group! Don't let your guard down!'\nRepeat for a third wave (spawns to the north, at the nearby wall).\nSlay the approaching cliknar agents! 0/3 (Arthicrex)\nKill nearby cliknar to ensure that the state of the dwarves is no longer known among the hive mind  0/10 (Arthicrex)\nHead into the hive and kill 10 cliknar.\nApproach the main hive in the north to make sure no agents have escaped 0/1 (Arthicrex)\nThis update happens at /loc 1529, 1075, 50\nInform Mardan that the attack has been prevented 0/1 (Arthicrex)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mardan Howlinblade'\nMardan Howlinblade says 'Friends, I am forever grateful for your help in such a time of need. We would have certainly perished without you.'\nMardan's previously empty eyes now glimmer with hope. As he puts his hand on your shoulder and slowly nods, you can feel the heavy burden he once bore fade away.\n157 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (1.6 AAs at Level 85)\n17 Brellium TokensRewards:\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]\n[",
