      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is the third of three solo tasks that begin with a bellikos named Delth in the Convorteum. She is located in the zone-in area, below the fortress at about -1380, 365, -65.\nKOS mobs wander close to her, so keep a lookout while speaking with her.\nYou say, 'Hail, Delth'\nDelth says 'Hello again outsider.  Are you here to [finish] what we started?'\nYou say, 'I'm here to finish it'\nDelth says 'I have revealed the truth and it is not a pretty one. Now I must get this information to three of the more influential [members] of the creator's elite creations.'\nYou say, 'Which members?'\nDelth says 'Belsa, Grodnis, and Argnus need to see this information right away. It will not be easy to [reach] them so I ask that you only do this if you think you really can.'\nYou say, 'I'll reach them'\nDelth says 'Take these samples to each of them and this should convince them of the truth.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Convorteum Coercion'.\nDelth wants you to show the results of her investigation to Belsa, Grodnis, and Argnus.\nDeliver the sample of proof to Belsa 0/1 (The Convorteum)\nBelsa is one floor up from the port-in point of the fortress. Location: -975, 1070, 375.\nBelsa takes the proof and looks it over. 'What is this?' she says. 'I cannot believe Delth actually got this far. I will spread this proof throughout the ranks of those I train. Perhaps it will be enough.'\nDeliver the sample of proof to Grodnis 0/1 (The Convorteum)\nGrodnis is on the top floor of the fortress and has a short roam range in one of the side areas. Location: -1400, +70, +1050.\nGrodnis grabs the information from you. 'Interesting findings here,' he says. 'Those who I lead will find this compelling for sure. Thank you for this outsider.'\nDeliver the sample of proof to Argnus 0/1 (The Convorteum)\nArgnus is on the top floor of the fortress, in the center pit. He roams around -1100, 1000, 1000, and will be the more difficult of the three turn-ins as he is surrounded by KOS mobs.\nArgnus looks at you angrily. 'This is incredible, I will let the others know at once.'\nReturn to Delth and tell her what the others said 0/1 (The Convorteum)\nYou say, 'Hail, Delth'\nDelth says 'Thank you again _____. Now we must wait and see if it was enough.'\nCompletion of this task leads into the group mission for the Convorteum.\nReward:\n105 platinum\n40 Brellium Tokens\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)Rewards:\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]\n[",
