      factions = {
        { name = "Dream Delvers", change = 10 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Researcher Breoro in the House of Thule's Lower Floors. He's located just inside the front door of the house.\nYou say, 'Hail, Researcher Breoro'\nResearcher Breoro says 'Are you yet another [figment] of my imagination seemingly come to life?'\nYou say, 'I'm not a figment of your imagination...'\nResearcher Breoro says 'No, I can tell that you are not from this accursed place. Thank the Gods. Please forgive me. I have been in this [living nightmare] for far too long. It has become difficult to tell that which is real from that which is not.'\nYou say, 'What living nightmare?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'This place, whatever it is, has trapped me within its dark grasp. You see, I am a researcher of dreams and nightmares. I have long suffered from debilitating nightmares for as long as I can remember. Long ago, I decided to dedicate my life to uncovering their meaning. As my research progressed over several weeks, the [nightmares] I was experiencing seemed to become more and more lifelike.'\nYou say, 'Nightmares?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'The nightmares always involve four horrible beasts. Night after night the nightmares grew in intensity until one night I woke up here, in this accursed place. Now I cannot [leave].'\nYou say, 'Why can't you leave?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'There seems to be some force blocking my escape from this place. I have discovered that the beasts hold some sort of influence over my mind and have brought me here. They are minions of Terris Thule. Terris is up to something, hence this house. I feel her calling to me. What she wishes to gain from this, I do not know. The beasts appear to be her tools for whatever evil plan she is envisioning however. We must stop this. The beasts must be [destroyed].'\nYou say, 'Destroyed?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'Before we can confront the beasts, several potions made from the essences of the creatures that exist here are needed. We will need a [potion of rot], a [potion of the unknown], a [potion of rage], and a [potion of horror].'\nYou say, 'What about the potion of the unknown?'\nResearcher Breoro says 'Collect the ingredients I need for the Potion of the Unknown and then bring them back to me. There is no time to waste.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Beast of the Unknown'.\nResearcher Breoro wants you to collect Cube Goos from sleeper cubes, Necromantic Trinkets from bone crafters, Poison-Coated Fangs from fright spinners, and Essences of the Unknown from beastlings of the unknown. These creatures all inhabit the first floor of the House of Thule. Once you have them, deliver them to Researchrer Breoro.\n- Collect 2 Cube Goos 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Collect 2 Necromantic Trinkets 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Collect 2 Poison-Coated Fangs 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Collect 1 Essence of the Unknown 0/1 (House of Thule)\n- Deliver 2 Cube Goos to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Deliver 2 Necromantic Trinkets to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Deliver 2 Poison-Coated Fangs to Researcher Breoro 0/2 (House of Thule)\n- Deliver 1 Essence of the Unknown to Researcher Breoro 0/1 (House of Thule)\nResearcher Breoro says 'Thank you, my friend. The cube goo is a powerful sleep-inducing component. I must take care not to add too much, or the potion may not wear off. Next, the poison-coated fangs must be carefuly handled. Each one must be dipped into the potion and then carefully discarded. The necromantic trinkets are next. The trinkets must be ground into a fine powder. If added in the right proportions, it should help protect me from the potion's poisonous effect. Finally, the essence of the unknown can be added. Make sure to speak with me again once all four of the potions have been brewed.'\n158 Platinum\nExperience (about 1.5 AAs worth; more if you have a low AA count)\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers has been adjusted by 10.\n5 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
