      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is the first in a series of three that begins with Rupkerr (click for map image) is found in the safe area in the north-central part of Feerrott, the Dream at approximate location 1175, 1340.\nYou say, 'Hail, Rupkerr'\nRupkerr says 'It's such a relief to come across a friendly traveler. I was sent here to determine the whereabouts of a missing [expedition crew], and found myself quite lost in this jungle, exposed to all its dangers. My own search has been halted, due to [rumors] of wandering undead.'\nYou say, 'A missing expedition crew?'\nRupkerr says 'A group of my fellow frogloks ventured out this way ages ago, with the intention of exploring the Feerrott and collecting [information] on how the jungle has changed since our time in Innothule.'\nYou say, 'What information?'\nRupkerr says 'We haven't had a report back since they first ventured this way; many fear the worst. I'm afraid I can't navigate this terrain well on my own. A helping hand won't go unrewarded. What do you say; will you [help] me find my missing kin?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nRupkerr says 'According to my findings, the expedition crew was traveling northeast through the Feerrott. See if you can locate the crew, or recover any information on their whereabouts.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'An Expedition Gone Awry'.\nFind the missing froglok expeditionary force 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nIn the far northeast part of the zone are the undead ruins. Note: This area is patrolled by numerous restless spirits, so you may need to do some clearing before you're able to proceed.\nSearch the froglok corpses for proof that you have found the missing expeditionary force 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nLoot a Tattered Expedition Journal from a froglok corpse (has a five minute respawn timer). If you have difficulty targetting it, use \"/target a_froglok\" and then \"/open\" their corpse.\nDefend yourself from the Lizardman Patroller 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nA lizardman patroller spawns here, but any patroller in the zone will update this step.\nDeliver the expedition journal to Rukperr 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nOn turn-in:\nYou have located the missing froglok expedition crew, only to find that they have perished for reasons unknown.\nRupkerr says 'This journal you brought me belonged to Krupp, the expedition leader. You say you found it on his corpse? It's a shame so many of the pages are missing. I'm sure they hold clues as to what caused the expedition crew to perish.'\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers got better.\n158 platinum\nExperience (about 6% in Level 86)\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n5 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
