      walkthrough = "**Level:** 80\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is the second of two tasks offered by Dark Alchemist Illian [npc=35881] at approximate location 1200, 145 in the Feerrott.\nYou must have completed his first task, Protecting the Weak (Minded) [quest=5128] in order to request this one.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dark Alchemist Illian'\nDark Alchemist Illian says 'Ah, welcome back. I've looked over the data you've given me, including the final bile sample, and it's quite puzzling indeed. There's certainly [more to investigate] with this phenomenon. Unless, of course, I have your [word] that any attempts on the original solution would go better than the last.'\nYou say, 'More to investigate?'\nDark Alchemist Illian says 'Before we examine the river more carefully, I'd like for you to investigate the portal to the realm of Fear. Do not wander inside, no, I rather cannot take the time to try to collect your remains out of there should you perish to the denizens within. No, instead, I want you to [collect samples] from the beings just outside, namely the blood of the bloodbone skeletons.'\nYou say, 'I will collect samples.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'There's Something In the Water'.\nDark Alchemist Illian turns back to his work, replying with a simple, 'Good. Go now and I'll prepare for the samples.'\n- 1. Loot 3 Bloodbone Skeleton Blood Samples from the bloodbone skeletons 0/3 (The Feerrott)\nBloodbone skeletons [npc=35854] are found in the southwestern part of the Feerrott. Loot 3 Bloodbone Skeleton Blood Sample [item=91156].\nNote: The skeletons are rootable/snareable and do not summon.\n- 2. Deliver 3 Bloodbone Skeleton Blood Samples to Dark Alchemist Illian 0/3 (The Feerrott)\n- 3. Speak with Dark Alchemist Illian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dark Alchemist Illian'\nDark Alchemist Illian dips a finger in the blood you've returned and tastes it, shaking his head slightly. 'It's not the same. Well, that was quite useless... or not. At least we verified what the source is not.' Frowning thoughtfully, he continues, 'Let's move forward, let's look back at the [river].'\nYou say, 'What about the river?'\nDark Alchemist Illian says 'There are two places that I'd like for you to take samples from. Up north, around where you had examined the blighted gorillas, I'd like for you to take a sample of the waterfall. The source itself may be what's coming from around that blasted city of Oggok, and the waterfall would be a good sample of that. As for the [second]...'\n- 4. Inquire further about Illian's needs 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nYou say, 'What second thing?'\nDark Alchemist Illian says 'The second location would be the southern end of the river, to where it disappears beyond the Temple. It's no secret that something is down that direction, but it's unclear just what it may be. I'd much rather you return alive with your sample than dead and I lose the sample, so please gather the second sample near the Temple of Cazic-Thule itself rather than beyond it. Go. Do not pass it, or you don't collect your pay.'\n- 5. Gather sample Azia from the waters near the waterfall 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nRight-click Water Collection Vessel Azia [item=92476] to get the update.\n- 6. Gather sample Beza from the waters at the southern end of the river 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nUpon gathering a sample by right-clicking Water Collection Vessel Beza [item=92477] at the southwestern fork of the river, an awakened rotdog [npc=36058] spawns and attacks.\n- 7. Defend the sample received 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nKill awakened rotdog. It hits for a max ~5,000; is rootable/snareable; has ~500k hp; and summons.\nNOTE: If you die to this mob, or if someone else kills it, there is no known way to respawn it.\n- 8. Collect the head of the rotdog as proof 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nLoot the Rotdog Head [item=92534].\n- 9. Deliver 1 Rotdog Head to Dark Alchemist Illian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n- 10. Deliver 1 Filled Water Collection Vessel Azia to Dark Alchemist Illian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\n- 11. Deliver 1 Filled Water Collection Vessel Beza to Dark Alchemist Illian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nGive the Filled Water Collection Vessel Azia [item=92491] and Filled Water Collection Vessel Beza [item=92494] to Dark Alchemist Illian.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dark Alchemist Illian'\nDark Alchemist Illian says 'Dark Alchemist Illian quickly puts down the water samples to look over the head that was returned with more detail. 'This... This is interesting. I'll have to investigate this further. And a strange gate, you say? There's one last thing I ask for you, and that's to examine the gate, then return to me with what you find.''\n- 12. Explore the gate discovered 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nZone into the House of Thule via the gate at the south-central zone boundary of the Feerrott.\n- 13. Speak with Dark Alchemist Illian 0/1 (The Feerrott)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dark Alchemist Illian'\nDark Alchemist Illian nods slowly. 'I won't ask you to go down there to investigate the area, and you've done what has been asked of you fairly adaquately. If you wish to examine that area further, that is up to you, but at this point it's beyond the scope of my own work.'\nExperience (7% regular at level 86)\n315 platinum\n10 Dream Motes [item=90255]\nFaction with Dream DelversSubmitted by: Tarvas of Tribal FuryRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
