      walkthrough = "**Level:** 86\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is the second in a series of three that begins with Scholar Kintorom at the zone-in of The Library.\nYou must have completed his prior task, \"Interview with a Scholar\" before being able to get this one.\nYou say, 'Hail, Scholar Kintorom'\nScholar Kintorom says 'The book you brought me is amazing! It describes ancient events that I have never seen recorded previously. Unfortunately, the book only covers a small time period. I would theorize this book is part of a larger [set].'\nYou say, 'A set?'\nScholar Kintorom says 'There must be more of these books in the library. The binding appears to be unique so they should be easy to find. Would you be willing to venture inside once again and [locate] more books from this set?'\nYou say, 'I'll locate them'\nScholar Kintorom says 'Excellent! I eagerly await your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'History of the World, Part 2'.\nScholar Kintorom is fascinated by the book you brought him and theorizes it to be part of a larger set. He has asked you to enter the library any books which match the appearance of 'Volume 791'.\nFind Volume 763 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nFind Volume 732 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nFind Volume 689 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nFind Volume 655 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nFind Volume 612 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nFind Volume 588 somewhere in the Library 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 763 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 732 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 689 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 655 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 612 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nBring Volume 588 back to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nNOTE: While you're doing this task, \"an enraged historian\" will occasionally spawn in the hall to the west of the scholars room and aggro the person with the task. You'll see a red emote when it becomes aggro on you. (He can spawn even if you haven't picked up any books.)\nThe enraged historian isn't social with other mobs, so you can be in a safe corner or hall and only deal with the one mob. It hits for a max ~6,000 and drops \"Volume 588\".\nGroundspawn locations for \"thulelibrary\" map file:\nP -138.1200, 45.4044, -26.3481,  0, 0, 0,  3,  763\nP -174.2901, 43.3982, -25.3919,  0, 0, 0,  3,  732\nP -193.9840, -95.1091, -3.3880,  0, 0, 0,  3,  689\nP -233.8292, -99.3892, 2.2231,  0, 0, 0,  3,  655\nP -36.9275, -75.1099, 35.4108,  0, 0, 0,  3,  612\nIn-game /locations:\n-45, 140, -25\n-45, 175, -25\n95, 195, -3\n100, 235, 2\n75, 35, 35\nSpeak to Scholar Kintorom 0/1 (The Library)\nYou say, 'Hail, Scholar Kintorom'\nScholar Kintorom says 'I was correct! These are all part of a lengthy set of books chronicling the history of Norrath. I will need some time to look these over. Check back with me shortly.'\nYou successfully located several books matching 'Volume 791', proving this was a set of books.\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n10 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
