      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is one of five solo kill tasks that are offered by a froglok named Ruppoc Rockjumper at the zone-in of the House of Thule (lower floors).\nYou say, 'Hail, Ruppoc Rockjumper'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'Hey, are you looking for mushrooms and moss to eat too? You're not? Well let me tell you about something I [found] anyway.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about that something you found...'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'I was walking through the jungle the other day, looking for some delectable moss and mushrooms for dinner, when I came across this gate you passed through. It just appeared one day. I thought that was strange, so I came inside to check it out. It is a treasure trove of delicious but strange-looking moss! There is one [problem] though.'\nYou say, 'What problem?'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'This place is crawling with nightmarish creatures. I managed to sneak around a bit, gathering a few samples of the delicious moss that grows in here, but the monsters eventually spotted me, and I had to flee back to the gate. I really want more of that moss. Think you could [help] me out?'\nYou say, 'I'll help you out'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'I can't get any more of that moss with all these critters in here. Do you think you could [thin] their numbers out a bit?'\nYou say, 'I could thin their numbers'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'You are too kind! What would you like to kill? [rot dogs] and [snakes], [skeletons] and [bone golems], [terror guards], [terror spinners] and [sleeper cubes], or [bone crafters] and [quaking haunts]?'\nYou say, 'Rot dogs and snakes'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'Rotdogs and snakes? Most of the rotdogs I found in here patrol the front of the mansion. The snakes can be found both inside and outside of the house. Good luck!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Thinning Out Their Numbers: Rotdogs and Snakes'.\nKill 4 rotdogs 0/4 (House of Thule)\nKill 4 snakes 0/4 (House of Thule)\nReport to Ruppoc Rockjumper 0/1 (House of Thule)\nYou say, 'Hail, Ruppoc Rockjumper'\nRuppoc Rockjumper says 'You cleared out some of the rotdogs and snakes? Thank you. Perhaps now I can go gather some more of that wonderful moss!'\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor Faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
