r a max ~6,500.\nFaernoc has been slain by _____!\nFaernoc's corpse hisses in agony in its final death throes.\nGive Faernoc's Fang to Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nGiladan the Botanist says '(Laughing) Is there anything you can't do?! Thank you so much for your help!'\n210 platinum (about 3 AAs)\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n13 Dream Motes\nCompletion of this task arc leads into the group progression mission for The Grounds, \"The Gardener\" from Gardener Aeriht.Rewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
