      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Giladan the Botanist at location -65, -1700, -105 in the Grounds (due east of the zone-in; just east of the central garden and next to Spensur, the Rk. III spell NPC).\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'These blasted things won't let me get any [work] done! First it's those rude [peponnites], then the arrogant [tree] things, then the buzzing [bixies], then those flea infested [dogs], and finally that awful pond scum [snake] and its offspring! It's no wonder why this once beautiful place is gone in the gutter!'\nYou say, 'Peponnites?'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'I've tried many times to go and speak to their patch warden. But the second I step foot near the patch, they attack me. Perhaps if someone more [capable] would go over there.'\nYou say, 'I'm capable'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'That you are! Please give them what's coming!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Garden of Feedin''.\nGiladan needs you to teach those peponnites a lesson!\nKill 5 peponnites 0/5 (The Grounds)\nPeponnites are concentrated in the north-central part of the zone.\nSpeak with Giladan the Botanist 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Giladan the Botanist'\nGiladan the Botanist says 'Maybe that'll teach them to mess with a helpless botanist! Thank you.'\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
