      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Athmos the Bard at the zone-in of the Grounds. The book reward (\"Fallen Gods\") is used in the \"Book Hunt\" task from the Library.\nNote: You need to have the task \"Book Hunt\" active in your quest journal from the Library in order to request this one.\nYou say, 'Hail, Athmos the Bard'\nAthmos the Bard says 'Ooo, you startled me! I was busy composing some new lyrics based on a [book] I read recently. Was there something you wanted?'\nYou say, 'What book?'\nAthmos the Bard says 'The book? It was called [Fallen Gods]. I had recently come across it in a fantastic library inside the house and decided to take it with me. '\nYou say, 'Fallen Gods? I need that book!'\nAthmos the Bard says 'Well, I don't have the book anymore, you see. While I was wandering the gardens, I had several unfortunate encounters with the beasts therein and [dropped everything] I was carrying. I barely escaped with my life!'\nYou say, 'You dropped everything?'\nAthmos the Bard says 'Yes, including the book. Say, if you were to go out into the garden and [find my belongings], I would be happy to give you the book.'\nYou say, 'I can find your belongings...'\nAthmos the Bard says 'What a fortuitous encounter! I'll wait here while you go looking.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'You Spoony Bard!'.\nAthmos the Bard wants you recover his various belongings from monsters in the Garden. If you are successful, he will give you the book 'Fallen Gods' as a reward.\nRecover Athmos' Lute from the bone golems 0/1 (The Grounds)\nRecover Athmos' Cape from the rotdogs 0/1 (The Grounds)\nRecover Athmos' Satchel from the mulch cubes 0/1 (The Grounds)\nRecover Athmos' Rapier from the bixies 0/1 (The Grounds)\nThe lute is dropped by bone golems. Capes are dropped by rotdogs. Satchels are dropped by mulch cubes. Rapiers are dropped by bixies.\nDeliver Athmos' Lute from the bone golems 0/1 (The Grounds)\nDeliver Athmos' Cape from the rotdogs 0/1 (The Grounds)\nDeliver Athmos' Satchel from the mulch cubes 0/1 (The Grounds)\nDeliver Athmos' Rapier from the bixies 0/1 (The Grounds)\nSpeak to Athmos 0/1 (The Grounds)\nYou say, 'Hail, Athmos the Bard'\nYou located all the personal effects that Athmos dropped in the garden and returned them.\nAthmos the Bard rummages around in his pack and says 'Amazing, you found everything! Here's the book as promised. Thanks again!'\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n10 Dream Motes\n\"Fallen Gods\"Rewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n- Fallen Gods [item=92798]\n[",
