      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Laoni Reista in Erudin Burning. She is located at -330, 260 (in the same area as the General and the Spirit of Erud -- the area south of the dock).\nYou say, 'Hail, Laoni Reista'\nLaoni Reista says 'Greetings, friend.  If you're here to [help], we can use all the help we can get.'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nLaoni Reista says 'The undead make up a significant amount of their army, and continue to be a grave threat against our people.  If you could [take down] several of the undead forces, it would help considerably.  Alternatively, I am collecting Nightmare Shards for our researchers to examine a source of the Terris Thule cultists' power.  If you wanted to [gather one], it would assist in our research.'\nYou say, 'I'll take down the undead forces'\nLaoni Reista says 'Good.  We greatly appreciate it.  My recommendation is to start with the tunnellers and push them back.  Be safe, friend.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Combating Death'.\nThe undead forces make up a large part of the invading forces, and Laoni Reista has requested your assistance in taking them down.\nKill a few skeleton tunnelers 0/4 (Erudin Burning)\nKill a few skeleton warriors 0/4 (Erudin Burning)\nKill a few skeleton sentinels 0/2 (Erudin Burning)\nKill a few bone golems 0/2 (Erudin Burning)\nSpeak with Laoni Reista 0/1 (Erudin Burning)\nLaoni Reista says, 'As undead, they may not be down for long, so stay vigilant. Your assistance is greatly appreciated.'\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Combating Death\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
