      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 15 minutes\n**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is the third in a series of five that begins with Abbit Scribbletch, a gnome found in the first room on the left immediately on entering the northeastern wing of the House of Thule's Upper Floors.\nYou must have completed his first two tasks prior to being able to request this one.\nYou say, 'Hail, Abbit Scribbletch'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'Good, you have returned. I know of someone that may be able to help. Goes by the name [Laerdin], and he was on the floor below us. '\nYou say, 'Who is Laerdin?'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'He is a very timid, yet very smart man. He has a peculiar way of speaking, but should have something for us if you listen. Would you go [speak] with him?'\nYou say, 'I'll speak with him'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'Let me know what he says, because I am at a loss I am afraid. '\nYou have been assigned the task 'Morzad Chronicle - Never Trust a Morzad'.\nAbbit is no closer to finding the real book than he was before. Maybe this new contact of his will help shed some light on what is going on here.\nSpeak to Laerdin Helleh 0/1 (House of Thule, Lower Floors)\nLaerdin Helleh is a Halfling found in the northwestern hall of the House of Thule's Lower Floors (same hall as The Library entrance).\nYou say, 'Hail, Laerdin Helleh'\nLaerdin Helleh says 'What you say hello? Reason I know your visit. Already the answer is known to Abbit. If what has transpired is thought of, realize the location of the book he will. Ask the basic question to yourself... Who is responsible for the book of fakery? Then, and only then, will you realize the location of the real book.'\nSpeak to Abbit Scribbletch 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Abbit Scribbletch'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'He said what? What does that mean? WAIT! OF COURSE! The filthy demon that gave you the fake book. It has to have the real one!'\nSpeak to Khalis 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Khalis'\nKhalis says 'It was not I! What do I care about a book. Some human gave me a taste of flesh for me to hand the book to someone who asked. It was my idea to add the riddle. A little bit of fun, you understand. I was to get more of the tasty flesh but he has not returned. I saw him head to the southeastern part of the wing... Gall, Gala, Gallo, Galo, something like that.'\nFind and speak to Galo Maric 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nGalo Maric is found in one of the side rooms deep within the southeastern wing of the zone. Go past the sleeping Cazic Thule and into the halls with the centipedes and scorpions. If standing in the same room as Morzad Earthcaller, Galo is through the door on the east side of that room. There are a few mobs around him you may want to clear before proceeding with this step.\nYou say, 'Hail, Galo Maric'\nGalo Maric says 'You should have stayed out of this! '\nGalo respawns as Angry Galo and attacks. He hits for a max ~6,500.\nDefeat Galo Maric 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYour task 'Morzad Chronicle - Never Trust a Morzad' has been updated.\nAngry Galo Maric has been slain by _____!\nSpeak to Galo Maric 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Galo Maric'\nGalo Maric says 'You are still a fool! That crazy demon has been using you against us. Appropriate, since we have been using you against him! You tell Abbit. Tell him that he will never get the book.'\nReturn to Abbit Scribbletch 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, Abbit Scribbletch'\nAbbit Scribbletch says 'This is getting crazy! Let me sort this out. We will talk in a bit. Thank you for your help so far.'\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers got better.\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n15 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
