      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with a listless madwoman in the House of Thule's Upper Floors (located in the first hallway of the southeastern wing).\nYou say, 'Hail, a listless madwoman'\na listless madwoman looks crazily back at you, some sort of twisted smile upon her face.  'Ha ha ha!  The blood!  The [blood] is in my head.  If I cut myself, I bleed it out!'\nYou say, 'Blood?'\na listless madwoman says 'The blood is in the house.  Isn't it pretty?  Preeeetty.  Almost like a [rotdog], wouldn't you think?  So pretty...'\nYou say, 'A rotdog?'\na listless madwoman says 'It is in their heads, it's in your head, the blood.  [Bring] me it.  Bring me lots?  I'm not [crazy].  Craaazy blood.'\nYou say, 'You're crazy'\na listless madwoman another grin exposes her sharpened teeth. 'What if it is you who is crazy?  Awake, asleep, bleeding with your brains.  How are you here?  You are the madman.  You have to [experience madness].  Experience it deep.\nYou say, 'I'll experience madness...'\na listless madwoman says 'Find what you think is crazy, you crazy!  Find it, and it may not be so crazy, crazy, until you find yourself some happy madness.  Pretty in my head.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'I Was Crazy Once'.\nWhile difficult to understand what exactly she wants, it's gathered that a listless madwoman actually wants you to experience madness by finding others in the second floor of the house that are mad themselves. Other madmen, flying monkeys, and raging beasts should suffice.\nKill a few flying monkeys 0/6 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nKill a few raging beasts 0/3 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nKill a gibbering madman 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nThe above mobs are found in the northeastern wing of the zone (flying monkeys are found around the bridge and outside Morell's Castle while raging beasts and a gibbering madman spawn in the room south of the winding staircase that leads to Morell's Castle). Note: There is also a room with gibbering madmen in the furthest room in the southeastern wing.\nLet the madwoman know you found madness 0/1 (House of Thule, Upper Floors)\nYou say, 'Hail, a listless madwoman'\nA listless madwoman exclaims, 'Futility! Oh, you'll never know now.  Or you'll know soon.'  However, she thanks you and goes back to herself.\nExperience (around 1 AA worth at Level 90)\nMinor Faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
