      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Seria Woodwind in Al'Kabor's Nightmare. She's located just north of the port-up area on Faydark island (-200, -4550, -322).\nNote: You must have completed the tasks \"The Rivervale Ruins\" and \"Wastelands of Everfrost\" in order to access the Faydark island.\nYou say, 'Hail, Seria Woodwind'\nSeria Woodwind says 'Hail, friend.  Once I might have offered young Koada'Dal in the ways of the Koada'Vie, but there is too much lost.  We have [little to defend] left of our city, and even Firiona seems to have lost all hope.'\nYou say, 'Little to defend?'\nSeria Woodwind says 'It's in ruins, leaving morale far more destroyed than our city.  If we can [sway another threat] from attacking us in our fragile state, we may have a chance to recover.'\nYou say, 'Sway another threat?'\nSeria Woodwind says 'Forgive me for my hesitation, _____.  I'd like to think you can, but if you're [willing to try], I suppose you shall give it a shot.'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to try'\nSeria Woodwind says 'Very well.  Our long time enemies have grown in power since the earth was sundered.  The decaying skeletons that you would think would fall apart at a breath on their fragile bones have become formidable.  And to make it worse, the minions of Crushbone are just as strengthened.  It has been suicide to many of our forces to try to kill them.  I can only wish you luck taking them down.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'For the Sake of Life'.\nSeria Woodwind, the traditional trainer of the Koada`Vie of Felwithe seems particularly sensitive over the state of Felwithe. With her esteem crushed, she's requested that you try to take down some of Felwithe's traditional foes.\nSlay some decaying skeletons 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nSlay some Crushbone warriors 0/4 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nReturn to Seria 0/1 (Al'Kabor's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Seria Woodwind'\nYour task 'For the Sake of Life' has been updated.\nSeria Woodwind says, 'There is so much I wish I could offer to repay you, but... everything is limited.  I greatly appreciate the assistance you have given.  Thank you.'\nAfter claiming the reward:\nYour faction standing with Dream Delvers could not possibly get any better.\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: For the Sake of LifeRewards:\n[",
