      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is one of five pre-requisite tasks leading up to this zone's mission, \"Miragul's Vendetta\". There are no pre-requisites for requesting this task.\nThis is a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with a mephit named Mylzital in Miragul's Nightmare. He's located at about 400, 445, 45 (in the northeastern ruins in the large clearing that's south of the castle entrance).\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'My brother, Xylzital is such a pain! He keeps pranking me and I am sick of it! Hmm. . . I know! You could help me prank him! There is only one tiny [problem] though.'\nYou say, 'A problem?'\nMylzital says 'The invisible men known as unseen foes have taken my tomes of summoning. I wanted to use the tomes to try to scare Xylzital. Do you think you could get the tomes [back] for me? We could prank him really good if you could do that for me.'\nYou say, 'I'll get them back'\nMylzital says 'You will get my tomes? Yes! The first tome I need is my tome of spider summoning. If you find it, bring it back to me and we will make Xylzital sorry he ever tried to play a trick on me!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Such a Prankster'.\nMylzital is fed up with his brother, Xylzital always playing pranks on him. He thinks he can gain the upper hand though. If you could help him out, that is.\nNote: All five tomes in this task are pre-lootable. They drop from the \"unseen\" mobs in the living areas of the castle. There are a few rooms of them on the bottom floor and another four rooms of them on the second floor.\nFor each of the five tomes: You'll turn in a tome, hail Mylzital, follow a summoned creature to his brother, Xylzital (southwest of Mylzital's location), hail Xylzital, and then return to Mylzital.\nOther than the unseen foes, there is no direct combat involved with this task.\nFind Mylzital's tome of spider summoning and return it to him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak with Mylzital 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'With my tome of spider summoning, I can summon a big, scary spider to freak Xylzital out! Stand back a moment while I invoke the spell! Whana, whana, boop, bang! Wow, this is a scary spider. Follow it and see if it scares Xylzital.'\nFollow the summoned spider to Xylzital and ask him if it scared him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xylzital'\nXylzital says 'Let me guess. My brother told you a big, scary spider would freak me out. Well you both will need to try harder than that. Amateurs!'\nThe spider didn't scare Xylzital. Return to Mylzital and let him know that he will need to think of a better prank 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'He isn't scared of spiders? What the heck? Hmm. Well why don't you get my tome of snake summoning back from the unseen foes. Surely he will have to be scared of snakes!'\nFind Mylzital's tome of snake summoning and return it to him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak with Mylzital 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Ok, stand back while I summon this horribly scary snake! Blazaamm! Oh, my. That is indeed a scary snake. Follow it to Xylzital and see if that does the trick.'\nFollow the summoned snake to Xylzital and ask him if it scared him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xylzital'\nXylzital says 'C'mon now. A snake? Really? How pathetic. You guys are the worst pranksters I have ever seen.'\nThe snake didn't scare Xylzital. Return to Mylzital and let him know that he will need to think of a better prank 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Ah, c'mon. Who isn't scared of snakes?! I guess we will have to try something else. Hmm. . . Why don't you get my tome of rat summoning back from the unseen foes? That just might work.'\nFind Mylzital's tome of rat summoning and return it to him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak with Mylzital 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Ok! One disgusting rat coming up! Shooom bam boom! What a lovely rat. You know the drill. Follow it to Xylzital and let me know if that makes him cry.'\nFollow the summoned rat to Xylzital and ask him if it scared him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xylzital'\nXylzital says 'Aw, a cute little rat. Are you trying to make me laugh? Well you have! Ha! Go away.'\nThe rat didn't scare Xylzital. Return to Mylzital and let him know that he will need to think of a better prank 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Geez. Is Xylzital scared of anything at all? Well, I am not giving up. Get my tome of bat summoning back from the unseen foes and return it to me.'\nFind Mylzital's tome of bat summoning and return it to him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak with Mylzital 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Alright, let's summon ourselves a bat! Zoom, doom and boom! That is a freaky looking bat. Let's hope this scares him. Follow it and let me know how Xylzital reacts.'\nFollow the summoned bat to Xylzital and ask him if it scared him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xylzital'\nXylzital says 'Ohhh! Bats are soooo scary! Not! You guys are a hoot!'\nThe bat didn't scare Xylzital. Return to Mylzital and let him know that he will need to think of a better prank 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Wow, this is getting tiresome, eh? Well I am almost out of ideas. Why don't you get my tome of rabbit summoning back from the unseen foes. I don't know anyone who is scared of a cuddly bunny, but it is worth a try.'\nFind Mylzital's tome of rabbit summoning and return it to him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nSpeak with Mylzital 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'Ok, give me some room and let's hope I don't summon a rampaging, murderous type of bunny. Salala, bala, dooop! Aw, how cute. Look at the little bunny! Follow him to Xylzital.'\nFollow the summoned rabbit to Xylzital and ask him if it scared him 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Xylzital'\nXylzital says 'Whoa, whoa, whoa! Now that's just wrong! Get that rabbit outta here! You guys win, just get it away from me!!!'\nThe rabbit scared the heck out of Xylzital. Return to Mylzital and let him know of your success 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mylzital'\nMylzital says 'You're kidding me, right?! He is scared of rabbits! Oh, man. The guys back at home would love this bit of info. Thanks for helping me find his weakness. Maybe now he will think twice about pranking me in the future.'\n315 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n30 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
