      id = "5239",
      title = "Suspiciously Sweet Treats",
      exp = "17",
      exp_name = "House of Thule",
      min_lvl = 90,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = 860.0, x = 1200.0, z = 60.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Zairia",
        "I like sweets!",
        "What price?",
        "Treats?",
        "I",
        "What ingredients?",
        "sweets",
        "price",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "me that look", count = 1 },
        { name = "the Hedgeberries to Zairia 0/4 (Morell's Castle)", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 90255, name = "Dream Mote", type = "item" },
        { id = 109186, name = "Halfling Soul", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is one of five tasks leading up to \"The Staff Retreat\" and the group progression mission for Morell's Castle, \"Hippity Hoppity Kill\".\nIt's a solo task that begins with Zairia who is found at approximate location 860, 1200, 60 (inside the house in the candyland area).\nThere are no pre-requisites for requesting this task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zairia'\nZairia says 'What a young and vibrant _____ you are. Tell me, do you like [sweets]?'\nYou say, 'I like sweets!'\nZairia says 'My sisters and I are masters of confections. Children flock from distant lands just to get a tiny taste of some of the sweet treats we conjure. Of course, there is a small [price] to pay for delighting in our delectables.'\nYou say, 'What price?'\nZairia says 'A bite of hedgeberry pie comes at the cost of a smidgen of life, which will help this aging witch bask in the grace and beauty of youth once more! Don't give me that look. It's not like the pudgy little candy hoarders around here will miss it much. All they care about is filling their rolling bellies with sweets and [treats]!'\nYou say, 'Treats?'\nZairia says 'The halfling youngsters can't resist a hedgeberry pie. Unfortunately, they've learned not to trust taking treats from a haggard old witch like myself. I need someone with a fresh face to [help] me lure the little candy hoarders into my house.'\nYou say, 'I'll help'\nZairia  grins mischievously while tapping her fingers together with obvious delight. 'Splendid! Together, you and I will create a positively delicious hedgeberry pie, but first, I'll need help collecting some [ingredients].\nYou say, 'What ingredients?'\nZairia says 'Hedgeberries dangle from the branches of hedgewalkers, but those fickle treants always grumble, 'Over my dead trunk!' when I ask to pluck a few. You can arrange that, I'm sure.' Zairia licks her withered lips with a sly grin and adds, 'Don't forget the speckled rabbit meat. You'd really be surprised at its sweetness! And of course, no pie could be complete without a dash of hopes and dreams, snatched easily enough from the few daydreams that float in the area.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Suspiciously Sweet Treats'.\nZairia is a master when it comes to curiously sweet treats, but she needs your help gathering a few ingredients to make a special pie, one that is sure to send anyone who eats it into a sugar craze!\n- 1. Loot 4 Hedgeberries 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\n- 2. Loot 2 Speckled Rabbit Meat 0/2 (Morell's Castle)\n- 3. Loot 1 Dream Fragment 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nThe above items are common drops from treants, speckled rabbits, and daydreams (respectively).\n- 4. Give the Hedgeberries to Zairia 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\n- 5. Give the Speckled Rabbit Meat to Zairia 0/2 (Morell's Castle)\n- 6. Give the Dream Fragment to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n- 7. Speak to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Zairia'\nZairia says 'You've done a fine job, _____. Now I'll need a full jug of enchanted water, which only spills from the falls on the castle wall. You can't miss the cascade, as it flows from a magical mural that hangs on the wall at the northern edge of the stream. The jug is rather large, and may take a while to fill. Be patient and you will be rewarded.'\n- 8. Collect a jug of water from the castle wall falls 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n- 9. Wait near the wall falls while the jug fills with water 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nThe above-two steps update at the north end of the forest's river, under the waterfall.\nWARNING: A shellscale guard spawns on you as you get these two updates. Its difficulty is on par with regular trash mobs in the zone. It's mezzable, stunnable, hits for a max ~9,000. (You don't actually have to kill it as long as you can lose its aggro.)\n- 10. Give the Jug of Enchanted Water to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nZairia says 'Many thanks. I'll whip up a pie in the blink of an eye!'\n- 11. Speak to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Zairia'\nZairia says 'Be cautious. The candy hoarders around here are hostile little things who protect their sweets at all costs. Find a hungry halfling and lure them with the hedgeberry pie. Once you have, the rest should be a piece of cake!'\n- 12. Use the Hedgeberry Pie on a hungry halfling 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nA hungry halfling is located in the area out front of the house. Target him and right-click the pie.\n- 13. Lead the candy-crazed halfling to the oven 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nHe will lead himself there.\n- 14. Collect the Charred Halfling Remains 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nThe charred remains spawn inside the oven after the halfling toasts himself.\n- 15. Give the Charred Halfling Remains to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\n- 16. Speak to Zairia 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Zairia'\nZairia sighs and looks at her hands, which are once again withered. 'It looks like a little halfling doesn't go a long way. I'd better get back to baking. Thanks for your generous help.\nThanks to your culinary prowess and sneaky ways, Zairia has been able to temporarily reclaim her youthful appearance.\nHalfling Soul\n158 platinum\nExperience (about 1 AA at Level 90, depending on your AA count)\nFaction\n20 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n- Halfling Soul [item=109186]\n[",
