      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Arki Battlehammer in Fear Itself. He is in an NPC camp right next to the zone-in area.\nYou say, 'Hail, Arki Battlehammer'\nArki Battlehammer says 'Oh, Brell protect us!  It's a slaughter out there.  The [threat] is so great.  I've never seen it quite this bad in Fear.'\nYou say, 'What threat?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'They're putting up quite a fight today, and Cazic's bloodthirsty slaughter of mortals just [empowers them].'\nYou say, 'Empowers them?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'I mean pretty much anyone native to this plane.  I suppose the biggest threat against my fellowship has been the [Amygdalans] and [fetid fiends].'\nYou say, 'What about the fetid fiends?'\nArki Battlehammer says 'They stopped us in our tracks in trying to progress forward, leaving us somewhat trapped in our current position.  Something needs to be done with them, and quickly.  Will you [help]?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nArki Battlehammer says 'Thank you so much.  It means a lot to us.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Pushing Onwards'.\nThe paladin Arki Battlehammer reports that his group has been blocked by the fetid fiends and cannot continue forward. There's so many to try to tear through, and he's asked for your help in the matter.\nSlaughter fetid fiends 0/5 (Fear Itself)\nReport back to Arki 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Arki Battlehammer'\nArki Battlehammer says, 'Once we can get Iyana to her feet, we'll push forward.  Thank you for clearing those fiends.'\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
