      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Hildran Heartguard in Fear Itself. He is found in an NPC camp on the eastern zone boundary in the northeast part of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Hildran Heartguard'\nHildran Heartguard says 'For once, I'm truly [scared], _____.  What is going on here?'\nYou say, 'Why are you scared?'\nHildran Heartguard says 'The place of Fear is terrorizing today.  We've been here before, fought many times against the beings here, but I'm not quite sure how we're in the position we are today.  We've lost many friends on the battlefield, including our cleric, and it may be looking like a complete loss.  The [undead] have been insistant on taking our camp, leaving us trying to fend them off when we can.  Of course, there is also my personal [phobias] begining to play out here, causing an unwary grip on my sword.  I had to switch to my two-hander for the sake of stability.'\nYou say, 'What about the undead?'\nHildran Heartguard says 'The forces of undead have unfortunately been a bit too active here.  There are few camps left with others in tatters, and the undead seem to want to add another notch in that respect.  If communication wasn't down between us, I'd try to rally support to [get rid of] the creeps.'\nYou say, 'I'll get rid of them'\nHildran Heartguard says 'Would you [do it] for us?  Any chance to further the survival of the group would be appreciative.'\nYou say, 'I'll do it'\nHildran Heartguard says 'Thank you very much.  We do appreciate it.  Find the turmoil toads and worry wraiths.  They seem to be the most problematic lately.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Encroaching Undeath'.\nCamp warrior Hildran Heartguard is afraid the undead are coming up on the camp, and there are few camps left to defend. He's asked that you rid the area of turmoil toads and worry wraiths for the safety of the camp.\nKill a few worry wraiths 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nKill a few turmoil toads 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nReport back to Hildran Heartguard 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Hildran Heartguard'\nHildran Heartguard smiles and gives you a pat on the back. 'You have no idea how much this means to us.  Thank you, adventurer.'\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
