      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Morae Windwatcher in Fear Itself. She is found in an NPC camp on the eastern zone boundary in the northeast part of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Morae Windwatcher'\nMorae Windwatcher says 'I'm sorry. You've probably lost friends here in the Plane of Fear, as well.  Do you come from another camp?  No matter; you are welcome here.  I've been observing [the area], to try to determine a way out, or to re-establish communication with anyone else.'\nYou say, 'What's going on in the area?'\nMorae Windwatcher says 'I fear problems with the [undead] that are encroaching on our camp.  There is also a [group of creatures] that have blocked us from progressing here.  Your assistance would be so great.'\nYou say, 'What group of creatures?'\nMorae Windwatcher frowns. 'Gorgons, thought bleeders, nightmares...  They overwhelm us.  We're unable to move forward.  It would greatly help us if you're able to break them up.  If you run across any, if it's not too much to ask, please [wipe them out]?'\nYou say, 'I'll wipe them out'\nMorae Windwatcher says 'You're too kind to a druid.  My thanks.  May the Mother protect you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Overwhelming Odds'.\nMorae Windwatcher feels that several denizens of the Plane of Fear have blocked the path of their group, and requests you assistance.\nKill a few gorgons 0/5 (Fear Itself)\nKill a few thought bleeders 0/2 (Fear Itself)\nKill a few nightmares 0/3 (Fear Itself)\nGorgons are found most commonly in the northwest part of the zone while thought bleeders are found most commonly in the east-northeast. Nightmares can be found in most areas of the zone.\nReport back to Morae 0/1 (Fear Itself)\nYou say, 'Hail, Morae Windwatcher'\nMorae Windwatcher bows her head gently.  'Thank you, adventurer.  Your selflessness is appreciated well beyond what we can offer.  Just... Thank you so much.'\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
