      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Utto the Haggard in Miragul's Nightmare. He's an ogre located at about 200, 460, 35 (head west from the first clearing, then north to the next clearing).\nYou say, 'Hail, Utto the Haggard'\nUtto the Haggard says 'Great adventures and battles not prepare Utto for hardships like these. Utto suffers much [pain], knowing friends all dead except Ziedan.'\nYou say, 'Pain?'\nUtto the Haggard says 'Utto weary. Utto see too many friends die in palace, killed by things Utto not understand. Attackers without shape, or substance. Unseen foes and forgotten guardians; trapped souls in thrall to whatever controls this place. You fight these things, destroy them for Utto, Utto be [grateful].'\nYou say, 'Grateful?'\nUtto the Haggard says 'Good. Utto like you already. Utto can kill anything Utto understands. Utto not understand unseen things, ghost things. Destroy these. . . make the bad memories of Utto's dying friends screaming not bother Utto so much.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'An Unseen Presence'.\nYou have agreed to help Utto the Haggard get revenge on the ghastly unseen forces that killed his friends.\nKill five unseen foes or warriors 0/5 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nKill five forgotten guardians 0/5 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nThe above mob types are found in the castle area.\nSpeak to Utto the Haggard after you have dealt with the menaces 0/1 (Miragul's Nightmare)\nYou say, 'Hail, Utto the Haggard'\nUtto the Haggard says 'You good friend, you avenge Utto's friends. I take heart, knowing souls of friends rest easier!'\nYou have successfully destroyed enough of the phantom threats to have avenged some of Utto's fallen comrades. Perhaps futile in the long run, but the gesture will help to keep Utto's morale where it should be.\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
