      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with Havrin in Morell's Castle. He's a satyr located at the entrance to the shellscale area in the northeast part of the forest.\nNote: Two roaming mobs (including a see invis daydream) path into the room he's in.\nYou say, 'Hail, Havrin'\nHavrin says 'Hail and well met, adventurer.  Enjoying your romp through the stuff dreams are made of?  Well, I do have some things to [keep you occupied], if you so wish.'\nYou say, 'Yes, keep me occupied...'\nHavrin says 'I figured you might enjoy that.  There are two issues of note that you might find relaxing as you dream, away from the slaughter of the waking world.  The native flora and fauna are [out of control] in population.  Unfortunately, you could say the same for the [shellscales], which are intent on encroaching on our area.'\nYou say, 'Out of control?'\nHavrin says 'The water serpents have taken over the river, and the hedge walkers killing the green life in their path.  If you could bring their populations [down to size], this may help keep the area healthy and vibrant.'\nYou say, 'I'll bring them down to size'\nHavrin says 'Great, friend.  I appreciate your assistance in the matter.  I know people of your type do not wish to sit idle.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Controlling the Population'.\nKill the water serpents overpopulating the river 0/8 (Morell's Castle)\nSerpents in the river and water serpents in the area preceding the water maze update this step.\nKill the hedgewalkers causing havoc in the forest 0/4 (Morell's Castle)\nReport back to Havrin 0/1 (Morell's Castle)\nYou say, 'Hail, Havrin'\nHavrin says, 'You've done a lot for us, friend.  For now, the populations seem fine, but will not be permanent.  Please let us know if there's anything we can do for you in the meantime.'\nTask rewards:\nExperience (about 1 AA worth)\nMinor Faction with Dream DelversRewards:\n[",
