      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Seamus Greendream in Sanctum Somnium. He's a leprechaun found in the southern part of the treasure halls.\nYou say, 'Hail, Seamus Greendream'\nSeamus Greendream says 'Me gold! Someone took me pot of gold! Was it you? No, you are not crafty enough to find me gold. We must find the culprit and get me pot of gold [back]!'\nYou say, 'Back from...?'\nSeamus Greendream says 'Now I remember! I was having a wee bit of mead the other day, when a dirty beggar came up and asked me for some change. I told him no of course, and he got a bit irate. Next thing I know, I wake up with a bit of a headache and me pot of gold was gone! I bet that [beggar] took me gold when I was passed out from drinking too much mead!'\nYou say, 'A beggar?'\nSeamus Greendream says 'He was a real crazy fellow. You have to [find] him and get me gold!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Me Gold!'.\nSeamus Greendream has had his pot of gold stolen. He believes one of the mad beggars in Sanctum Somnium took it.\nFind Seamus' pot of gold and return it to him 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nThese drop commonly from mad beggars (in the undead halls as well as the ruined village) and deranged beggars (only in the ruined village).\nThere are eight different versions of \"A Pot of Gold\" and only one of them will work for the turn-in. They are lore, so you can loot a bunch of them before attempting a turn-in.\nUpon a failed turn-in:\nSeamus Greendream says 'This isn't my gold? That beggar must have stolen this from someone else!'\nUpon a successful turn-in:\nSeamus Greendream says 'Yes! Me gold! Thank you!'\nSpeak with Seamus 0/1 (Sanctum Somnium)\nYou say, 'Hail, Seamus Greendream'\nSeamus Greendream says 'You have done well. I don't normally give mortals anything, but you can have this since you helped me out.'\n158 platinum\nExperience\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n20 Dream MotesRewards:\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]\n[",
