      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Alaran Language:** 10\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nVeil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis group mission begins with Aedros in the Valley of Lunanyn (central part of the zone's lower half).\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- Completion of \"Raid and Recover\"\n- Completion of \"The Assassination Game\"\n- Completion of \"Uncharted Territory\"\n- Completion of \"The Enemy of My Enemy\"\n- Completion of \"The Memory Remains\"\n- Minimum Skill Level in Alaran Language: 10\nYou say, 'Hail, Aedros'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'It is time to [make our move] on The Daevin and destroy him. ??????? you were unable to [convince] Taleg of The Daevan's devious deeds, I am certain that foul creature is to blame for the destructions of our village. We have too much to worry about on the battlefield without him spreading his chaos. This won't be easy though I'm afraid. He will be ready and waiting for now this time.'\nYou say, 'We're ready to make our move'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'Prepare for battle and inform me when you are [ready] to strike!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Into the Abyss'.\nIt is time to take our The Daevan once and for all. Aedros has sent you back into the caverns known as The Abyss. The Daevan has set up some portals so that you cannot easily reach him. Perhaps you can find a way around them.\nSpeak with Dory, one of The Daevan's minions.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nAedros says, in Alaran, 'May The Daevan meet death by your hands!'\nSpeak with Dory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nAll trash mobs in this zone hit for a max ~10,000; are stunnable; and see invisibility. All mobs are immune to mez, but can be split from each other with careful pulling.\nMake your way through the tunnels until you come across Dory.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dory'\nDory says 'You poor thing. The Daevan has trapped you here. All of these portals lead to the beginning of the caverns. There's no way you're gonna reach The Daevan to kill him. . . Unless you [help] me!'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nDory says 'I am no fan of The Daevan. He has been nothing but cruel to my brothers and I. What The Daevan doesn't know, is that my brothers and I have found his devices that can control these portals. You do what I [need], and I can help you get to The Daevan so you kill him. Unless that is, you are having second thoughts and want to [leave].'\nYou say, 'What do you need?'\nDory says 'Don't worry, it's nothing too difficult for a group of seasoned adventurers like yourselves. I just want you to take out some bullies that have been making life hard for my brothers and I. First up, I want you to kill Fizzlefingers. He is a reega that loves to brown-nose The Daevan. He thinks he's a powerful wizard, but he is a fraud. [Agree] to kill him, and my brothers and I will help you get through the tunnels.'\nYou say, 'I agree; we'll kill him'\nDory says 'I knew you would help me! You don't have much choice in the matter anyway!'\nDory removes the portal blocking your way.\nSpeak with Fizzlefingers 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fizzlefingers'\nFizzlefingers says 'So that crybaby, Dory sent you to try to kill me? Dory and his brothers are a bunch of cowards! It matters not, for now you die! Feel the wrath of my powerful magic spells!'\nFizzlefingers attacks. He hits for a max ~10,000 and casts the spell \"Fingers of Flame\" (or at least he attempts to; he fizzles a lot).\nDestroy Fizzlefingers 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nThe portal blocking your way to the next section has been removed!\nSpeak with Pory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nTask Window Says: Killing Fizzlefingers has removed another portal that was blocking your progress. You are to speak with Pory, Dory's brother, next.\nYou say, 'Hail, Pory'\nPory says 'So I heard my brother, Dory had you kill Fizzlefingers. Nice job. If you want to continue on to face The Daevan, you will also have to do something for me. Gigglen and his oashim pet, Fuzzles are a pain in the neck. Gigglen takes that nasty oashim everywhere, and frankly it creeps me out. I hate oashim! I have tried asking Gigglen to keep Fuzzles away from me, but does he listen? No! Oh, and once you kill Gigglen, bring me his head. I shall keep it as a trophy.'\nPory removes the portal blocking your way!\nKill Gigglen 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nKill Gigglen's pet oashim, Fuzzles 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nTask Window Says: Pory has asked you to defeat Gigglen and his pet oashim, Fuzzles. After you kill him, loot his head.\nGigglen hits for a max ~10,000. Fuzzles, a bit less. If you kill Fuzzles before Gigglen, Gigglen grows enraged...\nGigglen is furious over the death of Fuzzles!\n...And grows stronger.\nGive Gigglen's Head to Pory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nPory says 'Nice work there. I will remove the portal blocking your way.'\nSpeak with Mory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nTask Window Says: Pory has removed another portal that was blocking your progress. You are to speak with Mory, Pory's brother, next.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mory'\nMory says 'So you're the group my brother has told me about. Nice job down here. You aren't finished yet though! There are a couple of shape shifters I want you to deal with. Their names are Xevo, and Ovex. They found some magic charms that let them shape shift, and now they delight in changing into rocks and spying on me. Well I am sick of it. Kill them and return their magic charms to me.'\nSpeak with Xevo 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nTask Window Says: Speak with one of the shape shifting twins named Xevo.\nYou say, 'Hail, Xevo'\nXevo says 'You dare confront Xevo and Ovex, the master shape shifters? We shall show you a thing or two before you die!'\nXevo says 'Now you shall witness true magic! Shape shift grendlaen form!'\nOvex says 'A grendlaen? I can do better than that! Shape shift dragon form!'\nOvex says 'Dangit! Well I sure messed up that spell.'\nXevo says 'Just kill them!'\nOvex says 'Darn, that's no good either!'\nOvex says 'Finally! Now you're in trouble.'\nDefeat Xevo 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nDefeat Ovex 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nOvex, in his dragon form, AEs the spell \"Fiery Breath\" (about a 35k nuke unmitigated).\nDeliver Xevo's Charm to Mory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nDeliver Ovex's Charm to Mory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nLoot the charms from their corpses and bring them to Mory.\nSpeak with Mory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mory'\nMory says 'Thanks for taking those fools out. It looks like all that's left is for you to get rid of The Daevan. It won't be easy. He's sure to have some more tricks up his sleeve. I will remove the portal blocking you way. Good luck!'\nSpeak with The Daevan 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nTask Window Says: Mory has removed another portal, allowing you entrance to The Daevan's lair. Find The Daevan and speak with him.\nYou say, 'Hail, The Daevan'\nThe Daevan says 'So some of my less than faithful minions helped you enter my chambers? I shall deal with them later. I shall end your pathetic lives now!'\nSeveral portals spawn around The Daevan. If you step into them, you'll be ported to a different part of the tunnel system.\nNote: The Daevan isn't leashed to his room, so you can pull him out.\nDefeat The Daevan 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nThe Daevan hits for a max ~10,000 and casts an AE fear. He otherwise has an average amount of hitpoints and is no more difficult than zone trash.\nThe Daevan has been slain by _____!\nThe Daevan's corpse says 'Death cannot touch me! This is but a mere inconvenience.'\nSpeak with Dory 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\nDory respawns nearby.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dory'\nDory says 'I can't believe you defeated the Daevan! It's a good thing you did, because he was gonna flay the flesh off my brother and I's bones. Make sure to take your reward from this chest and when you are ready to leave, just let me [know]. If you are ever in the neighborhood again, stop by and say hello!'\nLoot the chest for your reward 0/1 (Valley of Lunanyn)\n320 platinum\nExperience\nEltarki's Diary - Life and Death\nPossible Chest Loot (1 Item Per Task)\nArchon's Charm\nBattlemage's Shield\nBattlesteel Double Hoop Earring\nDahlena's Pommel Gem\nHadal Blade of the Deep\nIkallis' Shell Ring\nLifeguard Ward\nReaver of the Deep\nTaer Reega Claw Pendant\nVermin Slicer\nMinor Alaran Cantrip\nLesser Alaran Cantrip\nMedian Alaran CantripRewards:\n- Eltarki's Diary - Life and Death [item=98146]\n- Median Alaran Cantrip [item=98717]\n[",
    },
