      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 91\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nVeil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis task is the third in a series of three; a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Guard Captain Naraind Relesin, located in the northwestern building (location 10, 620, 0).\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- Completion of \"The Governor's Plot\"\n- Completion of \"Rescue Ranger\"\n- 70 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Guard Captain Naraind Reles'\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles says, in Alaran, 'Well met, _____. I'm glad to see more of your kind coming to Sarith. You may be the [only chance] we have. After we take care of the issues at hand, we'll be launching a counter-attack, a [raid] on the city. I hope we can convince you to aid us. Is there anything I can do to help?'\nYou say, 'Only chance?'\nWithout pre-requisites, you see:\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles says, in Alaran, 'I will gladly use your help in the future, but I'm still putting together a plan. If you'd like to help out with the first stage, please speak to Governor Wenst in Sarith City Hall.'\nWith pre-requisites, you see:\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles says, in Alaran, 'That is correct. Without your help, we couldn't have made it this far. Regarding that, we'll be taking the fight directly to the enemy now. The rebels are ready to make their move. Take some time and get prepared. Let me know when you are ready to hear more.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Aid for Sarith'.\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles and the Sarith Rebels have been able to coordinate an attack against the City of Bronze troops thanks to your previous efforts. They have asked you to help put a stop to Archon Eries and their right-hand-man, Riago Barthes\nReceive a briefing from Guard Captain Naraind Reles 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Guard Captain Naraind Reles'\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles says, in Alaran, 'Things have gotten quite interesting since you arrived. I never imagined we could have gained this much ground. But Archon Eries has taken notice, now. Al was content to let the rebels remain due to their general ineffectiveness, but your appearance has turned the tables. I know how Eries thinks. There will be a counter-attack soon, and we need to strike first. Go speak to Marrien Kavus of the rebel faction by the drydock. Al has more information on the plan. Good luck.'\nDiscuss the plan with Commander Marrien Kavus 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Commander Marrien Kavus'\nCommander Marrien Kavus says, in Alaran, 'Glad to see you again! Here is how it is going to go. Archon Eries hasn't been too pleased with your actions as of late, and I think they are planning to crush our rebellion pretty soon. We'll strike first. The Archon has stationed sergeants in key locations in Sarith. Don't worry about the fodder too much, we'll make care of most of them. While the majority of the forces are distracted, strike hard at the commanders. After that, between us and you, the way to the City Hall should be clear. I'll make sure some people are in position to help you fight Riago and Eries, but this will be rather tough. Do what you can. If you can't kill them, at least give them a round thrashing.'\nDefeat members of the Orator's army 0/3 (Sarith)\nAny \"Orator's army\" mob counts.\nAssist the rebels at the docks 0/1 (Sarith)\nDefeat the commander at the docks, Sergeant Larren 0/1 (Sarith)\nAssist the rebels at the barracks 0/1 (Sarith)\nDefeat the commander at the barracks, Sergeant Elvan 0/1 (Sarith)\nAssist the rebels at the plaza 0/1 (Sarith)\nDefeat the commander at the city hall, Sergeant Karus 0/1 (Sarith)\nThe above \"assist\" steps are simple location updates: The west dock area (around -396, +440), the barracks (the building northeast of the Guard Captain's building), and the city hall (large building in the southwest). The three Sergeants are in the vicinity of each update. They hit for a max ~12,000.\nConfront Riago Barthes at the Sarith city hall 0/1 (Sarith)\nConfront Archon Xenavia Eries at the Sarith city hall 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou need to hail each of them.\nBoth the above mobs are found in the city hall building in the southwest (Riago in the northwest room; Xenavia in the northeast room). They each hit for a max ~12,000. Rebel mobs will spawn and assist you in your attack.\nRiago Barthes says, 'The Orator has issued the death sentence for you, heretic!'\na rebel skirmisher says, 'Both the anvaders ant the traicors will pay!'\nRiago Barthes has been slain by _____!\nRiago Barthes falls to the ground in a bloody heap.\nArchon Xenavia Eries says, 'The Orator has issued the death sentence for you, heretic!'\na rebel skirmisher says, 'Both the invaders and the traitors will pay!'\nArchon Xenavia Eries has been slain by _____!\nArchon Xenavia Eries falls to the ground in a bloody heap.\nReport the results of the operation to Guard Captain Naraind Reles 0/1 (Sarith)\nYou say, 'Hail, Guard Captain Naraind Reles'\nGuard Captain Naraind Reles says, in Alaran, 'You've done well.'\nRiago Barthes and Archon Eries have been temporarily halted, but they've retreated to lick their wounds. You have a feeling they will be back. In the meantime, you've made Sarith a safer place.\nEltarki's Diary - Time and Tides\n61 platinum\nExperienceRewards:\n- Eltarki's Diary - Time and Tides [item=98630]\n[",
