      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 95\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Alaran Language:** 73\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nVeil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis solo kill task begins with Yahnoa in the Beasts' Domain, located at -2940, 8, 40 (up a tree in the southeastern part of the upper half of the zone).\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- No tasks\n- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Yahnoa'\nYahnoa says, in Alaran, 'Greetings _____, I have been [waiting] for you!'\nYou say, 'Waiting for me?'\nYahnoa says, in Alaran, 'Yes. I felt sure that if I waited near this place, Kolos would send someone to aid me in my [mission].'\nYou say, 'What mission?'\nYahnoa says, in Alaran, 'I had a dream the other night, that I stood atop the hill and was given Kolos' blessing - but the hill was not made of dirt and grass as it is now; it was a [pile of wyvern corpses].'\nYou say, 'A pile of wyvern corpses?'\nYahnoa says, in Alaran, 'When I awoke, I knew in my heart that this was a sign from Kolos, that the wyverns' time on this earth has come to an end. They are grown too soft and tame, and should be wiped out so a new order of beasts can arise. Will you [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I'll help!'\nYahnoa says, in Alaran, 'Great! Please go out and kill as many wyverns as you can so they cannot easily breed. Oh! And when you've finished, please find my friend, Bale, and ask him to help as well.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Mass Extinction - The Hard Way!'.\nAid Yahnoa in helping the wyverns take that next evolutionary step: Extinction!\nKill 10 wyverns 0/10 (Beasts' Domain)\nPass Yahnoa's request on to Bale 0/1 (Beasts' Domain)\nYou say, 'Hail, Bale'\nYahnoa wants me to do WHAT?!', it pinches its nose and shakes its head, muttering something that sounds like, 'Rav..ng Lune..tic'. It seems too preoccupied to elaborate, leaving you to wonder vaguely who Raving Lunatic might be, as you head on your way.\n136 platinum\nExperienceRewards:\n[",
