      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Alaran Language:** 73\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nVeil of Alaris Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis solo kill task begins with Diviner Url in the Resplendent Temple, located at 2135, -375, -330. He's in the underground caves outside of the temple. The easiest way to get to him is by using the northeastern entrance at 2705, -400, -38 (from Sarith, go across the bridge, then head north along the eastern wall of the temple).\nNOTE: The rats in Diviner Url's room are KOS.\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- No tasks\n- 73 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Diviner Url'\nDiviner Url says 'Can you not see I'm busy? It's hard enough to divine without any [entrails] without you coming in here and interrupting my concentration!'\nYou say, 'Entrails?'\nDiviner Url says 'Gyah! Why do you insist on distracting me? If you want something, make yourself useful first! Go kill some Piq`as so that I may use their entrails in my divinations - only be careful not to disturb their entrails. I will collect those myself later, so they can be properly interpreted.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Piq`a - BOO!'.\nDiviner Url has asked you to go kill Piq`as so he can collect their entrails for later use in his divinations.\nKill 3 Piq`a diabolists 0/3 (Resplendent Temple)\nKill 4 Piq`a deadraisers or soothsayers 0/4 (Resplendent Temple)\nKill 3 Piq`a nobles 0/3 (Resplendent Temple)\nThese mobs can be found in the caves south of Url.\nReturn to Diviner Url 0/1 (Resplendent Temple)\nYou say, 'Hail, Diviner Url'\nUrl thanks you wholeheartedly, 'You're not such a bad.. er, whatever you are, after all!'\nExperience\n68 platinumRewards:\n[",
