      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Alaran Language:** 81\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo kill task begins with Havra in the Pillars of Alra, located outside the southeastern pillar at about -900, -235, 322.\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- No tasks\n- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, Havra'\nHavra says, in Alaran, 'Oh, how hideous looking! What, upon the pillars, are you?!' Its tentacles begin to writhe with disgust, but suddenly an idea seems to occur to it. Its tentacles curl thoughtfully as it addresses you in a tone of forced interest, 'Outsider, are you [headed] to the pillar across this bridge?''\nYou say, 'I'm headed there, of course'\nHavra says, in Alaran, 'How perfect!' It clasps its hands together, entwining its tentacles in delight, 'Could you perhaps do me a [favor], Outsider? You see, I've been planning a perfectly innocent visit to that island, however, every time I set foot upon it, those twisted guardians attack me!'\nYou say, 'Yes, I'll do you a favor'\nHavra says, in Alaran, 'Wonderful, I knew you were a kind person the instant I saw you!' Its tentacles clench excitedly and it continues, positively oozing with false sincerity, 'Much as I hate the idea of killing the poor things, it seems to be the only way. I'm sure my 'friend' over there will understand after I explain the situation.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Innocent as a Tiger'.\nHavra has asked you to kill several of the plant creatures that guard the Pillar of Nature.\nKill 3 okiina mossbranches 0/3 (Pillars of Alra)\nKill 5 animate shrubs 0/5 (Pillars of Alra)\nThese mobs are found around the southwestern pillar.\nSpeak with Havra 0/1 (Pillars of Alra)\nYou say, 'Hail, Havra'\nHavra chortles with glee!\n150 platinum\nExperienceRewards:\n[",
