      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Alaran Language:** 81\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFor an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about progression, spells, and armor, click here.\nThis is a solo kill task that begins with a distraught worshipper in Windsong Sanctuary, located at about 670, -175, -30 (inside the southern entrance to the inner area).\nPre-requisites for requesting the task:\n- No tasks\n- 81 Skill Level in Alaran\nYou say, 'Hail, a distraught worshipper'\na distraught worshipper says, in Alaran, 'May the Winds bless me! This is truly an ill-fated day. First my beautiful lute is destroyed by a dimwitted jumper, and now a filthy Outsider has come to defile our sacred lands! Had I my lute still, I would slay you now, Outsider - I don't suppose you'd [mind] doing me a favor and killing yourself?'\nYou say, 'Maybe you think I'm out of my mind'\na distraught worshipper says, in Alaran, 'I'm not surprised, but as you've no intention of slaying yourself, and I'm unable to do it for you, we'll call it a draw this time.' It croons sadly over its broken instrument, 'Besides, I'm not in the mood for killing anything right now beyond that infernal [haze jumper] that smashed my beloved lute.'\nYou say, 'What haze jumper?'\na distraught worshipper says, in Alaran, 'The stupid beast landed on me, causing me to drop my precious lute! If you could [kill] the blasted things, I might be grateful enough not to announce your presence to my fellow worshippers - although, if they find you themselves, you're on your own, Outsider.'\nYou say, 'I'll kill some of them'\na distraught worshipper says, in Alaran, 'I never thought I'd say this to an Outsider, but I wish you luck in your hunt.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Flat Lute'.\nA distraught worshipper has asked you to slay the haze jumpers in retribution for the destruction of his lute.\nKill 8 haze jumpers 0/8 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nSpeak with a distraught worshipper 0/1 (Windsong Sanctuary)\nYou say, 'Hail, a distraught worshipper'\nThe distraught worshipper thanks you gingerly, 'Now, if you've a mind to live much longer, you'd best get away from this place before my fellow worshippers find you.'\n150 platinum\nExperienceRewards:\n[",
