      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\ni could not get the quest until I did the other two frost fell quests Case of the Misplaced Dollies and Saga of the Empty Purse\nYou say, 'Hail, Belumb, the Yeti'\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'Oh, hello again Jeffro. Were you able to [collect the dolls]?'\nYou say, 'Yes, I was able to collect the dolls and deliver them.'\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'That is all good then. I am glad they will continue on to their rightful owners. Thank you for helping me to correct my [mistake].'\nYou say, 'No problem, happy to help. Can I ask why you made that mistake?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll'.\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'Yeti don't really [celebrate Frostfell] the same way as Gnome do. We tend to have feasts and gather our families close. We don't give or receive gifts. I wanted to show some of my friends those dolls and think that they would have liked them. But now they are all gone.'\nYou say, 'Maybe I could help you celebrate Frostfell and get a doll for your friends?'\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'Oh? And how would you [manage that]?'\nYou say, 'Let me manage that.'\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'Thank you Jeffro. I can't wait to see what you come up with.'\nTargeted (NPC): Ginjleg Gigglegibber\nYou say, 'Hail, Ginjleg Gigglegibber'\nGinjleg Gigglegibber says, 'Oh, what now? Can't you [see that] I am busy?'\nYou say, 'I can see that you are busy. However, I am curious about how you made your special dolls?'\nGinjleg Gigglegibber says, 'What? Why would I tell you [how to make] my dolls?'\nYou say, 'Well, I delivered your dolls for you, extending your vacation. I just want to learn how to make them.'\nGinjleg Gigglegibber says, 'Arrgh. Fine, fine. If I tell you how I made my dolls, will you leave me [in peace]?'\nYou say, 'Yes, of course I will leave you in peace.'\nYou have been given: Frostfell Biting Doll Kit\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nGinjleg Gigglegibber says, 'Fine, take this and go make your doll. But be careful, contents may bite.'\nTargeted (NPC): Belumb, the Yeti\nYou say, 'fur back'\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'What? Why do you [want that back]?'\nYou say, 'I want that back because I am making you a Frostfell gift.'\nYou have been given: Yeti Fur\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nBelumb, the Yeti says, 'Well, in that case, please take care with it.\nJeffro grabbed a Frostfell Doll Stuffing from Chattering Dolly.\n--You have looted a Frostfell Doll Stuffing from Chattering Dolly's corpse.--\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nTargeted (NPC): Ganjleg Gigglegibber\nYou say, 'magic dust'\nGanjleg Gigglegibber says, 'What [is this about]?'\nYou say, 'This is about Gingleg helping me make my own experimental doll. He's on vacation and doesn't have any on him. He recommended that I talk to you about getting some.'\nGanjleg Gigglegibber says, 'Hrmph. Are you making a [Frostfell gift]?'\nGutterhand tells General:1, 'so moses'\nYou say, 'Yes, I am making a special Frostfell gift.'\nYou have been given: Frostfell Goblin Magic Dust\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nGanjleg Gigglegibber says, 'Here you go. Happy Frostfell!'\nJeffro grabbed a Rebel Clockwork Eye Lens from a rebel clockwork.\n--You have looted a Rebel Clockwork Eye Lens from a rebel clockwork's corpse.--\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nJeffro grabbed a Cuddly Bear Brainstem from a cuddly bear.\n--You have looted a Cuddly Bear Brainstem from a cuddly bear's corpse.--\nYour task 'An Adorable Yeti Doll' has been updated.\nissues with the final combine of the  An Adorable Yeti Doll quest combine not working??' BUG was posted\nReward(s):\nFrostfell Yeti Doll [item=142712]\n- Frostfell Yeti Doll [item=142712]\n[",
