      walkthrough = "**Level:** 113\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Expedition\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nYou can obtain this group mission by speaking to Drifter Minki in The Nexus near the Odus portal pad. Drifter Minki is on the find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Drifter Minki'\nDrifter Minki says, 'Ika! Ika! Hail, adventurer! Please wait! Minki could really use your [help]!'\nYou say, 'What do you need help with?'\nDrifter Minki says, 'Aakaka, Minki is so relieved! You are the first person to notice me. Are you familiar with [Velious]?'\nYou say, 'Velious is a barren, icy wasteland.'\nDrifter Minki looks up at you with wide eyes. 'Kwee! Do you not like Velious?' He lets out a squeaky laugh. 'Yiyiyiyi, Minki understands. All of that ice is so blinding! So ugly! But Velious is where Minki is from and where Minki's [brother] is.'\nYou say, 'Are you looking for your brother?'\nDrifter Minki nods emphatically. 'Yes! Minki feels very guilty. Minki made a [daring escape] from the evil Zlandicar and evil Chetari... but Minki left Minki's brother Rinki behind.' His eyes begin to glimmer with tears. 'Minki is eya visso. Very sad.'\nYou say, 'Tell me more about your daring escape.'\nDrifter Minki rubs the tears from his eyes and sniffs back a bubble of snot threatening to drip from his nose. 'Minki is so tired of fighting the Chetari. One day, Minki heard rumors that other Paebala escaped from the tunnels. Well, Minki wants to leave too!' He lets out a defeated sigh. 'Aieee. Minki tried talking to other Paebala in the tunnels, but they are too scared to escape. Minki's brother is the same. They're all afraid that Vaniki or Zlandicar will find and kill us. But now Minki knows about this place called [Luclin]! Minki thinks we will all be safe there. Now, Minki just needs to tell Rinki the good news! If Minki brings a group of [strong] adventurers, maybe Rinki will be brave enough to leave.'\nYou say, 'Luclin isn't exactly safe....'\nDrifter Minki lets out a tiny gasp. 'Kweeee! Do you not think so? Well... it must better than living in a tunnel and being forced to fight our cursed brethren all day. Do you not think so?' Minki's whiskers twitch while he ponders your warning. 'Well, if Minki and Rinki are together, nothing on Luclin can stop us! Now I just need to get Rinki, yiyiyi.'\nYou say, 'I'm pretty strong.'\nDrifter Minki gives you a thumbs up. 'Minki thinks so too! You look eya strong!' He takes his bag off his back and peers into it, then frowns. 'Aieee. Minki cannot repay you. All Minki has is cheese.' He thinks for a moment. 'Ika! The Paebala and Chetari always dig up items in the tunnels. If you come with me, you can keep what you find. It will be a tough mission, but Minki thinks it will be worth your while! What do you think? Will you [come with Minki]?'\nYou have received a request timer for 'Risky Rat Rescue': 0d:1h:0m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Risky Rat Rescue'.\nYou say, 'come with Minki'\nDrifter Minki says, 'Aakaka, Minki is so happy. Together, we can navigate the tunnels and find Minki's brother. Then, Minki and Rinki can travel the world and live peacefully.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Dragon Necropolis: Risky Rat Rescue.\nYou end up not far from the rat tunnels at /loc 316, -1513, -12\n1. Tell Minki you're ready to begin the rescue mission 0/1\nYou say, 'Hail, Minki'\nMinki says, 'Aakaka, thank you again for coming with Minki. You make Minki feel eya pallo with your kindness. Minki has a good sniffer, so we will sniff our way to Rinki. But, aieee, these are dangerous tunnels. Chetari territory. You will have to protect Minki while Minki uses sniffer. Please let Minki know when you are prepared to [depart] and we will begin.'\nYou say, 'Let us depart.'\nMinki gives two thumbs up. 'Let us go. Please follow Minki closely. If you want to leave at any time, just tell Minki! Tila, be careful around the spiders. They do not think rats are very tasty, but maybe they will feel differently about you. Hopefully they do not notice you.'\n2. Delve into the underground tunnels with Minki 0/1\nFollow Minki until you receive an update around location  350, -1375, -239.\n3. Defend against the Chetari scavengers 0/4 Dragon Necropolis\nAt this point, six a Chetari scavenger [npc=57588] spawn, Four nearby all on top of each other. Currently they see through invisibility, IVU, and SOS (though this is probably a bug). They can be mezed, rooted, and snared.  Kill 4 of them.\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\nRinki [npc=57580] spawns around location 580, -500, -256.\n4. Tell Minki it's safe to continue 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nMinki says, 'Kwee! Thank you for protecting Minki. But now, Minki needs your help picking a [direction]....'\nYou say, 'direction'\nTo continue with bonus loot:\nYou say, 'snack'\nTo continue without bonus loot:\nYou say, 'brother'\n5. Follow Minki deeper into the tunnels 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n6. Escort Minki toward the scent of Rinki 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n7. Fight off Chetari reinforcements 0/5 Dragon Necropolis\nKill 5 a Chetari raider [npc=57585].\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\n8. Reassure Rinki that it's safe to leave the tunnels 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nYou say, 'Hail, Rinki'\nRinki looks at you and Minki with pain in his eyes. 'Minki!? Ika! Mi za'ka thwam. Na Chetari wo nikao muma. Se... Rinki za'bu wue fwee.' Rinki doubles over, clutching his stomach. 'Rinki does not feel so good. Rinki was so hungry and ate some dragon meat. Rinki thinks that was a [bad] idea....'\nYou say, 'bad'\nRinki's teeth grow longer. His body makes awful snapping and crunching noises as it grows larger. Rinki howls in pain. His eyes focus on you. They are dark and glazed over, unlike the Rinki who had been speaking to you only moments earlier.\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\n9. Defeat Maddened Rinki 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nKill Maddened Rinki [npc=57586].\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\n10. Loot the chest 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nOpen the Plundered Chetari Treasure [npc=57579]. This chest appears around location 582, -498, -255.\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'Risky Rat Rescue': 0d:5h:0m remaining.\nMinki looks anxious but gives you a small nod of appreciation.\n11. (Opt) Follow Minki toward the scent of the cheese 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n12. (Opt) Defeat Endsa 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nKill Endsa [npc=57548]. It appears around location 168, -1776, -253.\nEndsa collapses to the ground. 'Aakaka, you have protected Minki yet again. Endsa was a ruthless Chetari soldier. All the Paebala would run and hide when they saw her. Not only did you kill Endsa, you also rescued the cheese! Minki is eya grateful for you, yiyiyi. Now, let us follow the trail to my [brother].'\nYou have been given: Necropolis Cheese [item=144321]\nThis appears on your cursor and everyone in group gets it.\nYou say, 'brother'\n13. (Opt) Give the cheese to Rinki to calm his nerves 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nGive Rinki the Necropolis Cheese. Everyone in the task gets the bonus loot anywhere, even not in zone.\nRinki snatches the cheese from your hands and eats it ravenously. He pauses and makes an awful hacking noise, before coughing something onto the ground in a puddle of bile.\nYour task 'Risky Rat Rescue' has been updated.\nYou have been given: Endsa's Incisor of Striking\nReward(s):\nExperience\n15 Commemorative Coins [item=116720]\nPlundered Chetari Treasure loot:\n1 finger or waist item\nGnawed Strap of the Necropolis\nPolished Paebala Silver Band\nRinki's Lost Brass Buckle\nTattered Chetari Belt\nVaniki's Cherished Band\nZlandicar Scale Ring\nBonus Loot:\nEndsa's Incisor of Striking\nEndsa's Claw of Devestation\nEndsa's Tail of Striking\nEndsa's Eye of Devastation\nEndsa's Whisker of SoothingSubmitted by: Less3D and GOMNRewards:\n- Commemorative Coin [item=116720]\n- Endsa's Claw of Devastation [item=144919]\n- Endsa's Eye of Devastation [item=144921]\n- Endsa's Incisor of Striking [item=144918]\n- Endsa's Tail of Striking [item=144920]\n- Endsa's Whisker of Soothing [item=144922]\n[",
