        { id = 19090, name = "Medallion of the Obulus", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest results in the Medallion of the Obulus [item=19090], which is one of three medallions needed for the Rune of Scale [quest=87] quest to get into Veeshan's Peak [zone=93].\nSlixin Klex [npc=4467] is  located at -681.59, -1120.76, -559.74 in the Burning Woods. He is a level 50 skeleton and is indifferent to both good and evil races.\nYou say, 'Hail, Slixin Klex'\nSlixin Klex says, 'So long ago... The burning of our land?'\nYou say, 'What burning of your land?'\nSlixin Klex says, 'Fiery death from the sky. Rock and fire burning our lands. Death and destruction splintering our tribe. Once, strong we were, but the fiery rocks from the sky crushed our proud cities and weakened our tribe.'\nYou say, 'who was your tribe'\nSlixin Klex says, 'Obulus was our people. The hills and trees were our lands. We tamed the dark and wilds and bent the forests to our needs. But all is gone, all our people, all our works, even the medallion that was the symbol of our power.'\nYou say, 'tell me of the medallion'\nSlixin Klex says, 'Medallion of the Obulus. Symbol of our proud people. Broken into pieces long lost to the dark forests now. I know where they are now but I am no longer flesh. If I were, I would find them and bring them back together.'\nYou say, 'where are the pieces?'\nSlixin Klex says, 'Hhhhh. Three pieces there are. One rests in the hands of Sselot though he knows not its purpose. Another is guarded by an Iksar ghost in Trakanon's. The last is held by a long-rotted Iksar skeleton in the Dreadlands. Bring them all here and I may be able to unite them again. Perhaps this will even free me from my torment... or not.'\nRemember that there are three separate medallions in the game, each broken into three pieces that just say a piece of broken medallion when you find it. You need to identify the piece of medallion you find to determine which one it is.\nThese are the locations:\n(1)  Middle shard [item=18973]:  Drops off rotting skeleton [npc=11797] at approximately loc 2250, -5140 in the Dreadlands [zone=75] (7 minute static spawn);\n(2)  Bottom shard [item=18975]:  Dropped by pained soul [npc=7945] in Trakanon's Teeth [zone=90], Near the entrance to Old Sebilis [zone=89];\n(3)  Top shard [item=18974]: Given to you by Ssolet Dnaas [npc=4382], who spawns in the island in Warsliks Wood [zone=95], when you complete the Burnished Wooden Staff [quest=315] quest.\nWhen handing in all 3 pieces :\nSlixin Klex says 'Ssssss. I thought I would never see these. I never thought the symbol of our people would be made whole again. I feel no rest for my sssoul though. My torment still flows as freely as when my peoples first suffered fiery death. I need this not. It is useless to me. Here, you take it. Maybe you can find some good to do with it.'\nYou receive Medallion of the Obulus [item=19090], one of the 3 pieces for the key to Veeshan's Peak [zone=93].Submitted by: Sohgoth NyarlathotepRewards:\n- Medallion of the Obulus [item=19090]\n[",
    },
