    {
      id = "1108",
      title = "Crest of the Unicorn",
      exp = "02",
      exp_name = "The Scars of Velious",
      min_lvl = 55,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Lady Gelistial",
        "I am a friend",
        "Who is Lithiniath?",
        "Who is prince thirneg?",
        "Hail, Prince Thirneg",
        "Lady Gelistial sent me",
        "I seek a cure for the line of Lithiniath",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "Gelistial my regards", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 4445, name = "Crest of the Unicorn", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nSince some spawns have seemingly been removed, it may no longer be possible to complete this.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lady Gelistial'\nLady Gelistial nods towards Pharos  and a soft gentle voice whispers in your mind as if carried by the breeze passing through the gentle grove. You tread upon the sacred ground of Tunare. I am the Lady Gelistial, baroness of the Tunarean Unicorns. Are you a friend of the Tunarean Court?\nYou say, 'I am a friend'\nLady Gelistial says 'Be wary of the black unicorns then my friend. All unicorns once inspired dreams and fascination in mortals but the lineage of Lithiniath has been twisted and now inspire delusions and madness. If my duties here were not so pressing I would seek the wisdom of Prince Thirneg in finding a cure for the cursed bloodline of Lithiniath.\nYou say, 'Who is Lithiniath?'\nLady Gelistial says 'Lithiniath was once a proud and noble Unicorn until he stumbled upon the realm of Fizzlethorpe Bristlebane. The lord of mischief twisted the magical nature of Lithiniath. The once noble unicorns fur grew blacker as delusions clouded his mind and madness follows where he treads.\nYou say, 'Who is prince thirneg?'\nLady Gelistial says 'Prince Thirneg is the ruler of the Tunarean Court. He resides in the Plane of Growth where he is constant contact with the all mother herself.\nGo find the prince. He is located in the bottom of Tunare's Tree.\nYou say, 'Hail, Prince Thirneg'\nPrince Thirneg says 'Salutations! I am the Prince of the Tunarean Court! What brings you to this most sacred of all Tunares blessed creations?'\nYou say, 'Lady Gelistial sent me'\nPrince Thirneg says 'Gelistial is a very wise Lady. She does well in her duties to the court as well as the duties to her people. Unfortunately the weight of her responsibility prevents us from meeting as often as I would like.'\nYou say, 'I seek a cure for the line of Lithiniath'\nPrince Thirneg says 'Ahh..Lithiniath, the first of the black unicorns, cursed by Fizzlethorpe Bristlebane to spread madness and delusions. Lithiniath is not evil, but his lawful magical nature has been replaced with a chaotic reflection of it that has twisted his mind. Lithiniaths physical form can not survive the removal of the chaotic magical nature. The only cure for Lithiniath is death and rebirth into a lawful vessel.'\nLithiniath is found in the Plane of Mischief along the moat outside the castle. Kill him and loot his horn. Nearby is A White Stallion. Give the white horse the horn and you'll receive a Crest of the Unicorn in exchange.\nYou gain experience!!\nLithiniath shouts 'The madness has fled my mind and I am once again whole! Give Gelistial my regards, I must leave this place and try to quell the madness I have inflicted.'Submitted by: PharosRewards:\n- Crest of the Unicorn [item=4445]\n[",
