      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is triggered when completing the previous New Year task, Buried Too Deep [quest=11185].\n- 1. Visit the docks in Stonebrunt Mountains 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis updates at the end of the docks around /way -3983, -1569, -376\n- 2. Collect the Cinnamon Spiced Nectar 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nPick the Cinnamon Spiced Nectar (blue shiny) nearby.\n- 3. Follow the scent mark northeast along the water 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis updates around /way -4008, -2021, -381. An ambushing assassin spawns and attacks.\n- 4. Fight off the ambushing assassins 0/2 Stonebrunt Mountains\nKill the assassin. When he dies, another assassin spawns and attacks, kill him too. They are level 110-113.\n- 5. Collect the Cinnamon Spiced Nectar 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nCinnamon Spiced Nectar is a blue shiny on top of the rock nearby.\n- 6. Follow the scent marks north along the water 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis updates around /way -3850, -2563, -103. An ambushing assassin spawns and attacks.\n- 7. Fight off the ambushing assassins 0/2 Stonebrunt Mountains\nKill the assassin. When he dies, another assassin spawns and attacks, kill him too.\n- 8. Collect the Cinnamon Spiced Nectar 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nCinnamon Spiced Nectar is a blue shiny by the river nearby.\n- 9. Follow the scent marks north along the water 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis updates around /way -3200, -2670, -36 on the other side of the river. An ambushing assassin spawns and attacks.\n- 10. Fight off the ambushing assassins 0/2 Stonebrunt Mountains\nKill the assassin. When he dies, another assassin spawns and attacks, kill him too.\n- 11. Collect the Cinnamon Spiced Nectar 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nCinnamon Spiced Nectar is a blue shiny by the river nearby.\n- 12. Follow the scent marks north 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThis updates around /way -2666, -2973, 64. An ambushing assassin spawns and attacks.\n- 13. Fight off the ambushing assassins 0/2 Stonebrunt Mountains\nKill the assassin. When he dies, another assassin spawns and attacks, kill him too.\n- 14. Defeat the assassin commander 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nThe assassin commander spawns and attacks. She is level 115. Kill her.\n- 15. Deliver the egg to the wrulon protector 0/1 Stonebrunt Mountains\nGive the Stolen Phoenix Egg to A Wrulon Protector nearby.\nThe new year looks bright with fiery potential. You have safely delivered the stolen Phoenix Egg to its guardian.\nA Wrulon Protector roars in triumph.\nReward(s):",
