      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest begins with Captain Bvellos in Kael Drakkel (roams from the arena to the bank to the palace area).\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Bvellos'\nCaptain Bvellos says 'Greetings, _____.  I am the captain of the Kael militia.  I will be watching those of your kind who have come to Kael Drakkel as mercenaries and bounty hunters.  You may have come here to serve king Tormax but Kael is my home and I intend to keep it a safe place for the Kromzek.  Keep yourself out of trouble or you will end up in a world of pain.'\nYou say, 'I will keep Kael safe.'\nCaptain Bvellos says 'With the influx of [mercenaries] into Kael Drakkel, I have seen minor crimes increase.  I have had to increase my militia patrols.  A majority of my militia work longer hours than they did before.  There was a time when we only had to watch for the dragons from the sky and the Coldain from the outside.  Now we must watch within.'\nYou say, 'What about mercenaries?'\nCaptain Bvellos says 'I have several bounties open if you are interested.  Bring me the head of a Coldain and I will reward you with a small sum of money and spread the word of your good work. There is also a bounty upon the nefarious Icepaw kobolds who serve the outcast Velketor.  I require four of the paws of those little beasts.'\nIn exchange for a Coldain Head, you receive a few platinum pieces and a substantial faction increase with King Tormax. (Note: An easy way to test your faction standing with King Tormax is to exit the bank and turn hard left. Before you get to the Icy Bridge, stop and con Dlammaz Stormslayer who is across the bridge and to the left.)\nCaptain Bvellos says, 'Excellent, ______. Here is the bounty as promised.'\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by 40\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by 10\nYour faction standing with King Tormax has been adjusted by 10\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan has been adjusted by -20\nYou gain experience!!\nIn exchange for 4x Kobold Paw, you get a Silvery Mask, an Antlered Mask, or a Giant Scalemail Tunic:\nCaptain Bvellos says 'You have done well to hunt down these foul dogs.'\nCaptain Bvellos reaches into a large bag and pulls something shiny from within its depths 'Take this as a reward.'\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by 40\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by 10\nYour faction standing with King Tormax has been adjusted by 10\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan has been adjusted by -20\nYou gain experience!!Submitted by: Lias RoxxRewards:\n- Antlered Mask [item=5798]\n- Giant Scalemail Tunic [item=4776]\n- Silvery Mask [item=4761]\n[",
