      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 54\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nKyenka is located in the throne room of Kael Drakkel. /waypoint -1420, +1585, -193\nYou say, 'Hail Kyenka'\nKyenka says 'My, it is the great Lias who stands before me!  Rumors of your greatness have spread even to the court of King Tormax.  I am Kyenka, Duke of Kael Drakkel. I advise King Tormax on matters concerning the nefarious dragons.\nYou say, 'What about these dragons?'\nKyenka says 'The living dragons of this realm are the bane of Kael Drakkel and its people.  Eventually they will be gone and only we Kromzek will remain.  We will purge this land of their menace.\nYou say, 'I will help you purge them'\nKyenka says 'The beasts must be slain.  They only bring strife to this world.  You are a powerful mercenary, and are sympathetic to my cause, I would assume.  You could become rich beyond your wildest dreams by assisting King Tormax and me.\nYou say, 'I will assist you'\nKyenka says 'Rally together a band of adventurers and track down and slay the elder dragons of this continent.  For each head you return to me I will impart a gift to you.\nUpon turning in a Great Dragon's Head:\nKyenka says, 'This beast must have taken quite a force to slay. These boots have been crafted to reward your kind for such great efforts. Take them and wear them with pride. They will be a warning to other dragons that you are a great slayer of their kind.'\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by 30.\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with King Tormax has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan could not possibly get any worse.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive Barbed Dragonscale Boots.\nUpon turning in a Greater Dragon's Head:\nKyenka says, 'You serve the crown well, ______. This is one less beast to ruin our lands. Take these pauldrons which I had fashioned from the last dragon scales brought to King Tormax's court.'\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by 30.\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with King Tormax has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan could not possibly get any worse.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive Barbed Dragonscale Pauldrons.\nSubmitted by: Lias Roxx ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Barbed Dragonscale Boots [item=4905]\n- Barbed Dragonscale Pauldrons [item=3999]\n[",
