      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 6 hours\n**Level:** 53\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nTalk to Sentry Kale to get the quest.  You hail him and when he asks you question whether you wish to become friend of the kins, this quest will be given to you. When you answer him in correct manner like I wish to become friend of the kin, he will talk about how there is Kromzek spy amongst them and that Wenglawks in Kael has more info.\nGo in invis, and give him the note from Kale and 100pp and you'll get a note back. If you are brave enough, you can hand him the stuff in there with lot of giants around OR you can wait outside since he does come out from the root and walk up the corriodor. Not sure how often he does but he does come out every now and then. If you want to take safe approach, stay invis and wait for him to come out and when he does, hand him 100pp and note fast so he won't be out of range for the transaction.\nOnce you do, he'll give you a LORE/NO TRADE dispelling device that looks like a card. He tells you to give it to Sentry Rotiart and get ready to fight. He is in a room w/ a cube and pool. Give him the dispelling device, he'll change into lvl 53 Kromzek spy. Warning, he is tough.... Highly magic resistant. You have to be in melee range to cast which kinda sucks. You'll need a strong group for this.\nOnce you kill him, he will drop LORE/NO TRADE spy note. Turn that in to Sentry Kale to receive faction and a dragon tooth choker.\nNeed all dialogues; current faction hits; names, level, /loc and fight abilities of quest mobs; additional zones; names of quest items; and any other relevant information.Rewards:\n- Dragon Tooth Choker [item=4346]\n[",
