      walkthrough = "**Level:** 6\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nRoyal Guard Lilkus is located on a balcony in the Palace at /waypoint +1307, +685, -22 .\nYou say, 'Hail, Royal Guard Lilkus'\nRoyal Guard Lilkus says 'You tread upon sacred ground Erudite. None may go further unless they [have business with the Overlord]. Or, if youre looking to gain favor with the Heretics and a little coin, I have a [job] for you.\nYou say, 'What job?'\nRoyal Guard Lilkus says 'There are many campaigns we administer from within our city, Paineel. Some of these campaigns are threatened or hindered by annoyances. One of these annoyances are the Kobolds that live in the filth of a cave not far from here. Find that lair and kill as many of these beasts as you can. For every kobold mollar you return you shall be rewarded.\nFor each Kobold Molar [item=5169] that is turned in you receive some gold, and have a small chance of receiving a random piece of ringmail armor, and faction.\nHand Royal Guard Lilkus the Kobold Molar.\nRoyal Guard Lilkus says 'Not bad, ____. Here is your reward. If you slay enough of these dogs, Sheltian may have a more important task for you to perform.'\nYour faction standing with Heretics has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with Deepwater Knights has been adjusted by -7.\nYour faction standing with Gate Callers has been adjusted by -7.\nYour faction standing with Craftkeepers has been adjusted by -7.\nYour faction standing with Crimson Hand has been adjusted by -7.\nYou receive 6 copper from Royal Guard Lilkus.\nYou receive 5 silver from Royal Guard Lilkus.\nYou receive 6 gold from Royal Guard Lilkus.\nYou have completed achievement: Paineel Quests - Kobold Molars\nReward: Ringmail Cape\n- Ringmail Cape [item=2160]\n[",
