      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Waagosh",
        "No, I am not lost. I was just admiring your pet.",
        "A rug? That",
        "That",
        "No, I do not want to help fatten him up.",
        "Yes. I can find some replacement skins to take Ruugz",
