      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 26\n**Maximum Level:** 50\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is part of the Stone Cold Summer events that start in August.\nYou can obtain this task from Waagosh in The Feerrott (old zone) at /way 1765, -1754, 0 on the eastern side of the zone near the walking path. She is on the Find Tool (Ctrl+F).\nNOTE: I got this task from both a level 40 and a level 26 characters. For now the Min/Max Level are set to 26 and 50, to be refined.\nYou say, 'Hail, Waagosh'\nWaagosh says, 'Oh. Hello there. I didn't see you there. Are you [lost]?'\nYou say, 'No, I am not lost. I was just admiring your pet.'\nWaagosh says, 'Ha. Ha. Ruugz? He's not my pet. I just need him to grow more, before I turn him into [a rug]. '\nYou say, 'A rug? That's just horrible.'\nWaagosh says, 'He has [nice] scaly skin that feels good beneath my feet. The cold scaly skin helps sand off the extra bits between my toes.'\nYou say, 'That's nice, but did you need to name him?'\nWaagosh says, 'Do you want to help [fatten him] up? '\nYou say, 'No, I do not want to help fatten him up.'\nWaagosh says, 'Hrrm. Do you want to find some [replacement skins], to take his place?'\nYou say, 'Yes. I can find some replacement skins to take Ruugz's place.'\nWaagosh says, 'Great. My feet need some help if I am going to finish my [investigations].'\nYou say, 'What investigations?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Skin So Soft [50]'.\nWaagosh says, 'Don't take too long. I would hate to have to finish my work with sore feet. '\nWaagosh's feet have been bothering her, and she is looking for help to create a new scaly rug. She thinks it will take too long for Ruugz to grow to size, as she does have her investigation to get back to in the Feerrott.\nHead to the Temple of Cazic Thule and hunt Tae Ew for strips of scaly skin.\nHunt jungle raptors that also call the temple home for their sinews.\nIn Waagosh's run sewing kit, combine five strips of scaly skin, two rough sinews, one simple sewing needle, and two aligned steel threads into one stitched scaly rug.\n- 1. Loot a few strips of scaly skin 0/5 Temple of Cazic-Thule\nThese can drop off Tae ews.\n- 2. Loot a few rough sinews 0/2 Temple of Cazic Thule\nThese can drop off jungle raptors.\n- 3. Craft a new stitched scaly skin rug 0/1 ALL\nIn Waagosh's Rug Sewing kit, combine 5x Strip of Scaly Skin, 2 Rough Sinew, 1 Simple Sewing Needle [item=68508] and 2 Aligned Steel Thread [item=29191].\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Stitched Scaly Skin Rug.\nYour task 'Skin So Soft [50]' has been updated.\n- 4. Deliver the Stitched Scaly Skin Rug 0/1 The Feerrott\nYou offered 1 Stitched Scaly Skin Rug to Waagosh.\nYour task 'Skin So Soft [50]' has been updated.\nYou complete the trade with Waagosh.\n- 5. Talk to Waagosh about the rug 0/1 The Feerrott\nYou say, 'Hail, Waagosh'\nYour task 'Skin So Soft [50]' has been updated.\nWaagosh was chuffed to receive her new rug. Now she can treat her feet and move on to more pressing matters.\nYou have been assigned the task 'No Peeking or Eating'.\nWaagosh says, 'Now that is a fine rug indeed. How about you take my [notes] on this here investigation, while I treat my feet?'\nYou are given: Waagosh's Investigation Notes\nThis leads into the next task 'No Peeking or Eating [quest=12583]'\nReward(s):\n5x Fire-Branded Lizard Kebabs (Food: AC: 15, HP: 275, Mana: 190, End: 300, Rec Level: 90 This is a miraculous meal!)Rewards:\n[",
