      walkthrough = "**Level:** 30\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYour Location is -1409.67, 547.72, -49.54\nAfter bringing Xelha Nevagon four spiderling silks, she will tell you to bring her a cyclops eye. Give her one if she cons at least kindly to you (500). She will not talk to you if you are below +100 faction (amiably).\nXelha Nevagon says 'A cyclops eye!! You are stronger than I believed. You will rise in the ranks of the Dismal Rage quickly with acts such as this!! I am most appreciative! Here, take this. It was lying around my shelves, just getting all dusty. I hope you can use it. And watch yourself in your journeys, the aura of your faith in Innoruuk surrounds you like a shroud. Our enemies will surely see you for what you are.'\nYour faction standing with Dismal Rage has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Knights of Truth has been adjusted by -3.\nYour faction standing with Opal Dark Briar has been adjusted by 5.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive 7 platinum from Xelha Nevagon. Submitted by: Dral BlackstaffRewards:\n- Spell: Gate [item=8190]\n- Spell: Leering Corpse [item=9915]\n[",
