      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest may or may not be obsolete following the Plane of Mischief revamp in October 2003. If you have information about this quest's status, let us know.\nThere are random Mobs in the zone that drop library cards.  Give one to Posie the Librarian and she will give you a 4-slot container called the Book of Mischief.  Also dropping randomly are four pages, top left and right and bottom left and right.  Combine these four pages in the book and you will get a Words of Wealth, which unfortunately can't be equipped.\nNow talk to Bob the painter and give him your words of wealth and you will get an empty pot of gold (2 slot container).  You will need to create an item using the deck of spontaneous generation.  Only 2-throne combination items work (e.g., Green Wristguard, Vambraces of Distraction, Crown of Distraction), except for Mask of Melodies (1-throne), which also works.  Combine it in the pot of gold with a Words of Wealth.  This will give you a Funny Money.\nGive 2 funny moneys to Peachy D'Vicci and she gives you a colored Gift Box.  The box has 5 charges.  Occasionally you will receive a Frostmaidens Idol instead of a gift box.\nIf you click on the box, you will summon a doll.  The type of doll depends upon the color of the box.  The doll has 5 charges of Hug, which is a regen spell.  As far as I know, the color of the box you will get is completely random.  Each doll is named after a specific class; thus there is one colored box per class.  When this Doll is combined in the pot of gold with the main Armor of Distraction types obtained through the Deck of Spontaneous Generation quest, you get the class-specific doll quest armor.  Thus far, the gift boxes found produce dolls only for the pure int/wis casters and monks.Rewards:\n- Black Gift Box [item=22292]\n- Blue Gift Box [item=6146]\n- Crazy Cleric Arm Plate [item=6371]\n- Crazy Cleric Boots [item=6356]\n- Crazy Cleric Breastplate [item=6355]\n- Crazy Cleric Doll [item=22309]\n- Crazy Cleric Gauntlets [item=6380]\n- Crazy Cleric Greaves [item=6489]\n- Crazy Cleric Helm [item=6374]\n- Crazy Cleric Wrist Guard [item=6372]\n- Frostmaidens Idol [item=18656]\n- Green Gift Box [item=22293]\n- Grey Gift Box [item=22294]\n- Maleficent Boots [item=6527]\n- Maleficent Bracer [item=6526]\n- Maleficent Crown [item=6529]\n- Maleficent Gloves [item=6775]\n- Maleficent Leggings [item=6528]\n- Maleficent Necromancer Doll [item=22305]\n- Maleficent Robe [item=6384]\n- Maleficent Sleeves [item=6525]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Bracer [item=6543]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Crown [item=6367]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Doll [item=22307]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Gloves [item=6368]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Leggings [item=6366]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Robe [item=6352]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Shoes [item=6353]\n- Mischievous Dazzler Sleeves [item=6542]\n- Monkey Hide Arm Plate [item=6351]\n- Monkey Hide Boots [item=6363]\n- Monkey Hide Breastplate [item=6350]\n- Monkey Hide Greaves [item=6364]\n- Monkey Hide Helm [item=6365]\n- Monkey Hide Wrist Guard [item=6544]\n- Purple Gift Box [item=22296]\n- Red Gift Box [item=6144]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Arm Guard [item=6534]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Boots [item=6536]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Bracer [item=6535]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Chestplate [item=6359]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Doll [item=22308]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Gauntlets [item=6383]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Greaves [item=6537]\n- Shamanistic Shenanigan Helm [item=6360]\n- Silver Gift Box [item=22297]\n- Sly Summoner Doll [item=6147]\n- Sly Summoners Boots [item=6539]\n- Sly Summoners Crown [item=6540]\n- Sly Summoners Gloves [item=6541]\n- Sly Summoners Pants [item=6370]\n- Sly Summoners Robe [item=6354]\n- Sly Summoners Sleeves [item=6369]\n- Sly Summoners Wristguard [item