      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** Days\n**Level:** 22\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nWeltria Ostriss is located at -1100, -240 on the top floor of the Erudin Library.\nYou say, 'Hail, Weltria Ostriss'\nWeltria Ostriss says 'Good day, ______. I assist in maintaining an accurate collection of historical tomes here in the great library of Erudin. One of our citizens recently escaped the dungeons of the Kobold warrens and tells of a Kobold lore keeper who keeps a collection of scrolls detailing the history of their kind. Are you capable of obtaining those scrolls for our library?'\nYou say, 'I am capable.'\nWeltria Ostriss says 'Take this case and return it to me when you have collected all of the scrolls.'\nReceive Large Scroll Case.\nLorekeeper Roggik is located in The Warrens and drops seven different Dusty Kobold Scrolls, which identify as the following:\nRise of King Gkar and Klan Kolbok\nThe Ascension of Rolfron Zek\nThe Fall of Kolbok\nThe Kobold Age of Blood\nThe Council and the Dwarves\nKobolds in the Age of Scale\nThe Arrival of Rallos Zek\nThe scrolls are written in Elder Teir'Dal and detail the history of the kobolds.  Combine these 7 scrolls in the case to make the Kobold History Collection.  Hand the Kobold History Collection to Weltria Ostriss.\nWeltria Ostriss says 'You have my gratitude, ______! This will make a valuable addition to our historical volumes and perhaps offer some insight into the workings of Kobold society.'\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Erudin has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with High Council of Erudin has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with High Guard of Erudin has been adjusted by 3.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 50 platinum from Weltria Ostriss. Submitted by: Tibidus Farlighter, rewrite by SythikRewards:\n- Faction, Platinum\n[",
