      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYour Location is 270.79, -1110.29, -95.65\nAderius Rhenar regards you indifferently -- You could probably win this fight.\nYou say, 'Hail, Aderius Rhenar'\nAderius Rhenar says 'Hail, ______. I am Aderius Rhenar, priest of Quellious and assistant to Lady Leraena. I have been fortunate to be imprisoned here with these Kejekan cat men, they are a very wise people. Are you planning on returning to Erudin soon my friend?'\nYou say, 'Yes.'\nAderius Rhenar says 'I have managed to prepare a message on this scrap of cloth for the priestess Leraena. It is a matter of great importance to the High Council of Erudin. Please deliver this message to her promptly. I must stay here for a while longer and converse further with my Kejekan friends.'\nYou receive a Rolled Up Strip of Cloth (identifies as \"message to Laraena\").  Bring it to Leraena Shelyrak in the Temple of Divine Light in Erudin.\nYou have entered Erudin.\nYour Location is -649.03, -91.10, 67.10\nLeraena Shelyrak regards you indifferently -- what would you like your tombstone to say?\nYou say, 'Hail, Leraena Shelyrak'\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'Welcome my, child. I am Leraena Shelyrak, overseer of the Temple of Divine Light. Inside this temple, you may find the path to inner peace. Introduce yourself to each of the priests and priestesses of the temple as well as the paladins. Together we shall put an end to such disruptive influences as the [kobold shaman].'\nHand in the strip of cloth.\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'This is important news indeed. It seems there is a tribe of cat men in the Stonebrunt Mountains that wishes to form an alliance with Erudin. I must alert the High Council of this immediately, thank you for your services.'\nYour faction standing with Peace Keepers has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with High Council of Erudin has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Heretics has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 8 copper from Leraena Shelyrak.\nYou receive 2 silver from Leraena Shelyrak.\nYou say, 'What cat men?'\nYou say, 'What catmen?'\nYou say, 'What Stonebrunt Mountains?'\nYou say, 'What alliance?'\nYou say, 'What high council?'\nYou say, 'I will alert the high council.'\nIs there anything else after this?  Is there a minimum faction requirement?Submitted by: LeodeRewards:\n[",
