      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 100\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is the 25th Anniversary Group Mission.\nTo obtain this group mission, talk to Ghrald McMannus in Katta Castellum.\nYou say, 'Hail, Ghrald McMannus'\nGhrald McMannus says, 'Thank you for not running off the moment that we found this issue was spawned by Vazaelle. She's usually so subtle, trying to pick off those people others might unfortunately ignore. It's not quite possible to [ignore] the effect of Gaius' obsession though.'\nYou say, 'You can't ignore the apparitions.'\nGhrald McMannus says, 'Correct.' With a slow nod, he reaches a hand into his belt pouch and pulls out a smaller pouch. 'On that note, I have saved a portion of the ingredients left over from the vision that had occurred. They did not all dissipate with the coalescence. I believe we might be able to use it to access Vazaelle's [plane], or at least the sliver in which she keeps Gaius held. If you simply wish to handle some requests, I will send you back out to [gather] more information and ingredients.'\nYou say, 'I am willing to travel to her plane.'\nGhrald McMannus says, 'I recommend you bring some friends then. Gaius, if any part of him exists there, may be too difficult to subdue and return with only one of you. Take this helm, and put it on him when you find him; it should block her influence. When you are [prepared], let me know, and I will do my best to send you where no one dares tread.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Reflections of You'.\nGhrald McMannus, friend of Gaius Ludanus, took some of the spare ingredients you had gathered to send you to a sliver of Vazaelle's realm to find Gaius' mind and set him free. He gave you a helm which should release him from her influence.\nThere are dozens of dragon-related visions here with no rhyme or reason. They are only visions, so release Gaius' mind from their presence. In the eastern wing, the vision of a large fae drake takes up so much of Gaius' mind. Relieve him of that vision.\n- 1. Kill the various living visions 0/20 Paineel\ndrakes, undead drakes, drakkin all count for this step.\n- 2. Explore the east wing of this floor 0/1 Paineel\nThis step updates in the first room to the east of where you zone in.\n- 3. Kill what is clearly not a real fae drake 0/1\nKill a not a fae drake.\n- 4. Explore the central courtyard of this floor 0/1 Paineel\nThis is straight ahead of where you port in.\n- 5. Kill what is clearly not a real drake 0/1 Paineel\nKill not a real drake.\n- 6. Explore the west wing of this floor 0/1 Paineel\nThis is directly west of where you port in.\n- 7. Kill what is clearly not a real undead drake 0/1 Paineel\nKill not an undead drake.\n- 8. Hail the Messenger of Drinal in the central courtyard 0/1 Paineel\nMessenger of Drinal is in the central court yard on the east side in a corner.\nYou say, 'Hail, Messenger of Drinal'\nMessenger of Drinal says, 'Bark! It is good that you are here for one of the Silver Reaper's. Yip! He is right in the palace. I shall bless the helm you intend to use. Keep it close and in hand. You will need it for our friend. Bark bark!'\nYour task 'Reflections of You' has been updated.\n- 9. Explore the inner palace to the north 0/1 Paineel\nThis is just inside the building north of the central area.\n- 10. Use the helm on Gaius the Mad! 0/1 Paineel\nGaius is in the north tower just off the central courtyard area. Be ready to fight him, he spawns around 6 baby dragon adds that are slowable and mezzable.\nBeat Gaius's health down some and then click the Helm of Foiling while he is targeted. I beat him down to about 20% until the helm finally did anything.\nYou begin casting Place Helm.\nYour task 'Reflections of You' has been updated.\nTo complete the 25th Anniversary Mission Challenge: [quest=12901]\nYou can do this before or after opening the a reward chest.\nFind a ground spawn Vision of a Dragon's Egg in the zone Paineel: Reflections of You\nAdd these locations to your paineel_3.txt map\nP -866.2590, -1148.1648, -20.0181,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nP -723.3013, -1121.8312, -40.9667,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nP -435.0410, -1124.0919, -41.9667,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nP -404.2481, -1146.7939, -41.9667,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nP -521.8977, -1216.4966, -41.9667,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nP -790.0285, -1183.2151, -41.9667,  240, 240, 240,  3,  Egg\nGive the Vision of a Dragon's Egg to Gaius Lucianus\nYou offered 1 Vision of a Dragon's Egg to Gaius Lucianus.\nGaius Lucianus looks over the egg and sadly smiles. 'And now I see it for what it really is. Here, you can have it back.' A gem is offered back to you.\nYou complete the trade with Gaius Lucianus.\nYou have completed achievement: 25th Anniversary Mission Challenge\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: An Egg for Gaius\nYou get one choice from the following type 3 augs with a skill mod:\nEmerald of Abjuration [item=148921] - Skill Mod: Specialize Abjure +15% (45 Max)\nTourmaline of Alteration [item=148922] - Skill Mod: Specialize Alteration +15% (45 Max)\nCitrine of Conjuration [item=148923] - Skill Mod: Specialize Conjuration +15% (45 Max)\nPeridot of Divination [item=148924] - Skill Mod: Specialize Divination +15% (45 Max)\nTopaz of Evocation [item=148925] - Skill Mod: Specialize Evocation +15% (45 Max)\nRuby of Offense [item=148926] - Skill Mod: Offense +10% (20 Max)\nSapphire of Defense [item=148935] - Skill Mod: Defense +10% (20 Max)\n- 11. Speak with Gaius Lucianus 0/1 Paineel\nYou say, 'Hail, Gaius Lucianus'\nGaius Lucianus looks a little dumbstruck and blinks a few times. 'That was interesting. I never expected a passing interest would take over my entire identity... The things I would have tried to do to have it, to touch it, to partake in it. The idea of having my own egg or even my own wings.' He furrows his brow. 'Thank you. Please take a look at the chest and take what you need.'\nYour task 'Reflections of You' has been updated.\n- 12. Open the chest and receive your reward 0/1 Paineel\nYour task 'Reflections of You' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'Reflections of You': 0d:6h:0m remaining.\nYou have freed Gaius' mind from the sliver of Vazaelle's domain. It may take a bit for him to return back to normal, but you have been a large help to this devotee of Drinal.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou have gained 5 ability point(s)!\nYou gain experience! (0.296%)\nYou received 20 Commemorative Coins.\nYou have completed achievement: 25th Anniversary Mission\nPossible loot from a reward chest:\n--You have looted a Gleaming Silver Protector Source from a reward chest .--\n--You have looted a Gleaming Silver Conjuror Source from a reward chest .--\n--You have looted a Gleaming Silver Wayfarer Source from a reward chest .--\n--You have looted a Gleaming Silver Slayer Source from a reward chest .--\nReward(s):\n2p 2g 5s\nExperience\n20 Commemorative Coins\nLootSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Gleaming Silver Conjuror Source [item=148950]\n- Gleaming Silver Protector Source [item=148960]\n- Gleaming Silver Slayer Source [item=148919]\n- Gleaming Silver Wayfarer Source [item=148918]\n[",
