      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Adventure\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis 26th Anniversary Heroic Adventure can be obtained from Firiona Vie in Shadeweaver's Thicket at /waypoint -1699, +2149, -157 .\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie says, 'Welcome back, _____.  Your timing could not be more perfect. An associate of Nulna's just dropped off the device she had been working on. They claim it is more than just a [key] to bypass the security.'\nYou say, 'Nulna did mention that it wasn't so much a key, but a transportation device.'\nFiriona Vie says, 'Well, that confirms my suspicion that this has been modified to be a teleportation device. This plan sounds reckless, but without a better way of getting into the thief's hideout, it is the only one we have. When you are [ready] to teleport there, let me know.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Great Jade Idol Caper'.\nYou say, 'I am ready to teleport when you are.'\nFiriona Vie nods and presses the button. 'All right, here we go.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Boldven's Hideout.\nAfter considerable legwork you found the thief's hideout, and thanks to Firiona Vie's associate you hope to have a way of bypassing its security. All you need to do is activate a hastily made teleporter. What could go wrong?\nSpeak with Firiona Vie's arcane projection.\n- 1. Speak with projection of Firiona Vie inside the Thief's Hideout 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie says, 'I am not entirely sure what happened, but it appears the device malfunctioned or there was some kind of interference in the teleportation. I am not at the same location as you. Did you manage to make it into the thief's [hideout]?'\nYou say, 'It doesn't look like a cabin in the woods, but these golems look like the same ones guarding the hideout.'\nFiriona Vie says, 'At least you recognize the golems. I will try to make my way to you, but it may take me a while. In the meantime, we do not want to squander this [opportunity] to reclaim the idol.'\nYou say, 'I agree, this may be our only opportunity to get the jump on Boldven.'\nFiriona Vie says, 'Good. Then make your way through his hideout and I will figure out a way to reach you. Just be careful, we do not know if he has any traps or additional security lying in wait.'\nYour task 'The Great Jade Idol Caper' has been updated.\n- 2. Destroy Security Terminal Zero 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nThere are these objects located in the back rooms, one is Security Terminal One and the other is Security Terminal Zero.\nSecurity Terminal Zero is in the back left room.\n- 3. Defeat Security Bot Mongrop XV Alpha 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nKill Security Terminal Zero and Mongrop XV Alpha spawns and attacks. Kill it. It has around 155 million HP (level 126 version) and doesn't cast anything.\n- 4. Destroy Security Terminal One 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nSecurity Terminal One is located in the back right room.\n- 5. Defeat Security Bot Mongrop XV Beta 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nKill Security Terminal One and Mongrop XV Beta spawns and attacks. Kill it. It has around 155 million HP (level 126 version) and doesn't cast anything.\n- 6. Destroy the Vault Security Terminal 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nKill it.\n- 7. Defeat the first security wave 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\n3 a security drone spawn in the back of the room so set your group up on the opposite side where you killed the Vault Security Terminal.\nThey don't attack and don't see invis. You can pacify and pull them one by one.\n- 8. Defeat the second security wave 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\n2 a security golems and 2 a security drone spawn in the same place, in the back of the room. Pacify and pull them one by one.\n- 9. Defeat the security bot, Grung XV Max 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nOn the death of the last mob in that wave, Grung XV Max spawns and attacks. Kill it. Grung XV Max has 310 million HP (level 126) and doesn't cast anything.\n- 10. Locate the Jade Tiger Idol 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nClear out in the room before the Jade Tiger Idol. Once you step into the room, Boldven spawns and attacks.\n- 11. Defeat the thief, Boldven 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nBoldven has around 315 million HP (level 126). During the fight he casts a targeted AE called Serrated Blade Barrage. It's a Poison and as a negative resist adjust for Physical -300. Range is 600. It's a dot that does 17.5k damage per tic and lasts for 24 seconds.\nIt didn't really matter where I put my group, I wasn't able to dodge it. Just heal through it.\nDuring the fight he spawns 3x a mini max bot.  They despawn when Boldven dies\n- 12. Speak with Firiona Vie 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nYou say, 'Hail, Firiona Vie'\nFiriona Vie catches her breath as she looks over the idol. 'You did very well in securing the [idol]. I am sorry that I was not able to get here in time to assist you in defeating the thief, but you appear to have handled the situation admirably.'\nYou say, 'idol'\nFiriona Vie runs her hands across the surface. 'Yes, this is precisely what I needed, but now that I have it in my hands, I will need to do a little more research before I can utilize it effectively. For now, though, you have far exceeded my expectations. Thank you for all your help.'\nYour task 'The Great Jade Idol Caper' has been updated.\nBonus item: Jade Crystal Sconce\nBefore opening the chest, look around the zone for crystal ground spawns.  Combine a blue and yellow crystal in the Jewelcrafting table in this mission to create a Jade Crystal Sconce.\n- 13. Loot the chest 0/1 Grand Guild Hall\nYou can open the chest before everybody is in zone. You get the coin reward when you zone in.\nYou receive 41 platinum, 3 silver and 3 copper as your split (with a lucky bonus).\nYour task 'The Great Jade Idol Caper' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'The Great Jade Idol Caper': 0d:6h:0m:0s remaining.\nAfter a messy teleport you and Firiona Vie were separated, but you managed to disable the hideout's remaining security and after confronting the thief, Boldven, you secured the idol for Firiona Vie.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nReward(s):\n2 platinum 2 gold 5 silver\n10 Commemorative Coins\nChest Loot:\nCore of Resolve\nEcho of Mastery\nEpaulets of Lost Glory\nMantle of Faded Echoes\nMark of Fury\nSeal of the Sword\nShard of Verdicts\nShawl of Remembrance\nVision of Insight\nSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Core of Resolve [item=151421]\n- Crystal Junk [item=151459]\n- Echo of Mastery [item=151405]\n- Epaulets of Lost Glory [item=151422]\n- Jade Crystal Sconce [item=151454]\n- Mantle of Faded Echoes [item=151409]\n- Mark of Fury [item=151427]\n- Seal of the Sword [item=151406]\n- Shard of Verdicts [item=151408]\n- Shawl of Rememberance [item=151410]\n- Vision of Insight [item=151407]\n[",
    },
