      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Adventure\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis shared heroic adventure can be obtained from Faeta Glor [npc=60518] in Shadeweaver's Thicket. He is on the Find tool (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Faeta Glor'\nFaeta Glor says, 'Welcome back to the gallery. Seems you are ready to meet the secret sponsor now. Would you like to go [find] them or would you like to look at the gallery [pieces]?'\nYou say, 'I`ll go find them.'\nFaeta Glor says, 'The Doke Collective seemed to have also found out about the secret sponsor. I saw them heading there with some of the guards. You may run into them while searching for the sponsor. If you are [ready] just let me know and I will guide you to the entrance.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Secret Sponsor'.\nYou can now meet the secret sponsor. Hidden away in her lair what could they be doing. Time to venture forth and seek out what the sponsor has planned for figuring out their small riddle. Speak with Faeta Glor to enter the secret sponsor's lair.\n- 1. Enter the secret sponsor's lair 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis updated for me at /way -649, 997, -224 at the mouth of the first tunnel you come to from the Loda Kai Embassy building where you zone into the instance.\n- 2. Explore the cavern and seek out the sponsor 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis updated at /way -1339, 691, -429 heading south in the tunnel when you enter it from the west.\n- 3. Jade statues have come to life destroy them 0/10 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nKill 10 of them, any of the civilians and criminals. They are level 120.\n- 4. Fight through the Doke Collective's soldiers 0/10 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nNot far away, a jade soldier, a jade spiriitist, a jade seer all count for this step. This includes the ones in the tunnels.  Kill 10 of them, they are level 120.\n- 5. Explore deeper into the cavern to find out what is going on 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nGo further south to /way -1738, 788, -420 until you see a series of holes.\n- 6. Find what goes into the rock formation 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis updated for me at /way -2188, 1281, -427 in the far southern and west room in the tunnels.\n- 7. Kill the Doke Collective 0/3 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nSeveral mobs in the tunnels count for this. They have (Doke Collective) under their name. They are all level 126 but have very little hp.\nAlaston Dianthus which is in the same room as the location update from the previous step.\nVileor Wilkern is in the room to the east of Alaston Dianthus.\nNeetor Ikadiff is in the same room as Vileor.\n- 8. Collect jade hearts 0/3 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThey all drop Jade Heart, loot 3 of them.\n- 9. Go back to the rock formation 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nGo back to the a series of holes not far from the 2 rooms you were in.\n- 10. Insert the 3 jade hearts into the rock formation 0/3 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nTrade the 3 Jade Heart's to the a series of holes \"NPC\", click below the name to get a trade window. Or you can /target a_series\n- 11. Enter the secret sponsor's abode 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis part is bugged, the rock was still there when I traded in the Jade Hearts to a series of holes. I was able to shrink twice, and then kept on ducking and unducking over and over again while walking forward in the cracks of the rock.\n- 12. Enter the secret sponsor's abode 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nThis updates in the room behind where the big rock was at /way -1657, 1070, -434\n- 13. Defeat the secret sponsor, Illia Forgor 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nIllia Forgor is in the room back behind the rock. It's level 129 has the HP of a TOB rare.\nIt also casts Toxin Explosion, PB AE Unresistable, PBAE, Range 1000, AE Range 350. Duration 30 seconds. 47k to 50k damage per tick.\nIt also casts Slashing Strike. Unresistable, Single Target, Range 300. Pushback: 5, Push Up: 3. Duration 12 seconds.\nIt will push whoever has aggro the whole fight so the group will need to adjust as she pushes them.\nLater in the fight when it gets below 50% it starts to cast Silencing Screech (Silence) PB AE, range 200, AE Range 25. Lasts for 12 seconds.\nYou gain party experience! (0.308%)\nYou have slain Ilia Forgor!\nYour task 'The Secret Sponsor' has been updated.\nMy strat was to park the tank away from the group. Casters and healers keep their distance to avoid the silence, it's a short range on the silence. Heal through the dot.\n- 14. Loot the chest 0/1 Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou receive 18 platinum, 8 gold and 3 silver as your split.\nYour task 'The Secret Sponsor' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'The Secret Sponsor': 0d:6h:0m:0s remaining.\nYou found the secret sponsor, a gorgon by Ilia Forglor, and defeated them. On your way here you dispatched the Doke Collective, all the things they made you do were not humane anyways. You do not have a cure for the jade affliction, even if you wanted to spare any of them. Time to get out of this place.\nYou receive 5 silver .\nYou receive 2 gold .\nYou receive 2 platinum .\nYou received 10 Commemorative Coins.\nReward(s):\n2 platinum 2 gold 5 silver\n10 Commemorative Coins\nSide Quest: When you kill Ilia Forgor, it spawns a note on the ground. Hand it to Faeta Glor in Shadeweaver's Thicket after zoning out of the instance to get Metamorph: Jade Sessiloid [item=151455].\nChest Loot:\nEcho of Mastery\nGirdle of Antiquity\nMark of Fury\nSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Belt of the Departed [item=151411]\n- Commemorative Coin [item=116720]\n- Core of Resolve [item=151421]\n- Echo of Mastery [item=151405]\n- Girdle of Antiquity [item=151428]\n- Mark of Fury [item=151427]\n- Metamorph: Jade Sessiloid [item=151455]\n- Sash of the Vanished [item=151457]\n- Seal of the Sword [item=151406]\n- Shard of Verdicts [item=151408]\n[",
