      walkthrough = "**Level:** 100\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Adventure\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis Stone Cold Summer Heroic Adventure begins with Lanm Zidas [npc=60696] in Kaesora at /waypoint -231, +579, -299 on the bottom floor of the southwest area of the zone.\nLanm Zidas says, 'Hello, _____. Forgive me, I don't have time to chat. I'm investigating the rising bones and have narrowed down [the source].'\nYou say, 'You found the source?'\nLanm Zidas says, 'I have narrowed down the location. I just can't confirm the right time or what is causing the disruption. I might be able to send you to the location, if you want to [help investigate]?'\nYou say, 'I want to help investigate.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Stone to Rock, Gravel to Dust'.\nPlayer _____ creating instance Kaesora Library 2627.\nLanm Zidas says, 'I can't wait to learn what you find out. '\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Kaesora Library: Stone to Rock, Gravel to Dust.\nLanm Zidas thinks he has found the cause of the bones rising to the surface of the Field of Bones He believes that a cult has entered the old Kaesora library and stirring up the dead kept there He wants you to travel to the library, stop the cultist and any skeletons that they may have raised.\nDefeat the cultists to stop their summoning.\n- 1. Defeat the cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\nAny mob with cultists in their name counts for this step.\n- 2. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\nSame as above, any mob with cultists in their name.\nSame with the below steps. Keep making your way down clearing out the floors with cultists. Keep an eye out for ancient skeletons, kill them.\n- 3. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 4. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 5. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 6. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 7. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 8. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 9. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 10. Defeat more cultists 0/3 Kaesora Library\n- 11. Investigate where the skeletons come from 0/1 Kaesora Library\nThis is a location update at /way -1202, -1239, -567 at the mouth of the tunnel at the bottom of all the floors.\n- 12. Defeat the Hermit of Xalgoz 0/1 Kaesora Library\nOnce you get the location update above you see.\nLooking down the tunnel of skeletons, you see why the cultists haven't ventured further. The Hermit of Xalgoz charges forth to end the disruption to his rest.\n- 13. Loot the chest for your reward 0/1 Kaesora Library\nChest can be found further down the hall past the skellies, on the left past the columns.\nYou have stopped the cultists and helped lay the skeletons of Kaesora to rest.\nYou have completed achievement: Stone Cold Summer: Break the Stone\n(Opt) - 1. Stop the ancient skeletons 0/10 Kaesora Library\nYou should see these skeletons spawn on every floor, kill them.\nIf you don't kill them all and you kill Hermit of Xalgoz you will see\nYou failed to kill all ten of the ancient skeletons and at least one got away. You have failed the Sticks and Stones challenge.\nYou have failed the Wrap It Up time challenge.\nReward(s):\nBanner of Kaesora (from the achievement)\nSealed Sanguine Earring Box was looted from the chest\nSubmitted by: GidonoRewards:\n- Banner of Kaesora [item=151713]\n- Sanguine Earring of the Shackled [item=151736]\n- Sealed Sanguine Earring Box [item=151737]\n[",
