      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Brodlan Remdo'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'Why hello, I'm in charge of the fishing operations here on Jerns Isle. Fish are my area of expertise.'\nYou say, 'What fish?'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'We have fish come in here all the time, sometimes we catch an oddity now and again.\nYou say, 'What oddity?'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'Once we pulled up this ancient chest filled with this dark plate armor.\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'Looked the like kind of armor a dark knight would wear, if ya want it I'm sure we could arrange a trade of some sort.\nYou say, 'I want the armor'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'Looked the like kind of armor a dark knight would wear, if ya want it I'm sure we could arrange a trade of some sort.\nYou say, 'What trade?'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'Since Trevor and I are the ones that found it we split it between ourselves.  I have a helm, breastplate, vambraces, greaves, pauldrons, bracer, and boots. Ask Trevor about the rest of the armor.\nYou say, 'What about the bracer?'\nBrodlan Remdo says 'For the darkened knight's bracer fetch me a sun jewel, a mark of intimidation, and a small rough marble figurine. Rewards:\n- Darkened Knight's Bracer [item=7362]\n[",
