      walkthrough = "**Time:** 15 minutes\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nHardam Stonegrinder is located in the Short and Stout section of Shadowhaven (location is -307.24, 1462.57, -32.81).\nYou say, 'Hail, Hardam Stonegrinder'\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'In need of some ores or other mining supplies? Well step right up, I got everything ye could possibly need! Also I'll have more supplies coming in as soon as I can get some dern time to deliver my [payment] to the commissioner.'\nYou say, 'What payment?'\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'Well ya see mate I have a representative of me great mining business here that is currently in the bazaar, however I got some new things I need him to sell but I can't leave me shop! I just need to get these new [items] to him so that he can sell them.'\nYou say, 'What items?'\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'Well da usual items ya know. I gets a lot of different goods in here every day and it is important that I move em out as fast as possible when they worth more ya knows? If ye lewkin for a [task] I've heard about ye around town and ye seem to be a trustworthy person.'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'I'm simply lookin for someone to take me box of [goods] here to my friend in the bazaar, his name is Faeroi and he will know what to do with them.'\nYou say, 'I'll take these goods'\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'I thank ya for your willingness to help, _____. Here is the box of the different things I need taken to Faeroi. When I spoke to him before he left for the bazaar this morning he told me that the helm that I had been having customized was ready. I have enclosed a note for him to give that to you to return to me. I look forward to seeing you soon.'\nYou receive 'Hardams Box of Goods'.\nFind Faeroi in the Bazaar at location +16, 0, 0.\nYou say, 'Hail, Faeroi'\nFaeroi says 'Hi there _____. It's nice to meet ye. Many great deals here today if I don't say so myself.'\nGive him 'Hardams Box of Goods'.\nFaeroi says 'Ah Hardam sent you eh. Fair enough then, please let him know I will get to selling these goods as soon as possible and please let him know that the helm will be done soon. All I need is a certain [piece].'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 5.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'What piece?'\nFaeroi says 'I'm waiting to have a rhino beetle horn delivered to me to finish off Hardam's helm. I do not want to present it to him with one horn, you know. If you wanted to be a big help, any rhino beetles horn would do fine. Bring one to me and I can then finish Hardam's helm and send it back to his shop in your hands.'\nGo get yourself a Rhino Beetle Horn and give it to Faeroi.\nFaeroi says 'Its good to see you again so soon Hazan. I knew that you would be able to assist me in this task. As I said , here is Hardams finished helm. Please return it to him for me as I cannot leave my booth here.'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nNow take Hardams Custom Helm to Hardam.\nHardam Stonegrinder says 'Ah what a pleasant surprise indeed it seems my Helm is done! Many thanks for all your help once again Hazan. And safe travels to you.'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\n- Experience, Faction\n[",
