      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nBeriol Talorakoir is found in Shadow Haven's library area or casters area in the far northeast corner of the zone: Location +1400, -421. See NPC page for map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Beriol Talkorakoir'\nBeriol Talorakoir says 'Hail Ephemeral. And good day to you. What brings you to my quarters today? Do you wish to learn more about the [magic] that we study in our hallowed section of the Shadowhaven?\nYou say, 'What magic?'\nBeriol Talorakoir says 'It's always a pleasure to meet someone that shows interest in the magic we practice here. Our magic studies consist mostly of teleportation and the arts of elemental mastery. I'm Actually conducting a study now, but I' missing a few [books].\nYou say, 'What books?'\nBeriol Talorakoir says 'Well, I have an old student that is now serving as an advisor to one of the most respected residents of Katta Castelleum. He has some specific books that i need to further my research, but i cannot take the time to travel so far away from my home to retrieve them. I seek out one who will [bring my research] to me from Dersino.\nYou say, 'I will bring your research'\nBeriol Talorakoir gives you a Seal of Beriol.\nBeriol Talorakoir says 'You are exactly the one I am looking for. After presenting this seal to Dersino, inform him that you wish to take the research and I am sure that he will know i have sent you. I loook forward to seeing you soon.\nFind Dersino in Katta Castelleum at location -254, -26: In the castle to your right after zoning in from Tenebrous Mountains on the first floor. Look at NPC page to see map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dersino'\nDersino says, 'Hello stranger. Im very busy with my work, is there something specific you need to speak to me about?'\nHand him the Seal of Beriol.\nDersino says 'Ah of course my teacher Beriol needs some of these books for his research, here they are. It is a shame my studies have taken me so far from my roots. Hopefully I can return home soon and Visit my family and friends. In the mean time It was very nice to meet you and I wish you the best of luck. Please also return of you wish to deliver more books to my friend Beriol.'\nReceive a Book of Ancient Scribings.\nYour faction standing with House of Midst has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!!\nHead back to Shadow Haven and give Book of Ancient Scribings to Beriol Talorakoir.\nBeriol Talorakoir says 'This is exactly the research book that i was in need of. I am very thankful for you getting these for me. Should you ever feel up to it again in the future Dersino always is getting new books in that could be very helpful in my studies. Again I thank you and wish you the best of luck.'\nYour faction standing with House of Midst has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n- Faction\n[",
