      walkthrough = "**Time:** 10 minutes\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nMistala Glimmerblade can be found at approximately 25, 225 in Shadow Haven. See NPC page for map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mistala Glimmerblade'\nMistala Glimmerblade says 'Hello there ______! I am Lady Mistala Glimmerblade of the House of Fordel I reside over this great city of Shadowhaven along with my husband Daloran. I take great pride in knowing that our city has come so far and became a place of free trade and freedom for all of its inhabitants. We also are lucky to have some of the finest guardspersons in the land. Which reminds be I need to collect my [report].'\nYou say, 'What report?'\nMistala Glimmerblade says 'I have a report that I collect every few days from my first Lieutentant Broansas. This report contains information about each guard his performance and usually notes on suggestions upon how to limit the number of smugglers passing through our town. However, Lieutenant Broansas is currently on assignment investigating a smugglers ring. I need someone to retrieve his reports of the latest information that he gathered for me. Will you [retrieve the daily reports]?'\nYou say, 'I will retrieve the daily reports.'\nMistala Glimmerblade says 'Many thanks ______. The last I heard from Broansas he was heading for the Dawnshroud peaks please seek him out there and present him with this notarized letter so that he will know that I have sent you. Return to me with his report as soon as you can. I await your return.'\nYou receive a Notorized Letter [sic] from Mistala Glimmerblade.\nLieutentant Broansas can be found in Dawnshroud Peaks, at approximately -1300, 1500. See NPC page for map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Broansas'\nLieutenant Broansas says 'Greetings Stranger, is there something I can help you with? I would love to chat with you but im afraid I have to stay focused on the [case] I am investigating.'\nYou say, 'What case?'\nLieutenant Broansas says 'Well ______. Im monitoring a possible smugglers ring down there ahead of us in the distance. That group down there sure has a large shipment of goods and I intend to find out why.\nGive the notarized letter to Lieutenant Broansas.\nLieutenant Broansas says 'You are sent from Lady Mistala I see? Ah of course she needs my reports. I trust you will return these documents to Mistala at once. Here you are, and thank you for your help. I shall have more reports soon'\nYour faction standing with House of Fordel has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Haven Defenders has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive the Journal of Broansas.  Return to Shadow Haven, and give the journal to Mistala Glimmerblade.\nMistala Glimmerblade says 'It's nice to see that Broansas is doing well. I could not have been able to retrieve this information without your assistance, ______. I thank you for your help and will be sure to tell the council members of your good deeds. I often need reports retrieved so please check back if you would like to help to the House of Fordel.'\nYour faction standing with House of Fordel has been adjusted by 30.\nYour faction standing with Haven Defenders has been adjusted by 30.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 3.\nYou gain experience!! Rewards:\n[",
