      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Corporal Kent'\nCorporal Kent looks up from his shift report, 'Ho there, who are you?  Are you reporting for duty or just annoying me?'\nYou say, 'I am reporting for duty'\nCorporal Kent says 'Outstanding, now tuck in that tunic.  We are trying out some new Shadowscream armor from Barkhem, the smith in Shar Vahl, and some of his students.  They will cut us a nice deal if we deliver some of the supplies, so go fill this up with shrieking substances for me.  What are you staring at?  Go!! And suck in that gut!'\nYou receive an eight-slot Sonic Receptacle. Go to Tenbrous Mountians and collect 8 Shrieking Substances that drop off of Dire Sonic Wolves.  Combine the 8 Shrieking Substances in the container and hand in the result to Corporal Kent.\nYou offered 1 Full Sonic Receptacle to Corporal Kent.\nCorporal Kent says, 'Well done, _____, this should really help keep our costs down.  Here, take these, and keep up the good work.  Dismissed!'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by 4.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!\nYou complete the trade with Corporal Kent.\nReceive:\nCombine Throwing Axe\nValidus Custodus Flight Arrow\n- Combine Throwing Axe [item=55967]\n- Validus