        { name = "Magus Conlegium", change = 1 },
        { name = "Citizens of Seru", change = -1 },
        { name = "Seru", change = -1 },
        { name = "Shoulders of Seru", change = -1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest begins with Yurddle the Caretaker in Katta Castellum (location approximately -600, -1710, 10).\nThere are three reward items. You can do one part or all of this quest, depending on which items you want:\nScimitar of Ethereal Energy\nStaff of Ethereal Energy\nWarhammer of Ethereal Energy\nYou say, 'Hail, Yurddle the Caretaker'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'Greetings stranger. It's nice to have visitors of the living sort. Seems like my work here is never done. When I'm not having to dig fresh graves and keep the mausoleum clean I'm having to refill old graves that have been dug up by the [restless dead] or them disrespectful [grave robbers]!'\nYou say, 'What grave robbers?'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'It is unfortunate that there are so many disrespectful people that would rob the graves of the dead. The citizens of Katta Castellum do not commit such crimes against their ancestors but thieves from Shadow Haven, greedy Vampyres, and even members of the traitorous Inquisition seeking old combine relics have been caught digging up the dead. I have [lists of belongings] that have been stolen, it would please the spirits of Katta Castellum greatly if these items are returned.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about this list of belongings'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'Here are some lists of items that have been stolen from the crypts of the mausoleum in the past. You may bring each crypts set of four missing items to me separately. It is not necessary to find all three sets of items before returning but any set you do return must be complete to please the spirits. Perhaps you should ask around the shops in the other cities of Luclin if the merchants there have seen the missing items.'\nYou receive a List of Stolen Items.\nStaff of Ethereal Energy\nIn Marus Seru, kill recuso smugglers until you loot an Aeridia Family Signet Ring.\nFind Bertol Flagerty in the Twilight Sea (location -625, -1015, -11). Kill him and loot a Tarnished Copper Runed Wand.\nFind Rolktim Cogtop in Fungus Grove (location -1250, -635, -277 -- behind Ebben's tavern). Kill him and loot the Faded Silver Embroidered Robe.\nFind Mark Blotter in Shadow Haven (findable with the Find feature, CTRL+F -- location 1185, -295, -45).\nYou say, 'Hail, Mark Blotter'\nMark Blotter says 'Hail friend! Feel free to browse my selection of scrolls and scroll accessories but be careful when handling them, some of them are quite old and the parchment has seen better days.'\nYou say, 'What sealed golden seal tube?'\nMark Blotter says 'Ah hah! You are in luck. I just received a sealed golden scroll tube the other day that I think you will find quite acceptable. It seems to be quite old and the craftsmanship is superb! I will part with it for no less than one-thousand gold pieces.'\nHand him 1000 gold pieces:\nMark Blotter says 'Here it is, I am sure you will be very satisfied with this purchase!'\nYou receive a Sealed Golden Scroll Tube.\nHead back to Yurddle the Caretaker in Katta Castellum:\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'I require the Aeridia Family Signet Ring, the Sealed Golden Scroll Tube, the Faded Silver Embroidered Robe, and the Tarnished Copper Runed Wand that were stolen from Holin Aeridias crypt.'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'Give this box to the ghost of Holin Aeridia.'\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got better.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Citizens of Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Shoulders of Seru got worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Holin Aeridia's Belongings.\nNot long after you receive the box of belongings, the ghost spawns near one of the coffins.\nHolin Aeridia is at location -630, -1700, 10.\nHolin Aeridia reaches forward as his hands materialize to grasp the box of belongings then places them carefully in his crypt. He then reaches towards _____ again as an etherial staff materializes in his hands and is offered to _____.\nYour faction standing with Spirits of Katta Castellum got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious got worse.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Staff of Ethereal Energy.\nScimitar of Ethereal Energy (used to be Longsword of Ethereal Energy)\nFind Flerdo Brigged in the Twilight Sea (location -635, -1020, -16). Kill him and loot the Talikar Family Signet Ring.\nFind Maricella Slithra in the Paludal Caverns (location -1425, +1375 -- just outside the camp with Yelloweyes, close to Shadow Haven). She has a place holder. Spawn time is approximately 13 minutes and she doesn't drop the item every time. Loot an Ancient Ornate Combine Dagger from her corpse.\nFind Ebben Quickblade in Fungus Grove (location -1165, -575, -275).\nYou say, 'Hail, Ebben Quickblade'\nEbben Quickblade says 'What ya want? You wouldn't be one of them Talikars come lookin for who robbed your gran daddys grave would ya? Hahaha. Get lost!'\nKill him and loot the Antique Platinum Medal.\nFind Pietro Guiccini in Shadow Haven (not available with the Find feature -- location 1464, 65, -45 -- Inn near the bank, upstairs in the northeast corner of the zone).\nYou say, 'Hail, Pietro Guiccini'\nPietro Guiccini says 'Greetings! Have you ever seen my portraits? I am an artisan and collector of portraitures. If you are looking for a portrait, have one to sell, or wish to commission a piece of art I will be happy to take a look.'\nYou say, 'what about a portrait?'\nPietro Guiccini says 'I recently purchased a splendid antique portrait of a gorgeous lady that you may be interested in. It is a tad bit faded but a hauntingly beautiful and captivating piece none the less. I would be willing to part with it for 1000 gold pieces.'\nHand him 1000 gold pieces:\nPietro Guiccini says 'Here you are, you have made a marvelous purchase. I see that you have excellent taste.'\nYou receive a Faded Portrait of a Lady.\nHead back to Yurddle the Caretaker in Katta Castellum:\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'I require the Ancient Ornate Combine Dagger, Talikar Family Signet Ring, Faded Portrait of a Lady, and the Antique Platinum Medal that were stolen from Raien Talikars crypt.'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'Give this crate to the ghost of Raien Talikar'\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by 1\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium has been adjusted by 1\nYour faction standing with Citizens of Seru has been adjusted by -1\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1\nYour faction standing with Shoulders of Seru has been adjusted by -1\nYou receive Raien Talikars Belongings.  Take them to Raien Talikar.\nYour Location is -570.22, -1728.16, 10.13\nYou say, 'Hail, Raien Talikar'\nRaien Talikar reaches forward as his hands materialize to grasp the box of belongings then places them carefully in his crypt. He then reaches towards Yther again as an etherial scimitar materializes in his hands and is offered to Yther.\nYour faction standing with Spirits of Katta Castellum has been adjusted by 10\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Scimitar of Ethereal Energy.\nWarhammer of Ethereal Energy\nFind Malda Braltek in the Twilight Sea (location -635, -1000, -14). Kill her and loot a Silver Embroidered Tabard.\nIn Marus Seru, kill recuso smugglers until you loot an Ancient Ceremonial Warhammer.\nFind Missy McElle in Fungus Grove (location -1130, -800, -285 -- corner of Fungus Grove's outpost section).\nMissy McElle says 'That's the last mistake you'll make!'\nKill her and loot a Gold Embroidered Kilt.\nFind Alchemist Hikal in Shar Vahl (location -270, -380, -185).\nYou say, 'Hail, Alchemist Hikal'\nAlchemist Hikal says 'Greetings friend. If you're in the business for some herbs or shamanistic supplies, you've come to the right place. Please take a look around for yourself. If you're looking for something, feel free to ask. We may have what you need somewhere behind the counter.'\nYou say, 'what about an old sealed medicine pouch?'\nAlchemist Hikal says 'I may have just the thing you are looking for. I recently purchased quite an old and interesting sealed medicine pouch of superb craftsmanship. I will part with it for one-thousand gold pieces.'\nHand her 1000 gold pieces.\nAlchemist Hikal says 'Here it is. I am sure you will be quite happy with your purchase, it is quite an interesting old bag it is.'\nYou receive an Old Sealed Medicine Pouch.\nHead back to Yurddle the Caretaker in Katta Castellum:\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'I require the Gold Embroidered Kilt, Silver Embroidered Tabard, Ancient Ceremonial Varhammer, and Old Sealed Medicine Pouch that were stolen from Shoeon Malicus' crypt.'\nYurddle the Caretaker says 'Give this crate to the ghost of Shoeon Malicus.'\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got better.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Citizens of Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Shoulders of Seru got worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Shoeon Malicus' Belongings.\nNot long after you receive the box of belongings, the ghost spawns near one of the coffins.\nUpon handing in this item to Shoeon Malicus:\nShoeon Malicus reaches forward as his hands materialize to grasp the box of belongings then places them carefully in his crypt. He then reaches towards ____