      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nNilibik Driogo [npc=16904] is a gnome found in the northeast of the zone, at /way +520,-1274.\nYou say, 'Hail, Nilibik Driogo'\nNilibik Driogo says 'Hello, you look like a battleworn traveller.  Have you heard of the place where [Grieg] resides?'\nYou say, 'grieg?'\nNilibik Driogo says 'Aye, Grieg Veneficus. We do not know much about this madman, only where his [stronghold] is.  One of my friends from the Eye was sent there to investigate it, but he has not returned.  It has been quite some time and I am very worried about him.'\nYou say, 'What stronghold?'\nNilibik Driogo says 'Grieg's End is what it has become to be known as.  Some reports have come back that this place is cursed with foul visages. Any entering will surely loose their minds.  I.. I would go but you see I am desperately busy here in the city doing..uh..many important things!  You\nlook like you could help, [will you travel] to Grieg's End and look for my friend?'\nYou say, 'I will travel.'\nNilibik Driogo says 'Good, I am glad you would prove yourself useful to Seru. Look for Bronus, you should beware if he has lost his sanity for he is almost as powerful as myself.'\nLook for a naked gnome named Bronus [npc=12969] (a rare creature) in Grieg's End.  He drops a Cracked Amulet [item=7233].\nGive Nilibik Driogo the Cracked Amulet and his response is:\nNilibik Driogo speaks a small incantation as he pulls a branch from a nearby tree and ties it around the amulet 'I shall mourn him dearly, he was a good friend.  This was the amulet that I had given him before he left to explore Grieg's End.  I want you to have this for helping to find his lost soul. Go in peace my friend.\nYour faction with Citizens of Seru has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction with Heart of Seru has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction with Shoulders of Seru has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by -10\nReward:\nNilibik's Yew Affixed Amulet [item=7230]Submitted by: Arike IronheartRewards:\n- Nilibik's Yew Affixed Amulet [item=7230]\n[",
