        { name = "Valdanov Zevfeer", change = 1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Tymoz'\nTymoz says 'So Dark Elf, you dare to stand before the mighty Tymoz?  I am the Governor of this village of the Coterie of the Eternal Night.  Do you wish to assist the Coterie, or will you better serve us as sustenance for our eternal lives?'\nYou say, 'I wish to assist the Coterie.'\nTymoz says 'You have made an itelligent decision my friend.  Our primary fo is the meddling Validus Custodus, the militia of Katta Castellum. I will reward you for every two damaged custodus legionnaire helms or two damaged custodus centurion helms that you present to me as proof that you have slain members of our enemies ranks.'\nUpon handing in two Damaged Custodus Legionnaire Helms:\nTymoz says 'I require two damaged custodus helms as proof of your deeds.'\nTymoz says 'Excellent! Two less of those self righteous Validus Custodus goons to worry about!'\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Valdanov Zevfeer has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a random number of Blood Dipped Darts.\nUpon handing in two Damaged Custodus Centurion Helms:\nTymoz says 'I require two damaged custodus helms as proof of your deeds.'\nTymoz says 'Excellent! Two less of those self righteous Validus Custodus goons to worry about!'\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night could not possibly get any better.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus could not possibly get any worse.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Valdanov Zevfeer has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Potent Vitae.\n- Blood Dipped Dart [item=7234]\n- Potent Vitae [item=58798]\n[",
