      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nQuest begins in Katta Castellum in the Gnomish area beneath the city.  Find the small temple like structure and Toktonn is in a room directly across from the entrance.\n'Hail, Toktonn Geerlok'\nToktonn Geerlok says 'Well met kind Human. I am Governor Toktonn Geerlok of the Loyalist Combine. It is my duty to oversee all matters concerning engineering, construction, and maintenance within Katta Castellum. There is a wonderful ore native to Luclin called [Acrylia] that has proved to be a valuable asset to my crew and I.\nYou say, 'what acrylia?'\nToktonn Geerlok says 'Yes, it is a marvelous luminescent ore that when properly smelted has properties similar to the finest of steels, and sometimes even better. Depending on the purity of the ore of course. The Tenebrous Mountains are rich with very pure acrylia veins but unfortunately the Grimlings have overrun the mines and are not willing to allow others to mine the ore. Instead they horde it for their tribes to the south. I am permitted by the Validus Custodus to reward those seeking to cleanse the mines of the Grimlings. More precisely to pay a reward for every four grimling mining picks presented to me.\nBring him four Sturdy Grimling Mining Picks.  Found on grimling orefinders, geomancers, laborers, and foremen in the mines of Tenebrous Mountains. Seemed to be an uncommon drop.\nToktonn Geerlok says 'Excellent! Soon the grimlings may be coerced into being less stingy with their precious ore!\nYour faction standing with Concilium Universus got better.\nYour faction standing with Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru got worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nReceived Industria Acrylia War PickRewards:\n- Industria Acrylia War Pick [item=7317]\n[",
