      walkthrough = "**Level:** 11\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nHymnist Omiyad may be found near the fire dancers at -1600, -2690.\nYou say, 'Hail, Hymnist Omiyad'\nHymnist Omiyad says 'Greetings young one, have a seat by the fire. You will notice the dance being performed. This is much more than just a dance though. It is a ritual that we perform to [purge the evil spirits] that are plaguing the thicket.'\nYou say, 'Purge the evil spirits?'\nHymnist Omiyad says 'Lately there has been a surge in the number of Loda Kai threatening our trade routes. This ritual is performed around a fire that burns from their [remains]. Setting their remains in the fire will free their tie with this world and shall ward off their numbers.'\nYou say, 'What remains?'\nHymnist Omiyad glances toward the fire. 'I see the fire is dying down some. Should you come across the remains of the Loda Kai bring them to me to keep the ritual fire burning. Bring plenty though, four if you can.'\nThe remains are dropped off of various Loda Kai.  Hand in four.\nHymnist Omiyad takes the remains and throws them into the fire, flames blaze immediatey with a sicky hue. 'You have preformed a great service by helping destroy some of the wretched Lodi Kai. Take this small talisman, it is worn by the dancers here. Take it with you and feel free to do a dance whenever you like, haha!'\nYour faction standing with Guardians of Shar Vahl has been adjusted by 10.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Talisman of the Flame.\n- Talisman of the Flame [item=7318]\n[",
