      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFind Patriarch Lardalon in Shadow Haven south of The Nexus zone in area at -563, +1650, -55. Or look at the NPC page for him for the map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Patriarch Lardalon'\nPatriarch Lardalon says 'It is a pleasure to meet you, _____. I am the residing High Priest of the House of Stout. Many have come to seek my guidance for I have seen many a foe in my fighting days. If you are interested in [lending a hand] to the House of Stout, I may have some tasks for you to complete'\nYou say, 'lending a hand'\nPatriarch Lardalon says 'Aye, its good to hear that! We need all the help we can get with all the dern [smugglers].'\nYou say, 'smugglers'\nPatriarch Lardalon says 'Well the smugglers are a threat to all that we have accomplished here they steal stolen goods and turn around to sell them and undercut all the merchants of our quarter. There is not much we can do about them now but in time I may need your help. For the time being however, if you wish to assist us there are other [tasks] which i need to be completed.'\nYou say, 'tasks'\nPatriarch Lardalon says 'I believe we have some letters and supplies that need a trustworthy courier to see that they reach their destination. With the problems of smuggling we are having lately we have had a shortage of honest folks outside of the Haven. Please see Coglixar for further information and inform him that you wish to assist.'\nYou can find Coglixar outside the building where Marchap Biddinight is (can use Find for Marchap). Or look at the NPC page for Coglixar for a map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Coglixar Xorlopodil'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says 'Hello there, _____.  It's nice to meet you. Are you just passing through our fine city or do you have dealings you need to address to me personally? Also if ye know anyone that will want to assist with some deliveries to our mining contingent in the Paludal caverns let me know'\nYou say, 'I wish to assist'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says 'Ah Excellent, you must have been sent by our Patriarch. Well I have some goods that I need delivered to some different areas if you are still willing to [help].'\nYou say, 'help'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says 'That is great to hear _____. I have a task for you to complete for me first and if you are able to complete it I may have other things for you in the future. I have heard word that some of our dwarf workers in the [mining operation] are in need of some food.'\nYou say, 'mining operation'\nCoglixar Xorlopodil says 'In the Paludal caverns our workers are starting to get very low on rations and are working with very old and tarnished mining utensils. I need you to deliver these rations to Daesorak first and then see what supplies he thinks they need. He is the one overseeing the operation and will be able to tell you what supplies he needs and what quanity [sic] is necessary.'\nYou receive a Bag of Rations.  Head to the Paludal Caverns and look on your map for the Dwarven Miners (they are north and east of the Owlbear area, and west of where the Safe Tunnel part is).  Speak to Daesorak Steelknuckle. Look at his NPC page for a map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Daesorak Steelknuckle'\nDaesorak Steelknuckle says 'Lo there stranger what ya doin in ere? You know how dangerous it can be down ere! I be lucky I got some of da finest miners werkin for me. I sure do hope we get those supplies soon.'\nGive him the Bag of Rations.\nDaesorak Steelknuckle says 'Ah these must be from ol Coggo!  Ye see I had sent out a few men to gather some new picks an such for the mining operation ere but they havent returned yet. Im really in need of some picks that are being held in Katta by a friend of mine. Will you [retrieve the mining picks] for me?'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'retrieve the mining picks'\nDaesorak Steelknuckle says 'Excellent, _____. Please go see Terasol in Katta to retrieve my mining supplies. Bring him this note to show that you were sent by me. And dunt stray off track with these supplies, we needs em bad!'\nYou receive a Jarbled Note.  Now it's time to head to Katta Castellum and speak to Terasol. Look at his NPC page for a map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Terasol'\nTerasol says 'Nice to meet you _____. I have usually the finest mining supplies one can find, However I am waiting for a shipment so please check back later.'\nHand him the Jarbled Note.\nTerasol says 'Ah of course you must be sent to pick up the supplies that Daesorak has been needing for his mining operation. I was wondering when that crazy Dwarf was going to come and pick these up. I imagine then that you will [take the mining picks] to Daesorak?'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'take the mining picks'\nTerasol says 'Very well then. Here are the new mining picks. Send Daesorak my regards.'\nHe gives you a Bundle of Mining Picks.  Back to Paludal Caverns we go and speak again to Daesorak.  Hand him the Bundle of Mining Picks.\nDaesorak Steelknuckle says 'Ye did it, _____. Ye hear dat, boys? Dis outlander ere jess delivered us our new minin' picks! You have no idea how much these supplies will aid our operation! As a final task would you be able to [return a letter] to me wife back home?'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nNoppta Mottun says 'Hurray!'\nOverslo Herlsal says 'Hurray!'\nDiojb Waksom says 'Hurray!'\nFarlol Duriclo says 'Hurray!'\nYou say, 'return a letter'\nDaesorak Steelknuckle says 'I thank you _____. Without your help I doubt we would have been able to finish this project on time! Please take this to my wife Aliane back home. You can surely count on me telling the Patriarch of how much help you have been when I return home. I wish you good journeys as for me its back to work I go!'\nHe gives you a Letter to Ailane.  Head back to Shadow Haven and find Aliane Steelknuckle. Look at her NPC page for a map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Aliane Steelknuckle'\nAliane Steelknuckle says 'Hello, _____. I'm waiting to hear from my husband. He's been working on assignment for the Patriarch.'\nGive her the item Letter to Aliane.\nAliane Steelknuckle says 'Oh my sweet Daosorak, such a hard worker he is. It brings a smile upon my face to know that his mining operation is going well and that he will be home soon. I thank you for bringing me this letter from him.'\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n[",
