      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say: Hail Legionaire Delaran\nLegionaire Delaran says: Well met (you). Are you the new recruit that was sent to me to help exterminate the (Zelniaks) that attack our guards and caravans.\nYou say: What are Zelniaks?\nLegionaire Delaran says: Weren't you briefed on this already? The zelniaks are highly aggressive scaled creature with a large mane of fur that runs down the length of thier back. They are a constant problem for the gaurds and caracans that used travel in (Dawnshroud).\nYou say: What is the Dawnshroud?\nLegionaire Delaran says: Are you new here or something? The Dawnshroud Peaks are a range of mountains lush in vegetation and water. We used to utilize this area as a trade route to Shadow Haven. The carvans that would travel through were to often attacked by roaming Zelniaks. I thought you were the one that was sent to me to (help lower) the amount of Zelniaks in the area. So the trade route could be reestablished.\nYou say: I will help lower.\nLegionaire Delaran says: How ambitious of you to help the mighty warriors of the Hand. If you choose to serve the Seru bring me back four Zelniak Meat. I will reward you for you time in the field.\nYour reward is some decent money.\nFaction Hit from this quest:\nYour standing with the Citizen of Seru got better\nYour standing with the Hand of Seru got better\nYour standing with the Heart of Seru got better\nYour standing with the Eye of Seru got better\nYour standing with the Shoulder fo Seru got better\nYour standing with the Katta Castellum Citizens got worse.\nAfter you hand him the meat, Legionnaire Delaren says \"Although your service to Seru is appreciated, I just recieved word that you were not the one that was sent to do this meial task. That lazy boy [Peran] was supposed to take the job.\nYou Say, \"who Peran\"\nLegionnaire Delaren says \"Centurioni (game bug on spelling) Peran is new to the ranks. He gets things done I suppose it just takes him a long, long time. Since you did his job for him, take him these new orders. We will make a soldier out of him yet.\nLegionnaire Delaren gives you \"orders for Peran\", no drop note.\nFind Centurion Peran in Dawnshroud Peaks, near a lake NE of Sanctus Seru zone line.\nGive orders to Centurion Peran\nCenturion Peran says 'Bah, why do I always get stuck with the hard jobs.  Here I am, out here patrolling the area in all this danger!  They send me to even more\nthreatening conditions?  The life of a soldier is a hard one I tell ya!  Oh well, off to do these orders I suppose.  A shame no one will [help me] I am sure there is fame and fortune in the mission.  More for me I suppose.\nYou Say, \"What mission\"\nCenturion Peran says \"Well, since you are so inquisitive I will tell you. The orders say to go to Maidens Eye and investigate reports of Vampyres in the area.  Vampyres! Are they kidding?! I am just a Centurion! I know, I will continue to keep this area secure while you go investigate. Bring me sufficient proof of their existence in the area. Four piles of vampyre ashes should cover it. Well, get going! This mission isn't going to finish itself.\"\nGo to Maiden's Eye and kill Coterie's (vamp looking mobs who hit for 120's and have 200hp blood drain, exact locs unclear but are to the right when leaving\nDawnshroud zone in little churchlike houses) and get 4 Vampyre Ashes (no drop, stackable).\nReturn to Centurion Peran in Dawnshroud and turn in.\nCenturion Peran says 'Hah!  I knew that we could do it!  Oh, you can take my weapon for helping me out again.   I will just tell the Hand it was lost in battle.  I guess that I better take this evidence back to the Hand, right after one more lap!\nYour faction standing with Seru got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nReward:  Combine Two Handed Sword\nNeed all dialogues, /loc of quest mobs, missing quest items, current faction hits, additional rewards if any.Rewards:\n- Combine Two Handed Sword [item=7612]\n[",
