      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nExaminer Malikin [npc=15702] is located at /way -1573,+37,+9.75 in the south part of the zone, watching the arena from the spectator section.\nYou say, 'Hail, Examiner Malikin'\nExaminer Malikin says 'Good day to you, Melrik. I hope that you are enjoying the sanctuary that this beautiful city of ours provides.  We go through great efforts to keep this city not only clean, but extremely safe as well.  Have you ever wondered about the lengths to which we have to work to maintain the safety of a city as fine as this?\nYou say, 'to what lengths'\nExaminer Malikin says 'We have to work with great diligence and determination to maintain the security of this sanctum.  There are elements that are set on defiling our work here.  These antagonists seem to prefer attempts at corrupting people from within our ranks.  Weak minds are inevitable, so corruption is unavoidable.  That is why the Eye is necessary.  We are not here to pry or spy on anyone.  We simply maintain the security of our sanctum and weed out any unsavory elements.  If you're interested in learning more about the Eye, I can assign you a simple task or two.\nYou say, 'what is the eye'\nExaminer Malikin says 'The Eye keeps us informed of all that goes on beyond the walls.  They are responsible for security and purity inside the walls as well.  They also monitor the other three Praesertum.\nYou say, 'what simple task'\nExaminer Malikin says 'Simple tasks go a great distance to establish trust.  I may know of someone who can help you to establish yourself within the ranks of the Eye.  If you are interested in performing a task of that nature I can get you started at this time.  Would you like to begin?\nYou say, 'I would like to begin'\nExaminer Malikin says 'Very well, Melrik.  Please, take this coin to Percontorius Ontu.  She will advise you on your next course of action.  There is a decided lack of direction in this matter, for a member of the Eye should always be able to find people.  This will be good practice for you. Take care.  I hope to speak to you again soon.\nYou receive Heavy Coin [item=58546].\nPercontorius Ontu [npc=18078] is at /way -132.31,-693.12,+87.13. Hand her the Heavy Coin.\nPercontorius Ontu touches the coin to the back of her hand and then looks upu with a smile. 'Please take this back to it's source,' she says and nods. You feel the coin return to your hand. Your palm tingles slightly and then the sensation fades.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -10.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Haven Smugglers has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus could not possibly get any better.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium could not possibly get any better.\nYou gain experience!!\nHand the Heavy Coin back to Examiner Malikin.\nExaminer Malikin says 'Good job! I'm glad that you have returned. I'm also very glad that you were able to see this task as what it was, a purpose to be fulfilled.  I'm not sure that you understand, so please allow me to elaborate.  The coin that I handed you has great value.  That value is obvious in the fact that the coin is made of a precious metal and carries with it more weight than a standard coin.  That said, you did not take the coin for your personal gain.  You simply carried out your purpose.  The fact that you can be trusted has earned you that coin. Do you understand the meaning of the task now?\nYou say, 'I understand the meaning of the task'\nExaminer Malikin says 'Very good, for I have another task to offer you if you would like to continue.  This one is a bit more complicated. Im sure that you can handle it, but I need you to be sure as well.  I need this to be a surprise.  Do you think that you are prepared to handle an issue that will require both stealth and secrecy?\nYou say, 'I am prepared'\nExaminer Malikin says 'Please take the coin that I have just given you and find my friend, Consis Sinsolus.  He can often be found walking in one of the park areas.  I'm beginning to believe that he has a mild infatuation with trees.  Please take the coin that I have given you and slip it into my friend's left coat pocket.  When you do so, please remove the coin that you will find in his pocket and bring it to me.  Accomplish this task without error and I may have a special task for you.  Take care not to get caught. I would prefer that the swap remain a surprise for him to discover on his own.\nHand the heavy coin to Consis Sinsolus and get back Mark of the Hand I think.  I used sneak for this part but not sure it's necessary.\nYour Location is 673.96, 774.32, 59.13\nHand the heavy coin to Consis and receive a Mark? or Coin? of the Hand if I remember right.\nConsis Sinsolus turns to look at you for a moment, but does not apprear to notice that you made the swap.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru got worse\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru got worse\nYour faction standing with Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Hand legionnaries got better\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got worse.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nHand the mark/coin of the hand to Examiner malikin.\nExaminer Malikin says 'Splendid job, Melrik! You managed that task quite nicely.  Please, keep the coin.  The most important part of that task was the fact that you did not stop to question what was being asked of you.  That sort of trust is commendable.  The Eye is looking for people like you.  We need people who display not only integrity, but trust.  Trust in our purpose here and you will do well.  Our means may seem a bit harsh at times, but we are here to protect our people from an enemy whose methods are without honor.  It is one of those very attacks on our people that I will need your help with at this time.\nYou say, 'what can I do to help with the attacks'\nExaminer Malikin says 'We have found evidence that there is a traitor within the ranks of one of the other Praesertum.  We need you to help us remove this traitor and his contact in Katta Castellum.  You will need to take this poison and pour it into our target's ear while he sleeps.\nYou say, 'what is the name of the target'\nExaminer Malikin says 'The traitor's name is Ornis Tranum.  You should be able to get into his house with little to no resistance.  Just be sure to take care when entering and leaving the building.  We do not need to bring attention to the Eye in this matter.  Once you have poured the poison into Ornis' ear, he will be unable to move.  Just place the coin that you took from Consis on Ornis' body and leave.  Bring me the empty poison vial, so that I can be sure that no evidence was left behind. Once that is done, we can deal with his contact.\nI went invis and entered his house. then handed both the coin and poison to Ornis Tranum, but you can hand them in seperately and it still works. so this can get off if someone does part out of order.\nOrnis Tranum gasps suddenly and then falls still.\nYour faction standing with Shoulders of Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru got worse\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru got worse\nYour faction standing with Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got worse\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious got worse\nI didn't get this loc sorry... after you kill him and go back and give the empty vial to Examiner malikin.\nExaminer Malikin says 'Your worth to us is not going unnoticed.  There are many people within the Eye that are very pleased with your progress.  Finish this next task and we will have something for you.  Your willingness to assist us with this most unpleasant task is a great display of allegiance.  We are very excited about your future with us, but let's finish with this before we talk further.  Take this poison and do with it as you did with Ornis.  This time the target is a guard within Katta Castellum.  His name is Erallic.  Find him when he is asleep after a guard shift and kill him.  Be sure to bring me the empty vial and be careful.  They will have guards posted.  Stealth is key in this matter.  Take care.\nSit at location 178.00, -1944.00, 31.13, that's where he will suddennly POP to. I was at his post and he suddenly POPPED to his bed. Hand him the poison.\nLegionnaire Erallic gasps silently for air and then falls completely still! No one seems to have heard you.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got better.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious got worse.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night got worse.\nYour faction standing with Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru got worse.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries got worse.\nYou gain party experience!!\nHand the empty vial to Examiner malikin\nExaminer Malikin says 'It is good to see you again friend. Your deeds are well known winthing the ranks of the Eye. You have allowed us to remove several traitors from the walls of this sanctum. We are extremely thankful for your dedication and efforts. Please Take this gift and watch for us to call upon your again in the near future.\nYour faction standing with Citizends of Seru Gog Better\nYour faction standing with Hnad of Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru got better\nYour faction standing with Shoulders of Seru got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens got worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou get The Eye of Trust\nAc5 Str/Dex/Wis/Int2 Range slot all/all\nNeed all dialogues (these are transcriptions), current faction hits, /loc of quest mobs, missing quest items, any other missing quest information.Rewards:\n- The Eye of Trust [item=7611]\n[",
