      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nSteaon Alarenier [npc=7543] is inside the building just north when zoning from the Nexus. He can be found using the Find option as they are an Alchemy Supplies NPC.\nYou say, 'Hail, Steaon Alarenier'\nSteaon Alarenier says 'Hail ______. You will have to excuse me because I am quite busy with my work and trying to sort out my [deliveries]. However, please help yourself to anything in my store that may be to your liking.'\nYou say, 'What deliveries?'\nSteaon Alarenier says 'You see, I have to make more and more deliveries everyday, what with my business growing so much.  I find it difficult to make time to go pick up the different skins and pelts I need for my trade. It's tough when you need some good help but can't afford to pay them. Sorry to bother you with my banter, perhaps I will find someone on the [way to the bazaar].'\nYou say, 'I am on my way to the bazaar.'\nSteaon Alarenier says 'You are, eh ______? Well then if you wanted to\npick up some supplies for me and deliver them to my partner in the Bazaar I'm sure I would be very grateful. Would you like to make a [trip to the bazaar]?'\nYou say, 'I will make a trip to the bazaar.'\nSteaon Alarenier says 'All right! Great to hear that ______. Here are the supplies I need delivered to my partner Gearo in the Bazaar. Please take them to him and return with whatever he has picked up for me. I look forward to seeing you soon, and thank you.'\nYou receive Assorted Tailoring Supplies [item=12116]. Go to the Bazaar and find Gearo [npc=7682] at 0, -20, in the circular room labeled \"Merchants.\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Gearo'\nGearo says 'Hello there friend. My name is Gearo and as you can see I'm a Gnome, so what can I do for ya?'\nGive him the supplies.\nGearo says 'Ah you were sent from Steaon I see. So what's that tall drink of water up too? He must be busy at the store if he has you delivering his supplies for him. Well enough about all that. If he has trusted you to bring his supplies here I suppose I can give you these gems I picked up for him. Will you [take the gems] to him?'\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 25\nYour faction standing with House of Fordel has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction standing with House of Midst has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 2\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'I will take the gems.'\nGearo says 'Good ______! Here they are, please take them back to that gargantuan barbarian and let him know I want a raise for all this hard work!'\nYou receive a Bag of Assorted Gems [item=12115]. Head back to Shadow Haven and give it to Steaon.\nSteaon Alarenier says 'Hey again ______.  It's nice to see you back so soon, thank you for bringing my supplies to that crazy Gnome and bringing back my gems that he got for me. You are always welcome in my shop, good luck to you!'\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 25\nYour faction standing with House of Fordel has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction standing with House of Midst has been adjusted by 2\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 2\nYou gain experience!!Submitted by: ZinphandelRewards:\n- Experience, Faction\n[",
