      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nLumi Stergnon is located at -640, -90 in the Temple of Divine Light.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lumi Stergnon'\nLumi Stergnon says 'Peace and tranquility be with you, ______. Are you a [new acolyte of peace] or are you [here to pay homage] to the child of tranquility?'\nYou say, 'I am a new acolyte of peace.'\nLumi Stergnon says 'Then you shall learn the ways of Quellious and learn to do as you are told by higher ranking members. It is time for you to do the lesser duties of a young priest. Which will it be? [Retrieve the Peacekeeper staffs] or [battle the undead]?'\nYou say, 'I will battle the undead.'\nLumi Stergnon says 'Then you shall venture to Toxxulia Forest. There has been an increase in skeleton sightings lately. I do not know their origin, but I believe that your efforts will reduce their numbers! Take this box. Return it to me when you have filled it with the bones of these undead creatures and combined it. May Quellious' light guide you.'\nYou receive a Box For Bones, a 6-slot SMALL container.  Fill it with Bone Chips and combine them to craft A Box of Bones (identifies as \"Box For Bones\").  Hand this in.\nLumi Stergnon says 'This is fabulous work, my friend! You have served your people well. Take this as a gift. I hope it can be of use to you. We need proof of these skeletons' origins. Continue the eradication of the undead and find out who creates them. Once you know, bring their head to me.'\nYour faction standing with Peace Keepers has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with High Council of Erudin has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Heretics has been adjusted by -2.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 12 silver from Lumi Stergnon.\nYou receive 3 gold from Lumi Stergnon.Rewards:\n- Backpack [item=2364]\n- Belt Pouch [item=20864]\n- Hematite [item=7780]\n- Raw-Hide Gloves [item=1542]\n- Raw-Hide Sleeves [item=2214]\n- Raw-Hide Wristbands [item=800]\n- Rusty Mace [item=19]\n- Rusty Morning Star [item=47]\n- Spell: Cure Poison [item=9415]\n- Spell: Divine Aura [item=9416]\n- Spell: Flash of Light [item=9417]\n- Spell: Lull [item=9083]\n- Spell: Spook the Dead [item=9419]\n- Spell: Strike [item=9420]\n- Spell: True North [item=8188]\n- Spell: Yaulp [item=9421]\n- Worn Great Staff [item=474]\n[",
