        "Where is Claudius?",
        "Traitor to the Validus Custodus",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "this dossier to Tilbok", count = 1 },
        { name = "you much time", count = 1 },
        { name = "that recording stone to Condor", count = 1 },
        { name = "us some idea of what they may or may not know", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 7126, name = "Mask of Espionage", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
        { name = "Seru", change = -1 },
        { name = "Heart of Seru", change = -1 },
        { name = "Katta Castellum Citizens", change = 1 },
        { name = "Nathyn Illuminious", change = -1 },
        { name = "Coterie of the Eternal Night", change = -1 },
        { name = "Seru", change = -1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 1 hour\n**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest starts in Twilight Sea. You must be amiable or better faction with Validus Custodus for Legionnaire Halle to acknowledge you as worthy of the quest.\nLegionnaire Halle can be found laying in the water just barely off the shore to the right of the Katta Castle entrance in Twilight Sea.  She seems to be a rather long spawn (I kept checking up on her in a 12 hour span and never saw her respawn), but her spawn point is near -980,-1800.\nYou say, 'Hail, Legionnaire Halle'\nLegionnaire Halle coughs a few times and reaches out to you, 'Please help me.'\nYou say, 'I will help.'\nLegionnaire Halle reaches out and puts something in your hand, 'Find Magistrate Phenic, he is the only one that I know I can trust.'  With a look of someone who has left unfinished business behind her, Halle lets go and dies.\nYou should at this point find a Water-stained note in your inventory.\nGo find Phenic Dionicas.  He's in the castle to the left of the Tenebrous Mountains zone. Approximate location is 200,-20, on the second floor.\nYou say, 'Hail, Phenic Dionicas'\nPhenic Dionicas says 'Greetings adventurer. I am Phenic Dionicas, Magistrate of the Loyalist Combine Empire. I hope the [vampyres] did not cause you troubles on your journey here.'\nHand him the note (Warning: Dubious faction is not good enough).\nPhenic Dionicas says 'I was afraid of this.  I do not know how much Halle managed to tell you, but we have had our suspicions about one of the Legionnaires ever since she overheard him talking in his sleep.  She was\nmeant to get close to him, I guess she found something out... I should have been more careful!  Take this to Governor Markil, it concerns his men and I've no doubt he can handle it.  Thank you much for your help.'\nYour faction standing with Concilium Universus got better.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Heart of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou should receive a Sealed Message.\nMarkil Jurbac is in the same building, but on the first floor.  He is found inside one of the rooms at location 130,10.\nYou say, 'Hail, Markil Jurbac'\nMarkil Jurbac says 'Greetings, ______.  I am Governor Markil Jurbac.  It is my primary duty to uphold the law in Katta Castellum.  How may I be of assistance to you?'\nHand him the scroll.\nMarkil Jurbac lowers his head and mourns the loss of Halle.  'Tis the greatest shame of all when good people are lost to the most cowardly of deeds.  I will seek Governor Tilbok's council in this matter... I have never been able to wrap my head around this kind of treachery and he may very well have more information.  Give this dossier to Tilbok, it has all of the information he will need.'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Dossier: Case 3463827.\nTilbok can be found in a building quite some ways away, a tall, castle-like building with stairs leading up into it.  It's right across from the smithing shop.  Tilbok's location is -143,-1973.  He's on the second floor.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tilbok Furrunner'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'Hello there, ______.  Pleasure to meet you, I am\nGovernor Tilbok Furrunner.  I am tasked with the gathering and security of information for the Concilium Universus, the ruling council of our fine city.'\nHand him the book.\nTilbok Furrunner reads through the dossier and then looks at you, eyebrow raised curiously, 'look at the mess you have gotten yourself in the middle of,' he says with a chuckle, while beginning to jot a note.  'Here take this and...'  he stops midsentence.  'I guess I haven't even given you the chance to say whether or not you want to help.  Would you like to see this through to the end?'\nYou receive Field Orders.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'I will help.'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'Excellent.  Find Claudius and give that to him- it's gibberish but he and his new friends won't know that now will they?  We have been watching someone named Vahn enter the city under the guise of a trader. We know he works for Seru, but we were not sure what he was doing here, so we let him be- trouble was he kept giving us the slip passing through the tunnels.  Looks now like we may have found a connection.  The plan sounds complicated and I don't want to confuse you, but if you stick with me it will all go just fine.  You with me so far, ______.'\nHe hands you a Recording Stone.\nYou say, 'I'm with you.'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'OK, now you follow Claudius but not so closely that he can see you.  Keep this stone on you, it is imbued with the power to record anything spoken within a certain distance and will be a great asset to us when this is all said and done.  If Claudius does meet up with Vahn, I want you to walk right up to him and say, 'traitor to the Validus Custodus' and do it quickly- they won't give you much time.  That should rattle him a bit and it will be the signal for my men to come in and take care of them.  After the arrest, just give that recording stone to Condor.  Best of luck to you, _______.'\nYou say, 'Where is Claudius?'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'Claudius is a bit of a lazy sod anyway.  If he ain't asleep in a bunk downstairs right now, you can bet your undergarments he will be soon.'\nNow, go back down stairs.  There's four barrack rooms.  You can find him asleep on a bed at location 100,-2100.\nHand him the scroll ONLY.  The gem will go to Condor at the end of the quest.\nLegionnaire Claudius says 'Huh? What?  Oh, umm, let's see here... OK I best get these taken care of right away.  Thank you.'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou will follow Claudius all the way down to where the bank is.  He will walk around to the back and Vahn will spawn.  Once this occurs, walk up and say \"traitor to the Validus Custodus\" and this will trigger a small skirmish.\nVahn steps out of the shadows as though appearing out of thin air.\nYou say, 'Traitor to the Validus Custodus'\nCondor shouts 'Behind the Nectar of Unity man!!  Surround them!!'\nLegionnaire says 'For the good of the empire you shall be punished for you crimes!'\nVahn says 'You will not take me alive!!!'\nCondor says 'You would be best served to yield, I warn you.'\nLegionnaire Claudius says 'I have been discovered!  You should have left well enough alone!!!'\nThree guards will jump on Vahn, while an Elf by the name of Condor will jump on Claudius.  Both of these conned blue to me at 52.  Be warned, while Claudius isn't too bad.. Vahn is a MONSTER!  This halfling hits very fast, and very hard.  Neither cast however.  All you need to do here is make sure Condor LIVES. If worse comes to worse, training Vahn and Claudius to the guards will get them killed.  As long as Condor lives, you can complete the quest.  But you MUST help the guards.  The first time I tried this, Vahn killed all three of the guards by himself without breaking a sweat.  I recommend having a couple high level friends with you if possible.\nAfter the fight is won, hand the gem you recieved to Condor.\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus got better.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium got better.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nCondor says, 'Perfect, this should give us some idea of what they may or may not know,' as he puts the stone in his belt pouch.  ' Very well done my friend, have you ever considered a career in espionage?  Take this, I have little need for it these days- Tilbok will know how to recharge it,' he says with a wry grin before disappearing back into the shadows.\nThis relatively easy quest nets you a Mask of Espionage.Submitted by: Waffuru YakiRewards:\n- Mask of Espionage [item=7126]\n[",
