      },
      factions = {
        { name = "Arcane Scientists", change = 10 },
        { name = "Knights of Truth", change = 2 },
        { name = "Opal Dark Briar", change = -1 },
        { name = "The Freeport Militia", change = -1 },
        { name = "Deepmuses", change = 5 },
        { name = "Merchants of AkAnon", change = 1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter completing the Disciple Symbol of Quellious:\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'Your service to this temple is commendable. I award you the rank of Disciple for your devotions to The Tranquil. When you are [ready to advance] return to me and I will set you upon another task.'\nYou say, 'I am ready to advance'\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'You are ready to strike at the body of the kobold shamans power. There is no reasoning with the Kobolds thus there shall be no peace in our beloved lands until their devotion to their wicked deity ceases. Return once again to the Warrens and bring me the unholy symbol worn by the High Shaman.'\nHand in Odd Cold Iron Necklace.\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'It is imperative that we discern the nature of these symbols and the source of the kobolds shamanistic powers. There is a citizen of Erudin residing in Freeport named Glyssa Sonshaw. She is quite possibly the most knowledgeable individual in the field of heraldic and hieroglyphic studies. Take the high shamans necklace and this note to her. When you have discovered the nature of the symbols return to me with the documentation and your Disciple Symbol of Quellious.'\nReceive Sealed Parchment and Odd Cold Iron Necklace.\nGlyssa Sonshaw is located at -335, -795 in West Freeport.\nYou say, 'Hail, Glyssa Sonshaw'\nHand in Sealed Parchment and Odd Cold Iron Necklace.\nGlyssa Sonshaw says 'I require the parchment from Leraena as well as the Odd Cold Iron Necklace.'\nGlyssa Sonshaw says 'Ah..yes, I have seen this symbol before. There is a kobold that lives among the gnomes of Ak'anon. He may be reluctant to speak with you but you have no need to fear him. He is a follower of Brell Serilis and a valuable source of information on kobold society and culture. I will construct a message for him. Deliver the message and necklace and perhaps he can enlighten you to its meaning.'\nReceive Sealed Parchment and Odd Cold Iron Necklace.\nYour faction standing with Arcane Scientists has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Knights of Truth has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Opal Dark Briar has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with The Freeport Militia has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nDrigaz Grumblegrowl is located at 1245, -925 in a bar in Ak'Anon.\nYou say, 'Hail, Drigaz Grumblegrowl'\nDrigaz Grumblegrowl says 'Grrreetings, _____, would you like to share a roasted rat steak or perhaps a tall glass of gnomish spirits? Have no fear of my appearance. My bark is meaner than my bite! Grraw haw haw!'\nHand in Sealed Parchment and Odd Cold Iron Necklace.\nDrigaz Grumblegrowl says 'I need the odd cold iron necklace and the note from Glyssa if I am to assist you.'\nDrigaz Grumblegrowl says 'I had hoped to see the last of these sorrowful symbols. There is little I can tell you of the details of the kobold religion as I was rescued from death as a pup by the Deep Muses and reunited with Brell Serilis. What I know is this, the deity this symbol represents is named Rolfron Zek. He was a devoted shaman of Brell before the Abandonment, now he is the lord of Despair and Hopelessness. There is a shaman of Rolfron that teaches the local kobolds, he carries with him a doctrine. Recover the doctrine and take it with this translation scroll back to your Temple.'\nReceive Hieroglyph Translations.\nYour faction standing with Deepmuses has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of AkAnon has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Gem Choppers has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Dark Reflection has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nA kobold missionary spawns in the area outside the minotaur caves in the Steamfont Mountains. Kill it and loot an encrypted document.\nYou have slain a kobold missionary!\nYour faction standing with Clan Kolbok has been adjusted by -5.\nYour faction standing with High Guard of Erudin has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Heretics has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain party experience!!\nHand in Hieroglyph Translations, An encrypted document, and your Disciple Symbol of Quellious.\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'I require the hieroglyph translations, the doctrine of Rolfron Zek, and your disciple symbol of Quellious.'\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'I require the hieroglyph translations, the doctrine of Rolfron Zek, and your disciple symbol of Quellious.'\nLeraena Shelyrak says 'You have done well yet again, young disciple. I award you the rank of Regent of the Peacekeepers. With this information we can hopefully gain some insight into the workings of the kobolds' religion.'\nYour faction standing with Peace Keepers has been adjusted by 70.\nYour faction standing with High Council of Erudin has been adjusted by 17.\nYour faction standing with Heretics has been adjusted by -17.\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n- Regent Symbol of Quellious [item=10266]\n[",
