      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou will find Zimloro in the \"shorty\" section of Shadowhaven approx loc is (-450, 1450). You can find this gnome vendor using the Find option as he is an Alchemy Supplies NPC.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zimloro Jalobottle'\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'Oi there _____. If you are lookin for a potion or an antidote I got just what the doctor ordered, step right up! I also have many other special potions but sadly I do not have the correct [components] for them. '\nYou say, 'components'\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'Well you see I can make some very magnificent potions, unfortunately I am in need of a few [ingredients] that I lost in a lab accident a few days back. '\nYou say, 'ingredients'\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'You sure seem interested in my work there _____. So interested that I think you would be willing to go fetch the components I require for my studies for me! Am I correct? Will you [retrieve these components] for me? '\nYou say, 'retrieve these components'\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'Fantastic _____! Elefan, my apprentice, is currently studying under my wing. He had been collecting samples in Shadeweaver lately and he probably has the items that I need. If you could go and speak with him and present him with this ingredient list, hopefully he will have what I need. Please bring the components back to me as soon as possible! '\nHe gives you the item Zimloro Ingredient List.\nHead to Shadeweaver's Thicket and speak to Elefan who is at approx (0, -3000) next to a large grouping of rocks. See his NPC page for a map location.\nYou say, 'Hail, Elefan'\nElefan says 'Hello _____. Its a pleasure to meet you as I do not see many visitors while I am working in the field gathering research. '\nGive Elefan the Zimloro Ingredient List.\nElefan says 'Ah! Master Zimloro sent you, eh? This note indicates that he wants some specific ingredients. Luckily, I've got several [fresh samples] that I've only recently collected.'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'What fresh samples?'\nElefan says 'Oh, some antidote ingredients that I stumbled upon not long ago. They should meet his needs. Will you be so kind as to [take the antidote ingredients] to Zimloro?'\nYou say, 'Sure. I'll take the antidote ingredients to Zimloro.'\nElefan says 'Here you are _____. Please bring them to him at once so they do not spoil and thank you for your help. '\nElefan gives you the Antidote Ingredients [item=21639], so head back to Zimloro in Shadowhaven.\nReturn to Zimloro in Shadow Haven.\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'You did it _____! Finally I can finish these potions that I have been working on for such a long time. I will surely tell all of my friends of your willingness to help me! '\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n- Experience, Faction\n[",
