      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nGliblixl Rocktok is found in the Bazaar at location 150, -215, -27.\nYou say, 'Hail, Gliblixl Rocktok'\nGliblixl Rocktok says 'Hail _____! I sell the finest quality ore imported from the mines of Norrath! It's difficult to keep enough ore available with the demands of the local smiths however and could use some [assistance] in restocking my supplies.'\nYou say, 'I will give assistance'\nGliblixl Rocktok says 'Hooray! Fill this crate with either four Small Bricks of Unrefined Ore or four Large Bricks of Unrefined Ore from Norrath and I will pay you for your assistance in keeping me in business.'\nYou receive an Empty Ore Crate.\nIn the crate, combine four Small Bricks of Unrefined Ore (dropped by gnolls and goblins in various zones across all levels) to create a Small Shipment of High Quality Ore. Turn this in to Gliblixl Rocktok.\nGliblixl Rocktok says 'Thank you! I will prepare the ore for sale and be open for business again momentarily. Here is your payment for your services.'\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 4.\nYour faction standing with House of Fordel has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with House of Midst has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 1.\nYou receive 14 platinum.Rewards:\n- Faction, money\n[",
