      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nSylia Windlehands is located inside the Songweavers Bards' Guild cabin in Kelethin near /waypoint -286, +298, +77 .\nYou say, 'Hail, Sylia Windlehands'\nSylia Windlehands says 'Salutations! The Song Weavers are always glad to add a new voice to the choir.  In addition to your voice, will you also [fetch spiderling silk]?  We need some to replace our worn lute strings.  Carry out this task in high tempo and we will show our gratitude.'\nYou say, 'I will fetch spiderling silk.'\nSylia Windlehands says 'Very spirited of you!! Gather four spiderling silk and return them to me.  Good hunting, my friend!!\nHunt and kill widow hatchlings in the Greater Faydark and loot their Spiderling Silk. You need at least four of them.\nReturn to Sylia Windlehands and hand her four (4) Spiderling Silk.\nSylia Windlehands says 'Splendid job!  Now if you can just keep a tune, you'll be a fine bard.'\nYour faction standing with Song Weavers has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 1 gold from Sylia Windlehands.\nYou receive a Hand Drum.\nSubmitted by: Awen ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Hand Drum [item=2462]\n[",
