      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 58\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Gimlik Cogboggle'\nGimlik Cogboggle says 'Well met, noble soul! I'm Gimlik Cogboggle. You are correct, the Gimlik Cogboggle, renowned adventurer, scholar, and yes... creator of spells. Please don't goggle or touch. Your opportunity has arrived, my friend. I was sent here to complete a very important task and for that, I will need some slight assistance. If you will be kind enough to follow me, I'll show you to your doom... err... get this show on the road. Just let me know when you're ready.'\nYou say, 'I am ready.'\nGimlik Cogboggle says 'Well look at you! You see, you're off to a great start! Now, just follow me and yell out if something stabs you or maims you in anyway. Never fear, I've memorized gate and have complete confidence in your ability to fend off danger for at least five seconds. Follow me... follow me.'\nHe starts at the top of the wizard spire.\nHe stops at the following locations.\n-16, -454\n6, -323\n288, -108\n100, -296\n595, -136 at this location there's a Thul Tae Ew Tracker who dropped the Tiny Metal Quill just as he sets off a second tracker spawns and attacks. it also drops a quill. Triggering him to pause a second time at this location.\nThen back to the wizard spire where he asks for the quill and resets to the top of the spire upon hand in.\nAll other mobs spawned between 2-4 at a time at the dead ends plus any normal mobs that aggro along the way. If you let him die he instantly resets to the spire.\nHe will stop along the way and say stuff like this:\nGimlik Cogboggle says 'Now this looks like a mask! Give me a moment to draw this thing in my journal. It will only take a second. I'm a genius you know, though my job is very difficult.'\nGimlik Cogboggle says 'Alrighty, off we go!'\nProtect him against various mobs during his meander.\nYou have slain a Thul Tae Ew Tracker!\n--You have looted a A Tiny Metal Quill.--\nNeed all dialogues; name, /loc, level ranges, fight info for all quest mobs; quest items; faction hits if any; missing quest rewards.\n- Cogboggle's Clockwork Contraption [item=12453]\n- Iron Cog Earring [item=12187]\n- Rough Steel Cog Earring [item=12524]\n- Shiny Cog Earring [item=13114]\n- Tiny Gear Shaped Earring [item=13680]\n[",
