      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFirst, the trivials:\nVial of Quicksilver Temper is brewed and trivial at 135. The Yttrium Steel Sheet has a high smithing trivial (335). Both of these items are droppable. The final combines' trivial levels are in the mid to upper 100s. The final weapons are no drop, so you have to produce them yourself.\nQuicksilver Temper is made by combining Shissar Blood (dropped off Shissars), Fungoid Sap (from Ancient Shriekers in the Deep), ShikNar Ichor (from the Shik'Nars in Fungus Grove) and Meteor Dust (random drop in The Grey).\nThe Yttrium Steel Sheet is made by combining two Small Bricks of Yttrium Ore and the Quicksilver Temper.\nThe final combine produces the weapon of your choice.  The bow is fletched, while all others are smithed.  Use the Quicksilver Temper, an Yttrium Steel Sheet, and the following:\n- Bow - Oak Bow Staff, Planing Tool, Silk String\n- Dagger - Dagger Blade Mold, Hilt Mold, Pommel Mold\n- Falchion - Curved Blade Mold, Hilt Mold, Pommel Mold\n- Long Sword - Long Blade Mold, Hilt Mold, Pommel Mold\n- Mace - Mace Head Mold, Oak Shaft\n- Short Sword - Short Blade Mold, Hilt Mold, Pommel Mold\n- Spiked Gloves - High Quality Rockhopper Hides (2)\n- War Axe - Axe Head Mold, Oak Shaft\n- War Hammer - Hammer Head Mold, Oak Shaft\n- Yttrium Dagger [item=15384]\n- Yttrium Falchion [item=20308]\n- Yttrium Long Sword [item=20309]\n- Yttrium Mace [item=16181]\n- Yttrium Short Sword [item=19652]\n- Yttrium Spiked Gloves [item=14051]\n- Yttrium War Axe [item=19687]\n- Yttrium War Hammer [item=13958]\n- Yttrium-Imbued Oak Bow [item=20307]\n[",
