        { id = 15, name = "Iron Cudgel of the Clairvoyant", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 5\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter completing the Cursed Wafers [quest=201] quest, talk to Hierophant Oxyn [npc=4740] in the Temple of Terror.\nYou say, 'What lost skulls?'\nHierophant Oxyn says, 'You must have heard of the Trilac Brotherhoods disappearance.  They are the skulls of three soon to be ancients. They were taken from this temple by a silent intruder. Crusaders are always on duty. I do not know how they got into our vault. Every petitioner is ordered to search for the three skulls and return them to me along with their petitioner cudgel and then they shall become clairvoyants.'\nYou say, 'What Iron Cudgel of the Clairvoyant?'\nHierophant Oxyn shakes his head and waves a finger in your face.  If you are looking to be handed the Iron Cudgel of the Clairvoyant [item=15] then you are sadly mistaken. Perhaps if you were to gather a few [lost skulls] for the temple we may find you worthy to wield one.'\nYou need to gather the skulls to find out how the get the cudgel. The three skulls are named Waz [item=3472], Morgl [item=3473] and Logrin [item=3474]. The intruder (an iksar outcast [npc=4743]) can be found in the \"sewer\" area of East Cabilis (he may also spawn in the Swamp of No Hope).\nTo get to the sewers from the Temple of Terror, take either of the teleporters inside the guild up onto the balcony and descend down the eastern tower. Following these corridors you should eventually come to a broken path with a big hole leading down, jumping off should land you in a pool of water. In this area are mostly mosquitoes and scorpions, with the occasional decaying skeleton. Less common spawns here are Iksar outcasts and giant leeches. One known spawn location is by the stone stairs just past the drop down point.\nCollect all three skulls, and hand them in to Hierophant Oxyn along with the Iron Cudgel of the Petitioner [item=21269] you received when you gave your guild note to the guild master (not the wooden one).\nHierophant Oxyn says \"In my hand shall be placed three skulls of the Trilac Brotherhood and an iron cudgel of the petitioner\".\nAfter cudgel turn-in:\nHierophant Oxyn says \"Excellent! You have proved yourself worthy to wield the iron cudgel of the clairvoyant. As a clairvoyant I feel I can trust you, so I will tell you that the issue of the missing skulls is a [much larger problem] than last stated.'\nYou receive some faction, coinage, your very own Iron Cudgel of the Clairvoyant [item=15] and the second skull quest [quest=207].Rewards:\n- Iron Cudgel of the Clairvoyant [item=15]\n[",
