      items_required = {
        { name = "the Froglok Hex Doll to Hierophant Zand", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 17, name = "Iron Cudgel of the Mystic", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 14\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nTarget Hierophant Zand [npc=4741] and say I am the chosen savior.\nHierophant Zand closes his eyes and bows before you.\nHierophant Zand says \"I am honored to meet the one who shall pledge his life to the return of the Skulls of the Ancients.  However, I must see proof of our prowess as of yet.  Go to the outlands and retrieve one Froglok Hexdoll, and no, they are not found on Frogloks. They are shaman dolls made by the goblin tribe.\"\nThe Froglok Hex Doll [item=2294] can be found on a goblin hextracer [npc=4350] in Warsliks Wood [zone=95].\nTurn in the Froglok Hex Doll to Hierophant Zand.\nHierophant Zand says, 'Fine work! I hope for your sake, you did not purchase it from a brave adventurer. Take this note to the one for whom it is written. This lizard has knowledge of a large number of skulls.'\nYou receive The Bone Garrison [item=58383], a note that reads: \"Crusader Quarg. Assist this young mystic with the retrieval of the skulls.\"\nDeliver the note to Crusader Quarg in the Field of Bone.\nCrusader Quarg [npc=4183] roams inside a building near East Cabilis. He gives you Skull Chest [item=57627], a 6 slot container.\nKill undead crusaders in Kurn's Tower and loot 2 different Iksar Skull with an 'X'.\nHead to Kurn's Tower [zone=87] and bring him back the Skulls of the Caste of Bone Brethren, a caste of powerful shamans who perished fighting undead in the Field of Bone several decades ago.  You are to get the skulls of the 5 Caste members [item=3131] along with the skull of the leader.  The Leader Skull is a Lore skull with an \"X\" [item=21270]. The others are non lore Skulls with an \"X\". (When Identified, they show Caste of Bone Brethren).  They all drop off the undead crusaders [npc=4512] in Kurn's Tower.\nPut them in the Skull Chest and combine them. This turns the Skull Chest into a Full C.O.B.B. Chest [item=21271].\nTake the Full C.O.B.B. Chest back to Crusader Quarg, along with your previous cudgel.\nHand him the C.O.B.B. chest and your Iron Cudgel of the Seer [item=16] to receive Iron Cudgel of the Mystic [item=17].Rewards:\n- Iron Cudgel of the Mystic [item=17]\n[",
