hest) on the 3rd floor of the paladin guild hall, in the same structure as Torsten Reidan.\n/waypoint -795, -797, +12\nA File Cabinet slams shut after you take the original records out. Guard Hargrar spawns and says 'Hey! What are you doing in there?!'\nGuard Hargrar scowls at you, ready to attack -- he appears to be quite formidable.\nYou have been summoned!\nHe is level 37. You do not need to kill him, just run to the zone to clear aggro.  You shouldn't get adds as he's not on a faction table.\nYou have slain Guard Hargrar!\nYou gain experience!!\nGive Euzan Jurek the old records you received from the file cabinet and the Insignia Earring of Veracity.\nEuzan Jurek says 'By now you must realize that we need to avoid the question because of whom we are.  Seru is not the Noble Paladin this city would have you believe.  You see they teach that Katta feared Seru and that he had faked his own poisoning so they could pin the blame on Seru.  The next thing that I ask of you, I ask because you can travel without question from one city to another.  Go to Katta and give this report to Tilbok Furrunner.  Tell him we are successfully rooted within Sanctus Seru and await any commands.'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by 15.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -7.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou receive faction, experience, a Report to Tilbok and your Etched Earring of Veracity.\n- Etched Earring of Veracity [item=12500]\n- Report to Tilbok [item=20751]\n[",
