      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAt the end of the previous quest [quest=2147], you were told to head to Katta Castellum and seek out Tilbok Furrunner.  Tilbok Furrunner is located near the grave yard area and is inside a castle building along the 2nd floor.  He is the Rogue guild leader.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tilbok Furrunner'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'Hello there, Limecherry.  Pleasure to meet you, I am Governor Tilbok Furrunner.  I am tasked with the gathering and security of information for the Concilium Universus, the ruling council of our fine city.'\nGive him the Report to Tilbok.\nTilbok Furrunner reads through the report, hands you a small satchel then starts to explain, 'Finally news from Euzan.  I knew that it would take a long time to get planted within Seru, but I still worried about their mission constantly.  This report shows that you have earned trust from Euzan, so I in turn will show the same trust.  Euzan and Torsten were placed in the city for information.  They are deep undercover and risk their life everyday.  Every person in that city is ingrained with the [purpose] of either destroying Katta or converting his people.'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -5.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nNote: the faction hit here is fairly large but shouldn't make you KoS in Sanctus Seru.  You receive a Report Satchel [item=20750].\nYou say, 'What purpose?'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'The teaching in the city is that Katta feigned his death to blame it on Seru.  When in fact Seru actually poisoned Katta.  The crusade that Seru leads is false and must be stopped.  We must gain access to Seru's [chambers] and destroy him and show the city the truth.'\nYou say, 'What chambers?'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'We do not know much about Seru's Chamber, that is what we need you to find out.  This will require great effort on your part.  We need you to infiltrate Sanctus Seru and bring back reports from each Consillium.  I do not know who will have these reports, and I have only heard rumor that they exist.  Return to me with the Satchel full, and your Etched Earring.'\nFrom here, go back to Sanctus Seru and proceed to kill...\n-- a Lictor of the Heart - South East building - (Summons, Heals, Minor Nuke)-\n-- a Vigilum Cohortis - North East building - (Summons, Heals, Roots, Drones of Doom)-\n-- a Signiferi of the Hand - South West building - (Summons, Heals, Stuns)-\n-- a Custos Armorum - North West Building - (Summons, Furys, Stuns, Rampage)-\nOn the 3rd floor in each of the 4 main Guild buildings.  Each kill is HUGE faction hits and will most likely make you KoS to that Guilds Faction.  All dual wield and double attack for 150 on the average and 177 seemed to be the max.\nLoot a Concillium Report from each and combine in the Report Satchel to craft a Full Satchel [item=59306].\nReturn to Tilbok Furrunner and give him Etched Earring of Veracity and the Full Satchel.\nTilbok Furrunner says 'According to these reports Seru resides in a building called the Arx Seru. It is the large complex in the center of the four Praesertum Consillium. We must take [action] now. Do not underestimate the power of Sanctus Seru for what they do they feel is right.'\nYour faction standing with Validus Custodus has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Katta Castellum Citizens has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Magus Conlegium has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Nathyn Illuminious has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Coterie of the Eternal Night has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Seru has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Hand of Seru has been adjusted by -10.\nYour faction standing with Eye of Seru has been adjusted by -2.\nYour faction standing with Hand Legionnaries has been adjusted by -2.\nYou receive a Runed Earring of Veracity.\nYou say, 'What action?'\nTilbok Furrunner says 'You must go see Lcea. She was Tsaph Katta's closest advisor. This matter has escalated greatly and must be placed in her hands. Ask her about the [Arx Key] she will no doubt ask in your service retrieving it. I salute your service to the city and wish you well.\nThis leads into the fourth quest, Signet Earring of Veracity [quest=2299].Rewards:\n- Runed Earring of Veracity [item=14607]\n[",
