      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nJolum stands on a table on the southern balcony of the central building between the two banks.\nYou say, 'Hail, Jolum'\nJolum says 'Hail!  Nice to see ya, friend.  I've got a fine selection of spankin' good spells, perhaps you'd be interested? Or maybe you'd like to learn how to [upgrade] your Grandmaster Trade items?  Still yet, maybe you would like to know how to create a [Grandmaster's Medicine Bag]?'\nYou say, 'How can I upgrade?'\nJolum says 'What Grandmaster Trade item would you like to know how to upgrade?  I can tell you how to upgrade your [Grandmaster Baker's Spoon], [Grandmaster Brewer's Corker], [Grandmaster Fletcher's Knife], [Grandmaster Jeweler's Eyeglass], [Grandmaster Potter's Sculpter], [Grandmaster Smith's Hammer], [Grandmaster Tailor's Needle], or your [Grandmaster Tinker's Spanner].  While you can't have more than one of the new items, they will summon a [bag] for you.  Very useful for carrying heavy items about and such.'\nYou say, 'What bag?'\nJolum says 'Its a very sturdy bag, but I'm afraid that it's only temporary.  If you'd like to get a more permanent bag, just hand me your summoned one and I'll trade it out you.'\nHand in a TEMPORARY Grandmaster's Satchel, summoned by a tradeskill grandmaster's trophy (one of the upgraded/newer ones that summon bags) to receive an Artisan Essence.  Combine this by itself in the appropriate tradeskill container to get two corresponding containers, one a normal bag (XXX Carry-All) and one a bag for tradeskill components (XXX Component Bag).  You can get one set of each per tradeskill.\nOn progression servers, when you hand in the TEMPORARY Grandmaster's Satchel summoned by your tradeskill trophy, you will receive a Grandmaster's Carry-All bag.Rewards:\n- Adamantine Carryall [item=95590]\n- Adamantine Component Bag [item=104111]\n- Artisan Essence [item=95586]\n- Brewmaster's Carryall [item=95596]\n- Brewmaster's Component Bag [item=104113]\n- Clay Flinger's Carryall [item=95591]\n- Clay Flinger's Component Bag [item=104106]\n- Contraption Carryall [item=95604]\n- Contraption Component Bag [item=104182]\n- Denmother's Carryall [item=95588]\n- Denmother's Component Bag [item=104112]\n- Ethereal Carryall [item=95595]\n- Ethereal Component Bag [item=104110]\n- Fletcher's Carryall [item=95594]\n- Fletcher's Component Bag [item=104107]\n- Grandmaster's Carryall [item=14661]\n- Jeweler's Carryall [item=95593]\n- Jeweler's Component Bag [item=104108]\n- Mundunugu Carryall [item=95598]\n- Mundunugu Component Bag [item=104117]\n- Mystical Carryall [item=95587]\n- Mystical Component Bag [item=104109]\n- Peerless Carryall [item=95589]\n- Peerless Component Bag [item=104114]\n[",
