      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Defender Raldson'\nDefender Raldson says 'Good day to you Droo. A fine day it is today in the Haven. I hear the bazaar is full of great deals today. I'd love to go and check them out for myself unfortunately I'm stuck here worrying about my friend [Daksins]. '\nYou say, 'Who is Daksins'\nDefender Raldson says 'Well I know that he told me he was going to the Tenebrous Mountains to try to acquire the blood of one of the cursed vampyres there. A very brave gnome he is, but also sometimes not very aware of what he is getting himself into. He told me that he needed to bring it to Zimloro so that a potion could be made to cure his sick sister. She was attacked by one of the cursed not too long ago. Perhaps you could go [lend him a hand] so that he could return sooner. His family is very worried about him. '\nYou say, 'I will lend him a hand'\nDefender Raldson says 'That is very nice of you, Droo. I'm sure his family will be very grateful. He should not be there alone and we fear the worst for him. If you are to go search for him, please bring him this note from Zimloro that contains further instructions Please seek him out and do your best to convince him to come home. '\nYou receive List of Potion Components. Go to Tenebrous Mountains. Daksins is along the wall to the left as you enter TM from Katta Castellum.\nYou say, 'Hail, Daksins'\nDaksins says 'Hello traveller, what brings you to these cursed mountains? If I were you I would turn back now, all that really lies ahead of you is certain death. The vampires that inhabitant these mountains are some of the fiercest and most skilled. '\nGive Daksins the List of Potion Components.\nDaksins says 'I see you were sent by my friends from back home. I understand that they are very worried about me but they must understand that I am doing this to help my sister and anyone else infected by this horrible beasts. If only I could receive some help in collecting a vampyre blood extract.sample I could return it home along with the other components that Zimloro decribes in this letter. '\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!!\nGive Daksins a vial of Vampyre Blood that's an uncommon drop from Coterie in TM, there are 3 camps on the north wall of the zone.\nDaksins says 'The blood of one of the cursed! You have done it Droo. You must be a very skilled fighter to have bested one of these vile creatures. All that needs to be done now is to return this extract along with the other antidote supplies that I have prepared to Zimloro. Will you return this extract? '\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou say, 'I will return the extract'\nDaksins says 'I suppose I could trust you to return it to Zimloro. You have earned my trust by going and slaying this beast for me. This will help me greatly as well as I must rest in Katta for a few days to recover from the wounds I received at the hands of these monsters. Please return this bag that contains the extract along with other components that Zimloro asked me to retrieve to him. Thank you Droo, I am forever in your debt. '\nDaksins gives you a bag of Antidote Supplies.\nGo to Shadow Haven and find Zimloro in the Stout Quarter (upper part). Hand him the bag of Antidote Supplies.\nZimloro Jalobottle says 'Ah of course the antidote supplies I have been waiting for from Daksins. I hope he is ok, we all told him it was not wise to go out to the cursed mountains alone. I thank you for bringing me these supplies because Daksins was unable too. There have been many reports lately of people receiving the disease carried by the beasts you encountered. Should you come across these extracts in the future bring them to me if you like. Thank you again, your actions will not go unnoticed. '\nYour faction standing with House of Stout has been adjusted by 25.\nYour faction standing with Traders of the Haven has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!!Submitted by: Droo T'Alouqua, ZebRewards:\n- Experience and Faction\n[",
