      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Renni Stone'\nRenni Stone says 'Har har, _____!  I see yer curious mind has brought ye to what will be the most fabulous and fascinating museum display of them all, the geological exhibit. Behold the [rocks] of Norrath!  I'd be most delighted to show them to ye, eh, but I'm afraid it's not quite ready yet, you see. Some pieces of my collection have gone missing and I haven't gone to get replacements yet.'\nYou say, 'What rocks?'\nRenni Stone says 'Eh, let's see. I'm missing a Whirling Crystal, A Scarlet Stone, Icy Geoduck, and A Pulsating Rock. Might ye have these on ye? If ye do, go and get a Collector's Box from [Merri], and put them inside. Close the box and bring it to me. The display will be most grand if ye do!'\nYou say, 'Merri'\nRenni Stone says, 'Curator Merri is the founder of the museum in the Selia district of New Tanaan. She is a true visionary and a wonderful person as well. It is her dream to turn life's love into something truly grand. She also carries with her the Collector's Boxes. If you need one, be sure to ask her for it.'\n- Whirling Crystal [item=1413] drops off the rare creature Spinflint [npc=3521] Gorge of King Xorbb (Beholder's Maze).\n- Scarlet Stone [item=12402] drops off drolvargs in Firiona Vie.\n- Icy Geoduck [item=12536] drops off walruses in Eastern Wastes.\n- Pulsating Rock [item=7756] drops off mud burrowers in Paludal Caverns.\n- Collector's Box [item=18694] is obtained by saying \"I need a Collector's Box\" to Curator Merri [npc=11827] in the same room as Renni Stone.\nCombine the 4 items in the Collector's Box to get what item ?, then give it to Renni Stone for your reward.\nReward:\nFine Antique Pelisse [item=16649]\n- Fine Antique Pelisse [item=16649]\n[",
