      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nRandi Ellan may be found at /waypoint +900, +675.\nYou say, 'Hail, Randi Ellan'\nRandi Ellan says 'And a good morning to you as well, Gwyndalyn.  I can see by the gleam in your eye you are interested in learning more about the flowers of Norrath.  Sadly my exhibit is not much to speak of.  I require new [specimens] to help build my collection.'\nYou say, 'What specimens?'\nRandi Ellan says 'If you could find some for me, I would be ever so grateful.  I need a Black Root, Maneater Bud, Yew Leaf, and a Twilight Orchid.  If you should come across them, handle them with care.  Be sure to get a Collector's Box from [Merri] to keep them in.  Close the box and return it to me.'\nBlack Root may be foraged in Misty Thicket.  Maneater Bud drops from various plant monsters in the Emerald Jungle and Swamp of No Hope.  Twilight Orchid may be foraged in certain zones in Luclin.  Yew Leaf may be foraged in the Wakening Land.\nUpon handing in the items:\nRandi Ellan says 'Plants and flowers are a special treasure I keep close to my heart. Did you ever stop to marvel at how beautiful these specimens are? I thank you greatly for them. Here, take this in return.'\nYou receive a Fine Antique Corset.\n- Fine Antique Corset [item=16364]\n[",
