ceive Idol of Woven Grass.\nThe Coldain Fetish drops from coldain missionaries in the Eastern Wastes.\nYou receive The Coldain Fetish.\nThe Petrified Totem drops from the following NPCs:\n- Dawnshroud Peaks: a petrified stonegrabber\n- Scarlet Desert: a fierce rockhopper, a masterful cheetah, an enraged rockhopper\n- Tenebrous Mountains: a grol baku earthmaster\n- The Twilight Sea: an ancient sea turtle\nYou receive Petrified Totem.\nCombine the Forlorn Totem of Rolfron Zek, Idol of Woven Grass, Coldain Fetish, and the Petrified Totem inside the Collector's Box.\nYou receive Collection of Idols.\nHand the Collection of Idols to Curator Merri.\nMissing dialogue\nYou receive Fine Antique Velvet Rose.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Fine Antique Velvet Rose [item=16472]\n[",
