      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** An Hour\n**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Trep Thilcan'\nTrep Thilcan says 'Hi! You wouldn't be able to do a favor for a poor gnome would you?'\nYou say, 'I will do you a favor.'\nTrep Thilcan says 'Well I am trying to setup a shop here, it is such a choice location!  I am afraid if I leave though that nasty Halfling over there may steal my spot!  She has been watching me keenly all day.  I know she is just waiting for me to walk away.  If you would go purchase some supplies for me from various locations around the world I would be able to reward you for your time spent.  If you are ready to begin?'\nYou say, 'I am ready to begin.'\nTrep Thilcan says 'Great! Here is a special crate.  It needs to be filled with:\nA purification tablet from Freeport\nA keg of beer from Qeynos\nA ball of twine from Shadeweaver\nA bundle of weapons from Firiona\nAn armor assortment from Thurgadin\nAnd a case of meat from the Bazaar\nThat should give me quite a stock of items to sell to travelers out here.'\nPurification Tablet: Krystin Charcoal (good) in West Freeport or Toxdil (evil) in East Freeport.\nKeg of Beer: Crow or Tanlyn Galliway in North Qeynos (good) or Darien Felton in Neriak (evil).\nLarge Ball of Twine: Saren Kaja in Shadeweaver's Thicket or Fugla in the Feerrott.\nBundle of Weapons: Dom Pathfinder in Firiona Vie at +465, -3350 (good) OR Ootok in Grobb (evil).\nArmor Assortment: Terman Underbelly in Thurgadin\nCase of Meat: Gaelsori Heriseron in The Bazaar or Gellanna Zon in The Barter Hall.\nTrep Thilcan says 'Fantastic! You got me everything I need to set up shop. Here is some money for your troubles.  I hoped you learned something as well. I am sorry I have nothing more to give you except this advice, if you combine:\nA clockwork carapace\nA metal rod\nGnomish bolts\nFirewater\nAnd Grease\n..in a Toolbox you should get something nice!'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 60 platinum from Trep Thilcan.\n(The recipe he gives you is for a Wok).\nNeed missing /loc for mobs.Rewards:\n- Platinum\n[",
