      walkthrough = "**Level:** 9\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest is a followup to the previous quest in the series, Rotting Jawbones [quest=2249].\n- Turn in four thick jawbones from skeletal thugs.\nSpiritist Karina says, 'I was worried about your safety _____. I am glad you have returned in one piece. While you were away I have made arrangements to supply you with these _____. Now then, let us see what we can learn from these remains.' Karina cups her hands over the thick jawbones and calls to the spirits for guidance. As her meditation ends, she looks drained and short of breath. 'It is as I have feared. There is a [vampire] within this thicket.'\nYou say, 'vampire'\nSpiritist Karina says, 'There are rumors of Vampire appearances within the Tenebrous Mountains. I suspect you will be able to learn more about these horrifying creatures within Katta Castellum.'\nYour faction standing with Guardians of Shar Vahl has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain party experience!\nYou gain party experience!\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!\nRebirth Leather armor\n- Rebirth Leather Boots [item=76403]\n- Rebirth Leather Gloves [item=14650]\n- Rebirth Leather Leggings [item=76402]\n- Rebirth Leather Sleeves [item=7757]\n[",
