    {
      id = "226",
      title = "Warrior Pike #2 (Footman's Pike)",
      exp = "01",
      exp_name = "The Ruins of Kunark",
      min_lvl = 8,
      max_lvl = 130,
      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Drill Master Kyg",
        "what footman pike?",
        "I will slay many beasts",
        "what weapons of our foes?",
        "what footman",
        "footman pike",
        "slay many beasts",
        "weapons of our foes",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "your Full Footman's Pack and your Militia Pike", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 729, name = "Footman's Pike", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 8\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is the second upgraded warrior pike quest.\nYou say, 'Hail, Drill Master Kyg'\nDrill Master Kyg says 'Welcome. Welcome!! Time to train. Time to fight. Time to serve the Iksar Empire. You will need weapons. I have the [footman pike] for all new recruits to earn.'\nYou say, 'what footman pike?'\nDrill Master Kyg says 'A footman pike is what you need. A footman pike is what you get, but earn it you will. You must [slay many beasts] to prove to us that you are a true warrior. Fail and you will be exiled to live with the Forsaken.'\nYou say, 'I will slay many beasts'\nDrill Master Kyg says 'Yes. You will slay or you will be slain. Take this footman's pack and fill it you will. Fill it with [weapons of our foes]. When all are combined, the full footman's pack shall be returned to me along with your militia pike. Do this and earn your footman pike and then we may have a true mission for you.'\nYou say, 'what weapons of our foes?'\nDrill Master Kyg says 'Yes. You need to know the weapons required. Fill the pack with javelins. Froglok bounder and goblin hunter javelins. Two of each.'\nYou receive a \"Footman's Pack\" (4-slot container).\nDrill Master Kyg has a mission you need to complete if you want to get your Footman's Pike. He wants you to find four javelins, two from froglok bounders (found near the middle of the Swamp of No Hope) and two from goblin hunters (found in the middle of the valley leading to the lake in the Lake of Ill Omen).\nAbout one out of four goblin hunters and froglok bounders will have the javelin. They will equip it if they have it. They are named \"Goblin Hunter Javelin\" and \"Froglok Bounder Javelin\". Once you have all four, combine them in the Footman's Pack to receive \"Full Footman's Pack\".\nReturn to Drill Master Kyg and hand in your Full Footman's Pack and your Militia Pike.\nDrill Master Kyg says 'You were instructed to return with the full footmans pack and your militia pike.'\nDrill Master Kyg says 'Kyg knew you could do it. You will make a fine legionnaire some day but, for now, you shall be a footman. Take the footman pike head plans. Forge the footman's pike. Do so, and then you may have an audience with the War Baron on the subject of his [Memory of Sebilis].'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis got better.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents got better.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics got better.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist got better.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou will have received \"Footman Head Plans\"\nYou now need to forge your Footman's Pike. Go outside the fort near the forge and find Weaponsmith Grugl. He can tell you how to make your Footman's Pike.\nYou say, 'what footman's pike?'\nWeaponsmith Grugl says 'To forge a footman pike requires skill as well as an iron rod, forging hammer and a footman pike head. To forge the pike head you will need a geozite tool, raw pike head and petrified redwood if the footman pike head plans are yours.'\nBuy a \"Raw Pike Head\", \"Forging Hammer\", and an \"Iron Rod\" from Weaponsmith Grugl.\nIn a forge, combine \"A Raw Pike Head\", \"Footman Head Plans\", \"Petrified Redwood\" (foraged in Warslik's Woods or dropped from succulents in The Overthere), and your Geozite Tool (obtained by a quest from Drill Master Vygan). You'll receive \"Footman's Pike Head\" (blacksmithing, 15 trivial). If you fail you'll receive your Geozite Tool and your Footman Head Plans back.\nYou then need to combine an \"Iron Rod\", \"Forging Hammer\", and your \"Footman's Pike Head\" in the forge to obtain your Footman's Pike. If you fail the combine you'll receive your Footman's Pike Head back (trivial is 21).\nCongratulations, you've received your Footman's Pike!\nSubmitted by: Timmeh; Updated by BonestrikerRewards:\n- Footman's Pike [item=729]\n[",
    },
