      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nGoona Seesoo says 'Hello, ______.  Heard about my special armor and couldn't resist visiting eh?'\nYou say, 'what special armor'\nGoona Seesoo says 'I have learned how to make a light-weight armor out of a particular type of fungus that can be found in Innothule.  It is very nice armor for an aspiring adventurer.  Do you wish for me to craft you some?'\nYou say, 'i do wish for you to craft me some'\nGoona Seesoo says 'I can make you a piece of armor, but first you will need to gather some Fungus Clumps.  They only grow on the Fungus Man Watchers in the swamp.  If you come across four of these clumps, hand them to me and I will make you a piece of armor.'\nGoona Seesoo says 'Thanks, but I need four Fungus Clumps to make a piece of armor for you.'\nGoona Seesoo says 'Thanks, but I need four Fungus Clumps to make a piece of armor for you.'\nGoona Seesoo says 'Thanks, but I need four Fungus Clumps to make a piece of armor for you.'\nGoona Seesoo takes the clumps of fungus from you and begins to sew them together at a manic pace.  Before you know it, Goona is handing you a piece of armor.  Here you go.  May Marr's blessing be upon you and if you need more armor, bring me four more Fungus Clumps!\nYou gain experience!!\nYou get a piece of Fungus Flesh Armor.\nDoes this quest still exist after the trolls took Grobb over once more?Submitted by: TeaggwinRewards:\n- Fungus Flesh Pants [item=7958]\n- Fungus Flesh Shirt [item=11850]\n- Fungus Flesh Sleeves [item=7840]\n- Fungus Flesh Wristband [item=10366]\n[",
