      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nWista is found at +131, -373.95, +8\nYou say, 'Hail, Wista'\nWista says 'Hi, do ya likes eatin', or puhaps Hukulk sent ya?  I makes many gud eats. Doh, sum I can'ts make cause sum tings I ain't gots.  I cud makes some berry tastie stuff wid only [sum wolf meat].'\nYou say, 'I get sum wolf meat.'\nWista says 'Gets me two wolf meats sos I cans makes me foods.  I gib ya sumting.'\nTurn in 2 x Wolf Meat.\nWista says 'Deez berry gud.  Makes berry good suff.  Me berry happy.  Yous gets more bring dem ta mees.  Yous takes dis and tanks fer da meats.'\nYour faction standing with Grobb Merchants got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nNeed current faction hits, additional rewards if any.Rewards:\n- Large Bag [item=2594]\n[",
