        "What task?",
        "Hail, Assistant T`os",
        "task",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "your Fleshless Heart", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 19665, name = "Fleshweaver's Mark", type = "item" },
        { id = 19667, name = "Heartspike", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** Several Hours\n**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFleshweaver T`soma stands along a wall as you zone into Neriak Commons.\nYou say, 'Hail, Fleshweaver T`soma'\nFleshweaver T`soma says 'Ah you must be the one sent to assist me. Good. I have need of flesh for my spellwork. I wish to summon them myself! Get me three samples of flesh from these new Luggald beings.  Put the samples in this Fleshthread Satchel so that they don't decay.'\nYou receive a Fleshthreaded Satchel, a 4-slot GIANT container.\nJourney to Dulak.  As you enter Dulak from Gunthak, keep along the left wall till you find a hidden wall/secret passage into some caverns. Luggald Flesh (NO DROP) is a random drop in the tunnel, and seems to drop more commonly by the waterfall/temple-looking area. Combine 3 pieces of Luggald Flesh in the satchel to craft a Satchel of Luggald Samples.  Return this to Fleshweaver T`soma.\nFleshweaver T`soma says 'Hmm. You seem more capable than my other assistants. I have another [task] to ask of you.'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nFleshweaver T`soma says 'We first learned of the Luggalds through our agents on Broken Skull Rock. It appears that Innoruuk intended these servants only for the trolls. We shall see about that! Go retrieve three samples of Fecund Luggald Flesh. You will need to get the flesh of those in the Crypt of Nadox this time. Here. Make sure to put them in this Fleshwoven Bag.'\nYou receive a Fleshwoven Bag, another 4-slot GIANT container.\nHead for the Crypt of Nadox.  Just before you get to the Undead Troll area, there is a room filled with Luggald Initiates and Luggald Abominations.   The Fecund Luggald Flesh is pretty darn rare:  it took me 4 nights of 5-hour camps to get 3 pieces, and it can come from either initiates or abominations.  Combine the 3 pieces of Fecund Luggald Flesh to craft Fecund Luggald Samples.  Return this to Fleshweaver T`soma.\nFleshweaver T`soma says 'Ah, yes. These are fantastic examples. No doubt they will ensure the success of our attempt. Now quickly, go speak with my Assistant T`os. She's prepared the ritual of summoning on the shores of Toxxulia Forest. It should be far enough away if anything...occurs.'\nHead for Toxxulia Forest.  Assistant T`os can be found to the very north of the water at approximately +2000, +1500.\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant T`os'\nAssistant T`os says 'You're late! Never mind. Prepare yourself. I do not trust these magics T`soma has constructed.'\nThis triggers a giant skeleton called a Fleshless Servant, approximately level 60.  It harm touches, has a maximum melee of about 511, occasionally rampages, and is slowable with Shackle of Spirit.  Beat it down to loot the item Fleshless Heart (NO DROP).  As was mentioned, hailing T'os again will trigger another Fleshless Servant to spawn, so be careful not to go out in a blaze of harm touch. Take our Fleshless Heart back to Fleshweaver T`soma.\nFleshweaver T`soma says 'So. You've come back. I hope, for your sake, you haven't returned empty handed.'\nTurn in your Fleshless Heart.\nFleshweaver T'soma says 'Apparently our ignorance exceeded our luck. Ah well, I'm sure the Prince of Hate will find some other punishment for our folly. Well, since you too chance his anger I suppose you deserve a reward. Here, take this...though I'm not sure how much use it will be against a god.'Rewards:\n- Fleshweaver's Mark [item=19665]\n- Heartspike [item=19667]\n[",
