      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nKejar the Mighty, a named imp found deep in The Hole (#9 on Muse's map) asks you to bring him a Shining Metallic Robe.\nThe Shining Metallic Robe is dropped rarely off the Arch Ghoul Magus on the dead side of Lower Guk.\nIn exchange for the SMR, you'll either receive a Shiny Chunk of Metal or a Shiny Robe of the Underfoot. The former is the more common of the two.Rewards:\n- Shiny Hunk of Metal [item=19678]\n- Shiny Robe of the Underfoot [item=6779]\n[",
