      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 60\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'what additional item'\nJortreva the Crusader says ''The Ancients have resurrected many shadows of their former legions. Among these are the creatures known as the Ancient Drakeens -- creatures of mortal birth but are twisted and reshaped to suit the Ancients' plans. Find one of these Ancient Drakeens and seek out the very core of their being -- their heart. Be warned that these hearts are fragile in stability away from their host. It may prove difficult to find a flawless specimen that we need. Once you have obtained the Drakeen Heart, you will then seek the creature known as the Sinister Gargoyle. Upon the destruction of this creature's corporeal form, the core of their power that binds and allows them to affect the primal world should remain. That core you must extract and return to me with the ancient Drakeen Heart.''\nTurn in Corrupted Gargoyle Stone and Ancient Drakeen Heart result in.\nJortreva the Crusader says \"You have done well Sulan, and Jortreva of the Crusaders is pleased by the honorable actions that have bound you to this duty. The Crusaders of Veeshan recognized your efforts and we shall justly honor your allegiance and loyalty to us. This is Bracer of the Ages, an ancient item forged by the scales of our chromatic elders of the brood during the elder years of the Age of Scale. It shall server you well and will act as the token of the Crusader's acknowledgement of your individual efforts to aid us.\"\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan could not possibly get any better.\nYour faction standing with Yelinak could not possibly get any better.\nYour faction standing with Kromzek could not possibly get any worse.\nYou gain experiance!! Submitted by: SulanRewards:\n- Chromatic Bracer of the Ages [item=19702]\n