      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nBrianna Falsruinay is located on the second floor of the 'Erudin Port Authority' in Erudin.\n/waypoint +201, +55, +3\nYou say, 'Hail, Brianna Falsruinay'\nBrianna Falsruinay says, 'Hello, traveler. I am afraid I don't recognize you to be a local around these parts, although I could have been buried in my work. I have been quite busy since [Elisi] turned up missing.'\nYou say, 'Elisi'\nBrianna Falsruinay says, 'Elisi Nasin is a very well known enchanter and courier from Erudin. It is part of her trade to travel to Qeynos and share knowledge with the residents of the Order of Three. She often travels once or twice a month to deliver and pick up her most recent workings.  However, she still has not returned from her most recent [travel]. We fear the worst for her; pirates have been rampant around these parts lately. We should send [someone to Qeynos] soon but have not had the time to do so.'\nYou say, 'I will travel to Qeynos'\nBrianna Falsruinay says, 'Your offer is quite gracious Nuki, I do have a good feeling about you. If you wish to help us figure out what has happened to Elisi please travel to Qeynos. I believe the person she used to exchange magic with was named Jalorin. He is a member of the Order of Three so you should be able to find him there. Present him with this medal so that he may know you are sent from us. Please return to me if you should discover anything about Elisi's disappearance.'\nYou receive Tarnished Erudin Medal.\nTravel to South Qeynos. Jalorin Tar`Visgur is located in a house near the bank. Hand him the 'Tarnished Erudin Medal'.\n/waypoint +299, -497, +3\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'Ah erm. Yes of course. You have been sent by Erudin am I right?\nYou say, 'I was sent from Erudin'\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'Well what is it you have been sent for? Go ahead I don't have all day I must get these [incantations] to the council and I am not finished with them yet.'\nYou say, 'What incantations?'\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'You certainly do not look like you could read the scrolls I have been working on so I am wondering why you are questioning what they are. I am waiting for some scrolls from my friend Elisi. The last time I saw her she gave me this [parchment] but I am waiting for her to complete it, would you be able to [return] it to Brianna for me? It is quite clear that she trusts you so I suppose I should as well.'\nYou say, 'I will return the parchment to Brianna'\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'Very well here you are. If we are done here please excuse me for I have much work to do.'\nYou receive Scribbled Parchment.\nHead back to Brianna Falsruinay in Erudin and give her the 'Scribbled Parchment'.\nBrianna Falsruinay says 'Jalorin gave this to you? This is quite odd because this is not Elisi's handwriting and there is clearly something wrong. I really do think for some reason that Jalorin is involved so if you are [still willing to help] I would like you to help me find out if he is being truthful. I must warn you though, if Jalorin is in fact involved with her disappearance this could get dangerous.'\nYou say, 'I am still willing to help'\nBrianna Falsruinay says 'Very well Eliezer, please take this note to Jalorin. I would like him to provide us with some of Elisi's scrolls that she has brought him recently. If he can't provide you with the scrolls I have listed here then I believe he is withholding some information and we could alert the Qeynos council of Jalorin's possible involvement.'\nYou receive Note from Brianna.\nOnce again you have to travel to South Qeynos. Hand the 'Note from Brianna' to Jalorin Tar`Visgur.\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'Brianna must think I am stupid to trust a complete stranger with the most powerful spells I have ever collaborated on with Elisi. I will not give you the parchments that she asks for, but I will give you a fair warning to stay out of my business. If you do not leave me be and [forget about Elisi], I will grow quite angry.'\nYou say, 'I will not forget about Elisi'\nJalorin Tar`Visgur says 'You know, Elisi was a bit like you she didn't know when to quit. You and her will soon share the same [fate] I should think.'\nYou say, 'What Fate?'\nJalorin Tar`Visgur tries to punch YOU, but misses!\nJalorin starts attacking you. He is a level 31 Wizard with 1k HP. On his bloody corpse you will find a map.\nYou receive Faded Map of the Sea.\nHead back to Brianna Falsruinay in Erudin and give her the 'Faded Map of the Sea'.\nBrianna Falsruiay says 'Oh yes something is extremely wrong. It is at least good news that you have disposed of Jalorin. I knew he had to be involved in this one way or another. This map appears to have some dull writing on it but I cannot make it out correctly. While you were gone, my husband reminded me that Elisi always wore her medallion given to her by her mother and her guards carried the finest blade ever presented to a Sentinel of Erudin. If you could find 3 of these guardian blades along with Elisi's medallion I believe that we could come to a conclusion on Elisi's whereabouts. The sad news is that if you should recover these items there is no doubt in my mind that she is dead because she would never give up her medallion willingly. Oh and here is the map you took from Jalorin, I have no use for it.'\nShe returns the map which identifies as BROKUN SKUL ROK.\nYou receive Faded Map of the Sea.\nBrianna needs the 'Talisman of Gaerin' and three 'Erudin Defenders Blade'.\nTravel to Dulak's Harbor and kill Captain Bloodblade until you find the Talisman of Gaerin on his bloody corpse.\nYou receive Talisman of Gaerin.\nThe blades drop from undead crewman trolls in The Crypt of Nadox. Hunt and destroy them until you can loot three (3) of them off their stinky corpses.\nYou receive Erudin Defenders Blade.\nHead back to Brianna Falsruinay in Erudin and hand her the 'Talisman of Gaerin' and the three (3) 'Erudin Defenders Blade'.\nMissing dialogue\nSubmitted by: Niellya ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Runed Brooch of Erudin [item=64542]\n[",
    },
