        { id = 19857, name = "Symbol of Loyalty to the People", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 40\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nErandi Natasu in located in the tunnel after the newbie area leading to The Hole. He's close to the Warrens zoneline.\nYou say, 'Hail, Erandi Natasu'\nErandi Natasu looks nervously about before leaning in close to your ear. 'Do you need [work]?'\nYou say, 'What work?'\nErandi Natasu says 'My name is Erandi Natasu. I am here representing a group of interested parties among the merchant coalitions across Norrath. You do not need to know who is involved with this. We are looking to hire a few people to [take care] of some things for us.'\nYou say, 'Take care of what?'\nErandi Natasu says 'Our businesses are hurting, people cannot keep up their stock or afford to stay in business with the upsurge in [piracy] upon our waters. Trade lines are cut between the continents; supplies are not arriving at their proper destinations. It is quite dreadful.'\nYou say, 'What piracy?'\nErandi Natasu says 'As the pirates that reside in Broken Skull Rock become stronger and more bold, the attacks on our ships have increased dramatically. Would you be interested in helping the very merchants that supply your food and clothing by performing some mercenary services?'\nYou say, 'I will help you'\nErandi Natasu checks over his shoulder. 'Wonderful! There are a few ships in particular that have been causing us much grief, their names are Stormwave, Lady Dirulia, Dandolak's Run, Oceancrasher, and Windscorn. Between these five ships terror has been spread to the end of the seas. Each crew seems to have some kind of common badge amongst themselves, if you can slay two members of every crew I believe the merchants would be satisfied. Bring us these seals and we will be most pleased.\nYou say, 'I will help you'\nErandi gives you a Merchant's Crate [item=20112]. Fill it with two insignia from each ship in Dulak's Harbor [zone=180]. They drop randomly off mobs on each ship, From southwest to northeast : Stormwave (the easiest ship), Dirulia, Dandolak, Oceancrasher and Windscorn (the hardest ship).\nAfter you get all the insignia, hit the combine button to make a Sealed Crate [item=63798], then turn it to Erandi.\nErandi Natasu says 'How marvelous! The Coalition will be delighted by this win. We have all worked together to obtain this as a prize for whomever would be successful in this mission, please accept it and our gratitude.'\nYou have completed achievement: Paineel Quests - Pirate Trouble\nReward:\nSymbol of Loyalty to the People [item=19857]Rewards:\n- Symbol of Loyalty to the People [item=19857]\n[",
    },
