      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nMetallurgist Mirakzin is located southeast of the druid ring in the Steamfont Mountains 2.0.\n/waypoint -1608, +1486, +13\nYou say, 'Hail, Metallurgist Mirakzin'\nMetallurgist Mirakzin says, 'Quickly!  I need your [help]!'\nYou say, 'help'\nMetallurgist Mirakzin says, 'I just received a sample of a new ore mined by the pirates of Broken Skull Rock.  Unfortunately, it is not pure enough to conduct the needed experiments.  I need several Pristine Ore Samples from within the mines.  Are you willing to help me in return for a [favor]?'\nYou say, 'favor'\nMetallurgist Mirakzin says, 'Bah!  Don't worry.  You'll be rewarded well.  Take this Sealed Sack and get three samples.  Make sure to combine them.  I wouldn't want the samples to oxidize like the last ones.'\nYou receive Sealed Sack.\nHead to the Torgiran Mines and obtain three (3) Pristine Ore Samples from the miners and bruisers.\nYou receive Pristine Ore Sample.\nYou receive Pristine Ore Sample.\nYou receive Pristine Ore Sample.\nCombine the three Pristine Ore Sample in the Sealed Sack.\nYou receive Sealed Ore Samples.\nReturn to the Steamfont Mountains and hand Metallurgist Mirakzin the Sealed Ore Samples.\nMetallurgist Mirakzin says 'Hmm.  It LOOKS like the samples survived.  I will, however, have to test them.  But you've done well I suppose.  Here. Take this as payment.'\nYou receive Encased Mnemonic Vapor.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Encased Mnemonic Vapor [item=20553]\n[",
