      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nCollier may be found at -1170, -70, +83.\nYou say, 'Hail, Collier'\nCollier says 'Make it a habit of walking into peoples rooms now do ya? Well seeing as I'm here on business I may have a [proposition] for you.'\nYou say, 'What is the proposition?'\nCollier says 'I'm in the employment of an alchemist that desires some rare venom from this region of Norrath. I will reward you with a special weapon treatment if you can return to me with a venomous spikefish poison sac, an ancient poison sac, an ancient snake fang, and the blood of a necromancer.'\nYou say, 'What special weapon treatment?'\nCollier says 'My employer has uncovered the secrets of the Bloodclaw and can reproduce the weapon treatment used in the forging of the legendary Stiletto of the Bloodclaw.'\nHe wants:\n1. Ancient snake fang dam 11, del 30 procs weak poison - drops off Slyder in Stonebrunt\n2. Ancient venom sack, Rogue only, charges 1 - drops off Slyder in Stonebrunt\n3. Venomous spikefish poison sac - extremely rare drop off Venomous Spikefish in Kerra's Isle - Venomous Spikefish probably around level 15\n4. Blood of a necromancer - drops off Heretic invaders in Stonebrunt\nCollier gives back a \"Thick Caustic Liquid\" which is not No Drop along with the text reply to the effect of:  \"There is the weapon treatment I promised you.  Use it in a forge with any standard forged weapon.  Choose your preferred weapon carefully as there is only enough of the substance for a single treatment.\"\nReward varies depending upon which weapon you use.\nCollier says, 'Here is the weapon treatment that i have promised you. Use it with any standard forged weapon. Choose your preferred weapon carefully as there is only enough of the substance for a single treatment.'\nYour faction standing 