      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nKaram Dragonforge is located inside an inn in the western region of The Rathe Mountains.\n/waypoint +4108, +917, +5\nYou say, 'Hail, Karam Dragonforge'\nKaram Dragonforge says, 'Welcome, _____. I have a number of platemail items, if you are interested. I am also a master [smith] of exotic materials such as dragon scales.'\nYou say, 'smith'\nKaram Dragonforge says, 'Dragon scales make terrific armor. I can make a [white dragonscale cloak] and [red dragonscale armor]. I have not seen any other colored dragon variants around. But if you see any, be sure to let me know. I would be interested in what can be made from their scales.'\nYou say, 'red dragonscale armor'\nKaram Dragonforge says, 'So you have a red dragon scale, eh? Well, I am wanting very much to return to my fiancee and propose to her. If you could aid me in quickly returning to her with a bit of spare change, we could have a deal. Heck, for the armor, a vial of swirling smoke and 1000 platinum coins is a bargain!'\nHand Red Dragon Scales, a Vial of Swirling Smoke (Generic item bought from numerous vendors) and 1,000 pp to Karam Dragonforge.\nKaram Dragonforge says, 'Wonderful! Now I can get back to my fiance instantly! Isn't Love grand! As for your red dragonscale armor, it is all done. Farewell!'\nYou receive Red Dragonscale Armor.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Red Dragonscale Armor [item=2037]\n[",
