      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 1 minute\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAt the zone border of Eastern Karana, by the Qeynos road marker (/loc?), are a knight, Sir Morgan, and his squire.\nYou say, 'Hail, Squire Wimbley'\nSquire Wimbley says 'Hello!  Good to meet you.  The road ahead is full of all sorts of nasty creatures.  If I were you, I would speak with my master, Sir Morgan.'\nYou say, 'Hail, Sir Morgan'\nSir Morgan says 'Hail, traveler!  Might I escort you through to Highpass?  The path ahead is filled with giants and many other hungry beasts.  I assure you, you will be safe with me.  I must admit, I am quite experienced in the ways of the warrior.  Do you [wish an escort] or will you [travel alone]?'\nYou say, 'I wish an escort.'\nSir Morgan says 'I shall be honored to escort you to Highpass, but you shall have to wait for a spell.  I make trips every few hours.  I also would be grateful to any who wish to donate gold coins to the upkeep of my armor.  The rains in the plains cause much rusting.'\nYou say, 'I will travel alone.'\nSir Morgan says 'Then, good luck to you!  May your faith protect you.  Or at the very least, guide you to a grand afterlife.'\nGive him 5 gold:\nSir Morgan says 'What a grand donation!!  You must be a rich noble to be making such a donation.  Here.  I am but a simple warrior, but I found this lying on the highway to Highpass Hold.  The lifeless corpse next to it had no more need of it.'\nYou will get a random item, including the following:\nPatchwork cloak; Patchwork boots; Rusty Weapons; Silver Earring; Bloodstone; Halfling knife; 1st level spell scroll; shock of blades (mag 7), Bronze Dagger; Belt pouch; Damask cap; Mountain Lion Cape; Highkeep Flask; Snakeskin Mask; Drom's Champagne.\nNeed exact list of rewards, faction hits if any, experience if any, any other missing information.Rewards:\n- Bear-Hide Belt [item=928]\n- Belt Pouch [item=20864]\n- Bronze Dagger [item=599]\n- Damask Cap [item=1411]\n- Drom's Champagne [item=20050]\n- Halfling Knife [item=50986]\n- Highkeep Flask [item=2907]\n- Hunting Bow [item=4806]\n- Large Lantern [item=14946]\n- Mountain Lion Cape [item=2145]\n- Patchwork Boots [item=1731]\n- Patchwork Cloak [item=2129]\n- Ratskin Gloves [item=1531]\n- Rusty Dagger [item=595]\n- Rusty Flail [item=20]\n- Rusty Halberd [item=368]\n- Rusty Scimitar [item=176]\n- Silver Earring [item=8838]\n- Spell: Column of Frost [item=8197]\n- Spell: Glimpse [item=8191]\n- Spell: Mircyl's Animation [item=9108]\n- Spell: Shock of Blades [item=9038]\n- Spell: Soothe [item=9110]\n[",
