      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 48\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter Crix Tzo`mok has been freed from slavery in the Mines of Nurga [quest=2596], he spawns in Lake of Ill Omen near the Sarnak fort's back door at /waypoint -1390, +336 . He asks for:\n- 3 Death Mark of Nurga - Drops from goblin death callers in the Mines of Nurga.\n- 1 Silver Bracelet of Crizz - Drops from Taskmaster Crizz in the Mines of Nurga.\nYou say, 'Hail, Crix Tzo`mok'\nCrix Tzo`mok says 'Hello fleshling it is great to be here at our fortress once again freed from the enslavement within the goblin mines. Vengeance weighs heavily upon my mind. Would you help me bring vengeance to the goblins?'\nYou say, 'I will bring vengeance to the goblins.'\nCrix Tzo`mok says 'Yes this is what you must do to bring vengeance. Seek out the goblin death callers in the Mines of Nurga and bring to me three Death Marks of Nurga. I will also require you to bring me the Silver Braclet of Crizz.  Do this and I will reward you.'\nAll items can be found in the Mines of Nurga. The Death Mark of Nurga is a rare drop from goblin death callers, while the Silver Bracelet of Crizz is a common drop from Taskmaster Crizz. Gather the four items and hand them to Crix Tzo`mok.\nCrix Tzo`mok says 'This is exactly what I wanted. Vengeance is mine! Take this small token as a reward.'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Hideous Coif of Woe.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Hideous Coif of Woe [item=22428]\n[",
