      walkthrough = "**Level:** 61\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter Gillia Brissok has been freed from slavery in the Temple of Droga [quest=2635], she spawns in Firiona Vie at /waypoint +118, -3236, +159. She asks for:\n- 3 Sash of the Cave Lord - Drops from goblin cave lords in the Temple of Droga.\n- 1 Earring of King Dronan - Drops from King Dronan in the Temple of Droga.\nYou say, 'Hail, Gillia Brissok.'\nGillia Brissok says 'Greetings friend, it is good to be freed from the clutches of those evil creatures.  Tell me are you willing to help me bring some justice to them?'\nYou say, 'I will help bring justice.'\nGillia Brissok says 'For justice to be brought to them you will need to strike at some of the most powerful goblins found there.  Seek out the goblin cave lords deep within the Temple of Droga and bring me back three Sashes of the Cave Lords.  Also I will need the Earring of King Dronan.  Do this and you will be well rewarded.'\nAll items can be found in the Mines of Nurga. The Sash of the Cave Lord is a rare drop from goblin cave lords, while the Earring of King Dronan is a common drop from King Dronan. Gather the four items and hand them to Gillia Brissok.\nMissing dialogue\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Copper Medal of Rapture.\nSubmitted by: Lerroy Tinkerton ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Copper Medal of Rapture [item=22516]\n[",
    },
