        { id = 22958, name = "Dingy Pauldron of Brawling", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 49\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter Pungub Brawlum has been freed from slavery in the Mines of Nurga [quest=2596], he spawns in The Overthere at /waypoint +2359, +2607, -44 . He asks for:\n- 3 Nurgan Taskmaster Whip - Drops from goblin taskmasters in the Mines of Nurga.\n- 1 Dagger of the Sneak - Drops from Blackguard Thabis in the Mines of Nurga.\nYou say, 'Hail, Pungub Brawlum'\nPungub Brawlum says 'Pungub is happy to be free from the mines.  Pungub wants some gobbys to die will you kill gobbys for Pungub?'\nYou say, 'I will kill gobbys for Pungub.'\nPungub Brawlum says 'Good Pungub is happier! Go kill the gobbys called taskmasters and bring back three Nurgan Taskmaster Whips.  Pungub also wants the Dagger of the Sneak that Thabis has. If you bring to Pungub, Pungub will give good reward.'\nAll items can be found in the Mines of Nurga. The Nurgan Taskmaster Whip is a rare drop from goblin taskmasters, while the Dagger of the Sneak is a common drop from Blackguard Thabis. Gather the four items and hand them to Pungub Brawlum.\nMissing dialogue\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Dingy Pauldron of Brawling.\nSubmitted by: Churayen ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Dingy Pauldron of Brawling [item=22958]\n[",
