        { id = 24863, name = "Antique Ring of Truth", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 61\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAfter Digmaster Duggert has been freed from slavery in the Temple of Droga [quest=2635], he spawns in the Frontier Mountains at /waypoint -1970, +2130. He asks for:\n- 3 Hoodlum Symbol of Dust - Drops from goblin dust hoodlums in the Temple of Droga.\n- 1 Heaprit's Heart - Drops from Dust Hoodlum Heaprit in the Temple of Droga.\nYou say, 'Hail, Digmaster Duggert'\nDigmaster Duggert says 'I am certainly lucky to be alive this day hail and well met. The goblins in the Temple of Droga have been a constant thorn in my peoples side and we need to strike back at them.  Will you help us strike back?'\nYou say, 'I will help strike back.'\nDigmaster Duggert says 'I am glad you will help.  Here is what I need for you to do for me. Find the goblin dust hoodlums within the depths of the Temple of Droga and bring back three Hoodlum Symbols of Dust they often have.  Also seek out the famous thief, Dust Hoodlum Heaprit, and bring back his heart so I might use it in a ritual of protection.  If you do this for me I will reward you well.'\nAll items can be found in the Mines of Nurga. The Hoodlum Symbol of Dust is a rare drop from goblin dust hoodlums, while Heaprit's Heart is a common drop from Dust Hoodlum Heaprit. Gather the four items and hand them to Digmaster Duggert.\nMissing dialogue\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Antique Ring of Truth.\nSubmitted by: Aramond Crystalspirit ; Revamped by iventheassassiRewards:\n- Antique Ring of Truth [item=24863]\n[",
