      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nKings Court Casino is in Shadowhaven on the way to Paludal Caverns (from Nexus). It's the first door just before you go up the stairs on your way from Nexus zone in. open door, turn right, turn left quick, go down stairs for the class-specific token/game NPC and handy banker. Gold Ticket NPC Jacob Thornblade is on the main floor your entered by.\nPatch Intro: Shandeling's Roost in Shadowhaven now houses a game of chance. To play you will need to buy a King's Court Token. You then take this token and turn it in to any of the dealers. Based on what your hand turns out to be, you will be awarded a prize. The highest hands will return a gold ticket as the prize. This Ticket can be turned in to win prizes such as a Guise of the Deceiver (not if you are a dark elf), Fungus Covered Great Staff, or Holgresh Elder Beads. Good luck to all that play!\nYou say, 'Hail, Jacob Thornblade'\nJacob Thornblade says 'Welcome! Welcome to Shandeling's, the gaming hall of chance! The game room is downstairs. If you are lucky enough to get a Gold Ticket, be sure to bring it to me for a spin on the big wheel of prizes!  Make sure to tip your waitress well!'\nYou can buy King's Court Tokens from two Brewing merchants nearby : Nayda Winterwind and Keiya Oakwood.\nNote: In order to make sure you can use the item, only give your token to the dealer corresponding to your class. If in doubt, hail the NPC first. Their responses:\nTherin Asakith says 'Welcome to Shandeling's Casino!  If you would like to try your luck at a game of chance, I can offer you a game of King's Court with prizes best suited for any warrior, monk, or rogue.  To play, buy a token from any of the waitresses and hand it to me when ready.'\nGralin Silvertooth says 'Thank you for coming to Shandeling's Casino!  If you would like to try your luck at a game of chance, I can offer you a game of King's Court with prizes best suited for any shadow knight, ranger, beastlord, bard, or paladin.  To play, buy a token from any of the waitresses and hand it to me when ready.'\nVuri Pandar says 'Welcome to Shandeling's Casino!  If you would like to try your luck at a game of chance, I can offer you a game of King's Court with prizes best suited for any druid, shaman, or cleric.  To play, buy a token from any of the waitresses and hand it to me when ready.'\nTirac Goldbender says 'Welcome to Shandeling's Casino!  If you would like to try your luck at a game of chance, I can offer you a game of King's Court with prizes best suited for any wizard, necromancer, magician, or enchanter.  To play, buy a token from any of the waitresses and hand it to me when ready.'\nTurn in your token, and in return you can receive a variety of things based upon which item you don't have already:\nNothing (common)\nStat Food (common; the better the stats, the higher the rarity)\nMore Tokens (range from 2 to 25+ - uncommon)\nFireworks (uncommon)\nGems (rare)\nPotions (illusions, various effects - very rare)\nMinor Stat Items (very rare)\nGold Ticket (ultra rare)\nShould you be lucky enough to snag a Gold Ticket, turn it into Jacob Thornblade upstairs for what is typically a very nice reward.\nUpon turning in a gold ticket, a shout is heard across the zone:\nJacob Thornblade shouts 'Ladies and Gentlemen gather around, as our brave _____ is turning in his Golden Ticket for a chance at the big time! With a spin of the wheel let us determine the prize. Ladies and gentlemen, the [race] wins a [prize]. Everyone please congratulate _____ on this excellent luck!'\nNote: says \"his\" even when a female character does the turn in.\nIf you already have all the items you will see him say this when you try to hand in a gold ticket.\nJacob Thornblade says 'I am sorry, but at the moment our great wheel of prizes is not spinning! Could you try again in a few moments while I try to fix the jam? Thanks!'Submitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Beer Goggles [item=7107]\n- Black Marble [item=3760]\n- Blue Resistance Stone [item=6006]\n- Club Sandwich [item=27540]\n- Crushed Black Marble [item=3753]\n- Deluxe Sewing Kit [item=6140]\n- Elixir [item=27543]\n- Flawless Diamond [item=3755]\n- Fungus Covered Great Staff [item=27381]\n- Glazed Kabob [item=27545]\n- Glowing Black Drum [item=26826]\n- Gnomish Firework [Ground Bloom Flower]\n- Green Resistance Stone [item=6446]\n- Grilled Kabob [item=27544]\n- Guise of the Deceiver [item=1874]\n- Herb Stew [item=26132]\n- Holgresh Elder Beads [item=5552]\n- Illusionists Stone [item=3646]\n- King's Court Bread [item=27356]\n- King's Court Kabob [item=27358]\n- King's Court Sandwich [item=27357]\n- King's Court Stew [item=26133]\n- Philter of Major Translocation [item=48207]\n- Prayers of Life [item=3655]\n- Pristine Emerald [item=3818]\n- Red Resistance Stone [item=6007]\n- Roasted Mammoth Sandwich [item=25489]\n- Rubicite Breastplate [item=2020]\n- Scimitar of the Mistwalker [item=318]\n- Snakefingers [item=7875]\n- Sweet Bread [item=27362]\n- Ton Po's Bo Stick of Understanding [item=586]\n- Vegetable Stew [item=26134]\n- Vial of Ethereal Mist [item=27355]\n- Vial of Swirling Smoke [item=2586]\n- Vibrating Gauntlets of Infuse [item=2385]\n- Vibrating Hammer of Infuse [item=2384]\n- Wheat Bread [item=27363]\n- White Resistance Stone [item=6092]\n[",
