      walkthrough = "**Time:** Instant\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou can turn a droppable container into a token and vice versa by speaking with either Caerlyna in the Bazaar (in front of the central building) or Realnyna in Crescent Reach (-1345, -1350, -85 -- on the second floor inside the bank).\nYou say, 'Hail, Caerlyna'\nCaerlyna says 'Greetings ______! Nice to meet you.  I've started up a complimentary bag check service. Feel free to give me your weight reducing bag, and I'll give you a token in return.  When you would like to get your bag back, simply return to me with your token.'\nGive her a container.\nCaerlyna says 'Here you go. Bring this token back to me when you would like your bag back.'\nYou receive a non-stacking token corresponding to the container you gave her.  You may then sell the token on your bazaar trader, or exchange a purchased token for a bag.  You can exchange most droppable containers for a token.  A LORE container results in a LORE token, and vice versa.\nWarning:  If you turn in a LORE container and already have the LORE token in your inventory, you will not receive a second LORE token and will lose your container.  It works in the other direction as well:  turn in a LORE token when you already have the LORE container in inventory and you will lose the token.Submitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Ambleshift's Amazing Automated Amalgamator Token [item=45089]\n- Ambleshift's Basic Automated Amalgamator Token [item=72737]\n- Ambleshift's Golden Automated Amalgamator Token [item=72377]\n- Ambleshift's Opal Automated Amalgamator Token [item=72378]\n- Anizok's Bait Dispenser Token [item=45705]\n- Antonican Sewing Kit Token [item=55410]\n- Archaeologist Pack Token [item=25848]\n- Bag of Sewn Evil-Eye Token [item=25849]\n- Bag of the Tinkerers Token [item=25850]\n- Bee