      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 12\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nBegin by hailing Elder Patriarch Ixthal.  He's on the second floor of the SK/Shaman guild at loc 1052, -224.\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'Hello to you as well. I am Elder Patriarch Ixthal and I continue training when the Prime Patriarch becomes overwhelmed with duties. I will train you if you seek to one day [become a Patriarch of Cabilis].'\nYou say, 'I would like to become a Patriarch of Cabilis.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I thought you might. I can sense your spirit is strong.  For your first mission, you will need to use the spirits to guide you to collect some [rare items] we need on a daily basis in order to keep up with the demands of the city. This mission will also be great [training] for you.'\nYou say, 'What rare items?'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'We gather several items that we trade with the Hierophants. These items include a cracked femur, creeper cabbage, and lichenclover.  Once you have all of these items, return them to me with your Claw of the Cub and you shall be rewarded.'\nNow head out and collect the items he speaks of. The cracked femur is quite common, dropping off Greater Scalebones in the area. The creeper cabbage drops off the Man eating creeper, found in the Swamp of No Hope.  Lichenclover can be foraged from several zones, but it may be easier to buy it from the bazaar. Then simply turn them in, along with your Claw of the Cub from the previous quest, to receive your reward.\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I told you not to return without a cracked femur, creeper cabbage, some lichenclover, and your Claw of the Cub.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I told you not to return without a cracked femur, creeper cabbage, some lichenclover, and your Claw of the Cub.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I told you not to return without a cracked femur, creeper cabbage, some lichenclover, and your Claw of the Cub.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'You have returned unharmed with the items I asked for. Here is your reward now. If you wish to [continue training] please let me know.'\nYou gain experience!!Submitted by: SilraakRewards:\n- Claw of the Scout [item=28609]\n[",
