      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nElder Patriarch Ixthal [npc=15319] may be found on the second floor of the Shaman guild.  At the end of the previous quest [quest=2877], he told you to come back when you had decided to aid the cause.\nYou say, 'I have decided to aid our cause.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I thought you may, ______. We have an issue at hand that you may be able to help with. It seems as though there are rumors of the sarnak factions gathering forces. We must find out all the information we can regarding this situation. Travel to the kly's and seek what they know. Place all of their letters in this tome, which shall combine their mystical energies. Bring back the completed message to me with your claw of the apprentice and you will be rewarded.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal wants you to collect 8x \"Battle Plans\" from the Crypt of Dalnir. These all share the same item name, but there are eight versions of it (all LORE). They are confirmed to drop from \"a kly evoker\" and \"a kly cohort\" and reported (not confirmed) to drop from believers.\nOnce you have all eight, combine them in the container he gave you and give the Spiritual Tome [item=58015] to Elder Patriarch Ixthal, along with your Claw of the Apprentice [item=29045].\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I see you have returned with the information asked. Hmm . . . this doesn't bode well. I will need some time to think about the situation now. Take this and wear it proudly. You are a Young Patriarch now.'\nExperience + Claw of the Young Patriarch\nClaw of the Young Patriarch [item=28867]\nMAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM NO TRADE PLACEABLE\nSlot: PRIMARY\nSkill: Hand to Hand Atk Delay: 22\nDMG: 10 Dmg Bonus: 23 AC: 1\nThis item is placeable in yards and houses.\nSTR: +4 STA: +4 CHA: +4 WIS: +4 HP: +5 MANA: +5\nSV FIRE: +1 SV DISEASE: +1 SV COLD: +1 SV MAGIC: +1 SV POISON: +1\nWT: 3.5 Size: MEDIUM\nClass: BST\nRace: BAR TRL OGR IKS VAH\nSlot 1, Type 4 (Weapon: General)\nSlot 2, Type 20 (Ornamentation)Submitted by: TattbeastRewards:\n- Claw of the Young Patriarch [item=28867]\n[",
