      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** Days\n**Level:** 14\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nElder Patriarch Ixthal may be found on the second floor of the Shaman guild in East Cabilis.  At the end of the previous quest [quest=2860], he asked you to come back when you wished to continue training.\nYou say, 'I wish to continue training.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'That's the spirit. For your next task we will require you to show your skills at locating a [missing member] of the Patriarchs of Cabilis.'\nYou say, 'What missing member?'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'His name is Welgaz and he tends to roam the continent in search of a perfect training area. We have not heard back from him in a while now and we grow worried. You must now go forth and find him. Tell him I have sent you to find him.'\nWelgaz may be found in Warsliks Woods near the West Cabilis zone line hiding out as \"an injured traveller.\"\nYou say, 'Ixthal sent me.'\nan injured traveller says 'Oh, has he now? I can't return yet, I don't have the strength. If you were to [help] me I think I might be able to make it back though.'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nan injured traveller says 'Good. I have not eaten in a while so I will ask you to get me some Legion Lager and Noodles for my journey back.'\nBoth Legion Lager and Noodles are crafted, by brewing and baking respectively.  To craft Legion Lager, combine A Giant Blood Sac (dropped by leeches in the Swamp of No Hope), a Bottle (purchasable at brewing merchants), Deadbone Barley (foraged in the Field of Bone), and a Flask of Bloodwater (purchasable in various places, including Cabilis) in a brew barrel, trivial 36.  To craft Noodles, combine a Cup of Flour (purchasable at baking merchants), a Water Flask, and some variety of eggs in an Oven or Spit, trivial 31.  Snake eggs are probably the easiest version to obtain.  Bring the Legion Lager and Noodles back to the traveller.\nan injured traveller says 'You have returned with what I asked for. Here, take this note back to Ixthal and let him know I am safe and will be making the return trip soon.'\nHe gives you a note to return to Ixthal.  Give him the note and your Claw of the Scout.\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I will also need your Claw of the Scout my young apprentice. . .'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'Because of you, we now know that Welgaz is safe and will be returning to us shortly. Take this to represent our appreciation for your deeds completed here today. Please return soon once you have decided to [aid the cause].'\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n- Claw of the Apprentice [item=29045]\n[",
