      walkthrough = "**Level:** 14\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nPart 1 - Requirement: Level 14\nGuntrik is located in the warrior guild hall of Oggok. /waypoint +26, +72\nYou say, 'Hail, Guntrik'\nGuntrik says, 'Mmmph!!  Who you?  Oh, you _____.  You supposed to be promising Craknek.  Me need you.  There bad things in swamp.  You want [help Crakneks] or you [want Guntrik bash your face]!!?'\nIf you want Guntrik to bash your face he will oblige. And he hits VERY hard...\nYou say, 'Me want help Crakneks'\nIf your Craknek Warriors faction is indifferent or better:\nGuntrik says, 'Go to swamps. Find noble hunters of humans and elves. All have house crests. Return to me and I give things. If you find special item says where hunters sleep, give to me. If meat founded then give to Clurg's cook. She make fine stew and give coins for meat.'\nThe nobles are easy to find. They tend to hang out right in front of Guk and terrorize the newbies in Innothule Swamp. They are level 8-14. Note: The same NPCs located in The Rathe Mountains also drop these items and they will work for this quest.\nReturning a Noble's Crest will get you a random item, such as a bronze axe, and occasionally even a nice item, such as a Crude Stein. Note that you need Amiable faction for Guntrik to accept your crests.\nGuntrik says, 'One less trouble. Hunhuh!! You do good work. Keep up. Remember to bring any special things to Guntrik. Here junk for good work. Go away now.'\nYour faction standing with Craknek Warriors has been adjusted by 15.\nYour faction standing with Clurg has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Green Blood Knights has been adjusted by -2.\nYou receive 8 gold from Guntrik.\n- Bronze Two Handed Battle Axe\n- Bronze Two Handed Hammer\n- Bronze Two Handed Sword\n- Crude Stein\nPart 2 - Requirement: Level 19\nGuntrik asks above: \"If you find special item says where hunters sleep, give to me.\"\nSome of the nobles drop a Tattered Parchment. If you read it, this is a flier for Drinn's Inn in The Rathe Mountains. Give it to Guntrik.\nGuntrik says, 'Ooh! This where hunters stay. You must go to The Rathe Mountains and find Drinn's Inn. Kill all. Bring owners' scalps back and me give good junk. You get more warriors to help. Say Guntrik command them. You will need all help you get.'\nYour faction standing with Craknek Warriors has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Clurg has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Green Blood Knights has been adjusted by -1.\nTravel to The Rathe Mountains and kill both inn owners, Sven Drinn (Level 19) and Philicia Drinn (Level 15), and return both scalps. /waypoint +3990 -1362, +4\nGuntrik says, 'What! This just one. Paper say there two owners. Me give you fist in face if you don't scalp other owner.'\nGuntrik says, 'You some great warrior. Crakneks proud. Take reward. You show us you great. Great Crakneks we need.'\nYour faction standing with Craknek Warriors has been adjusted by 20.\nYour faction standing with Clurg has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Green Blood Knights has been adjusted by -2.\nYou receive Ogre War Maul.\nNOTE: You get negative faction hits with humans for killing the nobles. You can raise your faction with the Lizard meat, and lizard tail quests. If you find any High Elf Meat or Human Meat, you can give it to Chef Dooga. She is Clurg's cook.\nThe Tattered Parchment is missing in the database. Exact name and text content is needed.\nSubmitted by: Jink and DrumDrum ; Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Bronze Two Handed Battle Axe [item=367]\n- Bronze Two Handed Hammer [item=3610]\n- Bronze Two Handed Sword [item=364]\n- Crude Stein [item=2286]\n- Ogre War Maul [item=532]\n[",
