      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis appears to be a ring event of some sort in Torgiran Mines.\nTraxil Pidpop regards you indifferently -- You could probably win this fight.\nYou say, 'Hail, Traxil Pidpop'\nTraxil Pidpop says 'Woooh am I glad to see you!  Those troll dogs that run this place were about to let these fish beasties have me for dinner.  Anyways now I gotta get out here.  Could you distract the guards while I escape?  It'll be tough but I sure need the help!'\nYou say, 'I will distract the guards while you escape.'\nTraxil Pidpop shouts his thanks to the heroes and then sprints down the hall.\na luggald torturer slashes the air with its wicked claws as it moves to attack.\nAfter several rounds of two luggald torturers at a time, you see this:\nYou have slain a luggald torturer!\nYou gain party experience!!\na luggald torturer's corpse spews forth bloody gore from its numerous wounds as it falls over dead.\nDark whispers promising pain and torture come from just ahead.\na luggald pain master scowls at you, ready to attack -- it appears to be quite formidable.\nMore information needed.Submitted by: EpitapheRewards:\n[",
