        { name = "Peace Keepers", change = 1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFind Miranda in the Stonebrunt Mountians, located in the Kejekan camp.\nYou say, 'Hail, Miranda'\nMiranda says 'I'm not supposed to talk to strangers but if my parents let you in here I guess it's ok. Do you like [candy]? I could give you some candy to play a game with me but my [dice] are gone now.'\nYou say, 'What candy?'\nMiranda says 'Khonza Ayssla went away one time and came back with chocolate covered cherries and pixie powder cinnesticks for my sister and I. I like the chocolates the best.'\nMiranda would like some chocolate covered cherries, which are made from three marr cherries and one winter chocolate (126 trivial baking).\nMarr Cherries are foraged in the Ocean of Tears (droppable), while Winter Chocolate is made from 1 Brownie Parts and 2 Frosting (95 trivial baking).\nMiranda claps her hands with excitement 'Chocolate cherries!! My favorite!!\nHere try some of this!!'\nYour faction standing with Kejek Village has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Peace Keepers has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nIn exchange for the cherries, Miranda gives you a pouch of kejek catnip, sta-1, wis+5.Rewards:\n- Pouch of Kejek Catnip [item=22201]\n[",
    },
    {
      id = "2929",
      title = "Sentries and Their Trees",
      exp = "01",
      exp_name = "The Ruins of Kunark",
