    {
      id = "2942",
      title = "Rescue Joshel",
      exp = "02",
      exp_name = "The Scars of Velious",
      min_lvl = 1,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Translocator Kurione",
        "Teleport me near there",
        "Hail, Joshel the Large",
        "What Icebreaker?",
        "travel to North Ro",
        "teleport you near there",
        "Icebreaker",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "the bandana to Translocator Kurione", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nOn the docks of the Iceclad pirate base is Translocator Kurione.\nYou say, 'Hail, Translocator Kurione'\nTranslocator Kurione says, \"Hello there. There seems to be some strange problems with the boats in this area. The Academy of Arcane Sciences has sent a small team of us to investigate them. If you need to [travel to North Ro] in the meantime, I can transport you to my companion there. We also just recently discovered that Joshel has been stranded over in the middle of the ocean since the problems with the boats started. If you'd be willing to go see if he's ok, I may be able to [teleport you near there]. Keep in mind though that it will be a one way trip. There is no one on the island able to send you back.'\nYou say, 'Teleport me near there'\nYou are teleported near the dock at the island in the far northeastern  corner of Iceclad Ocean. Search for Joshel the Large on the other side of  the island.\nYou say, 'Hail, Joshel the Large'\nJoshel the Large says, 'That's right. Large, cause that's what I be. If'n ya don't like it, or even if ya do, ya best get to the dock on the other side o' this island. Ya never know when [Icebreaker] is gonna stop by again and yet not wantin' ta miss it.'\nYou say, 'What Icebreaker?'\nJoshel the Large says, 'What about it? Wait. How did you get here? There weren't no raft come to this island. Come to think o' it, I don't think I've heard hide nor hair o' the Icebreaker for a while. Well, drat. I wonder if anyone's been looking for me. Here, have this bandana to let whoever know that I'm alright. Thanks for checking up on me, but I'll be ok here for a while longer.'\nYou receive Joshel's Bandana.\nSwim or succor back to the dock, and give the bandana to Translocator Kurione.\nTranslocator Kurione says, 'Whew, it's good that you were able to find him, and doing so well. Thanks very much for checking on him for me. I would have done so myself, but with the problems with the boats, I just haven't had the time. Thanks again.'\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n[",
    },
