      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou can speak with Klok G`rshai, Finlay Kitoran, Uggrig Skullchomper, or Skizz Skazz in the Overthere.\nYou can speak with Klok F`tshai, Marana Dreadflats, or Hoobert Flinkl in the Dreadlands.\nYou say, 'Hail, Skizz Skazz'\nSkizz Skazz says 'Don't dawdle! If you want to know what [tasks] I have for you to do, just let me know. That way, we can be done with our business already so I can get back to doing nothing!'\nYou say, 'What tasks do you have for me to do?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Filth of Goblins'.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\nStep 1:  Speak with Khieka Ripclaw in Frontier Mountains, at the Burning Woods zone line.\nYou say, 'Hail, Khieka Ripclaw'\nKhieka Ripclaw says 'Thanks for contacting me, ______.  Your information on this matter has been most useful.'\nYour task, 'Filth of Goblins' has been updated.\nStep 2:  Search the dining hall in Droga\nYour task menu is updated with instructions to go to Droga and search the dining hall for clues as to whether a rebellion is forming.  Upon walking around the dining hall, a message will inform you the task is complete.\nYour task, 'Filth of Goblins' has been updated.\nStep 3:  Kill 10 goblin flame masters\nYour task, 'Filth of Goblins' has been updated.\nThe direction to someone related to your current Task has been marked on your compass.\nStep 4:  Speak with Korriz Stillripple (Dreadlands)\nKorriz Stillripple may be found in the old Combine outpost at location +380, +8925.\nYou say, 'Hail, Korriz Stillripple'\nKorriz Stillripple says 'Thanks for contacting me, ______.  Your information on this matter has been most useful.'\nYou receive 5 copper\nYou receive 7 silver\nYou receive 8 gold\nYou receive 116 platinum\nYou gain