      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a one-time per server event that still gets played out on TLP servers when OoW is unlocked.\nUpon completion of the Kidnapping of Firiona Vie quest, Galeth Veredeth has taken up residence in Iceclad Ocean Loc?\nNPCs that spawned outside the Tower of Frozen Shadow drop items with lore \"Freezing to the touch,\" which can be turned in to Galeth Veredeth for rewards for various levels (which items for which rewards?). Some mobs found outside the tower:\n- a doomshadow\n- a deathhound\n- a snowbone\n- an ice-encrusted armsman\n- a shadow terror\n- Guardian of Frozen Shadow Required to kill in order to zone in?\nOnce inside the tower, you'll have to make your way from floor to floor until you reach the seventh floor. You will have to clear the inhabitants of each floor before progressing to the next.\nUpon clicking a portal:\nYou touch the shimmering portal, but nothing happens. Tserrina's followers on this floor must be destroyed and her puzzles deciphered before you can ascend any further.\nOn each floor you will encounter a boss mob (names of mobs on floors?). Each of them drops loot. Upon reaching the final floor, you will find Tserrina Syl`Tor along with Firiona Vie. Tserrina must be killed, and proof of her death must be brought to Firiona Vie in order to \"free\" her.\nTserrina is red to 70 and requires a raid force to take down. She hits for 2,400 and casts a single target charm every 15 seconds. She drops a Dark Taint of Syl`tor.\nHail Firiona Vie.\nMissing dialogue\nOnce outside the tower and in Iceclad, give the Dark Taint of Syl`tor to Galeth. In exchange you'll receive the Aegis of the Valiant.\nMissing dialogue\n- Aegis of the Valiant [item=33530]\n- Barbed-Tooth Hook [item=33616]\n- Bonebuckled Warbelt [item=33529]\n- Cape of Stitched Shadows [item=33552]\n- Faceless Metal Mask [item=33553]\n- Polished Platinum Engagement Band [item=33614]\n- Sextant of the Lost Pirate [item=33550]\n- Shadowbash [item=33528]\n- Symbol of Shattered Faith [item=33549]\n[",
