      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nZreezas may be found above the GM (1029, -187, 60).\nYou say, 'Hail, Zreezas'\nZreezas says 'Lower your voice in here. I [cannot let the others know I am speaking to you].'\nYou say, 'Why cannot let the others know I am speaking to you?'\nZreezas says 'Because it is a [terrible secret] that is being guarded by the Patriarchs.'\nYou say, 'What terrible secret?'\nZreezas says 'I believe one of their [followers] has turned against them and is organizing a force to overthrow the Patriarchs of Cabilis.'\nYou say, 'What followers?'\nZreezas says 'That I do not know fully yet. If only I knew his [name]. . .If you wish to gain this information for yourself I would suggest searching in spiritual areas. That would be your best bet to find any more information.'\nYou need to retrieve two Hidden Plans from \"a corrupt spiritualist\" in City of Mist and Kaesora. The spiritualist in Kaesora is near Xalgoz. In City of Mist, he is in the north end of a small building. (This part can be skipped, as long as you collect the three Symbols of Lativ, and hand them in to Ixthal).\nHand Zreezas in the hidden plans and follow the conversation, which refers you to ask Ixthal about \"rumored attacks\" (which Ixthal will deny). Hand Ixthal the note Zreezas gave you (Lativ's Plans) in return for the hidden plans. He tells you to find rankings from three close to the traitor to reveal his location.\nThese three are the loyal followers found in the SE corner of the hidden valley in Dreadlands(Iksar), NW of giants in Frontier Mountains on a rock(Sarnak), and in Burning Woods near -820 -4080 on the east zone wall(Sarnak); each dropping a symbol of Lativ. Hand in the three symbols and your claw to Ixthal to receive your new Claw of the Mature Patriarch.\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I require their three rankings and your Claw of the Young Patriarch.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I require their three rankings and your Claw of the Young Patriarch.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'I require their three rankings and your Claw of the Young Patriarch.'\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'Well done ______, as promised here is your reward, the Claw of the Mature Patriarch. As far as the location of Lativ goes, that is a matter that needs to be dealt with by the elders of the Patriarchs. Go now, and continue your training ______.'\nYou gain experience!!\nNeed all dialogues, /loc of quest mobs, etc.Submitted by: SsithasRewards:\n- Claw of the Mature Patriarch [item=36684]\n[",
