      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 6 Hours\n**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nZreezas may be found above the GM at 1026.47, -189.62, 60.35.\nYou say, 'Is his name Lativ?'\nZreezas says 'Would that be the traitor's name? Hmm. . .that name does sound familiar. He had once gained the rank of young patriarch before he was banished from the Patriarchs of Cabilis. Now where [Lativ] is I may know.'\nYou say, 'Where is Lativ?'\nZreezas says 'I have heard talk of him training in a jungle region. Go seek him out and return with whatever you can retrieve from his demise.'\nKill Lativ in Trakanon's Teeth.  He may be found in a ruined building at 2695, 815.  Loot his remains and bring them back to Zreezas.\nYou gain experience!!\nZreezas says 'What is this? This cannot be Lativ. It seems as though he has gained more power than we have been aware of thus far. Take the remains to Prime Patriarch Vuzx. He should know what is going on from this point forward.'\nTake the remains to Prime Patriarch Vuzx.\nYou gain experience!!\nPrime Patriarch Vuzx says 'Are these what I think they are?! How long have you been doing our work from the shadows young one? No matter now you have seen too much as it is. We have been on a search for the four pieces of the [Seal of Choatl].'\nYou say, 'What is the Seal of Choatl?'\nPrime Patriarch Vuzx says 'The Amulet of Choatl is the seal that protected the pure energies of the Sacred Figurine from being tainted. It appears as thought Lativ knew that by destroying this seal we have no power against him now that he has the Sacred Figurine. The only hope we have is that someone is [capable] of finding the four pieces of the Seal.'\nYou say, 'I am capable.'\nPrime Patriarch Vuzx says 'If you believe you are, I will entrust this container to you. It will be the foundation needed to repair the Seal. Combine the seal fragments with heady kiola and the remains of Lativ and you should be able to restore the Seal. Using his remains in combination with the seal, will weaken him. Go now and seek out the Seal's pieces. Once you have combined them all go and [find Lativ]. Use the Seal against him and rid us of his nuisance. Return to me once you have [completed your mission].'\nYou receive Vuzx's Container.\nYou say, 'Where do I find Lativ?'\nPrime Patriarch Vuzx says 'You will be able to find him where we used to train for rituals. He will be expecting you in the jungle where he feels close to home.'\nRetrieve the Seals from the City of Mist and do the combine to craft the Seal of Choatl.\nFind Lativ in the Emerald Jungle at -682.62, 4049.52, -52.50.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lativ'\nLativ says 'Fool! Haven't you learned by now my wrath is absolute!'\nHand him the Seal of Choatl.\nLativ says 'What is this?! It can't be!'\nLativ appears to despawn and respawn and immediately attacks (level 50).  Note: despite having the appearance of being undead he flees at approx 10% health.  Loot the Sacred Figurine from his corpse and head back to Prime Patriarch Vuzx.\nYou say, 'I have completed my mission.'\nPrime Patriarch Vuzx says 'Ah, if what you speak is true, hand over the Sacred Figurine and your Claw of the Mature Patriarch to Elder Patriarch Ixthal to reward you properly.'\nGive him the figurine.\nElder Patriarch Ixthal says 'You have honored your fellow Patriarchs ______. Jon us now in celebration as you gain the rank, Elder Spiritualist!'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive the Claw of the Spiritual Elder.Submitted by: SsithasRewards:\n- Claw of the Spiritual Elder [item=36775]\n[",
