      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 3\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nCaptain Gideen is on an balcony at -2210, -383, +301 near the West Cabilis zoneline in the southeast part of the zone.\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Gideen'\nCaptain Gideen says 'I hope you have come to assist in the defense of the gate. We have had numerous assaults by the goblins. No doubt it is due to those [goblin watchers].'\nYou say, 'What goblin watchers?'\nCaptain Gideen says 'The goblin watchers are rumored to be the communication link between goblin outposts and patrols. We have found goblin watcher signal torches on a few of them. You bring me back no fewer than three and I will reward you.'\nHand in three:\nCaptain Gideen says 'Good work, player name. You are on your way to becoming a respected ally of the Iksar Empire. Keep up the good work. Take this reward for a job well done.'\nYou faction standing with Legion of Cabilis got better.\nYou faction standing with Cabilis Residents got better.\nYou faction standing with Scaled Mystics got better.\nYou faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist got better.\nYou faction standing with Swift Tails got better.\nYou receive 7 silver from Captain Gideen.Submitted by: MuseRewards:\n- Aloe Swatch [item=5950]\n[",
