        "Hail, Zeflmin Werlikanin",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "it back to him", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nZeflmin Werlikanin may be found in a niche in the Guild Hall.\nYou say, 'Hail, Zeflmin Werlikanin'\nZeflmin Werlikanin says 'Hello ______.  Come to take a look at the crystal geode?  The geode has some very strong magic inside of it that can help you.  I can bring out the magic of the geode for you, but a gnome has to make a living! Even if he's stuck in this little hole in the wall all the time.  Not that I'm bitter.  Each of the crystals I sell is linked to a location in our world.  If you give me one of the crystals I can focus the geode to let you and your companions travel there in the blink of an eye!'\nPurchase one of the crystals he sells and give it back to him.\nArcstone Spirit Sapphire - Arcstone\nBrilliant Frigid Gemstone - The Eastern Wastes (ToV)\nBroken Auretite Chain - Hodstock Hills\nBroken Timestone - Plane of Time A\nBurning Lamp - Stratos: Zephyr's Flight\nChipped Shard of Slaughter - Wall of Slaughter\nChunk of Argathian Steel - Argath\nCloudy Stone of Veeshan - Plane of Sky\nCrystallized Dream of the Feerrott - Feerrott, the Dream\nDragonscale Faycite - Dragonscale Hills\nDrowned Katta Castrum Powerstone - Katta Castrum: Deluge\nEtched Marble of Barindu - Barindu, Hanging Gardens\nForest Emerald of Faydark - Greater Faydark\nFragment of the Combine Spire - Lceanium\nFrozen Shard of Iceclad - Iceclad Ocean\nFuligan Soulstone of Innoruuk - Plane of Hate\nGoru`kar Mesa Sandstone - Goru`kar Mesa\nGrassy Pebble of the Commonlands - Commonlands\nKarana Plains Pebble - North Karana\nKatta Castrum Powerstone - Katta Castrum\nLavastorm Magma - Lavastorm Mountains\nMiniature Worker's Sledge Mallet - The Overthere(RoS)\nMedal of Heroes - Laurion Inn\nMoss Agate of Stonebrunt - Stonebrunt Mountains\nOpal of Toxxulia - Toxxulia Forest\nOthmir Clamshell - Cobalt Scar (CoV)\nShadowed Sand of the Twilight Sea - The Twilight Sea\nShattered Bone of the Dreadlands - Dreadlands\nSplinter from a Guild Standard - The location of your guild's banner\nStone of the Shard's Fall - Shard's Landing\nStormstone of the West - Ethernere Tainted West Karana\nTri-Spirit Embossed Token - Shar Vahl, Divided\nUndershore Coral - Undershore\nUnrefined Brellium Ore - Brell's Rest\nVelium Shard of Cobalt Scar - Cobalt Scar\nZeflmin Werlikanin takes the crystal from you and mutters some arcane words over it.  'The crystal geode is now active, just go step on the crystal platform and you'll be whisked away to your destination!  I hope you don't get motion sickness!'\nThe crystal geode is now set to teleport you to the location you picked.  Note that this will reset if someone else turns in a different crystal or the instanced Guild Hall goes away after no one has been in the instance for a while.Submitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Ability to teleport to specific locations\n[",
    },
    {
      id = "3142",
      title = "Within the Warrens",
      exp = "02",
      exp_name = "The Scars of Velious",
      min_lvl = 14,
      max_lvl = 15,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = -97.0, x = -45.0, z = 0.0 },
      triggers = {
