        "I",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 38263, name = "Kobold-Hide Mask", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 30-45 Minutes\n**Level:** 14\n**Maximum Level:** 15\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task begins in the Plane of Knowledge with Castlen Drewe, who can be found across from the Soulbinder at -97, -45. It is one of seven tasks introduced for players from level 10 to 20.\nYou say, 'Hail, Castlen Drewe'\nCastlen Drewe says 'Greetings and welcome. I have been compiling reports from all over Norrath! There are many odd jobs to be done by someone like you. Would you be interested in such a [quest]?'\nYou say, 'I'm interested in a quest'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Within the Warrens'.\nThe Warrens is home to a tribe of kobolds know as Clan Kolbok. These kobolds in particular are rather advanced and very aggressive. They have recently slain a resident of New Tanaan who was attempting to travel to the Stonebrunt Mountains. We can only assume that it was they, for he was never seen again. We believe that some trinket may have been presented to their Prince Bragnar as evidence of this slaying. Take the portal to Paineel and explore the bridge area outside of the prince's throne room within the Warrens. Be careful!\nExplore the bridged waterway near Prince Bragnar 0/1 (The Warrens)\nKill 5 kobold protectors 0/5 (The Warrens)\nLoot 10 kobold hides 0/10 (The Warrens)\nLoot 10 kobold meat 0/10 (The Warrens)\nSpeak with Castlen Drewe 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nYou say, 'Hail, Castlen Drewe'\nVery well done. One of our tailors has fashioned this mask for you, I do hope that you find it useful.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou have been given: Kobold-Hide MaskRewards:\n- Kobold-Hide Mask [item=38263]\n[",
