      walkthrough = "**Level:** 15\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAt the end of the previous quest [quest=3157], you received a Note About Your Fifth Trial and the task Journey to Cabilis.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Journey to Cabilis'.\nYou receive a Note About Your Fifth Trial.\nTake it to Arch Duke Xog in East Cabilis (/loc?).\nTargeted (Shadowknight GM): Arch Duke Xog\nYour task 'Journey to Cabilis' has been updated.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist got better.\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Black Scale Blade.Rewards:\n- Black Scale Blade [item=38524]\n[",
