      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** Yes\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis group monster mission begins with Tribesman Juill who may be found in the Stonebrunt Kejekan Village at location +1330, -510, +1017.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tribesman Juill'\nTribeman Juill says 'Hello to you. If it is the blessing of our tribe you are after you must pass the [test].'\nYou say, 'What test?'\nTribeman Juill says 'This test has been given to all those that wish to belong to the Kejek Tribe. If you [wish to belong] we have a place for you here.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Kejek Trials'.\nTo become a member of the Kejekan tribe you must pass their tests. If you are able to prove yourself you will belong to the tribe.\nIn this monster mission you play a 25th level Kejekan in an instanced version of Stonebrunt Mountains.  Available classes are ranger, druid, warrior, magician, and shaman.\nYou say, 'I wish to belong'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Stonebrunt Mountains.\nKill 10 mountain spiritlings 0/10 (Stonebrunt Mountains)\nCollect 5 panda pelts 0/5 (Stonebrunt Mountains)\nThese drop from pandas throughout the area.\nDeliver 5 panda pelts to Tribesman Juill 0/5 (Stonebrunt Mountains)\nKill the Kobold Warlord 0/1 (Stonebrunt Mountains)\n(Location of the Kobold Warlord?)\nLoot the reward from his corpse.\nThe common reward is Clasped Chain Arms, while the rare reward is Green Patina Covered Mask.\nClasped Chain Arms transmute to:\nClasped Chain Arms (level 1-10)\nDusky Chain Arms (level 11-20)\nFaded Chain Arms (level 21-30)\nWell-Formed Chain Arms (level 31-40)\nGem-Inlaid Armbands of the Tribe (level 41-50)\nAdorned Armbands of the Tribe (level 51-60)\nBeaded Armbands of the Tribe (level 61-70)\nGreen Patina Covered Mask transmutes to:\nGreen Patina Covered Mask (level 1-10)\n???? (level 11-20)\nDingy Mask of the Tribe (level 21-30)\nSomber Faceplate of the Tribe (level 31-40)\nDecorated Facemask (level 41-50)\nFiery Ornate Mask (level 51-60)\nEtched Mask of the Tribe (level 61-70)Submitted by: Silverfur Mangycoat, The Fools RepublicRewards:\n- Adorned Armbands of the Tribe [item=45994]\n- Beaded Armbands of the Tribe [item=45349]\n- Clasped Chain Arms [ARTIFACT]\n- Clasped Chain Arms [item=103468]\n- Decorated Facemask [item=45997]\n- Dingy Mask of the Tribe [item=45995]\n- Dusky Chain Arms [item=45990]\n- Etched Mask of the Tribe [item=45382]\n- Faded Chain Arms [item=45991]\n- Fiery Ornate Mask [item=45998]\n- Gem-Inlaid Armbands of the Tribe [item=45993]\n- Green Patina Covered Mask [item=45381]\n- Green Patina Covered Mask [item=59522]\n- Somber Faceplate of the Tribe [item=45996]\n- Well-Formed Chain Arms [item=45992]\n[",
