      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = 1350.0, x = 2075.0, z = 0.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, a fallen student",
        "What cursed dreams?",
        "I will complete the task.",
        "Show me the way of the enlightened.",
        "Hail, Cedrick",
        "Hail, Mystik",
        "I am ready for the test.",
        "I am ready to start.",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "to just anyone", count = 1 },
        { name = "both seals", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis flags you to start the quest for the epic 1.5 if you don't have the Celestial Fists (epic 1.0).\nAre You Ready to Leave This Place, Grasshopper?\n\"a fallen student\" may be found in Lake Rathetear at +1350, +2075.\nYou say, 'Hail, a fallen student'\nAs you look at this individual, you can tell he has something bothering him greatly. The fallen student says, 'Eh? There is nothing I can help you with. I have nothing for myself anymore. . .except these [cursed dreams].'\nYou say, 'What cursed dreams?'\na fallen student says 'I sense something within you. . .You may walk the path, but I must be certain. The information I possess is too important to give to just anyone. If you believe you are worthy of the information I hold you will [complete this task] I ask.'\nYou say, 'I will complete the task.'\na fallen student says 'Do not think that it will be an easy feat, even for one with such capabilities as yourself. There are two masters you must find. They will show you the ways of the enlightened. Return to me after you have gained proof of your deeds.'\nYou say, 'Show me the way of the enlightened.'\na fallen student says 'Very well then. There is a place full of mirrors. Locate one of them and speak the words, 'I am ready to be tested.' It is at this point you will face the darkness within yourself. You will have to face this foe alone, remember that. Return back to me if you manage to prove that you are worthy of true enlightenment.'\nMaster Cedrick\nThe first master is Cedrick, found in Cobalt Scar at -970, +1185.\nYou say, 'Hail, Cedrick'\nCedrick says 'So you wish to challenge me, eh? Why else would you be here bearing the Sign of Acceptance. It is your own funeral though. If you still wish to [prove your worth] and ascend to the next level I am ready.'\nYou say 'I will prove my worth.'\nCedrick says 'I didn't know slime could speak common.. go back to the sewer before I lose my temper.'\nCedrick attacks.  Upon defeat, loot a Seal of Cedrick.\nMaster Mystik\nMystik is found in West Karana at +1370, -7350.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mystik'\nMystik says 'I see you bear the Sign of Acceptance. So you believe you are strong enough to accomplish all that is asked of you? If you stand true during this [test] you will find all you seek.'\nYou say, 'I am ready for the test.'\nMystik says 'In this test you will have to face me and prove that you have the heart to succeed. I hope you have brought strong allies to accompany you for you shall need them. We shall begin as soon as you are [ready to start].'\nYou say, 'I am ready to start.'\nMystik says 'I didn't know Slime could speak common..go back to the sewer before I lose my temper.'\nMystik attacks.  Mystik is highly fire-resistant, but vulnerable to magic and cold and is magic-slowable.  Upon defeat, loot a Seal of Mystik.\nReturn to Vortix\nYou say, 'Hail, a fallen student'\nA fallen student says 'I see you do have the skill that is needed to continue this quest, but you must now face your hardest foe yet. For your final task, you will be alone, and in that moment you will have to face your true self. Many cannot bear to see what they find within. It is at that time we really see what we are capable of. If you wish to continue, I will [show you the way].'\nHand in both seals.\nA fallen student says 'Very well then. There is a place full of mirrors. Locate one of them and speak the words, 'I am ready to be tested.' It is at this point you will face the darkness within yourself. You will have to face this foe alone, remember that. Return back to me if you manage to prove you are worthy of true enlightenment.'\nMirror, Mirror\nGo to the Tower of Frozen Shadow.  On the fourth floor, there is a mirror to zone out.  Stand in front of the mirror and say, \"I am ready to be tested.\"  mirror reflection (a level 65 monk that looks like you) will spawn and attack.  You must defeat it entirely solo.  Once defeated, it drops a Medal of Identity.\nHead back to the fallen student and turn it in.\nA fallen student says 'So I see you do truly have the ability to follow the path of the Enlightened. I am sorry I was not sure before but I am now. Now I must tell you of my [cursed dreams].'\nCongratulations, you have completed the pre-quest.Rewards:\n[",
    },
