      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 65\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis flags you to start the quest for the Epic 1.5 if you do not have Ragebringer (Rogue Epic 1.0).\nFind \"a shady Highpass citizen\" (/waypoint -95, 425) in Highpass Hold.  You need to talk to him; say \"one,\" \"two,\" or \"three\" to him; and purchase\nthe Gold-Leafed Urn he has for sale for approximately 2099 pp.\nOne\nThis task has you gamble away the urn in Highpass Keep at the tables.  Go to Dealer Maeline near the guards/nobles (/loc?)\nand give him the urn.  Say \"deal me a hand\" until you get 2000 coins, at which point Guard Kovan turns his attention and emotes about nobles.\nCash out.\nYou have unloaded the stolen urn, completing the first task for the Smuggler's Camp.\n(Need all dialogues and emotes.).\nTwo\nThis task has you search for Nichols.  Go to the prison area near the warrior guild in Shar Vahl (/waypoint 100, -545, -236).\nTalk to \"a prisoner\" in the cells there.\nYou say, 'Hail, a prisoner'\nA prisoner leans forward and whispers, 'Psst, you'll never get the guards here to budge.  They don't make deals, don't take bribes and they are\nmuch too careful to catch by surprise.  If you promise to help me, I can tell you [where to find the keys].'\nYou say, 'where to find the keys'\nA prisoner nods and continues to whisper, 'Before we were brought to these cells, we were held in Katta briefly.  I bet you'd find a keys to these\nblasted cages and another key to our shackles there, and the best part is that the guards are much more careless...  Are you with me?\n[Do you understand]?'\nYou say, 'Do you understand'\nA prisoner says, 'Lift the keys, kill them, whatever.  I don't care.  Just do it quickly and do it quietly.  Don't know how much longer before they\nmove us to a new location. This may be our only chance to escape.'\nNext, head to Katta, where you will find two guards at the TOP level. Guard Zimmer is in the western building at the very top (/waypoint -540, -1760),\nand Guard Lennon is in the cemetery to the southeast at the very top (/waypoint 295, -820, +2).\nGuard Zimmer sees through SoS (does not see through SoS Tier 2).\nSneak in through a hidden wall in the building and backstab him (you will kill him in one hit).\nLoot a Rough-hewn Shackle Key.\nPickpocket Guard Lennon to get the Shar Vahl Cell Key, which is TEMPORARY and which identifies as\n\"This key might open the cells in Shar Vahl.\"\nHead back to Shar Vahl.  Make your way to \"a prisoner\", a human male that is sitting on the ground (/waypoint 103, -546, -235),\nby unlocking the cell door with the Shar Vahl Cell Key. Hand the prisoner the \"Rough-Hewn Shackle Key\" and he will turn into Nichols.\nYou try the Cell Key on the lock and it's a perfect fit.\nYou have freed Nichols, completing the second task of the Smuggler's Camp.\nNichols unlocks his manacles and stands up. As he dusts himself off and stretches out his limbs, he greets you, 'Well met, Iven.\nYou have my thanks, but more importantly, I think you'll find that assisting our faction comes with great rewards.'\nYou gain experience!\nYou complete the trade with Nichols.\nThree\nFollow the dialogue and get a Sealed Silver Package.\nHead to Qeynos.  No matter how you zone in, you will be placed in the same spot in the northeast part of the zone.\nYou need to sneak into Crow's Tavern in North Qeynos.  Hang out in the corner near the Priest of Discord and learn the guards' movements.\nGuards include Elite Guard Lika, Elite Guard Sarve, Elite Guard Inski, and Elite Guard Lewot.  Sneak inside (look out for the Lewot inside).\nUse the door that leads to the hidden wall to go to the hidden rogue guild, and hide there until the guards path past.\nOnce a guard is near the door standing still, give the package to Crow.  You have completed this task.\nYou have smuggled the mysterious package into Qeynos, completing the third task for the Smuggler's Camp.\n(Need all dialogues, names of guards involved, locations, etc.)\nFinale\nHead back to the shady highpass citizen and say \"done.\"  If you have not yet done your epic 1.0, he will shake your hand and welcome\nyou to the Circle of Unseen Hands a la Stanos.\nNeed all dialogues, exact names of mobs, /locs, faction hits if any, etc.Rewards:\n[",
