      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** Instant\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nArchaeologist Flottwit may be found at +45, -5.\nFrom the Dec. 7, 2005 patch message:\nArchaeologist Flottwit has uncovered a cache of older Darkhollow items and is currently searching the bazaar for some of the newer items for comparison. If you have a Depths of Darkhollow item that changed from tradeable to no trade with the last patch and you'd prefer to have the old tradeable item instead, give the no trade version to Flottwit and he'll give you the old tradeable item in return. Flottwit will only be around until the next patch.\nYou say, 'Hail, Archaeologist Flottwit'\nArchaeologist Flottwit says 'Good day to you ______.  As much as I'd love to chat, I'm a bit busy trying to find samples of some of the [items] that have recently come out of Darkhollow.'\nYou say, 'What items?'\nArchaeologist Flottwit says 'I unearthed a large cache of artifacts from deep within Darkhollow and found that they look suprisingly similar to some of the newer items that adventurers have been uncovering.  I'm trying to locate a few samples of these new items for comparison.  If you have one and are willing to part with it, just hand it to me.  I have a large number of the artifacts I found so I'll give you one of those in return.'\nHanding in item XXX nets you Archaic XXX, with a possible degradation in quality:\nArchaeologist Flottwit says 'Ahh, yes this is one of them!  The similarity is absolutely striking.  Thank you, ______.  I'll hold onto this for further study.  Please, take this in return.  I believe it's a predecessor to the item you gave me.'\nIf you try to hand in an item he won't accept, you'll see:\nArchaeologist Flottwit says  'Hrm, no, this doesn't look anything like the artifacts I uncovered.  You can have it back.'\nFlottwit hasn't disappeared yet.  We need to know whether any items that work are missing from the list.Submitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Archaic Black Coral Ring [item=54121]\n- Archaic Chaotic Korlach Mangler [item=46602]\n- Archaic Deep Current Lute [item=46603]\n- Archaic Drachnid Preserver [item=54122]\n- Archaic Drachnid Rib [item=54770]\n- Archaic Drachnid Voodoo Doll [item=54771]\n- Archaic Eerie Wurine Hoop [item=46604]\n- Archaic Fishweave Belt [item=46655]\n- Archaic Fishweave Cloak [item=54772]\n- Archaic Giant Angler Rod [item=46607]\n- Archaic Hydromancer's Ring [item=46919]\n- Archaic Jagged Coral Sledge [item=46608]\n- Archaic Korlach Worshipper's Belt [item=46619]\n- Archaic Korlach Worshipper's Mantle [item=46620]\n- Archaic Lucky Harpoon [item=46621]\n- Archaic Reef Hunter Bow [item=54773]\n- Archaic Shiliskin Butcherer [item=50651]\n- Archaic Shiliskin Infantry Collar [item=46622]\n- Archaic Shiliskin Myrmidon Shield [item=46623]\n- Archaic Shiliskin Myrmidon Sword [item=46624]\n- Archaic Torn Shiliskin Infantry Cape [item=46625]\n- Archaic Undead Drachnid Chitin Choker [item=46626]\n- Archaic Undead Drachnid Chitin Mantle [item=46627]\n- Archaic Wand of Dark Waters [item=54774]\n[",
