      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nIf you purchased the boxed set of Prophecy of Ro, you have an Ornate Barding available if you type \"/claim #,\" where # is the particular number corresponding to the Prophecy of Ro reward claimable on your account.  This summons a very slow (but free!) horse.  If you would like to upgrade it to the speed of your other horse, find Stable Ward Kyle in The Bazaar and do the following:\nYou say, 'Hail, Stable Ward Kyle'\nStable Ward Kyle says '______!  It's good to see you.  You've caught me in a bit of a [bind].'\nYou say, 'What bind?'\nStable Ward Kyle says 'It's this blasted Automated Barding Oscillator!  The dang thing just came in from Ak`Anon.  It's designed to take the barding on and off of horses in only a few seconds.  It works really well.  In fact, too well.  It's going to drive us Stable Wards out of a job.  Isn't that a [shame] ______?'\nYou say, 'It's a shame.'\nStable Ward Kyle says 'You said it, my friend!  It's a crying shame!  In fact, I'm going to cry my eyes out for the next thirty seconds.  The only thing that would make this even more of a shame is if, by chance, SOMEONE were to STEAL the Automated Barding Oscillator FROM THE SECOND STALL ON THE LEFT while I'm busy crying.  If that were to happen, I would downright inconsolable.  Do you [understand] the severity of the situation?'\nYou say, 'I understand.'\nStable Ward Kyle says 'Alright, ______.  Then please excuse me whilst I begin my weeping.  I tend to sob rather loudly. . .loudly enough to drown out the echoing steps of a prowling footpad, you know, should one be in the area.  Please, pay me no mind.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Automated Barding Oscillator'.\nTake the Automated Barding Oscillator (0/1) - The Bazaar\nStable Ward Kyle starts sobbing loudly.\nGo to the second stall on the left, where you'll find an Ak'Anon Shipment Chest. /open the chest and loot the Automated Barding Oscillator.\n--You have looted a Automated Barding Oscillator.--\nYour task 'The Automated Barding Oscillator' has been updated.\n--You have looted a Automated Barding Oscillator Users Manual.--\nLeave the stables.  The task will update as you pass Stable Hand Kyle.\nYour task 'The Automated Barding Oscillator' has been updated.\nStable Ward Kyle winks at you on your way out the door.\nPlace your current bridle and the Ornate Barding in the Automated Barding Oscillator and combine to create a new XXX Bridle and Barding that is a warhorse version of your normal XXX Bridle.  If you combine the XXX Bridle and Barding in the oscillator again, you'll get the individual bridle and barding back.Submitted by: MerdarieRewards:\n- Black Chain Bridle and Barding [item=47306]\n- Black Leather Bridle and Barding [item=47314]\n- Black Ornate Chain Bridle and Barding [item=47307]\n- Black Rope Bridle and Barding [item=47315]\n- Black Silken Bridle and Barding [item=47313]\n- Brown Chain Bridle and Barding [item=48054]\n- Brown Leather Bridle and Barding [item=48056]\n- Brown Rope Bridle and Barding [item=47591]\n- Brown Silken Bridle and Barding [item=48055]\n- Ghostrider's Bridle and Barding [item=55334]\n- Tan Chain Bridle and Barding [item=47308]\n- Tan Leather Bridle and Barding [item=48062]\n- Tan Rope Bridle and Barding [item=47590]\n- Tan Silken Bridle and Barding [item=75364]\n- White Chain Bridle and Barding [item=47309]\n- White Leather Bridle and Barding [item=47312]\n- White Ornate Chain Bridle and Barding [item=47310]\n- White Rope Bridle and Barding [item=47311]\n- White Silken Bridle and Barding [item=48067]\n[",
