      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nJolum stands on a table on the southern balcony of the central building between the two banks, at 155, -425.\nYou say, 'Hail, Jolum'\nJolum says 'Hail!  Nice to see ya, friend.  I've got a fine selection of spankin' good spells, perhaps you'd be interested? Or maybe you'd like to learn how to [upgrade] your Grandmaster Trade items?  Still yet, maybe you would like to know how to create a [Grandmaster's Medicine Bag]?  I can even work with the new bags made from the trophies given by Baublie.'\nYou say, 'What new bags?'\nJolum says 'It's a very sturdy bag, but I'm afraid that it's only temporary.  If you'd like to get a more permanent bag, just hand me your summoned one and I'll trade it out you.'\nUse your tradeskill trophy to summon a TEMPORARY XXX artisan satchel, where \"XXX\" is one of Beginner, Apprentice, Freshman, Journeyman, Expert, Master.  Give the satchel to Jolum.\nJolum says 'Take this essence and put it in the appropriate container, and it will change into a new bag.  Do this before your trophy evolves because this essence is delicate and will only respond if you own the appropriate trophy.'\nYou receive a corresponding XXX Artisan Essence.  Place the essence in an appropriate container for your particular tradeskill and hit combine.  You will craft a permanent XXX YYY Carry-All, where \"YYY\" is the tradeskill, e.g.:\nThe essence flickers brightly and coalesces into a bag.\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Master Baker Carry-All.\nThe carry-alls are LORE within the tradeskill, so you can only have one for Baking, for example.Rewards:\n- Apprentice Alchemist Carry-All [item=48174]\n- Apprentice Baker Carry-All [item=48175]\n- Apprentice Brewer Carry-All [item=48141]\n- Apprentice Fletcher Carry-All [item=48142]\n- Apprentice Jeweler Carry-All [item=48176]\n- Apprentice Mechanist Carry-All [item=48177]\n- Apprentice Potter Carryall [item=48178]\n- Apprentice Researcher Carry-All [item=48143]\n- Apprentice Smith Carryall [item=48179]\n- Apprentice Tailor Carry-All [item=48180]\n- Apprentice Toxicologist Carry-All [item=48181]\n- Beginner Alchemist Carry-All [item=48182]\n- Beginner Baker Carry-All [item=48183]\n- Beginner Brewer Carry-All [item=48184]\n- Beginner Fletcher Carryall [item=54512]\n- Beginner Jeweler Carry-All [item=48185]\n- Beginner Mechanist Carry-All [item=48144]\n- Beginner Potter Carry-All [item=48186]\n- Beginner Researcher Carry-All [item=48145]\n- Beginner Smith Carry-All [item=48187]\n- Beginner Tailor Carry-All [item=48188]\n- Beginner Toxicologist Carry-All [item=48146]\n- Expert Alchemist Carryall [item=48189]\n- Expert Baker Carryall [item=48147]\n- Expert Brewer Carryall [item=48148]\n- Expert Fletcher Carryall [item=48149]\n- Expert Jeweler Carryall [item=48150]\n- Expert Mechanist Carry-All [item=48151]\n- Expert Potter Carry-All [item=48190]\n- Expert Researcher Carry-All [item=48191]\n- Expert Smith Carryall [item=48152]\n- Expert Tailor Carry-All [item=48153]\n- Expert Toxicologist Carry-All [item=48154]\n- Freshman Alchemist Carry-All [item=48192]\n- Freshman Baker Carry-All [item=48193]\n- Freshman Brewer Carry-All [item=48194]\n- Freshman Fletcher Carry-All [item=48195]\n- Freshman Jeweler Carry-All [item=48155]\n- Freshman Mechanist Carryall [item=48196]\n- Freshman Potter Carry-All [item=48156]\n- Freshman Researcher Carryall [item=48197]\n- Freshman Smith Carry-All [item=48157]\n- Freshman Tailor Carry-All [item=48158]\n- Freshman Toxicologist Carry-All [item=48198]\n- Journeyman Alchemist Carryall [item=48159]\n- Journeyman Baker Carry-All [item=48173]\n- Journeyman Brewer Carry-All [item=48200]\n- Journeyman Fletcher Carry-All [item=48199]\n- Journeyman Jeweler Carry-All [item=48160]\n- Journeyman Mechanist Carry-All [item=48201]\n- Journeyman Potter Carryall [item=48202]\n- Journeyman Researcher Carryall [item=48203]\n- Journeyman Smith Carry-All [item=48161]\n- Journeyman Tailor Carry-All [item=48162]\n- Journeyman Toxicologist Carry-All [item=48204]\n- Master Alchemist Carry-All [item=48163]\n- Master Baker Carryall [item=48164]\n- Master Brewer Carryall [item=48165]\n- Master Fletcher Carry-All [item=48166]\n- Master Jeweler Carry-All [item=48167]\n- Master Mechanist Carryall [item=48168]\n- Master Potter Carry-All [item=48169]\n- Master Researcher Carry-All [item=48205]\n- Master Smith Carryall [item=48171]\n- Master Tailor Carry-All [item=48170]\n- Master Toxicologist Carryall [item=48172]\n[",
