      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nLewena [npc=9807] is located at /loc -74.24, 343.97, 4.38, which is upstairs on the balcony at Grimthor's Distillery in Shadow Haven.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lewena'\nLewena says 'Hi there ______, care to bring me a drink? If you bring me my favorite I will tell you a secret.'\nAfter much experimentation by the tradeskill community, particularly the people at EQ Traders Corner, her favorite drink was discovered:  Cinnamon-Spiced Elven Tea.  After handing her a Cinnamon-Spiced Elven Tea [item=47673]:\nLewena gazes at you in complete astonishment. 'How. . . Where. . . The recipe for this drink has long been lost. I've known only one person who was able to craft this fabulous drink with any accuracy. It was a dwarf by the name of . . . Let me see here. Baldin. . . Bruldor. . . Bognip. . . Oh dear, my memory is quite bad when it comes to names. I haven't seen him in ages, I hope the poor dwarf is alright.' Lewena fidgets about for a few seconds, then pulls out a worn piece of parchment. 'My dwarven friend gave this to me, though he told me to keep it a secret. As promised, I will live up to my end of the bargain.' she says, as she hands you the brittle piece of parchment.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Brittle Parchment [item=48982].\nIt reads:\nTo my friend,\nIncluded in the note below is the recipe for your favorite drink! Please take care to keep it safe, it is a well guarded dwarven secret!\n1 - Bottle of Brandy\n1 - Bottle of Ale\n1 - Bag of Mashed Vegetables\n1 - Large Basilisk Egg\nMix each of these items together until you get a thin, evenly textured liquid. Place it in a cask and let it ferment for 8 weeks\nThis is the recipe for Brodder's Revenge [item=25627], named for the character who contributed many recipes, particularly brewing recipes, to early EQ.Submitted by: FlevenRewards:\n- Brittle Parchment [item=48982]\n[",
