      walkthrough = "**Level:** 16\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\n1. There have been rumors of a squad terrorizing the local villages. You need to eliminate this squad before they can destroy any other buildings along the way. Get out there and kill 10 greater Scalebone and make sure you clean up the mess when you loot 4 bonechips.\nObjective: Kill 10 Greater Scalebones in Kurn's Tower\n2. Clean up the mess.\nObjective: Loot 4 Bone Chips in Kurn's Tower\n3. Exploration.\nObjective: Explore the Twin Iksar Statues northwest of Kurn's Tower in Field of Bone.\n4. Kill Scorpions.\nObjective: Kill 10 Giant Scorpions in the Field of Bone\n5. Delivery of the Bone chips.\nObjective: Deliver 4 Bonechips to Rasaku Scalerunner in Field of Bone. /loc 1056, 1157, -50 north of Kurn's Tower under a tree.\n6. Just to be on the safe side, you're being sent back out to explore the cave that leads to Dalnir's crypt, a bit more. There is no harm in a little extra security to ensure the safety of the people nearby.\nObjective: Explore the cave that leads to Dalnir's Crypt in Warsliks Woods - just need to walk into the cave to the first bend for the task update to complete, updates at -895,+2600, the Iksar bandits ruin between \"Overthere\" zone line and the \"Giant Fort\".\n7. Speak with Juikull Slizz for your reward.\nObjective: Speak with Juikull Slizz in Warsliks Woods. /loc 252, 3619, 224 due North of Dalnir alongside the path.\nReward: 35 % Regular Experience at level 16 and 4 platinum, 2 gold, 9 silver and 8 copper\nNeed all task stages and descriptions (these are transcriptions), /loc of quest mobs, any other missing information like faction hits.Submitted by: Lady Cenyana Erinyes of Firiona VieRewards:\n[",
