      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 42\n**Maximum Level:** 42\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis short task is given by Cadale Brohat in the Gulf of Gunthak.\nReady to go on a hunt?  The local landowners are putting together a hunting contest and you've been invited.  Though it's a group event, you are to go off on your own and kill 10 deadly skeletal sailors.  Before they'll accept that you actually did the deed yourself, they're going to want proof, so make sure you loot 4 Bone Chips, before you return.\nKill 10 deadly skeletal sailors 0/10 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nLoot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nDeliver 4 Bone Chips to Calambra 0/4 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nThe hunting went superbly well, it seems, and you're on your way to winning. All you need to do now is to deliver 4 Bone Chips to Calambra, so you're not disqualified for not fulfilling all the requirements.\nCalambra is located on the mast of the zone ship to Stonebrunt Mountains. Her location is 1486, -1047, 43. Upon giving the 4 unstacked Bone Chips to Calambra:\nIt looks like you made an impression on the other hunters and you won!  They're more than excited about asking you along for their next hunt.  Here is your prize!\nYou receive 1 copper\nYou receive 4 silver\nYou receive 6 gold\nYou receive 15 platinum\nYou gain experience!\nExperience gained as level 42 barbarian beastlord was 11%.Submitted by: mchimahusky (information from Lovejoy)Rewards:\n[",
