      walkthrough = "**Level:** 22\n**Maximum Level:** 25\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou may be able to request this task outside the listed levels (22-25).\nWho starts this task? (It is a task master in Shar Vahl; we know that much.)\nThis was a \"medium\" task available to a 23rd level Ranger.\nThe time has come for you to venture out into the wild and earn the respect of your friends and relatives.  This rite of passage is yours and yours alone and if you succedd you will be one step closer to the power you have always wished to possess.  Venture out far into the land and explore the royal arena box at the east end of the arena.  There you will received the next step of your journey from the spirits beyond.\nExplore the royal arena box at the east end of the arena in Shar Vahl\nYour journey has led you into the wild, now you must face the predators head on.  You must find and kill 10 Firefall Saureks, before you can conitnue your test.  You must also collect proof of your power and loot 4 Damaged Hopped Hide.  Once you have passed this test, the next step of our\njourney will be revealed to you.\nKill 1 Firefall Saureks in Shadeweaver's Thicket\nLoot 4 Damaged Hopper Hide in Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou have proven your worth to the spirits as a figher, but there is still\nmore for you to do.  You must once again venture deeper into the wild, but\nthis time you must explore the Loda Kai pavilion in the northwest.\nExplore the Loda Kai pavlion in the northwest of Shadeweaver's Thicket\nYou're nearly done!  You have come through these adventures with nary a\nscratch.  You might say the wild is your domain.  All you must do to\ncomplete this journey is to deliver 4 Damaged Hopper Hide to Fellmorr\nPowell, and when the last one has been received, you shall be done.\nDeliver 4 Damaged Hopper Hide to Fellmoor Powell in Shadeweaver's Thicket\nFellmoor Powell is found at location -2710, -2290.\nYou have done well, wild spirit.  You have come away from the experience as a new person, haven't you?  Though it will no doubt be meaningless to you, here is your reward for completing this journey to its fullest.  Well done. May life's path continue to lead you to greatness.\nYou receive 10 plat, 5 gold, 8 silver, and 7 copper.\nYou gain experience!!\nExperience gained was about 25% of a level at 23.Rewards:\n[",
    },
