      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 42\n**Maximum Level:** 46\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is available to level 42-46 characters. It's randomly available from either Assistant Vagli or Cadale Brohat.\nAssistant Vagli [npc=11262] can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Overseeing Operations':\nYou have been assigned the task 'Overseeing Operations'.\nCaptain Nalot, scourge of the high seas, terror of the depths, is looking for someone to find him something to replace his rum. You've been selected from a pool of applicants who know what they're doing. First, go over and explore Overseer Wrank's room in the southwest,. you won't find a better place to start your search for the rum replacement.\n[This task begins in Torgiran Mines]\n(Need information on further task stages; locations, items, NPCs, rewards, dialogues, etc.)Rewards:\n[",
