      id = "3992",
      title = "Pray to Stay Alive",
      exp = "05",
      exp_name = "The Legacy of Ykesha",
      min_lvl = 43,
      max_lvl = 45,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = false,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = 1385.0, x = 75.0, z = 3.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Assistant Vagli",
        "What task?",
        "task",
        "This task begins in Gulf of Gunthak",
        "Dulak's Harbor",
        "Gulf of Gunthak",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 43\n**Maximum Level:** 45\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task was available at level 43.\nAssistant Vagli can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Pray to Stay Alive':\nYou have been assigned the task 'Pray to Stay Alive'.\nOne of the local families is asking for a surveyor to look at a couple plots of land that they're interested in. The places are nearby. First, they'd like you to explore the small prayer pedestal to the left of the entrance,. They'd like to know what the surrounding fauna is like, so keep an eye on that while you're there.\n[This task begins in Gulf of Gunthak]\nExplore the small prayer pedestal to the left of the entrance.\nThis will update at location -2475, 2530.\nIt's a good thing you were sent to scout out the area for their home, because it looks like the monsters are getting restless. Why don't you take care of them so there's a better chance they'll buy that land? All you have to do is kill 10 shady treasure sorters. They'd also like it if you could get a few samples of the wildlife too, so while you're out there, loot 4 Shiv.\nKill 10 shady treasure sorters [Dulak's Harbor]\nLoot 4 Shiv [Dulak's Harbor]\nDespite your efforts, it seems those monsters were a bit much for the family and they're looking at another plot of land nearby. Why don't you head out and explore the Hungry Shark tavern along the southern docks,. Maybe they'll like that one instead.\nExplore the Hungry Shark tavern along the southern docks. [Dulak's Harbor]\nThis can be completed at the doorway.\nWell, it looks like the family didn't like that plot either. It's going to be difficult to prove to them that it'll take a bit of elbow grease to get any land looking like a home. In any case, they don't want the samples from the wildlife, but you can probably diliver 4 Shiv to Welligorn. Researchers always love getting more samples.\nDeliver 4 Shiv to Welligorn [Gulf of Gunthak]\nWelligorn is on the beach back in Gulf of Gunthak. Hand him the 4 Shivs.\nEven though the family is on their way to greener fields to look for land, your help in surveying those areas was invaluable. Sadly, without more families pickingup these plots of land, any compensation for services is running a little thin. Hopefully, though, this payment will be enough to tide you over until your next bit of work.\nYou receive 5 copper.\nYou receive 6 silver.\nYou receive 3 gold.\nYou receive 41 platinum.Rewards:\n[",
    },
