      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 42\n**Maximum Level:** 46\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is available to level 42-46 characters. It's randomly available from either Assistant Vagli or Cadale Brohat.\nAssistant Vagli can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Shiver Me Timbers':\nYou've been charged to take care of the beasts wreaking havoc in the area. There's not much to it. In fact, it's probably one of the easiest things you'll ever do. First things first, kill 10 Broken Skull mercenaries,. We don't want to let them off easy. Be sure to loot 4 Shiv, that'll teach them. Time is of the essence, so get out there.\n[this task begins in Dulak's Harbor]\n1. Kill 10 Broken Skull mercenaries 0/10 Dulak's Harbor\n2. Loot 4 Shiv 0/4 Dulak's Harbor\n(Need information on further task stages; locations, items, NPCs, rewards, dialogues, etc.)Rewards:\n[",
