      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 43\n**Maximum Level:** 43\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task was available at level 43.\nAssistant Vagli can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Prayers to the End' (a \"long\" task):\nYou have been assigned the task 'Prayers to the End'.\nYou're going off to uncover what these lands have to offer. It won't necessarily be easy, and there will be those that want to stop you from uncovering anything at all, but you've got to be resolute in your actions. To start, you need to explore the ship Lady Dirulia at one of the southern docks,. Once you've done that, a courier will be sent with more information on the next step!\n[This task begins in Dulak's Harbor]\nExplore the shop Lady Dirulia at one of he southern docks Dulak's Harbor\nRun around the ship while invisible. This step is completed on the back side of the ship.\nKill 10 shady treasure sorters -- Dulak's Harbor\nLoot 4 Shiv -- Dulak's Harbor\nThat was an exciting distraction, but you need to focus and redouble your efforts. You need to get back out there and explore the main prayer hall at the end of the temple. There's a whole wide world out there just waiting to have its secrets uncovered and you're perfect for the job.\nExplore the main prayer hall at the end of the temple -- Gulf of Gunthak\nThis step is completed at the top of the second set of stairs.\nYou've got to admit that uncovering these secrets is exciting. But you're not done yet. You've got one more spot to explore before you can call it a day. Go explore the entrance to Nadox, then you can think about heading home.\nExplore the entrance to Nadox -- Gulf of Gunthak\nThis updates at the entrance to Nadox (the zone-in in the tunnel).\nDrat! Your attempt to hide the evidence wasn't enough and now their friends are after you. You've got to stand tall and kill 10 Broken Skull seers, before they kill you!\nKill 10 Broken Skull seers -- Gulf of Gunthak\nYou did well. You should take the evidence you collected and deliver 4 Shiv to Welligorn, so they have a record of what went on today.\nDeliver 4 Shiv to Welligorn -- Gulf of Gunthak\nYour compass will lead the way to him. Hand him the shivs.\nWelligorn says, 'Exploration isn't all fun and games, as you discovered today. You need to always keep a sharp eye and an even sharper mind on everything around you so you aren't so easily surprised. In any case, so you can take care of any battle wounds or resupply, here's a small stipend for today's work.'\nYou receive 7 copper.\nYou receive 4 silver.\nYou receive 62 platinum.\nYou also receive about six blues of normal experiance.Rewards:\n[",
    },
