      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 44\n**Maximum Level:** 44\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task was available at level 44.\nAssistant Vagli can be found in the pirate village in Gulf of Gunthak at location 1385, 75, 3.\nEntry for map file:\nP -75.1076, -1387.0557, 0.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Assistant_Vagli\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Vagli'\nAssistant Vagli says 'Greetings, friend. If you have come to study under the great Alvarik you have come to the right place! I help by carrying his research tomes for him. If there is one you would like to buy, feel free to browse through what we have. If you're looking for something to do, I may have a [task] available for you to get started on. Alvarik has much he needs done and I can't do it all myself!'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nHe offers you 3 tasks, one of which is 'Brigand Drunks' (a \"short task\"):\nYou have been assigned the task 'Brigand Drunks'.\nIt's no small wonder that the locals are skittish. There have been reports of some monsters lurking about that are a threat to not only the people, but the livestock and supplies as well. You're going to kill 10 Broken Skull brigands,. Remember, they're threatening the supplies, so be sure to loot 4 Broken Bottle, while you're out there. The locals are counting on you.\n[This task begins in Dulak's Harbor]\n(Need information on further task stages; locations, items, NPCs, rewards, dialogues, etc.)Submitted by: Zippenchant of Fallen from Grace, PrexusRewards:\n[",
