      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nGracie F`Liler is found at location 235, 3220 (next to Fyrefly and Luminare Pasinia in the east wing of the \"merchant building\").\nOn Progression servers that have reverted the zone she is at -3315, 2639, in the bank.\nOn regular Live servers you can use \"Find\" to get to the soulbinder in the area where all the good NPC's were moved\nYou say, 'Hail, Gracie F`Liler'\nGracie F`Liler says, 'It's so good to see new faces, not to mention more adventurers in the area.  On some nights, the sounds that come from the nearby hills will scare even the hardiest of travelers. I volunteered in the name of the Keepers of the Art to help locate any [new spell scrolls] that might surface. Maybe you will have a successful journey and find some of these scrolls yourself.'\nYou say, 'What new spell scrolls?'\nGracie F`Liler says, 'I have recently come into possession of some of these scrolls. They seem to be very promising in adding to the strength of our occupation. Some more good news is that I have a few extra of these scrolls. Perhaps you might have or find an extra of your own and be willing to trade? In case you are interested, I am looking for the scrolls Theft of Thought, Color Slant, Cripple, and lastly Dementia. Bring me one of these and I'll make an even trade.'\nUpon handing Gracie one of the mentioned spells:\nGracie F`Liler sats, 'Here is the scroll that I promised. We have both gained much knowledge today. I hope to business with you again soon. Farewell.'\nYou'll receive one of four possible spells (reward is random):\nSpell: Boon of the Clear Mind\nSpell: Clarity II\nSpell: Recant Magic\nSpell: Wake of TranquilityRewards:\n- Spell: Boon of the Clear Mind [item=9237]\n- Spell: Clarity II [item=9244]\n- Spell: Recant Magic [item=9243]\n- Spell: Wake of Tranquility [item=9238]\n[",
