      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAnniversary events tend to run from mid-March to mid-April (sometimes to mid-May) each year. They are not available during the \"off season\".\nFor an overview and list of EverQuest Anniversary events, see this quest entry [quest=6782].\nThis quest begins with Tyla Filinav in The Nexus.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tyla Filinav'\nTyla Filinav says 'Have you come to help me in my collection ______?  There are quite a few items on my list and I'm worried about my chances to find them all.  Would you be [interested] in helping me find them all?'\nYou say, 'I am interested.'\nTyla Filinav says 'Perfect, here's the list of items I'm looking for and a bag to hold them in. Make sure you seal the bag once you've found them all and then return it to me.'\nYou receive a Lunar Collection Bag and A Lunar Clue Book, which reads:\n1. Loo careflly a what you see. Find what yu are missin and use it to you advantge.\n2. All the better to hear you with!\n3. This is an unhappy little hallux.\n4. You seek something basic.\n5. You can't wring blood from a stone, but you might be able to grab what you need from this.\n6. This hides not threats nor innuendo, but a sunny smile.\n7. Walker on sunbeams, thing of nightmares.\n8. This is concealed just a hop, skip or a jump away.\n9. No eyes to see, but teeth in maw, this is found at the end of its paw.\n10. This is skin and meat made of peat.\nYou are looking for:\n1. The missing letters are K U T O G R A.  Rearrange these to spell \"gor taku.\"  You are looking for A Collector's Crude Stone Idol - gor taku, Shadeweaver's Thicket.\n2. A Collector's Sonic Wolf Ear - dire sonic wolf, The Tenebrous Mountains\n3. A Collector's Grimling Toe - bone cracker, Grimling Forest\n4. A Collector's Elemental Focus - elementals, The Twilight Sea\n5. A Collector's Polished Stone - stonegrabber, Mons Letalis\n6. A Collector's Sun Revenant Veil - sun revenant, The Scarlet Desert\n7. A Collector's Lightcrawler Shell - lightcrawler, Dawnshroud Peaks\n8. A Collector's Rockhopper Hide - greyhopper, Marus Seru\n9. A Collector's Netherbian Claw - netherbian, Netherbian Lair\n10. A Collector's Fungal Fiend Flesh - plerg fiends, Paludal Caverns\nRed herring items (no known use) include:\nA Collector's Tribal Belt, sambata, Dawnshroud Peaks\nA Collector's Chk`Thk Horn, various Cht`Thk beetles, Shadeweaver's Thicket\nA Collector's Ball of Mud, muck diggers, Paludal Caverns\nCombine the ten items in your Lunar Collection Bag to craft a Sealed Lunar Collection Bag.  Hand this in.\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Sealed Lunar Collection Bag.\nTyla Filinav says 'These are perfect! I can't believe you found them so quickly. Here take this as a reward for your help.'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive Lunar Fungus.Rewards:\n- Lunar Fungus [item=67302]\n[",
