      walkthrough = "**Level:** 25\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nCaptain Keatar may be found at +440.57, -2992.67.\nCaptain Keatar tells you that the goblin raiders have been quite a nuisance to his trackers.   Bring him proof that you have taken at least four of these beast down and you will earn the respect of this outpost and insure your well being.   The raiders and other goblins sometimes drop headbands.  Bring him 4 and he will reward you with a minor item and the battlemaster quest.\nYour Location is -3439.51, 3319.71, -101.22\nYou say, 'Hail, Captain Keatar'\nCaptain Keatar says, 'Hail! Beware of the [goblin raiders] roaming the plains outside of Firiona Vie. They have caused much trouble and continue to assault this outpost.'\nYou say, 'goblin raiders'\nCaptain Keatar says, 'The goblin raiders have been quite a nuisance to my trackers. I implore you to aid my men and lessen the presence of the vile beasts. Bring me proof that you have taken at least four of these raiders down. You shall earn the respect of this outpost and insure your own well-being.'\nUpon turn in:\nCaptain Keatar says, 'You serve this outpost well. Here is a small reward. You should try and hunt down [goblin battlemasters]. I have very few resources to send into the plains to track them down. Perhaps you can help us.'\nYour faction standing with Inhabitants of Firiona Vie has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Emerald Warriors has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Storm Guard has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Pirates of Gunthak has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive 9 gold from Captain Keatar.\nYou recieve a minor item as well.Rewards:\n- minor item\n[",
