      items_required = {
        { name = "you this handy shillelagh I found in the forest", count = 1 },
        { name = "him those three items", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 493, name = "Dark Oak Shillelagh", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
        { name = "Inhabitants of Firiona Vie", change = 5 },
        { name = "Emerald Warriors", change = 3 },
        { name = "Storm Guard", change = 3 },
        { name = "Legion of Cabilis", change = -1 },
        { name = "Pirates of Gunthak", change = -1 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 30\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nFind Shrub Marwood in the eastern hideout of the Firiona Vie outpost.\nYou say, 'Hail, Shrub Marwood'\nShrub Marwood brushes pollen off of his tunic. 'Aachoo!!  Oh!! Hello.  Please look around.  Unless you are a [druid looking for work].'\nYou say, 'I am a druid looking for work'\nShrub Marwood says 'Good.  I need a stout adventurer to go to the wilds and find me a few items.  I need some tump stumps - one Kromdul and one Kromdek type.  I also need a mantrap root.  Get me those three things and I will give you this handy shillelagh I found in the forest.'\nThe items he needs:\n- One Kromdul Stump (forest giants in Burning Woods)\n- One Kromdek Stump (forest giants in Frontier Mountains)\n- Mantrap Root (erollisi mantraps in the Emerald Jungle)\nGive him those three items, and in exchange you will receive a Dark Oak Shillelagh, some faction, and some experience.\nShrub Marwood says 'Hey!!  Trying to pull a fast one?!!  I said I wanted tump stumps of Kromdek and Kromdul type and a mantrap root!!'\nShrub Marwood tosses the mantrap root out the window.. SPLASH!!  'I made a mistake.  I didn't need that one.  Here is the shillelagh I told you about.  I found it in some burned out woods far from here.  I cleaned it up and found it had a spark of mana so I had it enchanted with a few charges of my spell, [Fertile Crop]. Hope you like it.'\nYour faction standing with Inhabitants of Firiona Vie has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Emerald Warriors has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Storm Guard has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Pirates of Gunthak has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nThe fertile crop he mentions is the lead-in to the Beguile Plants [quest=419] quest.Submitted by: (anonymous) with additional information from ArtemisiaRewards:\n- Dark Oak Shillelagh [item=493]\n[",
