      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Marana Dreadflats in the Dreadlands.\nStep 1: It's no small wonder that the locals are skittish. There have been\nreports of some monsters lurking about that are a threat to not only the\npeople, but the livestock and the supplies as well. You're going to need to help give them back a little piece of mind. To do that, you're going to kill 10 reanimated creatures Remember, they're threatening the supplies so be sure to loot 4 bone chips, while you're out there. The locals are counting on you.\nStep 2: Kill 10 reanimated creatures in Chardok\nStep 3: Loot 4 bone chips\nStep 4: Deliver 4 bone chips to Lehell Sithmoor\nYour help in getting rid of those mongrels is more appreciated than you\nknow. There's just one more thing left for you to do though, and that's to\ndeliver 4 bone chips to Lehell Sithmoor, I'm sure getting some additional\nsupplies will be a relief.\nUpon completing:\nYou really did a phenomenal job helping these locals out. They were too\nscared to even go out at night. It's a wonder they were able to hang in\nthere that long. Your help has proven to them that there's nothing they\ncan't handle, but they know that if they ever have any problems like this\nagain, to call on you. They've been able to pool some of their meager\nearnings as thanks for your help. Well done!\nYou receive 6 silver\nYou receive 3 gold\nYou receive 61 platinum\nYou gain experience!!Rewards:\n[",
