      walkthrough = "**Level:** 70\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a solo task, the second in a series of three that leads up to the Jardel's Hook group mission. It begins with Farwhendle Higglespout (click for map image) who is located in a tent at the Blacksail Smuggler camp at approximately -270, -120 in the Barren Coast.\nPre-requisites for Requesting:\n- Completion of Howlan's Research: Tracking the Missing Notes\nUpon completion of the previous task, you saw:\nFarwhendle Higglespout says, 'With this note, I will be able to [direct] you to the other notes needed to recreate Chataya's staff.'\nYou say, 'Direct me...'\nFarwhendle Higglesnout says 'Aye, I believe the debris can be found along the coasts of lands near the Buried Sea. Go to Gunthak, Ocean of Tears, and The Overthere and investigate for more notes.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Howlan's Research: The Rest of the Diary'.\nFarwhendle believes he knows where the missing pages of the Diary are found and he wants you to find them. Recover the pages and return to him in the Barren Coast.\nExplore The Overthere and find the wreckage of the ship The Greysong 0/1 (The Overthere)\nKill the undead pirates 0/4 (The Overthere)\nLoot the researcher's notes 0/1 (The Overthere)\nHead to the Overthere and just east of the Plane of Knowledge book along the coast. You will find several undead Greysong pirates and some Greysong debris. This is the same as the previous task: Get a location update, kill four undead pirates, and loot the debris object for \"The Magical Siren Staff Chapter II\".\nThe undead pirates are casters and hit for a max ~1,700 each. They are stunnable and mezzable. They have ~60,000 hitpoints each and do not summon. (Same goes for all undead pirates in this task.)\nExplore Ocean of Tears and find the wreckage of the ship The Greysong 0/1 (Ocean of Tears)\nKill the undead pirates 0/4 (Ocean of Tears)\nLoot the researcher's notes 0/1 (Ocean of Tears)\nHead to the Ocean of Tears and find another group of Greysong pirates and debris on the goblin isle (/location 80, -7540 -- directly south of the dock from Butcherblock). Here, you'll loot \"The Magical Siren Staff Chapter V\".\nExplore Gunthak and find the wreckage of the ship The Greysong 0/1 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nKill the undead pirates 0/4 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nLoot the researcher's notes 0/1 (Gulf of Gunthak)\nHead to the Gulf of Gunthak and onto the east side of the beach. Here, you will find several undead Greysong pirates and some Greysong debris (/location -175, -1150). You will be looting an item called \"The Magical Siren Staff Chapter VII\".\nDeliver the chapter II notes to Farwhendle 0/1 (Barren Coast)\nDeliver the chapter V notes to Farwhendle 0/1 (Barren Coast)\nDeliver the chapter VII notes to Farwhendle 0/1 (Barren Coast)\nReturn to the Barren Coast and hand in the three pages:\nFarwhendle Higglespout says, 'With the return of these pages I can now draw up a map of where the [pieces of Chataya's staff] can be found.'\nThis completes the task.\n50 platinum\nExperience (0.7% in Level 70)\nFaction with Blacksail Smugglers (+10)Submitted by: Elevon Figrin, Ranger of the 75th season, Vallis Aspectus on the TribunalRewards:\n[",
