      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 36\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAssistant Buford [npc=12813] can be found inside the Firiona Vie bank.\nYou say, 'Hail, Assistant Buford'\nAssistant Buford says 'Well hello there. I am new to the bank. I am helping the Fargins out since it is so busy lately. Mr. Fargin doesn't even have time for his [hobby] these days.'\nYou say, 'What hobby?'\nAssistant Buford says 'Mr. Fargin used to collect rare coins and gems. He came to Firiona Vie to do just that, but now he never has the time to [collect rare coins] since he is always working here. That is why I came to help him out.'\nYou say, 'I will collect rare coins'\nAssistant Buford says 'If you want to help, you can begin by replacing Mr. Fargin's prized Star of Odus which was taken from his vault when he stepped out to dine one night. Do so, and I may trust you to collect coins. I will also reward you with an item a composer left here. With Mr. Fargin's approval of course.'\nYou can purchase a Star of Odus [item=20863] for about 115 PP in the jewel shop under the Erudin palace. Giving it to Buford results in a Tin Box [item=32911] with 6 slots.\nHe says \"Thank you!! I never could have gone to Odus to replace this. Perhaps now you can collect some rare coins.\" He asks for the following coins:\n- Ancient Coin (Torsis Ton) [item=3170] foraged in the Emerald Jungle\n- Ancient Coin (Royal Crown of Dalnir) [item=3074] dropped by imprecators in Crypt of Dalnir\n- Ancient Coin (Terraz Ton) [item=3158] dropped by failed crypt raider in Kaesora\n- Ancient Coin (Veksar Gran) [item=3181] dropped by bloodgill goblins in Lake of Ill Omen\n- Ancient Coin (Danak Gran) [item=2794] dropped by a scorpikis scrounger in The Overthere\n- Ancient Coin (Ik Gran) [item=2933] dropped by Captain of the Guard in the City of Mist\nPut these gems in the Tin Box, combine it, and return the Full Coin Collection Box [item=63726] to Buford.\nReward:\nNostrolo Tambourine [item=2471]Rewards:\n- Nostrolo Tambourine [item=2471]\n[",
