      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nGrand Armsmith Korin is located in Kael Drakkel. /waypoint -1665, +1440\nYou say, 'Hail, Grand Armsmith Korin'\nGrand Armsmith Korin says 'Another offlander who has recognized and submitted to the will of Tormax I see in you, _____, and that is a good thing for you indeed. For your service I offer you the option of trading in any plate helm you earned from our smiths for one more suited to your race. I believe I can make a fine helm indeed for a Human of your standing. Just hand over your Malevolent Crown, Shining Helm, Troubadour's Helm, Crown of the Kromzek Kings, Frostweaver's Velium Crown, Cowl of Mortality or Warlord's Crown and I'll perform the work for you.'\nUpon turn-in:\nGrand Armsmith Korin says, 'Ah, here is your helm, _____, may it serve you as well as you have served us.'\nDepending on which helm you turned in, you receive one of the following helmets:\n- Custom Cowl of Mortality\n- Custom Crown of the Kromzek Kings\n- Custom Frostreaver's Velium Crown\n- Custom Malevolent Crown\n- Custom Shining Helm\n- Custom Templar's Crown\n- Custom Troubadour's Helm\n- Custom Warlord's Crown\n- Custom Cowl of Mortality [item=25425]\n- Custom Crown of the Kromzek Kings [item=25439]\n- Custom Frostreaver's Velium Crown [item=25441]\n- Custom Malevolent Crown [item=60174]\n- Custom Shining Helm [item=63391]\n- Custom Templar's Crown [item=63547]\n- Custom Troubadour's Helm [item=60175]\n- Custom Warlord's Crown [item=25378]\n[",
