      walkthrough = "**Level:** 30\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task begins when you loot a Silverwing Choker from Trakanon's Teeth.\n--You have looted a Silverwing Choker.--\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Heirlooms (Level 30)'.\nSpeak to Aiden Silverwing about the choker you found. (0/1) - Plane of Knowledge\nAiden Silverwing is located outside the Guild Lobby.  If you do not yet have a Silverwing Lockbox in your inventory, you will receive it upon hailing him.\nAiden Silverwing says 'You've found Cyren's necklace! Cyren was such a feisty young girl. No mistaking the dragon's blood running in her veins. A real firebrand. Where did you say you found this? Trakanon's Teeth? Nasty place that is... Very dangerous, but then we Silverwing's never did shy away from trouble.'\nFind a shard of power to infuse with Aiden's heirloom. (0/1) - Warsliks Woods\nLoot a Fiery Shard from Warsliks Woods.\nPut the choker and shard into the lockbox and combine them. (0/1)\nCasters/priests craft a Scintillating Lavaliere of the Silverwing, while melees/hybrids craft a Blazing Choker of the Silverwing.Submitted by: Iradya from TestRewards:\n- Blazing Choker of the Silverwing [item=69407]\n- Scintillating Lavaliere of the Silverwing [item=69360]\n[",
