      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task begins when you loot a Silverwing Faceguard from The Deep.\n--You have looted a Silverwing Faceguard.--\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Heirlooms (Level 50)'.\nSpeak to Aiden Silverwing about the faceguard you found. (0/1) - Plane of Knowledge\nAiden Silverwing is located outside the Guild Lobby.\nYou say, 'Hail Aiden Silverwing'\nYour task 'Lost Heirlooms (Level 50)' has been updated.\nAiden Silverwing says 'You've found Corelan's mask! She was my eldest daughter, and a capable explorer as well. She ventured alone into areas few others would go, seemingly unafraid of the dangers that awaited her. She was studying the creatures we now know as Thought Horrors when she fell into a deep chasm after a mis-step crossing an invisible bridge.'\nIf you do not yet have a Silverwing Lockbox in your inventory, you will receive it upon hailing him.\nFind a shard of power to infuse with Aiden's heirloom. (0/1) - Temple of Droga\nLoot a Polished Shard from Temple of Droga.\nPut the faceguard and shard into the lockbox and combine them. (0/1) - ALL\nCasters/priests craft a Lustrous Visage of the Silverwing, while melees/hybrids craft a Polished Mask of the Silverwing.Rewards:\n- Lustrous Visage of the Silverwing [item=69389]\n- Polished Mask of the Silverwing [item=69396]\n[",
