      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task begins when you loot a Silverwing Belt [item=69382] from the Temple of Droga.\n--You have looted a Silverwing Belt.--\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Heirlooms (Level 55)'.\n1. Speak to Aiden Silverwing about the belt you found. (0/1) - Plane of Knowledge\nAiden Silverwing [npc=26660] is located outside the Guild Lobby.  If you do not yet have a Silverwing Lockbox [item=69354] in your inventory, you will receive it upon hailing him.\nYou say, 'Hail, Aiden Silverwing'\nAiden Silverwing says 'You've found Burrien's Belt! Burrien was always looking for the next treasure, the next prize. I heard rumors he was planning an expedition to uncover the lost treasures in the Mines of Droga, but that seemed rather far-fetched. To this day nobody has found much of value in its depths. Though he had discovered much in his travels, he never seemed to keep any of it for himself.'\n2. Find a shard of power to infuse with Aiden's heirloom. (0/1) - Nobles' Causeway\nLoot a Scintillating Shard [item=69381] found all around Nobles' Causeway.\n3. Put the belt and shard into the lockbox and combine them. (0/1)\nIn the Silverwing Lockbox, combine the Silverwing Belt and the Scintilating Shard.\nReward(s) :\n- Scintillating Sash of the Silverwing [item=69419] (casters / priests)\n- Studded Girdle of the Silverwing [item=69412] (melees / hybrids)\n- Scintillating Sash of the Silverwing [item=69419]\n- Studded Girdle of the Silverwing [item=69412]\n[",
