      id = "4524",
      title = "Become PvP",
      exp = "01",
      exp_name = "The Ruins of Kunark",
      min_lvl = 1,
      max_lvl = 130,
      quest_type = "Quest",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Priest of Discord",
        "Tome of Order and Discord",
        "like to read",
        "coward",
        "beg for mercy",
        "wish to go to Discord",
        "know more",
        "coward's",
      },
      items_required = {
        { name = "you passage to the new world of purest Discord", count = 1 },
      },
      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 1\n**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nIf you follow the dialogue with the Priest of Discord, you will receive a Tome of Order and Discord. If you hand it back to him, you will become a PvP player and be vulnerable to other PvP players. You will no longer be affected by beneficial spells of non-PvP players and the name of your player character will appear in red instead of blue.\nThe Priest of Discord is located outside the Great Library in the central part of The Plane of Knowledge.\n/waypoint +48, +565, +4\nYou say, 'Hail, Priest of Discord'\nPriest of Discord says, 'Ah, another who admits that the path to glory and power lies in discord? Have we not always preached the truth?  We are the only ones that can give you passage to the new world of purest Discord.  Should you like to go there, tell me you [wish to go to Discord] and I will grant you passage.  If you wish to [know more] about this travel, I will tell you. And, of course, if you have come to seek the way of Discord in your life, then ask me about your [Tome of Order and Discord].'\nYou say, 'Tome of Order and Discord'\nPriest of Discord says, 'The Tome of Order and Discord was penned by the seventh member of the Tribunal and has become the key to a life of Discord, in spite of the author's pitiful warnings.  Do you not have one, child of Order?  Would you [like to read] it or do you seek the [coward's] way?'\nYou say, 'like to read'\nPriest of Discord says, 'Very well.  Here you go.  Simply return it to me to be released from the chains of Order.'\nYou receive Tome of Order and Discord.\nReturn it to the Priest of Discord.\nYou offered 1 Tome of Order and Discord to Priest of Discord.\nPriest of Discord says, 'I see you wish to join us in Discord!  Welcome!  By turning your back on the protection of Order you are now open to many more opportunities for glory and power.  Remember that you can now be harmed by others who have also heard the call of Discord.'\nYou complete the trade with Priest of Discord.\nYou are now player kill and follow the ways of Discord.\nThe PVP status has been added to your player character. Its name appears in red instead of blue.\nIf you want to remove the PVP status, you can transform your player character back:\nYou say, 'coward'\nPriest of Discord says, 'So, the life of Discord proved to be too much for you, very well. I am disappointed in the path you have chosen, but if you wish to be coddled by the encumbered embrace of Order then you need only [beg for mercy].'\nYou say, 'beg for mercy'\nPriest of Discord says, 'Very well, return this note to me and I will once again return you to the shackles of Order.'\nYou receive Note of Order.\nReturn it to the Priest of Discord.\nYou offered 1 Note of Order to Priest of Discord.\nPriest of Discord says, 'You are once more under the stifling protection of Order. You can no longer be harmed by others who have heard the call of Discord.'\nYou have renounced the ways of Discord. You can no longer attack or harm other players.\nYou complete the trade with Priest of Discord.\nThe PVP status has been removed from your player character. Its name appears in blue instead of red.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n[",
