      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis solo task begins with Fenden Helter in the Citadel of Dragonscale (right next to the port-in location). It has a lockout timer of 18 hours, which is shared with his other \"Quick Errand\" tasks.\nYou say, 'Hail, Fenden Helter'\nFenden Helter says 'Hey there _____! You look like just my kind of adventurer! Do I have an [opportunity] for you! Why don't you come over here and we'll discuss the riches and adventures that can be yours?'\nYou say, 'An opportunity?'\nFenden Helter says 'Yes, yes! I alone am in a rather unique and fortunate position and lucky for you I'm willing to allow you to work for me! You see I happen to be close personal friends with nearly everyone in this part of the world. I am so trusted, in fact, that I'm authorized to hire adventurers such as you to perform various, ah, [tasks] for the groups in this part of Faydwer.'\nYou say, 'What tasks?'\nFenden Helter says 'There are several types of services you can perform for my various employers. You can perform [errands] or engage in [combat] or even perform various [acts] of mischief and sabotage. Whatever you choose you will be rewarded!'\nYou say, 'Errands?'\nFenden Helter says 'Why don't you take a look at these tasks and see if one of them seems like something you'd like to do today?'\nA window pops up offering seven tasks, one for each faction.\nYou have been assigned the task 'A Quick Errand - Crusaders of Veeshan'.\nFenden has asked you to perform a small favor for the Crusaders of Veeshan. You are to seek out an Emissary of Yelinak in Skyshrine and give him this progress report from Dragonscale Hills. Be warned that travel through Skyshrine can be dangerous for those that the Claws of Veeshan do not trust and love. Return and speak with Fenden when you have completed this small task.\nAsk Fenden for the report you need to deliver. 0/1 (Dragonscale Hills)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fenden'\nYou receive a Crusader's Progress Report.\nDeliver 1 Crusader's Progress Report to Yelinak`s Emissary in Skyshrine 0/1 (Skyshrine)\nLocation for your in-game map:\nP 733.7481, -177.4146, 171.5626, 240, 0, 0, 2, Yelinak's_Emissary\nSpeak with Fenden again now that you are done. 0/1 (Dragonscale Hills)\nExperience\nFaction with Crusaders of Veeshan (+25)\n20 Faycitum (currency used to buy items from Fenden Helter)Rewards:\n- Faycetum [item=75595]\n[",
    },
