      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 53\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis \"long task\" begins with Hoobert Flinkl in the Dreadlands. It was available at level 53.\nKill 10 drolvarg sentries 0/10 (Karnor's Castle)\nLoot 4 Plague Mites 0/4 (Karnor's Castle)\n(From here on out you can only complete steps one at a time.)\nExplore the stone hut in the south 0/1 (Dreadlands)\nLocation of this stone hut is: -2097, -178, 6\nKill 10 mountain giant braes 0/10 (Dreadlands)\nDeliver 4 Plague Mites to Bosellana Skyspeed 0/4 (Dreadlands)\nBosellana Skyspeed is found in a pyramid in the undead area by the spires. Loc: 1217, 8904, 1065 - front right pyramid. (She'll be marked on your compass.)\nExplore the northwest crater 0/1 (Burning Woods)\nIt's time to wrap up the 'Go Anywhere' portion of the event. Why don't you hurry on over and explore the northwest crater.  It'll be your last chance to make up lost time before the contest is over, so get going!'\nThis task step updates at the bottom of the giant fort crater. Loc: 1361, 1152, -442.\nSpeak with Raobez Krayku 0/1 (Dreadlands)\nYou're in the homestretch now, just one last thing to do!  You need to get moving and speak with Raobez Kraykru. They're waiting for you!\nRaobez Krayku is found in a pyramid in the undead area by the spires. Loc: 367. 8870, 1068 - front left pyramid. (He'll be marked on your compass)\nWell, unfortunately, you didn't come in first, but you were close!  You did an excellent job and nearly beat all the competition.  Don't give up.  You'll do much better next time!  You did do quite well though, so here's your prize money.  Better luck next time!'\nReward:\n141pp, 7gp, 9sp, 8cp + Experience (21% at level 54)Submitted by: LovejoyRewards:\n[",
    },
