      id = "4636",
      title = "Visions - Past or Future",
      exp = "01",
      exp_name = "The Ruins of Kunark",
      min_lvl = 75,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = false,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = nil,
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Deckarn Mystglade",
        "No time?",
        "What visions?",
        "I",
        "time",
        "visions",
        "meaning",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 76769, name = "Conflicted Stone of Chaos", type = "item" },
        { id = 76767, name = "Disrupted Stone of Chaos", type = "item" },
        { id = 76770, name = "Focused Stone of Chaos", type = "item" },
        { id = 76768, name = "Living Stone of Chaos", type = "item" },
        { id = 68275, name = "Potion of Adventure", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nNOTE: This quest is no longer active.\nThis is a temporary task, a pre-launch event for the Seeds of Destruction expansion (available until October 7, 2008). It begins with Deckarn Mystglade in the Dreadlands. He is located at the spires (approximately 2975, 9415, 1045).\nYou say, 'Hail, Deckarn Mystglade'\nDeckarn Mystglade says 'I have no [time] for idle chat.'\nYou say, 'No time?'\nDeckarn Mystglade says 'I'm sorry. I have had many strange visions as of late that have caused me much misery. I wish I could find out if these [visions] were real or not.'\nYou say, 'What visions?'\nDeckarn Mystglade says 'Yes, visions or epic battles, cities re-building, corruption and decay, and war. If you could aid me by finding out if my visions have any [meaning], I would reward you properly.'\nYou say, 'I'll find their meaning'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Visions - Past or Future'.\nDeckarn Mystglade says 'Thank you. Travel to my list of locations and please bring me back any information you can find.'\nLocate and end the disturbance in Field of Bone 0/1 (Field of Bone)\nTwo dragons roam the Field of Bone - Lady Buzzaire and Lord Ayrnar. They hit for a max ~2,500; are partially slowable; rootable/snareable; and have ~350,000 hps. Some flavor text among them:\nLady Buzzaire says, 'What magic has Ganak learned to cause this?'\nLady Buzzaire says, 'Could this pile of bones be Jaled`Dar?!'\nLord Ayrnar says, 'What place is this? Where are the armies?'\nLord Ayrnar says, 'The Ring of Scale will never fall! We must continue to stand strong against the Iksar!'\nYou have been slain by Lord Ayrnar!\nLord Ayrnar says' 'Another falls at the claws of the Ring of Scale!'\nLocate and end the disturbance in Warsliks Wood 0/1 (Warsliks Wood)\nTwo dragons roam in Warsliks Wood - Lord Chavair and Lord Domgar. They hit for a max ~2,500; are partially slowable; and rootable/snareable.\nLocate and end the disturbance in Qeynos Hills 0/1 (Qeynos Hills)\nKill one of the 6-7 mobs near the Blackburrow entrance (called \"an ancient Blackburrow _____\"). They hit for a max ~2,500; are fully slowable; and are immune to root/snare.\nLocate and end the disturbance in Commonlands 0/1 (Commonlands)\nKill one of the 6-7 mobs in the Commonlands (called \"an Obliteration _____\"). They hit for a max (?); are partially slowable; and rootable/snareable.\nLocate and end the disturbance in the Rathe Mountains 0/1 (Rathe Mountains)\nThese are the green mobs called \"a Rallosian scout\" right when you zone in from the Gukta stone. They hit for a max (?); are partially slowable; and rootable/snareable.\nSpeak with Deckarn Mystglade 0/1 (Dreadlands)\nYou say, 'Hail, Deckarn Mystglade'\nYour task 'Visions - Past or Future' has been updated.\nYou have found answers to Deckarn's questions but have raised many more for yourself. What could all of this mean?\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Visions - Past or Future\nReward Options:\n5x Potion of Adventure and your choice out of the following augs (task is NOT repeatable, so choose wisely):\nFocused Stone of Chaos\nLiving Stone of Chaos\nConflicted Stone of Chaos\nDisrupted Stone of Chaos Submitted by: MoonglummBB; Lord Elbribon L'AbattageRewards:\n- Conflicted Stone of Chaos [item=76769]\n- Disrupted Stone of Chaos [item=76767]\n- Focused Stone of Chaos [item=76770]\n- Living Stone of Chaos [item=76768]\n- Potion of Adventure [item=68275]\n[",
    },
