      rewards = {
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAnniversary events tend to run from mid-March to mid-April (sometimes to mid-May) each year. They are not available during the \"off season\".\nFor an overview and list of EverQuest Anniversary events, see this quest entry [quest=6782].\nThis is an anniversary quest available only during anniversary season (a few weeks during March and April). It was introduced in 2009 as part of EverQuest's 10th anniversary.\nThis is one of 16 deity quests. For an overview of how rewards work and how these quests are linked with one another, see this writeup [quest=4843].\nBelow here are the details for this particular quest.\nThis task begins with the Avatar of Mithaniel Marr in the Plane of Tranquility.\nYou say, 'Hail, Avatar of Mithaniel Marr'\nAvatar of Mithaniel Marr says 'Hail! I am pleased to see you here in this place of peace. It is rare that one such as I is given the opportunity to relax, for treachery and evil never appear to [rest]. Are they not wonderful, the lives we lead here? You mortals travelling about Norrath earnestly living your lives as best you can. We gods struggling to earn your respect and to be worthy of your worship. Certainly we come in conflict frequently, but how does one measure life without struggle? If we do not face conflict then we grow complacent and our honor grows stale. One cannot be content with honor of days past. We must continue to earn our place and our pride!'\nYou say, 'Rest?'\nAvatar of Mithaniel Marr says 'Ah, perhaps you have noticed my nervous energy. It is difficult for me to celebrate knowing that there are insipient beings hiding throughout the mortal realm waiting to prey on the innocent and unwary. But we gods have agreed to hold this celebration, each in our own fashion, to honor the year. I would feel so much better if you could go and [vanquish] a few of those that would leap from shadows upon your fellow mortals.'\nYou say, 'I'll vanquish a few of them'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Deliver Us From Evil - Mithaniel Marr's Favor'.\nAvatar of Mithaniel Marr says 'Wonderful! I will not ask you to take much of a risk. It is not that I doubt your honor and willingness to do so, but simply to reduce my worry. I would rest no better knowing that I had sent you to do a task that is the duty of one of my paladins if you were to enter into great risk. This symbol will reveal the evil that you seek. So go forth, hero! I shall toast you upon your return!'\nMithaniel Marr has asked you to deal with some minor evil for him; insidious creatures that are the cause of deception, lies and unhappiness. when you finish he invites you to drink with him in honor of a decade of good will between Norrath's heros and those gods with honor.\nYou'll have to kill an even-con spectre for some (or all?) clicks.\n- 1. Seek your foe near the icy entrance to the under-ice cave. Everfrost Peaks.\nGo west of the LDoN Camp and follow the frozen-over river north until you reach the wall, right click the Eye of Valor and Kill \"a spectre of evil\".\n- 2. Look for evil close to the undead ruins of Lord Grimrot. South Karana\nSouthwest of the zone-in of North Karana. (or just about directly south of the succor point for you evac-able types).\n- 3. Evil lurks near the Lumberyard. Highpass Hold.\nGo south from the Zone of HighKeep and take the first right, you should see a large wooden structure. click 'n' kill.\n- 4. The chess board has dangers seen and unseen. You seek then unseen. Butcherblock Mountains.\nNorth of the Wayfarer's Camp. past the goblin camp. It's a big chessboard.\n- 5. Peer into the dusk around the monument of the shadowed men. Lesser Faydark.\nFollow the east wall from Greater Faydark/Steamfont zone in. South until you see shadowed men.\n- 6. Search the docks for treachery. Firiona Vie.\nGo into the dark elf controlled area of Firiona Vie and head southeast until you find the Docks.\n- 7. Near the 'pirate' campe you shall find a true evil. Iceclad Ocean.\nThe camp is pretty close to where you zone in via Translocator. for those who use the GH/Druid port. its the North Island from Tower of Frozen shadows. (Succor will get you close.)\n- 8. Darkness threatens the traverls on the Queen of Thorns in Abysmal Sea.\nYou can click the Eye as soon as you zone in.\n- 9. Shadows lurk in the Vah Shir camp. Shadeweaver's Thicket.\nAnother simple one. Click the eye when your in the Vah Shir camp just outside the entrance to Shar Vahl.\n- 10. Peril hides in the vah Shir camp. Hollowshade Moor.\nJust outside the entrance area of Shar Vahl. (Succor will put you right close)\n- 11. Return to Avatar of Mithaniel Marr with the Eye of Valor.\nAvatar of Mithaniel Marr says 'You honor me, mortal. I raise my mug to you. May your days be remembered well!'\nYour task 'Deliver Us From Evil - Mithaniel Marr's Favor' has been updated.\nYou have removed some treachery from the world. For that Mithaniel Marr toasts your honor!\nReward:\nCelebratory Firework Caster (if this is your first diety task)\nFireworks Focus of Mithaniel Marr",
    },
