      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAnniversary events tend to run from mid-March to mid-April (sometimes to mid-May) each year. They are not available during the \"off season\".\nFor an overview and list of EverQuest Anniversary events, see this quest entry [quest=6782].\nThis is an anniversary quest available only during anniversary season (a few weeks during March and April). It was introduced in 2009 as part of EverQuest's 10th anniversary.\nThis is one of 16 deity quests. For an overview of how rewards work and how these quests are linked with one another, see this writeup [quest=4843].\nBelow here are the details for this particular quest.\nThis task begins with Avatar of Quellious the Tranquil in the Plane of Tranquility near the Plane of Earth zone-in.\nAvatar of Quellious the Tranquil says '[Beautiful], isn't it?'\nYou say, 'It's beautiful'\nAvatar of Quellious the Tranquil says 'This little pool. I'd forgotten how peaceful it is to watch this pool and listen to the weavers weave. If only I could [continue].'\nYou say, 'Continue'\nAvatar of Quellious the Tranquil says 'You mean you don't feel it? No... no, you wouldn't. There are disturbances in the world below, and they need my [influence].'\nYou say, 'Influence?'\nAvatar of Quellious the Tranquil says 'Why, to stop them, of course. Tranquility is so very fleeting. Without constant vigilance peace would never be maintained. Without a [champion] I must go there myself.'\nYou say, 'Champion?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor'.\nAvatar of Quellious the Tranquil says 'I thank you for your offer.'\nAs the champion of Quellious, the Tranquil, you are charged with spreading peace throughout the lands of Norrath.\nFind a way to distract Nettle from his mission 0/1 (Misty Thicket)\nNettle Higglesbury is on the east side of the center wall (south: -703, +355). Have room for a stack of Strawberry-Jumjum Pie.\nYou say, 'Hail, Nettle Higglesbury'\nNettle Higglesbury says \"Hello to you! Would you like to join our [fight] against the goblins?\"\nYou say, 'What fight?'\nNettle Higglesbury says 'They slink in at night and ruin our crops! They attack our supplies of timber and honey! They..they smell bad! And I am going to put a stop to it!'\nAfter you have him targeted and click Quellious' wand:\nNettle Higglesbury says 'Is...is that pie I smell?'\nYou get a stack of 20 pies after a brief flourish.\nNettle Higglesbury says \"I'm getting a little hungry here, how about all of you?\"\nAn angry farmer says \"I know I am!\"\nAn angry farmer says \"Yeah!\"\nAn angry farmer says \"I know I am!\"\nAn angry farmer says \"Who isn't?\"\nNettle Higglesbury says \"Okay, okay, first pie, then freedom!\"\nCalm the rowdy halflings with the power of Pie 0/10 (Misty Thicket)\nNumerous angry farmers are found nearby.\nHand out the pies (Nettle himself won't take one, he'll just give it back.) You need to do 10 pies out of the stack of 20 you got.\n(note: You can actually hand each farmer four pies, and get four updates!)\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nan angry farmer says 'Mmmm, pie...'\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nan angry farmer says 'Pie!'\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nan angry farmer says 'Pie? For me?'\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nan angry farmer says 'Oh boy, pie!'\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nan angry farmer says 'I love pie!'\nBring peace to an angry citizen 0/1 (Crescent Reach)\nAtler Flamejabber is in the council chambers on the 2nd floor.\nYou say, 'Hail, Atler Flamejabber'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'These councilmembers are too lazy to address my issues! Let's see them ignore me now!'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'Whose idea was it to put elevators in here when ramps or stairs work just fine?'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'No one in this city wants to do anything with me. Fix it!'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'The bakers burned some bread and the whole place smells awful now. They should be fired!'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'The council's still conducting their business after all my shouting. Was I not communicating my points clearly?'\nWhen you click him with the wand:\nAtler Flamejabber says 'Well, I suppose my demands are awfully self-centered. Maybe if they get done with the items that affect everyone they can get to me.....'\nAtler Flamejabber says 'I'll write a letter I suppose.'\nAnd off he goes.\nCalm two agitators and send them home 0/2 (Shadow Haven)\nYou'll find two drunken miscreants on the north side, just before the Monk GM area, by a building.\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"I just found something that reminded me of your faces....it was really really ugly!\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"That must have been a mirror!\"\nA drunken Fordel miscreant says \"Fordel rules, Midst drools!\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"You have confused us with your mothers!\"\nA drunken Fordel miscreant says \"Why fight when we already own you!\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"The only thing Fordel owns is bills!\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"Any friend of Fordel's is....dumb!\"\nA drunken Fordel miscreant says \"It's OK, Midst, sometime you'll get friends. Maybe\"\nThey do not respond when hailed, so just click 'em. I had to click them both twice, to get the following before they despawned:\nA drunken Fordel miscreant says \"M'tired.\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"Me too. Hungry\"\nA drunken Fordel miscreant says \"Food would be good. I'll go get some.\"\nA drunken Midst miscreant says \"Yeah, eggs. Maybe some potatoes.\"\nSpeak with the Avatar of Quellious 0/1 (Plane of Tranquility)\nYou say, 'Hail, Avatar of Quellious the Tranquil'\nYour task 'Peace and Understanding - Quellious' Favor' has been updated.\nYou have helped spread peace and understanding through the lands of Norrath, for now. There will always be violence, but you have stopped much of it this day.\nReward:\nCelebratory Firework Caster (if this is your first deity task)\nFireworks Focus of Quellious",
    },
