      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 06:00:00\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task was a part of the lead-in events to the Underfoot expansion. It is no longer in the game.\nThis task began with:\n- a concerned citizen (in Paineel at +805, +240, +5 -- directly to the right after zoning in and leaving the tunnel)\n- Protector of the Ruins (in the Hole)\n- Elanna Noraka (near the Paineel pod)\n- Surveyor Lodestone (in Corathus Creep at -190, +180: same general area as Cartographer Slipgear)\nThe task had a six-hour time limit and an 18-hour lockout timer.\nOpening with a concerned citizen:\nYou say, 'Hail, a concerned citizen'\na concerned citizen says 'It is horrible.  Some horrible insect creatures have managed to crawl up from the ruins of Old Paineel.  Can you please [destroy] some for me?  I will compensate you for your actions.'\nYou say, 'I will destroy them!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'They Came From Below'.\na concerned citizen says 'Very good.  When you have killed a good amount of them come back to me.  I have heard rumors that others are encountering problems.  I expect that they will reward you as I will if you prefer to talk to them.'\nOpening with the Protector:\nYou say, 'Hail, Protector of the Ruins '\nProtector of the Ruins  says 'It is worse than I originally thought.  The Guardian of the Seal has [Fallen].'\nYou say, 'The guardian has fallen?'\nProtector of the Ruins  says 'Yes.  My greatest creation has fallen.  Now these invaders have spread out through much of the lower levels of these ruins.  Some have even managed to escape into Paineel and Toxxulia.  Rumor has even reached me of an incursion in a set of caverns off of Nektulos Forest.  I need you to [assist] me and kill some of the invaders.'\nYou say, 'I will assist you!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'They Came From Below'.\nOpening with Elanna:\nYou say, 'Hail, Elanna Noraka'\nElanna Noraka says 'I've never seen anything like it, _____. These [invaders] are breaking through Paineel's defenses and are on the march.'\nYou say, 'Invaders?'\nElanna Noraka says 'I know not what they are, but they appear to have the physiology of a common insect. My colleagues and I have a [plan] that will play on those details, but we'll need your help to put the plan in action.'\nYou say, 'A plan?'\nElanna Noraka says 'It's simple: Insecticide. We don't know how effective it will be, but the best we can do is amass a large supply. We, however, need the supplies to make it happen. If you could [gather] the [supplies] we need to make the concoction, we'll be greatly appreciative. Or, if you just want to [kill them] directly, if that's your prerogative, that works, too.'\nYou say, 'I want to kill them'\nElanna Noraka says 'It is by no means a long-term solution, as the insecticide is, but you might be able to thin the ranks enough to distract them. If you're [up for it], let me know.'\nYou say, 'I'm up for it'\nElanna Noraka says 'Sounds like a plan. Go ahead and kill a few, then get back to me on your progress.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'They Came From Below'.\nOpening with Surveyor Lodestone:\nYou say, 'Hail, Surveyor Lodestone'\nSurveyor Lodestone says 'Blast it all! I was out surveying and these freakish bug men showed up out of nowhere. Now I can't continue my surveys. Hey, you look tough. Maybe you could [do something] about it?'\nYou say, 'I will do something'\nSurveyor Lodestone says 'I'm glad to hear that! Now go out there and kill as many of those things as you can. You'll find them to the Northwest of here.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'They Came From Below'.\nTask Steps\nKill 40 cliknar invaders 0/40 (ALL)\nTask Window Says: Eliminate the Cliknar Invaders.\nThese creatures are found in multiple areas:\n- Bottom of the Hole outside the Underfoot seal\n- Toxxulia Forest near the entrance to Paineel and surrounding areas; also around the orc camps\n- Paineel (location information needed)\n- Corathus Creep (location information needed)\nReport your success to one of the four interested people 0/1 (ALL)\nTask Window Says: You may return to the individual that gave you this quest, or any of the individuals most involved with recruiting adventurers.\nYou can finish off the task with one of the four NPCs who give it out.\nYou say, 'Hail, a concerned citizen'\nYour task 'They Came From Below' has been updated.\nYou have assisted in the elimination of many Cliknar Invaders\nYou receive 2520 platinum.\na concerned citizen says 'Thanks for clearing out some of those bug men. Maybe now I can get back to my surveying.'\nReward:\n2520 Platinum\nFlavor Text (before the task was available):\nYou say, 'Hail, Protector of the Ruins'\nProtector of the Ruins says 'Oh No. It is horrible. My creation, the Guardian of the Seal has failed. Something has caused a horrible [earthquake] that has broken through the seal from the Underfoot. I came up here to see if I could think of anything different to do to make it stronger. It is much too dangerous to assist the Guardian. I would not ask that of myself, so I will not ask it of anyone. If you can, keep an eye on things. I expect The Guardian can hold his own, but one can never be too careful.'\nYou say, 'An earthquake?'\nProtector of the Ruins says 'I do not know conclusively where it originates since it has been reported over all of Norrath, and even a few of the planes. But the extent of the earthquake causes me to believe it is from the Underfoot itself.'Rewards:\n[",
