      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is a shared task that was introduced in October 2005 and is available every year around Halloween. It scales according to your group's average level.\nIt's one of five tasks required to receive a Bone Mask of Horror [quest=5371] (illusion click item).\nIt begins with a dressed-up halfling in Kithicor Forest (location 1090, -570 against a log a little west of the Commonlands zone).\nYou say, 'Hail, a Dressed-Up halfling'\na Dressed-Up halfling says 'Oh no! I can't find the rest of my costume and I'm running late to our costume gathering. It was here just a little while ago and I can't seem to find it. Can you [help me find] it?'\nYou say, 'I'll help you find it'\na Dressed-Up halfling says 'You would help me? That is wonderful, I could use all the help that I can get. I don't want to be late. If you're late you miss out on all the candy. The last thing I remember was setting my cape and my fangs down over here next to the other [costumed vampire]. I walked away for no longer than it takes me to eat a mouthful of pie and when I turned around it was gone.'\nYou say, 'A costumed vampire?'\na Dressed-Up halfling says 'I have never seen him before but he had a good costume. He almost looked like a real vampire. Would you be [willing to search] for him to see if he has it?'\nYou say, 'I'm willing to search'\na Dressed-Up halfling says 'Wonderful, I'll keep looking around here. Please hurry back if you find them.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Missing Costume Pieces'.\nYou have come across a Halfling dressed up for a costume gathering. He is searching for the rest of his costume before he is late for the festivities and has asked you to help him find it. The last thing he remembers was another person dressed up as a vampire. Search for the vampire and locate the rest of his costume.\nLevel 30 version\nSearch for the vampire that might have taken the cape and fangs for his costume 0/1 (Castle Mistmoore)\nThe Blood Vampire roams the northeastern part of the zone (from the castle entrance to the northern valley that leads up to it).\nRecover the cloak from the vampire 0/1 (Castle Mistmoore)\nRecover the fangs from the vampire 0/1 (Castle Mistmoore)\nLoot the pieces of the costume and deliver the items to the halfling.\nReturn the cloak to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nReturn the fangs to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nCongratulations!  You have found the rest of the costume and returned it.  Here is a reward in appreciation for finding the rest of the costume!\nReward:\n1x \"Bristlebane Ticket of Admission\" for each person in the task (access to \"Out With the Old\")\nBand of Mortality\nHarrowing Black Silk Cape\nLevel 40 version\nSearch for the vampire that might have taken the cape and fangs for his costume 0/1 (The Tenebrous Mountains)\nThe Blood Vampire roams an unknown location.\nRecover the cloak from the vampire 0/1 (The Tenebrous Mountains)\nRecover the fangs from the vampire 0/1 (The Tenebrous Mountains)\nLoot the pieces of the costume and deliver the items to the halfling.\nReturn the cloak to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nReturn the fangs to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nCongratulations!  You have found the rest of the costume and returned it.  Here is a reward in appreciation for finding the rest of the costume!\nReward:\n1x \"Bristlebane Ticket of Admission\" for each person in the task (access to \"Out With the Old\")\nEerie Silver Band\nSpooky Stone Totem\nLevel 53 version\nSearch for the vampire that might have taken the cape and fangs for his costume 0/1 (Katta Castellum)\nThe Blood Vampire roams a set path from -700, -1532, 12 in the southeast building (Mausoleum) to 200, 80, 69 in the middle western building (Tsaph Katta Hall).\nRecover the cloak from the vampire 0/1 (Katta Castellum)\nRecover the fangs from the vampire 0/1 (Katta Castellum)\nLoot the pieces of the costume and deliver the items to the halfling.\nReturn the cloak to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nReturn the fangs to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nCongratulations!  You have found the rest of the costume and returned it.  Here is a reward in appreciation for finding the rest of the costume!\nReward:\n1x \"Bristlebane Ticket of Admission\" for each person in the task (access to \"Out With the Old\")\nEarring of Spectral Essence\nGhoulish Bolster Belt\nLevel 58 version\nSearch for the vampire that might have taken the cape and fangs for his costume 0/1 (The Maiden's Eye)\nThe Blood Vampire roams around the northwestern part of the zone, outside the entrance to Dawnshroud Peaks.\nRecover the cloak from the vampire 0/1 (The Maiden's Eye)\nRecover the fangs from the vampire 0/1 (The Maiden's Eye)\nLoot the pieces of the costume and deliver the items to the halfling.\nReturn the cloak to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nReturn the fangs to the Dressed Up Halfling in Kithicor 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nCongratulations!  You have found the rest of the costume and returned it.  Here is a reward in appreciation for finding the rest of the costume!\nReward:\n1x \"Bristlebane Ticket of Admission\" for each person in the task (access to \"Out With the Old\")\nBlood Talon Necklace\nEarring of Ghostly Chants\nLevel 66+ version\nSearch for the vampire that might have taken the cape and fangs for his costume 0/1 (Plane of Hate)\nThe Bloody Vampire of the Plane of Hate (only spawns while Halloween events are active). He is 66th level and has ~12-15 bats with him, each of which hit for a max ~235. All of them (including the vampire) are mezzable.\nRecover the cloak from the vampire 0/1 (Plane of Hate)\nRecover