      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAnniversary events tend to run from mid-March to mid-April (sometimes to mid-May) each year. They are not available during the \"off season\". Note that the augment rewards are currently flagged as \"prestige\" items.\nFor an overview and list of EverQuest Anniversary events, see this quest entry [quest=6782].\nThis is a task introduced with EverQuest's 11th anniversary (and expected to be available only during anniversary season). There are versions of this task for players of every level.\nThe tasks are all set up in the same manner:\nDeliver 10 (item a) to (npc) 0/10 (Zone)\nDeliver 1 (item b) to (npc) 0/1 (Zone)\nSpeak with (npc) 0/1 (Zone)\nIn addition to the aug rewards listed below, you also receive experience and a positive faction hit with any of the (useful) factions from the Dragons of Norrath expansion and onward.\nYou must be at least the required level of the aug in order to request the corresponding task.\nThe tasks have lockout timers of 18 hours (from the point of request). This lockout is shared among the different level versions.\nLevel 5 (begins in the Everfrost Peaks)\nNPC: Fenworth Iceflinger (near the guards at the entrance to Halas).\n10x Coldsteel Ore - from Ice Goblin Orehoarders in Everfrost (roam the valleys between Halas and Blackburrow).\n1x Hammer of the Coldforge - from Minotaur Brawlers in the Steamfont Mountains (in the valley outside the minotaur mines leading to the Dragonscale Hills and Loping Plains).\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Jade\nAC: 10\nHP: +10 MANA: +10 ENDUR: +10\nRecommended level of 5.\nLevel 15 (begins in South Ro)\nNPC: Gnorble Iceflinger (-539, -626, by entrance from Innothule Swamp)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gnorble Iceflinger'\nGnorble Iceflinger says 'Ah! An adventurer. Just what I need! How would you like to go on a grand [adventure] to collect some items for me?'\nYou say, 'I would like to go on a grand adventure.'\nGnorble Iceflinger says 'Well, I will be honest. It isn't such a grand adventure, but you would be helping a poor gnome out. I need to collect some [items], but I haven't had much luck finding them.'\nYou say 'What items?'\nGnorble Iceflinger says ' I seek ten Flameforged Daggers and Ring of the Steel Legions. It is said that the orcish flameforgers in South Ro carry the daggers and the undead ringbearers in Butcherblock sometimes possess the rings. Think you could [find] these items for me?'\nYou say 'I will find them for you.'\nGnorble Iceflinger says 'You will? Thank you! I need the items to give to my boss, Karl. You see, our anniversary of when we started to work together is coming up soon and he would love to have those items. Good luck with your search. I will be waiting here for your return.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gifts of Steel'.\n10x Flameforged Daggers - from Orcish Flameforgers in South Ro (roam in various parts of the zone - no known specific PHs)\n1x Ring of the Steel Legions - from Undead Ringbearers in Butcherblock (these are the size of Dwarf skeletons and roam along with them in the zone)\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Sapphire\nAC: 12\nHP: +15 MANA: +15 ENDUR: +15\nRecommended level of 15. Required level of 10.\nLevel 25 (begins in the Lavastorm Mountains)\nNPC: Harte Earthflinger (199, -40, by the zone in from Nektulos Forest)\n10x Earthcore Ore - from Fire Goblin Miners in Lavastorm Mountains (roam around the southern half of the zone)\n1x Stoneforger's Lore - from Kobold Stoneforgers in Stonebrunt Mountains (spawn among the kobolds throughout the southern part of the zone)\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Granite\nAC: 14\nHP: +20 MANA: +20 ENDUR: +20\nRecommended level of 25. Required level of 20.\nLevel 35 (begins in the Dawnshroud Peaks)\nNPC: Istod Woodflinger (-53, 1940, by the entrance to Sanctus Seru).\n10x Loam-Infused Ore - from Tribal Miners in Dawnshroud Peaks (spawn along with the other Tribal mobs around the entrance to Greig's End)\n1x Flamecore Branch - from Sarnak Flamebearers in the Overthere (roam along with the Sarnak Berserkers and Knights in the zone)\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Topaz\nLevel 45 (begins in the Iceclad Ocean)\nNPC: Juston Windflinger (5299, 480, on the gnome pirate dock)\n10x Frozen Wind - from howling dervishes in Iceclad Ocean\n1x Airless Ore - from a wary golem in the Grey\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Malachite\nAC: 18\nHP: +40 MANA: +40 ENDUR: +40\nRecommended level of 45. Required level of 40.\nLevel 55 (begins in the Barren Coast)\nNPC: Kert Waterflinger (726, 1197, to the left as you zone in from Toxxulia Forest)\n10x Water-Soaked Ore - from Bloodgill Ore Scavengers in Veksar\n1x Blood Engorged Steel - from bloodsoaked stoneworkers in the northwestern part of the Bloodfields\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Amethyst\nAC: 20\nHP: +50 MANA: +50 ENDUR: +50\nSV CORRUPTION: +2\nRecommended level of 55. Required level of 50.\nLevel 65 (begins in Nobles' Causeway)\nNPC: Laminth Stoneflinger (-1677, -250, near the dragorn quest NPC Nerask)\n10x Arcstone Bricks - from Arcstone Miner Golems up in the hills of Arcstone in view of the big bones on the ground in the undead area near the Colosus of Skylance)\n1x Gatebreaker's Mallet - from Dragorn Gatebreakers at the bottom level of the spire in the tunnels branching off from the ground floor of the Spire room itself.\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Turquoise\nAC: 22\nHP: +60 MANA: +60 ENDUR: +60\nSV CORRUPTION: +4\nRecommended level of 65. Required level of 60.\nLevel 75 (begins in Oceangreen Hills)\nNPC: Myrton Lightningflinger (4605, -1145, just north of the port-in from the Void)\n10x Conjurer's Stones - from Girplan Conjurers in the basement of Riftseeker's Sanctum\n1x Anvil of Evil - from an evil blacksmith in the Temple of Bertoxxulous\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Ruby\nAC: 26\nHP: +70 MANA: +70 ENDUR: +70\nSV CORRUPTION: +6\nRecommended level of 75. Required level of 70.\nLevel 85 (begins in Brell's Rest)\nNPC: Norten Magmaflinger (up the ramps, outside the entrances to Kernagir and Brell's Temple).\nYou say, 'Hail, Norten Magmaflinger'\nNorten Magmaflinger says 'Hello there! You look like you could be of assistance. I need to find some suitable items to use as gifts for my master, Karl. It's the first anniversary of us working together so this is a special occasion. Would you be [willing] to help?'\nYou say, 'I am willing.'\nNorten Magmaflinger says 'Excellent! I'm looking for a sizable quantity of Lavaborn Steel and one Steamforge Anvil. You should look around in Lichen Creep and Steam Factory. I'll be waiting for your return!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gifts of Steel'.\n10 x Lavaborn Steel - from lavaborn golems in Lichen Creep (\"in a room filled with lava near the center of the zone\")\n1x Steamforge Anvil - from a steamforge anvil transporter in the Steam Factory. There are five transporters found on the catwalks at 1090, -337 (the ones leading to the Clankwrench event area). They hit for a max ~6,100.\nReward:\nEleventh Shard of Emerald\nAC: 30\nHP: +80 MANA: +80 ENDUR: +80\nSV CORRUPTION: +10\nRecommended level of 85. Required level of 80.\nSubmitted by: Numerous folks on the Akz EQ ForumsRewards:\n- Eleventh Shard of Amethyst [item=88888]\n- Eleventh Shard of Emerald [item=88801]\n- Eleventh Shard of Granite [item=88817]\n- Eleventh Shard of Jade [item=88803]\n- Eleventh Shard of Malachite [item=88969]\n- Eleventh Shard of Ruby [item=88842]\n- Eleventh Shard of Sapphire [item=88904]\n- Eleventh Shard of Topaz [item=88971]\n- Eleventh Shard of Turquoise [item=88867]\n[",
