        { id = 89268, name = "Gem of Bound Voidsouls", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 75\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task is still active as of September 2011.\nThis task begins with Skal Nethus in the Plane of Knowledge. He's an Erudite found at location -320, 1200, -111 (close to Franklin Teek).\nYou say, 'Hail, Skal Nethus'\nSkal Nethus says 'Come closer! You smell...odd. Yes, have you been crawling around in dungeons? I smell the bacterial spores on your armor. You should be careful: [dungeon rot] will make you unpleasant in ways worse than odor.'\nYou say, 'What is dungeon rot?'\nSkal Nethus says 'Adventures pass through here all the time, wreaking of the stuff. It seems to be spreading through dungeons everywhere. Just last week I was accosted by a putrid, infected halfling. He accused me of wanting to steal his powers. His skin was boiling red, and a cloud of spores billowed about his body. He lifted me above his head and tossed me into a fountain. His [anger] was five times his body size, and I was afraid for my life.'\nYou say, 'What was up with his anger?'\nSkal Nethus says 'Creatures infected with Dungeon Rot have augmented [strength] and rage. How else would a halfling overpower someone as large and fits as I? I am not positive, but I think the Rot spreads more easily to creatures with anger running through their veins. That is why I resisted the halfing's infection: I am a naturally calm, composed individual.'\nYou say, 'What strength?'\nSkal Nethus says 'Ah, you know me too well. Yes, my interest in the Rot is not wholly selfless. I would like to find a way to cure adventurers of this blight, but I am sure it would be possible to manipulate the compounds of the disease in order to safely [augment] one's strength. Doubtless, it would be safer than my previous experiments with those [Voidsouls].'\nYou say, 'What Voidsouls?'\nSkal Nethus says 'I accidentally opened a portal to the Void, and souls escaped into Norrath and possessed many creatures. If you [capture] them for me, I can steal them inside this gem.'\nYou say, 'I will capture them'\nSkal Nethus says 'Thank you, adventurer. '\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Escaped Voidsouls'.\nSearch for the escaped Voidsouls in Lavastorm Mountains, Blightfire Moors, Firiona Vie, the Gulf of Gunthak, Goru`kar Mesa, the Broken Shores of Natimbi, the Broodlands, the Bloodfields, the Barren Coast, Arcstone, the Elddar Forest, the Loping Plains, and Old Blackburrow.\n- Deliver 1 Weak Tarnished Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nWeak Tarnished Voidsoul [item=89304] is in Lavastorm Mountains [zone=31] - Level 20\n- Deliver 1 Tarnished Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nTarnished Voidsoul [item=89290] is in Blightfire Moors [zone=432] - Level 25\n- Deliver 1 Strong Tarnished Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nStrong Tarnished Voidsoul [item=89701] is in Firiona Vie [zone=71] - Level 30\n- Deliver 1 Weak Shadowed Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nWeak Shadowed Voidsoul [item=89344] is in Gulf of Gunthak [zone=179] - Level 35\n- Deliver 1 Shadowed Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nShadowed Voidsoul [item=89289] is in Goru`kar Mesa [zone=434] - Level 40\n- Deliver 1 Strong Shadowed Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nStrong Shadowed Voidsoul [item=89275] is in Natimbi, the Broken Shores [zone=237] - Level 45\n- Deliver 1 Weak Blackened Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nWeak Blackened Voidsoul [item=89295] is in Broodlands [zone=274] - Level 50\n- Deliver 1 Blackened Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nBlackened Voidsoul [item=89269] is in The Bloodfields [zone=260] - Level 55\n- Deliver 1 Strong Blackened Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nStrong Blackened Voidsoul [item=89298] is in Barren Coast [zone=469] - Level 60\n- Deliver 1 Weak Black Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nWeak Black Voidsoul [item=89306] is in Arcstone, Isle of Spirits [zone=333] - Level 65\n- Deliver 1 Black Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nBlack Voidsoul [item=89297] is in Elddar Forest [zone=340] - Level 70\n- Deliver 1 Strong Black Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nStrong Black Voidsoul [item=89194] is in Loping Plains [zone=529] - Level 75\n- Deliver 1 Midnight Voidsoul to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nMidnight Voidsoul [item=89285] is in Old Blackburrow [zone=614] - Level 75\n- Speak with Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nYou say, 'Hail, Skal Nethus'\nSkal Nethus says, 'Thank you for returning all the Voidsouls. My, they seem to have grown in power! Already it has taken all my magical knowledge to keep them bound to me. With the last of my ability, I have trapped them inside this gem. But now that I have finished, I do not want it. It may prove too much for me if the souls were ever to escape again. Here, you take the gem, as a reward for your troubles. You can handle it, for you are more powerful than I.'\nThe above 13 items come from the 13 hotzones added with the June 9, 2010, patch (in order):\nLavastorm Mountains\nBlightfire Moors\nFiriona Vie\nGulf of Gunthak\nGoru`Kar Mesa\nNatimbi, the Broken Shores\nThe Broodlands\nThe Bloodfields\nBarren Coast\nArcstone, Isle of Spirits\nThe Elddar Forest\nLoping Plains\nOld Blackburrow\nWhen killing regular mobs in these zones, they can turn into a mob called \"The Voidsoul Possessed.\" These mobs drop a \"_____ Voidsoul\" item unique to its zone.\n605 platinum\nExperience (how much?)\nGem of Bound Voidsouls\nMAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM NO TRADE AUGMENTATION\nAugmentation type: 7 8\nSlot: HEAD FACE EAR NECK SHOULDERS ARMS BACK\nWRIST RANGE HANDS PRIMARY SECONDARY FINGER\nCHEST LEGS FEET WAIST\nAC: 15\nMANA: +30 ENDUR: +30\nRequired level of 75.\nWT: 0.0 Size: TINY\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALL Submitted by: missjackieRewards:\n- Gem of Bound Voidsouls [item=89268]\n[",
