      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 90\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nTilbok Furrunner will recharge your Mask of Espionage for you if you hand it to him.\nHe's found at -145, -1975, 75 in Katta Castellum. This is on the second floor of the castle-looking building near the graveyard. Go up the stairs and hang a right. He's in the last room on your left.\nLocation for \"katta.txt\" map file:\nP 1973.9192, 161.6429, 71.0020, 240, 240, 0, 3, Tilbok_Furrunner\nOn handing in the mask:\nTilbok Furrunner says 'I see you've spoken with Condor, and no doubt he told you I can recharge this for you. Well, it's true, but don't go around telling everyone. It's not something I like to make public, you know. Keep up the good work, though, we all appreciate it around here.'Submitted by: TorrinTookRewards:\n- Mask of Espionage [item=7126]\n[",
