      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 60\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest is only available on progression servers before Gates of Discord unlocks.\nIt starts with a skunk named Debbis the Fish [npc=37371].\nYou say, 'Hail, Debbis the Fish'\nDebbis the Fish sighs. 'If only I could walk in somebody elses shoes just for a day. It's not easy being a skunk you know.'\nKill Sniffles [npc=6746] to spawn Stomples [npc=37362] and loot its Rabbit Foot [item=56139]. Then turn in the Rabbit Foot to Debbis the Fish:\nDebbis the Fish says, 'Oh wow! A rabbit's foot! Thank you so much. Here take this, I won't need this smelly thing any more.'\nYour faction standing with Denizens of Mischief has been adjusted by 2.\nReward:\nLucky Skunk Foot [item=56010]Rewards:\n- Lucky Skunk Foot [item=56010]\n[",
