      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 10\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Group\n**Min. # of Players:** 3\n**Max. # of Players:** 6\n\nThis is a group task (3-6 players) that was introduced in October 2005, and is available every year around Halloween.\nIt's one of five tasks required to receive a Bone Mask of Horror [quest=5371] (illusion click item).\nIt begins with Barsin, the Bone Collector at location -110, 25 in Kithicor (north edge of the lake in the southeastern part of the zone).\nYou say, 'Hail, Barsin, the Bone Collector'\nBarsin, the Bone Collector says 'You there! Yes you! You look like the type that isn't scared off easily. I have a few projects that I'm working on and need someone to retrieve a few [bones] for me.'\nYou say, 'What bones?'\nBarsin, the Bone Collector says 'I can use all types really. I have a rare give with bones you see. I'm able to fashion just about anything out of an adequate collection of them. The problem is that I'm running low on bones for my [projects].'\nYou say, 'What projects?'\nBarsin, the Bone Collector says 'I don't have any specific projects at the moment. It's the bones that tell me what to make. If you can collect this [list] of bones I'd be happy to see what sort of things I could make with them.'\nYou say, 'What list?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Bone Collector'.\nThere are many places you could collect bones from, but some of the more exotic bones are harder to obtain. Here's a list of some of the more interesting bones I'd like. See if you can collect them and then we'll see what sort of creation they will make.\nNOTE: This task varies by your group's average level. You may be sent to different zones from what's shown here depending on level.\nLevel 20 Version\n- Loot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Befallen)\n- Loot 2 Warbone Chips 0/2 (Estate of Unrest)\n- Loot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Kurn's Tower)\n- Deliver 8 Bone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/6 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Deliver 2 Warbone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/2 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Wait for Barsin to examine the bones 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Destroy the bone construct 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nExperience\n1x \"Bristlebane's Ticket of Admission\" (for everyone in the task)\nPossible loot:\nCarved Bone Totem\nLevel 41 version\n- Loot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Tower of Frozen Shadow)\n- Retrieve 2 bone chips from plaguebone skeletons 0/2 (ALL)\n- Loot 2 Iced Bone Chips 0/2 (Lower Guk)\n- Deliver 6 Bone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/6 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Deliver 2 Iced Bone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/2 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Wait for Barsin to examine the bones 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Destroy the bone construct 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nExperience\n1x \"Bristlebane's Ticket of Admission\" (for everyone in the task)\nPossible loot:\nEngraved Bone Earring\nLevel 60 version\nLoot 1 Ghast Fingerbones 0/1 (Plane of Hate)\nThese drop from ire ghasts.\nLoot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Old Sebilis)\nThese drop from skeleton mobs in the crypt.\nCollect a dragon rib from the Dragon Necropolis and return with it 0/1 (Dragon Necropolis)\nDeliver 1 Ghast Fingerbones to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nDeliver 4 Bone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nWait for Barsin to examine the bones 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n\"a bone construct\" spawns and attacks.\nDestroy the bone construct 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\nKill it to update the quest.\nWhew that was close. I don't know why the bones turned on you like that, they've never done that before. I'm sure my next work will be perfect though!\nExperience\n1x \"Bristlebane's Ticket of Admission\" (for everyone in the task)\nPossible loot:\nBone-Studded Cloak\nCarved Bone Totem\nConstruct's Blackened Bone Earring\nGlowing Skull Pendant\nLevel 69+ version\n- Loot 1 Splintered Discordling Bone 0/1 (Wall of Slaughter)\n- Loot 4 Bone Chips 0/4 (Plane of Nightmare)\n- Collect some dragon skull fragments from the dragon necropolis and return with it. 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Deliver 1 Splintered Discordling Bone to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Deliver 4 Bone Chips to Barsin, the Bone Collector 0/1 (Kithicor Forest )\n- Wait for Barsin to examine the bones 0/1 (Kithicor Forest)\n- Destroy the bone construct 0/1 (Kithicor Forest))\nExperience\n1x \"Bristlebane's Ticket of Admission\" (for everyone in the task)\nPossible loot:\nConstruct's Blackened Bone EarringSubmitted by: Egat Boneskinner, Erollisi Marr - The Nameless ServerRewards:\n- Bone-Studded Cloak [item=63001]\n- Bristlebane's Ticket of Admission [item=45441]\n- Carved Bone Totem [item=62023]\n- Construct's Blackened Bone Earring [item=61394]\n- Glowing Skull Pendant [item=62210]\n- Spell: Illusion: Frost Bone [item=61079]\n[",
