    {
      id = "5372",
      title = "Nights of the Dead: Terror of Illis Taberish",
      exp = "01",
      exp_name = "The Ruins of Kunark",
      min_lvl = 10,
      max_lvl = 125,
      quest_type = "Task",
      repeatable = true,
      group_size = "Solo",
      npc = "player",
      loc = { y = -1700.0, x = -3200.0, z = 0.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Illis Taberish",
        "What",
        "Skinwalker?",
        "Evil?",
        "I",
        "coming",
        "Skinwalker",
        "evil",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 94965, name = "Vampire Bat", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 10\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 3\n\nThis is a shared task (1-3 players) that was introduced in October 2010 and is available every year around Halloween.\nIt begins with a dwarf named Illis Taberish at about 300, 350 in the Plane of Knowledge (near the main bank).\nYou say, 'Hail, Illis Taberish'\nIllis Taberish says 'Tis coming, [coming] to take yer souls! And den it be too late!'\nYou say, 'What's coming?'\nIllis Taberish says 'Da [Skinwalker] o'course! Yer worst nightmare in da flesh! It takes yer soul ana' takes yer very being.'\nYou say, 'Skinwalker?'\nIllis Taberish says 'Nobody knows where it comes from. At dis point, I tink it matters not. But I knows what I seen, ana' I knows [evil] when I sees it!'\nYou say, 'Evil?'\nIllis Taberish says 'Vile an' despicable tings it does to one ana' all! But stopped it can be! Gather da shards its dark soul forms when it takes o'er a body, ana' [bring] dem back to me. I can take it from dere. Den, we can put a stop to dis creature!'\nYou say, 'I'll bring them to you'\nIllis Taberish says 'Yous must head to da Field of Scale ana find da skinwalker in whatever form 'tis taken. Destroy its shell and retrieve da shard. Once yous 'ave da best number o' shards, bring dem to me. We just might beat dis ting yet!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Terror of Illis Taberish'.\nIllis Taberish is terrified of the existence, and the possible increase in power, of a being he refers to as a Skinwalker. You will need to find this being and take the shards of its soul back to Illis. He is convinced that this is the only way to stop it.\nFind and kill a Distorted Soul near the columns on the road to East Cabilis. Loot a piece of the Skinwalker's shard from the slain distorted soul.\nThis is the highest level version of the task. For lower level versions, see below.\nFind and kill a distorted soul 0/1 (Field of Scale)\nFind and kill a distorted soul 0/1 (Field of Scale)\nFind and kill a distorted soul 0/1 (Field of Scale)\nFind and kill a distorted soul 0/1 (Field of Scale)\nRetrieve 4 Skinwalker Shards 0/4 (Field of Scale)\nDeliver 4 Skinwalker Shards 0/4 (Plane of Knowledge)\nTrebor Ollijurt, Sral Umbric, Krit Haemit, and Semaj Fetheld can be found in the Field of Scale in the vicinity of -2110, 2867, -50, around the column archways near the Cabilis zone line.\nThey are outside each other's aggro ranges, stunnable, and mezzable. They each hit for a max ~5,800 and have an average amount of hitpoints.\nKill them, loot their shards, and take them to Illis to complete the task.\nIllis Taberish says 'Ah! Yous 'ave da foul tings shards! A right good job yous done! Now maybe I can find a way o' makin' sure it stays gone!'\nYou have returned the shards to Illis before the Skinwalker could become too strong.\n105 platinum\nExperience (about 0.5 AAs worth at Level 90)\nVampire Bat\nFlag for the Halloween mission \"Under Your Skin [quest=5373]\"\nAlternate Versions\nLevel 1-10: Nektulos Forest (Lorna Sheecot; Saldis Oro; Petra Grenal; Piolo Meesker in the northeastern part of the zone)\nLevel 10-20: Lake of Ill Omen (Kano Burber; Lendal Fobins; Liskard; Shay Talgot at around -1700, -3200 -- southeastern part of the zone; north of the windmill area)\nLevel 20-30: Firiona Vie (Igo Pho; Meego Battledrum; Schalter Gringham; Tenos Aryvin at around -2800, -2700 -- east-central part of the zone by the coast)\nLevel 30-40: Emerald Jungle (Hael Nebur; Jolee Winqer; Pas Neep Arda; Salohcin Bilox at around 4000, -2700 -- in the very far northeastern corner of the zone)\nLevel 40-50: Goru`Kar Mesa (Thob Runtskil; Racso Gundar; Nonnahs Sernwall; Aliq Reet at around location 850, 1730 -- the narrow valley in the north-central part of the zone)\nLevel 50-60: Barren Coast (Amoro Bosckillio; Fellot Newten; Onda Granst; Kellar Dinit at around 50, -1000, 40 -- the turtle island in the east-central part of the zone)\nLevel 60-70: The Steppes (Jaecen Oel; Nella Vond; Djando Kordisan; Trawets Deeve in the central part of the zone around location -245, 375)\nLevel 70-80: Loping Plains (Allistan Fenner; Calaen Demre; Jae Hunol; Wendel Mummershen at around 500, 1600 -- due south of the druid ring towards the water)Rewards:\n- Vampire Bat [item=94965]\n[",
