      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Plagus Ladeson'\nPlagus Ladeson says, 'Greetings, ______, and welcome to the bunker. Are you a [new warrior] or a [veteran]?'\nYou say, 'I'm a veteran.'\nlagus Ladeson says, 'I apologize for not knowing. I am new to the bunker. I was a trainer at the Hall of Steel in Qeynos before this. I left Qeynos in search of [Milea] and instead found myself joining the bunker's weaponmasters.'\nYou say, 'Who is Milea?'\nPlagus Ladeson says, 'Milea Clothspinner. She was my one true love. She, too, is a Steel Warrior. When she left Qeynos in search of adventure, my heart left also. I never saw her again, but I decided to transfer my skills to Freeport. It is probably best I did not find her. She was in love with adventure.  The woman I am attracted to are always in love with another. Just like [Toala].'\nYou say, 'She's in East Karana.'\nPlagus Ladeson says, 'You have seen Milea Clothspinner! This is great news! I wish I could travel to see her, but Cain will not allow me to do so at this time. You must take her a note for me. Here, take this to her. As a master in this order, I command you to do so immediately. Go!'\nYou receive a Sealed Note.\nUpon giving the note to Milea Clothspinner:\nMilea Clothspinner says, 'Oh great! I thought I'd seen the last of Plagus, or as all the women in the Steel Warriors called him, the Plague. Please do not tell him where I am. It must have been a long journey for you. Here. A little something for your wasted trip. I found it on the ground. Have fun going back to Freeport.'\nYour standing with Steel Warriors got better.\nYour standing with Guards of Qeynos got better.\nYour standing with Corrupt Qeynos Guards got worse.\nYour standing with The Freeport Militia got worse.\nYour standing with Knights of Truth got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nNeed other quest rewards if any.Rewards:\n- Backpack [item=2364]\n- Blackened Iron Coif [item=1432]\n- Cloth Shawl [item=995]\n- Damask Cap [item=1411]\n- Gold Ring [item=12989]\n- Grizzly Hide Cloak [item=2158]\n- Rusty Spear [item=631]\n- Rusty Two Handed Hammer [item=3609]\n[",
