      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Expedition\n**Group Size:** Raid\n**Min. # of Players:** 6\n**Max. # of Players:** 54\n\nRain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis raid expedition begins in the Western Wastes at the portal to the Temple of Veeshan. Beside the portal is a crystal. Click the crystal to spawn \"a temple custodian\".\nPre-Requisites for Requesting the Raid:\n- None\nPre-Requisites for Participating in the Raid:\n- None\na temple custodian shimmers into view as you touch the crystal, almost as if it read your thoughts and knew your desires.\nYou say, 'Hail, a temple custodian'\na temple custodian speaks though it utters no sound. The words seem to form within your mind. \"All that you knew before is lost, yet not lost, and is new again. Do you wish to [enter] the temple?\"\nYou say, 'I wish to enter'\na temple custodian speaks, the words echoing in your mind. \"You have been warned, traveler. Speak to me again when you are [ready].\"\nTemple of Fear's Fall is now available to you.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Corrupted Temple.\nThis is a fully spawned instanced version of the northern wing of the original Temple of Veeshan.\nThere are 13 dragons in the zone (links point to individual event and loot listings):\nAaryonar [quest=6117]\nCekenar [quest=6118]\nDagarn the Destroyer [quest=6119]\nJorlleag [quest=6120]\nLady Mirenilla [quest=6121]\nLady Nevederia [quest=6122]\nLord Feshlak [quest=6123]\nLord Koi`Doken [quest=6124]\nLord Kreizenn [quest=6125]\nLord Vyemm [quest=6126]\nSevalak [quest=6127]\nZlexak [quest=6128]\nVulak`Aerr [quest=6129]\nThere is no set order for fighting them, although you may want to save Vulak`Aerr for last...Rewards:\n[",
