      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nDargon McPherson (Warrior Guildmaster) is located in northeast Halas at +472, -449, +3.75. He's on Find (Ctrl+F). You must be Amiable to Wolves of the North to obtain this quest.\nYou say, 'Hail, Dargon McPherson'\nDargon McPherson says 'Hail, mighty ______! I assume ye must be a [warrior o' the Wolves]. Why else would ye approach a trainer such as meself, then?'\nYou say, 'I am a warrior o' the Wolves.'\nDargon McPherson says 'Aye, 'tis as I thought. I'm glad t' see we've warriors such as yerself amongst the Wolves o' the North. Lately, Kylan's been allowing too many scrawny warriors in, methinks. Nor have they fared well in Everfrrost. Many frreeze to death, ye know... Will ye assist me and [deliver an elixir to young warriors] in Everfrost?'\nYou say, 'I will deliver an elixir to young warriors.'\nDargon McPherson says 'Ach, 'tis good o' ye! Take this bottle of elixir to Everfrost Peaks. Find Talin O'Donal. He'll take the first sip, and then instruct ye on who else ye need to find. Do that, and I'll give ye a fine reward when ye return the empty elixir bottle. Good luck, then. Don't die.'\nYou receive a Full Bottle of Elixir [item=38369].\nTalin ODonal is at +3620, +670 in the tunnel in Everfrost, near the two female merchants.\nYou say, 'Hail, Talin O`Donal'\nTalin O`Donal says 'Brrrrrr!! Grr.. Grreetings. It is freezing out here!!'\nGive him the elixir.\nTalin O`Donal says 'Mmmm.. I feel much warmer. Thank you. You should now find Bryndin McMill. He could use a swig also. I saw him hanging around two other guards.'\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive back a less-full bottle of elixir named One Quarter of Elixir [item=38371].\nBryndin McMill [npc=637] is located at at +2038, -1153, down the ramp, then east, next to a tree and a wolf named Snowflake [npc=649].\nYou say, 'Hail, Bryndin McMill'\nBryndin McMill says 'H-ha.. H-hai.. Hail!! It is v-v-very.. C-cold out here. You sh-sh-should light a c-c-campfire.'\nGive him the elixir.\nBryndin McMill says 'Ahhh!! I feel warm all over. Thanks. You should go give Arnis McLish a drink of this elixir. Last time I saw him he was headed toward Blackburrow.'\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive back a less-full bottle of elixir named One Half of Elixir [item=38370].\nArnis McLish [npc=636] may be found in the southeast corner of the zone at -1600, -170.  If he isn't there, wait a bit and he'll come running back.\nYou say, 'Hail, Arnis McLish'\nArnis McLish says 'My word!! I cannot believe how cold it is out here. I must keep running around just to keep warm.'\nGive him the elixir.\nArnis McLish says 'Mmmm.. Thank you stranger. I feel a lot warmer now. You should now go and find [Megan] O'Reilly.'\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive back a less-full bottle of elixir One Quarter of Elixir [item=38372].\nYou say, 'Where is Megan?'\nArnis McLish says 'I heard she got lost on the plains. You should go ask her dog, Snowflake, where she is. I hear he is somewhere around the pass to Halas.'\nHead back again to the previous spot at +2021, -1159.\nYou say, 'Hail, Snowflake'\nSnowflake says 'Grrrrrr!!'\nYou say, 'Where is Megan?'\nSnowflake says 'Ruff.. Ruff.. Woof..'\nFollow Snowflake [npc=649] east across the tundra, ending up at the North Tower at +2060, -3890.  If Megan O`Reilly [npc=638] is not there, wait for her return (from a patrol) or respawn (orcs attacked her).\nYou say, 'Hail, Megan OReilly'\nMegan OReilly says 'Brrrr.. It.. Is sooo.. c-cold!! I never.. sh-should've j-joined.. the.. the W-wolves of the N-north!!'\nGive her the One Quarter of Elixir.\nMegan OReilly says 'Oh thank you. Sorry, but the bottle is empty now. I hope you did't need any. Take the empty bottle back to Dargon. He may refill it for you.'\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive an Empty Bottle of Elixir [item=38367].\nReturn to Dargon in Halas and give him the Empty Bottle of Elixir.\nDargon McPherson says 'Ye've proven yerself to be a cut above the rest and aided yer fellow warriors, no matter how worthless they were. Ye may take this. It was found in the snow by one of our foraging parties. I hope it can be of use to a warrior like yerself.'\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Steel Warriors has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 1 copper from Dargon McPherson.\nYou have completed achievement: Halas Quests - Magic Elixir for the Warriors\nReward:\na random low level item\nSubmitted by: Kyll, revised writeup by VoidCadetRewards:\n- Black Burrow Stout [item=18047]\n- Copper Band [item=5561]\n- Lapis Lazuli [item=5069]\n- Small Lantern [item=10164]\n- Tattered Cloth Sandal [item=1722]\n- Throwing Axe [item=21117]\n- Turquoise [item=7779]\n[",
