      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nIn the Tink 'N Bubble at night there is an NPC named Grype. He spawns in the same place as Clerk Doval. If you hail him, he'll just be finishing his ale. Go buy four Cabilis Pale Ales and give them to him. You'll be rewarded with a loud burp, some experience, and coin.\nHe'll also tell you not to mess with a Blue Talon. If you ask him what a Blue Talon is he'll take a swipe at you (text, not an actual attack) and tell you that the Blue Talons were the bruisers of the westside. Whether or not there is more to this is unknown.Rewards:\n- Experience, Coin\n[",
