      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 3\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nJondin in West Cabilis asks if you would gather bone chips, but in reality he needs Bone Granite Powder.  To make bone granite powder, combine in a forge, 1 bone chip + 1 bone chip + 1 pile of granite pebbles + 1 forging hammer. Return the powder to him for a reward, occasionally a Kromdul Toothpick.  Rewards:\n- Kromdul Toothpick [item=632]\n[",
