      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 85\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nRain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview | Group Progression & Task List | Raid Progression | Visible Armor\nThis task begins with the shadowed figure named Sister Fealcrest in Shard's Landing (this is the north-central portal: 970, -120, 1).\nYou say, 'Hail, Sister Fealcrest'\nSister Fealcrest's eyes flick up at you as you approach. Her vow of silence restricts her voice, but you both already know what must be done. Her Maiden's plane needs saving, and you'll need to [attune] yourself to accomplish it.\nYou say, 'Attune?'\nA crystal shard hovers in the shadowy corner of the tent. You reach out to grab it and it floats into your hand.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Plane of Shadow Portal Activation'.\nActivate the Dire Tuning Crystal 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nEnter the Plane of Shadow from its actual access point. This is at -210, -900, -43 in Vex Thal. Step out of the zone's entrance hallway and take an immediate left (south) where you'll see the purple shard.\nFor your \"vexthal.txt\" map:\nP 897.2314, 209.9796, -43.9980,  0, 0, 0,  1,  Plane_of_Shadow\nThere, click on the crystal to zone in and right-click the Dire Tuning Crystal. Then return to Shard's Landing to complete the task.\nReturn to Shard's Landing 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (minor)\nAllows you to use the crater portal to the Plane of ShadowRewards:\n[",
