      loc = { y = -320.0, x = 1200.0, z = -111.0 },
      triggers = {
        "Hail, Skal Nethus",
        "I haven",
        "What journey?",
        "What flower?",
        "What task?",
        "I",
        "dreams",
        "journey",
      },
      items_required = {
      },
      rewards = {
        { id = 112112, name = "Udumbara", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 90\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis task begins with Skal Nethus (map) in the Plane of Knowledge. He's an Erudite found at location -320, 1200, -111 (close to Franklin Teek, just east of the Guild Lobby).\nYou say, 'Hail, Skal Nethus'\nSkal Nethus says 'Adventurer, you have not seen any strange apparitions in your [dreams] lately, have you?'\nYou say, 'I haven't had any strange dreams'\nSkal Nethus says 'Thank the gods! Then it is not too late! After my last, uh, mishap with Dungeon Rot, I went on a walking [journey] across Norrath, to clear my head and think of my next venture. Eventually night found me in the Feerrott, and I laid my head down upon a mossy statue to [sleep].'\nYou say, 'What journey?'\nSkal Nethus says 'Ah, you're interested in my journey? Well, it's quite a story. While traveling, I came across a dusty old book. It tells the story of a legendary [flower], the Udumbara, that blooms once every three-thousand years.'\nYou say, 'What flower?'\nSkal Nethus says 'That's right! A natural artifact so powerful, it is rumored the Gods themselves limited its recurrence in Norrath. But there is a catch: the alchemist who wrote this book found a way to grow the flower artificially, though it is no easy [task].'\nYou say, 'What task?'\nSkal Nethus says 'Hmm... where to start? You'll have to travel to many dangerous areas of Norrath and recover a series of [artifacts], some natural, some crafted by unknowns. Once you have, come talk to me and I'll instruct you on what to do with them. Be very careful though, mysterious natural forces are at work and will be looking for these artifacts too!'\nYou say, 'I'll find the artifacts!'\nSkal Nethus says 'Very well, here is a list of where you can look for them. Good luck to you!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Udumbara, the flower of legend'.\nAll items in this task are found in the hot zones that were introduced on June 19, 2013.\nMobs in these zones will randomly morph into a treant (does not change its name or abilities; only changes form into a small green treant). When that happens, that mob will drop the item.\nNOTE: It's possible (not confirmed) that only specific mob types have a chance to morph into a treant. It's also possible (again not confirmed) that the mob type can vary by the day (or some period of time). Update to the NOTE: looking at bestiary entries of the past few years it really looks like these are zone randoms and not specific NPC (again not confirmed)\nAll items are pre-lootable.\n- Deliver 1 Soul of the Wilderness to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Warsliks Wood in the cave that is the entrance to Crypt of Dalnir. (kill \"an iksar lookout\"; \"a skulking brute\", and various scaled wolves for the Soul of the Wilderness).\n- Deliver 1 Scorching Light of the Heavens to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Marus Seru (confirmed from \"A Hand of Seru\"; \"a Greyhopper\"; \"a Crumbling Stonegrabber\"; \"a Weathered Stonegrabber\").\n- Deliver 1 Alpine Light of the Heavens to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Frontier Mountains (confirmed from \"a burynai cenobite\"; \"a mountain giant tump\"; \"a Sarnak knight\"; \"a mountain giant brae\").\n- Deliver 1 Water of Plenty to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Dawnshroud Peaks (confirmed from \"A Rockhopper\", \"a wolf\"; yellow fungus mobs).\n- Deliver 1 Tears of Karana to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Jaggedpine Forest (confirmed from \"a black panther\", \"a black pinewolf\"; \"a giant anaconda\"; \"a grey pinewolf\"; \"a greenwood grizzly\").\n- Deliver 1 Ashes of Kunark to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Burning Woods (confirmed from \"a forest giant ancient\", \"a forest giant arbor\", \"a forest giant verdant\", \"a sarnak avenger\", \"a sarnak knight\", \"a tatterback gorilla\").\n- Deliver 1 Ancient Compost Box to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Corathus Creep (confirmed from \"a corathus squirmer\", \"a slithering corathus\" and \"a creep reaper\").\n- Deliver 1 Blood Infused Soil to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Bloodfields in the circular rooms that are at the zones to City of Dranik and Dranik's Scar. (confirmed from \"a dragorn commoner\"; \"a dragorn peon\", \"Sentry of Kaavi\").\n- Deliver 1 Infrangible Bottle to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Undershore (confirmed from \"an Illsalin soldier\", \"a witheran gnasher\", \"a splorgath\", \"a basilisk\").\n- Deliver 1 Flawless Air of the Plane to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Plane of Air, otherwise known as \"Eryslai, the Kingdom of Wind\" (confirmed from \"a fearsome stormrider\", \"a stormrider lightningclaw\", phoenix mobs and \"A Nilborien Servant\").\n- Deliver 1 Sunlight Prism Box to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Wall of Slaughter (confirmed from \"girplans along the path to Anguish\").\n- Deliver 1 Serene Light of the Heavens to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in Oceangreen Hills (confirmed from \"a Blackburrow lurker\"; \"a zombie bombardier\").\n- Deliver 1 Antipodal Light of the Heavens to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Hills of Shade (confirmed from \"a Kirathas villager\"; \"thorned mulch\").\n- Deliver 1 Damp Fog of the Field to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Old Bloodfields (confirmed from \"nocs and kyvs\").\n- Deliver 1 Blood of Lunanyn to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Valley of Lunanyn (confirmed from the \"reega\" mobs in the mephit tunnels).\n- Deliver 1 Portable Greenhouse of Thule to Skal Nethus 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nThis is found in the Grounds (confirmed from \"a souring treant\"; rotdogs; peponnites).\n- Ask Skal what comes next! 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nYou say, 'Hail, Skal Nethus'\nOutstanding! I cannot believe you were able to recover all of them. Well, almost all of them. I was not entirely honest with you. This is the final item you'll need. I was keeping it in case you would not return. Take it, and take this recipe: follow it to the letter and you shall have Udumbara!\n605 platinum\nExperience\nYou also receive back all 16 items, an Ancient Seed, and The Legend of Udumbara (a book that details steps required to assemble an augmentation, \"Udumbara\").\nAshes of Kunark + Blood Infused Soil + Blood of Lunanyn combined within Ancient Compost Box = Udumbara Fertilizer\nWater of Plenty + Tears of Karana + Damp Fog of the Field combined within Infrangible Bottle = Udumbara Water\nScorching Light of the Heavens + Alpine Light of the Heavens + Serene Light of the Heavens + Antipodal Light of the Heavens combined within Sunlight Prism Box = Udumbara Sun\nAncient Seed + Soul of the Wilderness + Udumbara Fertilizer + Udumbara Water + Udumbara Sun + Flawless Air of the Plane combined within Portable Greenhouse of Thule = Udumbara\nUdumbara\nMAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM NO TRADE AUGMENTATION\nAugmentation type: 7 8\nSlot: HEAD FACE EAR NECK SHOULDERS ARMS BACK WRIST HANDS PRIMARY SECONDARY FINGER CHEST LEGS FEET WAIST\nAC: 28\nSTA: 0+4 WIS: 0+4 INT: 0+4 HP: +170 MANA: +120 ENDUR: +120\nRequired level of 90.\nWT: 0.0 Size: TINY\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALLRewards:\n- Udumbara [item=112112]\n[",
