      walkthrough = "**Level:** 14\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAt the end of the previous quest, Lord Gikzic said it was for another Lord of Pain to decide whether you would wield the knight's khukri.  Lord Korzin may be found at +1060, -170 (in the same room with Gikzic).\nYou say, 'Hail, Lord Korzin'\nLord Korzin says 'What is it you seek? Eternal suffering?'\nYou say, 'I seek eternal suffering.'\nLord Korzin says, 'Then follow the words of Cazic-Thule and may his blessed curses rain upon your soul as they shall on all of his faithful servants.'\nYou say, 'i accept the calling'\nLord Korzin says, 'As if you had a choice. Seek out the tower of Kurn and find the Skull of Torture. You should be able to easily recognize this skull as it glows with the power of Cazic-Thule. Return it to me with your squire's khukri and I shall reward you with the knight's khukri. Go at once.'\nGo to Kurn's Tower and loot A Glowing Skull (identifies as \"The Skull Of An Undead Cook\") from various scalebone skeletons. It's TEMPORARY, so don't camp until you've finished the quest. Hand it in.\nLord Korzin says 'You will be rewarded with the knight's khukri when I have possession of your squire's khukri and the Skull of Torture.'\nTurn in:\nLord Korzin says 'Excellent work! You are no squire. You are now a knight of the crusaders. Your next step shall be zealot. And every zealot wields a magical khukri.'\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 2.\nYou receive 1 gold from Lord Korzin.\nYou receive 1 platinum from Lord Korzin.\nYou receive your Knight's Khukri.Submitted by: SallassRewards:\n- Knight's Khukri [item=245]\n[",
