      walkthrough = "**Level:** 5\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nCindl (Tailoring Supplies) may be found at +300, -160, inside Mac's Kilts. She's on Find (Ctrl+F). She is on Merchants of Halas faction. At the end of the previous quest [quest=224], Cindl mentioned a [second job].\nYou say, 'What second job?'\nCindl says 'I've seen the warriors bringin' in items called 'wrath orc wristbands.' Apparently, they find them on the lifeless bodies o' the snow orc troopers. They're made from a skin I've yet to find. I'll gladly reward ye with either a rawhide tunic or leggings or even perhaps leather gloves, if ye like. All I'm askin' are two wrath orc wristbands.'\nWrath Orc Wristbands [item=3287] drop from a snow orc trooper [npc=648] and a snow orc shaman [npc=654] in Everfrost Peaks.  Hand in two.\nCindl says 'No reward until I've got TWO wrath orc wristbands!'\nCindl says 'Fine work, Hunter!! As yer reward, please accept this item which I've fashion'd fer ye.'\nYour faction standing with Merchants of Halas has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Wolves of the North has been adjusted by 7.\nYour faction standing with Shamen of Justice has been adjusted by 7.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou have completed achievement: Halas Quests - Cindl's Wristband CollectionSubmitted by: Juntao, revised write-up by VoidCadetRewards:\n- Large Raw-Hide Leggings [item=22262]\n- Leather Gloves [item=1540]\n- Raw-Hide Leggings [item=1281]\n- Raw-Hide Tunic [item=1965]\n[",
