      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 1\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis is a seasonal task (offered around Valentine's Day) given by Grimble Grumblemaker in the Plane of Knowledge. He's located at -280, 1510 (just northwest of the entrance to the Guild Lobby).\nYou say, 'Hail, Grimble Grumblemaker'\nGrimble Grumblemaker shuffles his feet on the stones. He sighs and looks at you from under his wrinkled brow. 'Why don't [they] like me?! I followed all the steps in 'A Tinkerer's Guide to Love:' Compliment Target, Demonstrate Superior Skill, Create Desire, and Kindle Love! I don't know what's wrong with me!'\nYou say, 'Who is 'they'?'\nGrimble Grumblemaker says 'You don't know who THEY are?! They're only the most beautiful, talented women in all of [Norrath]! They're elegant, determined, caring, lovely... everything that I would want my lady to be!'\nYou say, 'All of Norrath?'\nGrimble Grumblemaker says 'Yes, all of Norrath! I am an equal-opportunity appreciator of the female gender! From dark elves to iksar, there is no specimen of woman that I would kick out of my laboratory. For some reason, though, these Special Sixteen -- as I have come to call my beauties -- have all [rejected] my advances!'\nYou say, 'Rejected?'\nGrimble Grumblemaker says 'Yes, most of them cannot stand to look at me. But I have figured out how to secure their love! If you would be so kind as to [help] me, you will be rewarded. I may be small, but my brain is large, and I know how to use it!' Grimble mumbles under his breath, 'Why did that line never work on them?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nGrimble Grumblemaker says 'Oh, thank you! You are such a kind and beautiful soul! You will not regret this! Here is a list of their names and locations. I merely need a few gifts... a few hairs or pieces of loose skin from them. Don't worry! I don't want you to hurt them! Just a little pluck here or there when they're not looking... I just need at least five of them, please.' Grimble rubs his hands together and says to himself, 'This is going to be so good!''\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Perfect Companion'.\nGrimble Grumblemaker has made an odd request for you to bring him hair and skin -- 'gifts' he calls them -- from sixteen women of Norrath with whom he is infatuated. Despite any misgivings you might have, he has promised you a reward.\nOnce you have collected at least five 'gifts', return to Grimble and let him know what you have done.\nNote: All NPCs for this task show up on the Find feature (CTRL+F to bring it up in game).\nGet close to the NPC, and hail them. They tend to run away, so this may take a few attempts.\nNote: While you only need to collect five (there is no actual item; only hail updates) before returning to Grimble Grumblemaker, there is an achievement [quest=7480] and special item rewarded for getting all 16 updates.\nTake a lock of hair from Marnia McMensen 0/1 (Halas)\nTake a lock of hair from Sylnyk T`Vok 0/1 (Neriak Commons)\nTake a lock of hair from Tilliki 0/1 (Crescent Reach)\nTake a lock of hair from Myra Denghop 0/1 (South Kaladim)\nTake a lock of hair from Veintana Uralia 0/1 (Paineel)\nTake a piece of skin from Gilbina 0/1 (Mountains of Rathe)\nTake a lock of hair from Mekinti 0/1 (Ak'Anon)\nTake a lock of hair from Kirilin 0/1 (Northern Felwithe)\nTake a lock of hair from Smarta Bragglethin 0/1 (Rivervale)\nTake a lock of hair from Lalanis 0/1 (Southern Felwithe)\nTake a lock of hair from Karon 0/1 (South Qeynos)\nTake a piece of scale from Zarkrys 0/1 (East Cabilis)\nTake a lock of hair from Grenda 0/1 (Oggok)\nTake a lock of hair from Gorble 0/1 (Grobb)\nTake a lock of hair from Kalika 0/1 (Shar Vahl)\nTake a lock of hair from Alleana 0/1 (Greater Faydark)\nTell Grimble Grumblemaker about all the 'gifts' you have collected for him 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grimble Grumblemaker'\nGrimble Grumblemaker claps his hands with joy. He stuffs the disturbing 'gifts' into his pockets. 'Yes! This is wonderful! I can now infuse my clockwork with their essences! It will be the ultimate companion, the greatest woman in all of Norrath! And she will love me unconditionally! They will love me! The Special Sixteen are mine, all mine!' Grimble laughs to himself and clasps his hands. 'I suppose I should pay you... now leave me alone... I have a lot of work to do in my lab!\nYou feel somewhat dirty fulfilling Grimble Grumblemaker's desires, but at least no one was hurt. And you did it for love, right? It might be a strange, unnatural, obsessive love, but love nonetheless. Perhaps you will sleep better tonight by telling yourself that.\n1,237 platinum, 5 gold (at Level 100)\nExperience (\"a fair amount\" -- about 0.7% experience in Level 100)\n887pp and 3.75AA worth of xp (at Level 80)\nThere is also a bonus reward if you do all 16 steps:\nGrimble Grumblemaker searches his packs and retrieves a small bouquet of half wilted roses. He gives you an unnerving grin and speaks excitedly, 'My perfect woman will have no need for these gifts. Please, consider it an extra reward for your diligent service.'\nErollisi Day Flowers\nNO TRADE HEIRLOOM PLACEABLE\nSlot: RANGE PRIMARY SECONDARY\nThis item is placeable in yards, guild yards, houses, and guild halls.\nWT: 0.9 Size: SMALL\nClass: ALL\nRace: ALLRewards:\n- Erollisi Day Flowers [item=96831]\n[",
