      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 95\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Task\n**Time Limit:** 24:00:00\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nAnniversary events tend to run from mid-March to mid-April (sometimes to mid-May) each year. They are not available during the \"off season\".\nFor an overview and list of EverQuest Anniversary events, see this quest entry [quest=6782].\nThis task became available on live servers on Wednesday, April 23, 2014, but was then taken offline. It returned on Tuesday, April 29, 2014, and will remain available through to Wednesday, June 11, 2014.\nThis is an anniversary timed solo task (24-hour timer) introduced with EverQuest's 15th anniversary. It begins with Jimothy the Delicious (click for map image) in the Plane of Knowledge at /location 270, 300 (a little ways southeast of the main bank).\nNOTE: This task requires some running around and killing in static (non-instanced) zones. You'll want to leave yourself ample time to finish it before starting it.\nPre-Requisites for Requesting:\n- No tasks\n- Level 65\nNOTE: It is strongly recommended you read up on (and acquire) tradeskill components (listed in a section below) before requesting this task, as some of the components are rare or out-of-the-way to acquire.\nShopping List\nVendor:\n2 Bottle of Milk - PoK Chef\n1 Cup of Flour - PoK Chef\n8 Cup of Sugar - PoK Chef\n1 Butter - PoK Chef\n1 Almonds - PoK Chef\n1 Dried Vanilla Beans - PoK Chef - NO TRADE\n1 Vegetables - Crafted with ingredients from PoK Chef, or Foraged\n2 Bottle - PoK Brewer\n3 Water Flask - PoK Brewer\n2 Short Beer - PoK Brewer\n1 Anise - PoK Alchemist\n1 Fennel - PoK Alchemist\n1 Grande Wormwood - PoK Alchemist\n1 Kiola Nut - Ocean of Tears - Cleonae Kalen on zone-in island - good race illusion or use sneak -- not stackable until you brew it into Tumpy Tonic\n1 Blood Flower - Kael (Velious era) - Bjorak Stonefist - using sneak (shroud / persona) can help to raise the faction -- not stackable\nGround spawn:\n3 Corn Rose - Oceangreen Hills and Oceangreen Village\nForage:\n2 Drench Flower - Frontier Mountains\n2 Koraskian Sprigget - Rathe Council Chambers\nForage or Farm:\n1-2 Phoenix Egg - Dropped in Plane of Air, or Foraged in Temple of Marr\nFarm:\n2 Treant Flower - The Grounds, Morell's Castle, Valley of Lunanyn, etc\nSkill:\nyou need Baking skill minimum 30, even though the task combine is no fail\nyou need Brewing skill minimum 30, even though the task combine is no fail\nsomeone who can bake 151 trivial\nsomeone who can brew 300 trivial\nSteps & Summary\n- Say \"lend a matchmaking hand\" to request the task.\nSpeak to Grand Librarian Maelin 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Bloodstained) 0/5 (Dreadspire Keep)\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Smudged) 0/5 (The Library)\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Singed) 0/5 (Erudin Burning)\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nBake Magically Delicious Cookies 0/1 (ALL)\nBrew Magically Delicious Sweetwater 0/1 (ALL)\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nArrange a Beautiful Bouquet 0/1 (ALL)\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Beautiful Bouquet to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\nGive the Magically Delicious Cookies to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\nGive the Magically Delicious Sweetwater to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\n- Kill animated books in Dreadspire Keep, The Library, and Erudin Burning until you've gotten five updates from each zone.\n--- Grand Librarian Maelin will port you to the zones upon request.\n- Hail Jimothy the Delicious.\n- Bake \"Magically Delicious Cookies\".\n- Brew \"Magically Delicious Sweetwater\".\n- Hail Jimothy the Delicious.\n- Make a \"Jimothy's Beautiful Bouquet\" in the container provided.\n- Hail Jimothy the Delicious.\n- Hand in all three items Bemienn Grinrain in Surefall Glade.\n- NOTE: If you want the bonus reward, give the items to Maghee Thunderwood in Surefall Glade.\n--- This spawns a KOS \"Jimothy the Delicious\" - kill him for the \"Jimothy Junior\" item.\nTriggering the Task\nYou say, 'Hail, Maghee Thunderwood'\nMaghee Thunderwood sobs, barely able to speak, 'I... love him... but he... doesn't even... NOTICE meeeeeee.'\nYou say, 'Hail, Jimothy the Delicious'\nJimothy the Delicious says 'Poor Maghee. It crumbles my gingerbread heart to see her in such an unsettled state. She hasn't moved from this spot for hours, perhaps even days. I worry for her well-being. Just look at her, _____! Have you ever seen someone so broken up over a case of [unrequited love]?'\nYou say, 'Unrequited love?'\nJimothy the Delicious says 'The man she has eyes on has not returned her affections.' Jimothy pauses, dramatically wiping a bead of frosting out of his eye. 'You know, we have to do something. A romantic picnic will bring the poor, deluded dolt around for sure. And sure as I'm standing here, Surefall Glade is clearly the perfect place. So that leaves the task of cooking up a basket of delightful delicacies. Seeing as how this is a serious matter, not any delicacy will do. I've heard of a [certain recipe book]...'\nYou say, 'A certain recipe book?'\nJimothy the Delicious says 'Yes! 101 Delicious Recipes. The esteemed Maelin, head librarian of Knowledge, will know where to find it. I must stay here to comfort Maghee. If you're [half as sweet] as I am, you'll [lend a matchmaking hand].'\nYou say, 'Half as sweet?'\nJimothy the Delicious shrugs, flecks of sugar shedding from his shoulders, 'I can't help but be sweet. It's in my nature.'\nYou say, 'I'll lend a matchmaking hand...'\nJimothy the Delicious says 'Splendelicious! See to Maelin at once and ask him to retrieve 101 Delicious Recipes from the stacks. Meanwhile, I'll [stay here and comfort] Maghee.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Magically Delicious'.\nMaghee Thunderwood needs to catch the attention of the man she adores! A strange gingerbread gentleman with a sweet disposition who goes by Jimothy the Delicious has enlisted your help.\nYou say, 'You stay here and comfort her...'\nJimothy the Delicious shrugs, flecks of sugar shedding from his shoulders, 'I can't help but be sweet. It's in my nature.'\nSpeak to Grand Librarian Maelin 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nTask Window Says: Speak to Grand Librarian Maelin in the pinnacle of the Plane of Knowledge library about a book titled 101 Delicious Recipes.\nYou say, 'Hail, Grand Librarian Maelin'\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'I do know where the recipe book is and you're welcome to it. Well, you're welcome to what's left. Many of the pages have been [borrowed].'\nYou say, 'Borrowed?'\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'Unfortunately for you, many pages of the recipe book you seek have been borrowed. Over time, subsequently, they were scattered about to different realities and locales across Norrath. But fortunately for you, I know where to find them: [Dreadspire Keep], the [House of Thule Library], and [Erudin Burning]. The animated tomes in these places will have the missing pages of 101 Delicious Recipes, and they won't [give them back willingly]. I can teleport you to each of these locations; just say the word.'\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Bloodstained) 0/5 (Dreadspire Keep)\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Smudged) 0/5 (The Library)\nDefeat tomes to recover Recipe Pages (Singed) 0/5 (Erudin Burning)\nTask Window Says: Grand Librarian Maelin gave you 101 Delicious Recipes, but many pages were missing. Animated tomes in several out-of-the-way libraries have the pages and they won't give them up without a fight.\nGrand Librarian Maelin will port you to the mentioned zones if you ask him to.\nYou say, 'Send me to Dreadspire Keep'\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'Say hello to Mayong's underlings for me, and don't forget: the tomes in the library have the missing recipe pages you'll need!'\nYou port into Dreadspire Keep in front of a large door. Click on it to port over to the Keep, then head north until you come to the ballroom. The library is located east of the ballroom. Kill tomes in the library of Dreadspire until you get all five updates.\nYou say, 'Send me to the House of Thule Library'\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'There isn't a whole lot to see or do in the Thule library, so you shouldn't be distracted from your task. Don't forget: the tomes have the missing recipe pages you'll need!'\nIn The Library are several tome mobs. Kill animated books (scattered throughout the entire zone) until you've gotten five updates.\nYou say, 'Send me to Erudin Burning'\nGrand Librarian Maelin says 'Watch out for agitated erudites, and flames, and paper cuts. Mark my words, paper cuts are the worst. Don't forget: the tomes in the library have the missing recipe pages you'll need!'\nIn Erudin Burning, kill tomes (found in and around the library in the far southern part of the zone) until you've gotten your five updates.\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nTask Window Says: Jimothy the Delicious will want to see the completed 101 Delicious Recipes.\nYou say, 'Hail, Jimothy the Delicious'\nJimothy the Delicious gasps, 'You recovered the missing pages of 101 Delicious Recipes! Now let me have a look.' He rips the recipe book from your pack and flips through it excitedly. You can't help but notice how his clumsy gingerbread hands deposit crumbs between the pages. 'Yes, yes, YES. Here are two surefire candidates: cookies and a tasty tonic guaranteed to satisfy even the sweetest teeth. They will make for memorable picnic fare. I've jotted down the recipes in your journal. They won't require much skill on your part, but you will need to locate the appropriate ingredients.'\nYou have learned the recipe Magically Delicious Cookies!\nYou have learned the recipe Magically Delicious Sweetwater!\nBake Magically Delicious Cookies 0/1 (ALL)\nMagically Delicious Cookies (Baking, 15 Trivial)\n- 1x Bottle of Milk\n- 4x Cup of Sugar\n- 1x Phoenix Dough\n- 1x Butter\n- 1x Almonds\n- 1x Dried Vanilla Beans\n\"Bottle of Milk\" and \"Cup of Sugar\" are common vendor items (see Klen Ironstove in the Plane of Knowledge).\n\"Butter\", \"Almonds\", and \"Dried Vanilla Beans\" are bought from Chef Dunrun [npc=43311] in the Plane of Knowledge.\n\"Phoenix Dough\" is a Baking combine (151 Trivial) - click here for recipe.\nBrew Magically Delicious Sweetwater 0/1 (ALL)\nMagically Delicious Sweetwater (Brewing, 15 Trivial)\n- 1x Tumpy Tonic\n- 4x Cup of Sugar\n- 1x Rose Absinthe\n- 1x Vodka\nTo obtain a \"Tumpy Tonic\", either combine 1x \"Kiola Nut\" (bought from Cleonae Kalen in the Ocean of Tears) + 1x \"Water Flask\" (135 Brewing), OR hand those two items to Tumpy Irontoe in South Kaladim.\nThe \"Rose Absinthe\" is a Brewing combine (300 Trivial) - click here for recipe.\n\"Vodka\" is a Brewing combine (135 Trivial) - click here for recipe.\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nHail Jimothy the Delicious to receive \"Jimothy's Flower Vase\".\nArrange a Beautiful Bouquet 0/1 (ALL)\nBeautiful Bouquet (Non-Tradeskill)\nInside the container, combine the following items to produce \"Jimothy's Beautiful Bouquet\":\n2x \"Corn Rose\"\n2x \"Drench Flower\"\n2x \"Koraskian Sprigget\"\n2x \"Treant Flower\"\n1x \"Blood Flower\"\n\"Corn Rose\" is a ground spawn in Oceangreen Hills at 186, 762 (close to the village zoneline), with other nearby locations.\n\"Drench Flower\" is foraged in the Frontier Mountains (common) and Swamp of No Hope (uncommon).\n\"Koraskian Sprigget\" is foraged in the Rathe Council Chambers (common) and Pellucid Grotto (rare).\n\"Treant Flower\" is a common drop from treants throughout House of Thule and Veil of Alaris (The Grounds; Morell's Castle; Valley of Lunanyn; among others).\n\"Blood Flower\" is bought from Bjorak Stonefist in Kael Drakkel's arena - only confirmed from the low-level Kael in Velious (requires apprehensive+ faction with Kromzek in order to buy).\nSpeak to Jimothy the Delicious 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nGive the Beautiful Bouquet to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\nGive the Magically Delicious Cookies to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\nGive the Magically Delicious Sweetwater to Bemienn Grinrain 0/1 (Surefall Glade)\nBemienn Grinrain is found at the small bridge over the stream just inside the Surefall Glade zone-in tunnel.\nBONUS ITEM: For the bonus loot item, \"Jimothy Junior\", instead of giving these items to Bemienn Grinrain, hand them to Maghee Thunderwood (all three items at one time), who stands next to him. Maghee hands the items back, and this spawns and aggro's \"Jimothy the Delicious\", who has a lot of hitpoints. Whoever summons Jimothy (in Surefall Glade, by doing turn in) is the only person who can loot the Jimothy Junior. You can kill him to loot this bonus item.\nNOTE: Don't do the bonus item turn-in unless you're ready for the fight with Jimothy the Delicious. If you fail the fight, you won't be able to respawn him.\n250 platinum\n5 Commemorative Coins\nCommemorative Coins are used to purchase items from \"a jubilant merchant\" (click for map image), found in the northernmost tent in the neutral district (close to The Nexus portal stone).Rewards:\n- Commemorative Coin [item=116720]\n- Jimothy Junior [item=116776]\n[",
