      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 8\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nDrill Master Vygan (Warrior Guildmaster) may be found at the top Fortress Talishan. He's on Find (Ctrl+F).\nYou say, 'Hail, Drill Master Vygan'\nDrill Master Vygan says 'I am a Drill Master of the Legion of Cabilis. I have no time for idle chitchat. Be off if you were not summoned to this fortress! Find that guild which was chosen for you as an egg.'\nYou say, 'What militia pike?'\nDrill Master Vygan says 'The pike is the prime weapon of Cabilis warriors. It can be upgraded, too, such as from the partisan pike to the militia pike and beyond. All these pikes may be slung on one's back when your hands are needed for other pursuits. To upgrade a pike is something that is learned, but it can never be performed without a [geozite tool]. Do you [desire to upgrade the partisan pike]?'\nYou say, 'What geozite tool?'\nDrill Master Vygan says 'The Geozite Tool is used to sharpen the pikes of the Legion of Cabilis. Only it can produce the serrated edges necessary for these deadly weapons. They are not handed out to just any broodling. The tool is only given to warriors who serve the legion. Do you [want a geozite tool]?'\nYou say, 'I want a geozite tool.'\nDrill Master Vygan says 'Then take this satchel and go to the outer walls of Cabilis and seek out large scorpions. When you can fill and combine the satchel with scorpion pincers, then you shall prove to me that you are truly a warrior and I shall send you off on your true test.'\nYou receive a 2-slot Pincer Satchel [item=38119].  Kill a large scorpion [npc=4199] in the center of the Field of Bone to loot 2 Large Scorpion Pincer [item=2969].  Combine the 2 pincers in the satchel:\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Full Pincer Satchel [item=38120].\nBring this back to Drill Master Vygan.\nDrill Master Vygan says 'You are a true warrior of Cabilis. You obviously are aware that in order to upgrade your pike you shall need a [geozite tool]. Take this note to the Lord of the outer gates. He desires a young warrior for a small task. Do this and he is instructed to reward you with the tool.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 10 copper from Drill Master Vygan.\nYou receive 1 gold from Drill Master Vygan.\nYou have completed achievement: Cabilis Quests - Geozite Tool\nYou then receive a random Note to Iksar Lord to be delivered to one of three warlords.  Each warlord gives you a subquest to complete to receive your Geozite Tool.\n- Warlord Hikyg [npc=4090] in the Swamp of No Hope gives the quest to collect Busted Froglok Slave Shackles.\n- Warlord Zyzz [npc=4218] in the Field of Bone gives the quest to collect charred bones.\n- Warlord Vyzer [npc=4392] in Warslik Woods to collect stolen pages.\nTheir respective notes identify as \"Note to Lord Hikyg,\" and \"Note to Lord Vyzer,\" and \"Note to Lord Zyzz.\"\nWarlord Hikyg\nDetails needed.\nYou receive an 8-slot Slave Shackle Bag.  Fill it with Busted Froglok Slave Shackles and combine to form a Filled Slaved Shackle Bag.  Give this to Hikyg.\nWarlord Hikyg says, 'Good work, _____. You would make a fine trooper in my garrison. As instructed by the War Baron, I reward you with the geozite tool. May you find your place among the Legion of Cabilis and win many battles.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders of Greenmist has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 2.\nYou gain experience!\nYou receive 1 gold from Warlord Hikyg.\nWarlord Zyzz\nWarlord Zyzz says 'Ah!! Good to have you on board. We lack strong young recruits such as yourself. Take this box. Your task is to seek milita skeletons near this gate. Apparently, someone or something has been raising militia corpses and they now walk the land not knowing the difference between friend or foe. They even continue using their old call, 'Halt Who goes there?'. Fill and combine within the box their charred bone shards and return the filled box to me for your geozite tool.'\nYou receive a 4-slot Charred Bone Box [item=5397].  Fill it with Charred Bone Shards [item=5370] dropped by a militia skeleton [npc=4200] that roams the area south/southeast of the path to Cabilis, and combine to form a Full Charred Bone Box [item=64640].  Give this to Warlord Zyzz for your reward:\nWarlord Zyzz says 'Very fine work, young _____. You will make a fine trooper, should you survive long enough. As promised, here is your geozite tool. Be sure to visit the legion weaponsmith to learn how to use it. Farewell.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis got better.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents got better.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics got better.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist got better.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails got better.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 1 gold from Warlord Zyzz.\nWarlord Vyzer\nWarlord Vyzer may be found at -1852, -894, +307, on the balcony of building in Warsliks Woods, just outside West Cabilis.\nYou say, 'Hail, Warlord Vyzer'\nWarlord Vyzer says 'Greetings, small one! You should not waste your time in the safety of the troopers' patrols. Go forth into the land and earn your stripes in battle. Become a greater asset to the Iksar empire.'\nGive him the note.\nWarlord Vyzer says 'I am glad to see they have sent a strong new recruit. I have a task for you which will require you to recover a few pages of a certain poem I once wrote. I never should have written of such weak-minded things, but the pages were stolen from me before I could destroy them. Take this poem binder and find the [thieves]. When you combine the pages in the binder, it will magically lock and you may return it to me for your prize, the geozite tool.'\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive a Book Binder, a 4-slot container (identifies as \"Binder for Love Poem\").  Kill \"a goblin thief,\" who may be found mostly between the succor point (-1430, -465) and the goblin pond (-2180, 900).\nYou have slain a goblin thief!\n--You have looted a A Page of A Poem.--\nLoot four different LORE versions of A Page of a Poem (they identify as \"Page One of Love Poem,\" \"Page Two of Love Poem,\" \"Page Three of Love Poem,\" and \"Page One of Love Poem,\" respectively.\nPage 1 reads:\nTo my dear sweet Kyg Why did we part Why did you go Now I am all alone Feeling all low.\nPage 2 reads:\nMy heart is in ruin My heart is not whole I miss the sweet loving warmth and the way that we hold\nPage 3 reads:\nI miss the picnics in the ruins the way that you smile I miss that all now that life is so vile\nPage 4 reads:\nSo listen to my plea It is heartfelt and quite big Let us get back together So hurry up and dump that zero. Hikyg.\nCombine the four pages in the binder:\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: magically locked poem.\nIt identifies as \"Love Poem by Lord Vyzer.\"  Give it to Warlord Vyzer.\nWarlord Vyzer says 'Great work!! You have saved me from disgrace. I reward you with the geozite tool. You may find its purpose within Cabils' warriors guild. A true Iksar warrior should always have one.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders Of Greenmist has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 1 gold from Warlord Vyzer.\nYou receive the Geozite Tool.\nNeed all dialogues, missing faction hits if any, /loc of quest mobs, in-game names of missing items, etc.\nSubmitted by: MuseRewards:\n- Geozite Tool [item=3257]\n[",
