      walkthrough = "**Time:** 5 hours\n**Level:** 20\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou get this after completing the goblin raider quest.  The captain now wants you to hunt goblin battlemasters.  They sometimes drop Goblin Bracers.  Bring him 4 of these and you will receive a random piece of Faydark Ringmail Armor, which has the same AC as ringmail/chainmail, plus stat modifiers.\nNeed all dialogues, /loc of Captain Keatar, current faction hits if any, list of quest rewards.Rewards:\n- Faydark Ringmail Boots [item=4825]\n- Faydark Ringmail Bracer [item=4885]\n- Faydark Ringmail Coat [item=5084]\n- Faydark Ringmail Coif [item=1462]\n- Faydark Ringmail Collar [item=4842]\n- Faydark Ringmail Gloves [item=5060]\n- Faydark Ringmail Mantle [item=5083]\n- Faydark Ringmail Pants [item=1307]\n- Faydark Ringmail Skirt [item=4874]\n- Faydark Ringmail Sleeves [item=5061]\n[",
