      walkthrough = "**Level:** 3\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'Hail, The Toilmaster'\nThe Toilmaster says 'Do not bother me unless you wish to join the chain gang. Now go away or I shall have my slaves chop you as they chop this granite!'\nYou say, 'I need granite pebbles.'\nThe Toilmaster says 'Ah. Looking for granite pebbles, are we? You must be a Swifttail. I am tired of doing your caste's work when you give nothing in return. Tell you what, I have lost many slaves to escape. If you bash their heads in with your many skills and return at least two busted froglok shackles I will give you one pile of granite pebbles.'\nBusted Froglok Slave Shackles [item=2774] drop from escaped frogloks [npc=5135] and escaped froglok slaves [npc=4227] in the Swamp of No Hope [zone=74].  Hand him two Busted Froglok Slave Shackles.\nThe Toilmaster says 'A deal is a deal. Here is one pile of granite pebbles. I hope you need more because I know there are more escaped froglok slaves.'\nYour faction standing with Legion of Cabilis has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Cabilis Residents has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Scaled Mystics has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Crusaders of Greenmist has been adjusted by 1.\nYour faction standing with Swift Tails has been adjusted by 1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive 12 copper from The Toilmaster.\nYou receive Pile of Granite Pebbles [item=3243] used for crafting Iksar Monk newbie armor.Submitted by: MuseRewards:\n- Pile of Granite Pebbles [item=3243]\n[",
