      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 130\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nSarth Scarscale is located in Cabilis East, inside the Temple of Terror, in the basement of the east tower, at /waypoint +1010, -260, -26\nYou say, 'Hail, Sarth Scarscale'\nSarth Scarscale hisses at you loudly. 'So, you [bear the mantle of a crusader], yes? I am known as Sarth and shall reward you, provided you prove your worthiness to our cause, child of Rile.'\nYou say, 'bear the mantle of a crusader'\nSarth Scarscale says, 'We shall see if you are worthy of that. I shall make [armor] for you, to aid you in your service to our Father. I specialize in the forging of [bracers], [greaves], [masks], and [breastplates]. Sirtha makes the other items of armor. Take care when you address her, hatchling, it would not be the first time a hatchling has left here with scars.'\nYou say, 'greaves'\nSarth Scarscale says, 'Do you know the beasts that call themselves sarnaks? One such beast who calls itself Zorash attacked an envoy of merchants who were to deliver a pair of special boots to me. It taunts us by wearing them as a trophy. Bring them back and the skull of Grachnist, his goblin ally. Return them to me along with a star ruby and your banded greaves, and I shall craft you an excellent pair of greaves.'\nBuy a Star Ruby from a jewelcrafting supplies merchant. Rumor has it that there is a shop in Cabilis East.\nCraft or buy Banded Leggings (Blacksmithing, 108 trivial).\nHead to The Overthere, kill Zorash and loot his boots. He can spawn in any of the Sarnak camps.\nYou receive Boots of Zorash.\nMove to the Warsliks Woods, kill Grachnist the Destroyer and loot his head. He spawns in the goblin-infested ruins including the fort. All static goblins are placeholders.\nYou receive Grachnist's Head.\nReturn to the Temple of Terror in Cabilis East and give Sarth Scarscale the Star Ruby, the Banded Leggings, the Boots of Zorash and Grachnist's Head.\nMissing dialogue\nYou receive Dreadscale Greaves.\nSubmitted by: Revamped by iventheassassinRewards:\n- Dreadscale Greaves [item=3622]\n[",
