      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n\nArgash in Thurgadin offers a series of quests for rangers to obtain a set of Runed Scout's Armor. He can be found around location -203, -298.\nYou must be at least KINDLY with Coldain in order to complete these quests.\nYou say, 'Hail, Argash'\nArgash says, 'Greetin's, (playername), you look like a (playerrace) who knows the value of a good bow when ye see one. I'll let ye in on a li'l secret, the bow is the greatest of all weapons as it allows you to inflict maximum punishment on yer foes with minimum risk. How can ye possibly go wrong? Or better yet, if'n ye be a ranger, I can see my way clear to making you a coif, tunic, sleeves, bracer, gauntlets, leggings, or boots that I'm sure ye would enjoy.'\nCorroded Armor molds drop from giants in the Kael Arena. Gems can be found on a variety of different creatures throughout velious with some, such as diamonds, coming from higher level creatures.\nQUICK LIST\nBracer - 3x Crushed Flame Emerald + Corroded Chain Bracer\nBoots - 3x Crushed Black Marble + Corroded Chain Boots\nArms - 3x Flawed Emerald + Corroded Chain Sleeves\nGloves - 3x Crushed Topaz + Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nHelm - 3x Crushed Coral + Corroded Chain Coif\nLegs - 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire + Corroded Chain Leggings\nChest - 3x Flawless Diamond + Corroded Chain Tunic\nBracer\nYou say, 'bracers'\nArgash says, 'For the bracers, I will require a corroded chain bracer as well as three crushed flame emeralds.  Return to me when you find such things, (playername).'\nGive Argash 3x Crushed Flame Emerald and a Corroded Chain Bracer\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Bracer\nBoots\nYou say, 'boots'\nArgash says, 'We use our feet so often, should not they be protected as well as any other portion of our bodies?  If you seek fine protection for your feet, return to me with three pieces of crushed black marble and a set of corroded chain boots.'\nGive Argash 3x Crushed Black Marble and a Corroded Chain Boots\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Boots\nArms\nYou say, 'sleeves'\nArgash says, 'Protection for your arms will come at the price of three flawed emeralds and a set of corroded chain sleeves.'\nGive Argash 3x Flawed Emerald and a Corroded Chain Sleeves\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Vambraces\nGloves\nYou say, 'gauntlets'\nArgash says, 'Protecting your hands is very important.  I can forge protection for your hands if you bring me a pair of corroded chain gauntlets and three crushed topaz.'\nGive Argash 3x Crushed Topaz and a Corroded Chain Gauntlets\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Gauntlets\nHelm\nYou say, 'coif'\nArgash says, 'To create a piece of armor to protect your sensitive skull. I will require three pieces of crushed coral as well as a corroded chain coif.'\nGive Argash 3x Crushed Coral and an Corroded Chain Coif\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Helm\nLegs\nYou say, 'leggings'\nArgash says, 'A set of corroded chain leggings might be salvageable if you were to find three flawed sea sapphires.  With the right techniques and ingredients almost anything is possible.'\nGive Argash 3x Flawed Sea Sapphire and a Corroded Chain Leggings\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Greaves\nChest\nYou say, 'tunic'\nArgash says, 'To forge a spectacular chain tunic I will require three flawless diamonds and a corroded chain tunic.  With the gems and my skills I may be able to draw out some of its magical powers.'\nGive Argash 3x Flawless Diamond and a Corroded Chain Tunic\nArgash smiles warmly as he hands you your reward.\nArgash says 'You have done well.'\nYou receive: Runed Scout's Breastplate\nSubmitted by: BobbybickRewards:\n- Runed Scout's Boots [item=4283]\n- Runed Scout's Bracer [item=4476]\n- Runed Scout's Breastplate [item=4928]\n- Runed Scout's Gauntlets [item=4699]\n- Runed Scout's Greaves [item=5063]\n- Runed Scout's Helm [item=4713]\n- Runed Scout's Vambraces [item=4371]\n[",
