        { name = "Kromzek", change = -1 },
        { name = "Kromrif", change = -5 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 35\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThe Coldain Shawl quest begins with Loremaster Borannin [npc=5958] in Thurgadin. He's found near the Paladin guild at /way -305,+815.\nYou say, 'Hail, Loremaster Borannin'\nLoremaster Borannin says 'Greetings, _____, please be seated and hear the Grand Historian, he is among the wisest of our people.'\nYou say, 'I seek to perform duties for the crown.'\nLoremaster Borannin says 'Those eager to prove their loyalty to the Dain may do so by completing tasks that I have been commissioned to assign. If you wish to begin your service, return to me with four toes of our enemy, the Kromrif.'\nBring him four Frost Giant Toes [item=4047] (common drop from Kromrif giants). Upon turn-in:\nLoremaster Borannin says 'Ahh, well done! On behalf of the Dain I thank you for making a dent in the number of our sworn enemy. Please accept this as a token of our appreciation. It is trivial, I know, but if you are as loyal as you claim to be, it will increase in power over time. It just so happens I have a [task] to further demonstrate your loyalty, ______.'\nYour faction standing with Coldain has been adjusted by 10.\nYour faction standing with Dain Frostreaver IV has been adjusted by 2.\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by -1.\nYour faction standing with Kromrif has been adjusted by -5.\nYou gain experience!!\nThis leads into the second Coldain Shawl quest : Coldain Shawl #2: Cloth Coldain Prayer Shawl [quest=978].Submitted by: Hippen MuffinstufferRewards:\n- Burlap Coldain Prayer Shawl [item=4048]\n[",
