      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nThis quest begins with Bloogy Shellcracker in Cobalt Scar (location 187.25, -1507.34, 77.76 on upper edge of coast).\nYou say, 'Hail, Bloogy Shellcracker'\nBloogy Shellcracker says, 'Hello, strange one. I am Bloogy Shellcracker, the preparer of meals for my people. I am not familiar with the culinary tastes of your kind but you are welcome to purchase some of my supplies. I will also barter for ingredients to some of my exotic dishes.'\nYou say, 'What ingredients?'\nBloogy Shellcracker says 'The rarest treat I can prepare for my people is saucy salted seadragon steak. I wish to barter for some water dragon meat, saltwater seaweed, and fish eggs. The rest of the ingredients are collected locally by our collectors.\nYou need one Water Dragon Meat. Water Dragon Meat (dropped by Kelorek`Dar, Lord Koi`Doken, or Faydedar) will suffice.\nSaltwater seaweed is fished in Ocean of Tears or Timorous Deep. You need one of these.\nFish eggs are made by combining,\n1 X Thunder Salmon or Greengill Salmon or Evergreen Salmon\n1 X Skinning Knife\nin a Tackle Box (Skill: Fishing, Trivial: 135)\nYields:\n2 X Fish Eggs\n2 X Fish Scales\nGive 1 Water Dragon Meat, 1 Fish Eggs and 1 Saltwater Seaweed to Bloogy Shellcracker.\nBloogy Shellcracker says 'It has been many moons since my people have feasted on this rarest of meat. Take this totem crafted in the form of our oceanlord Prexus and inscribed with the runes of our people. may the oceans watch over you, _____'\nYour faction standing with Othmir got better.\nYour faction standing with Ulthork got worse.\nReward:\nOthmir Prexus TotemRewards:\n- Othmir Prexus Totem [item=5616]\n[",
