      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 3 hours\n**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nYou say, 'hail Wenglawks Kkeak'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Greetings, Kabal , I have heard of you.  My name is Wenglawks Kkeak.  Welcome to my humble home.  My sources tell me you are a mercenary.  Is this true?\nYou say, 'I am a mercenary'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Well then, I suppose you might be looking for work.  Are you?\nYou say, 'I am looking for work'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'I have been looking for a few good people to deliver goods for me.  I have several deliveries to clients which must be made soon.  My last delivery person ended up dead, unfortunately.\nYou say, 'I will deliver goods for you'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Wonderful, Kabal .  Take this note to Kellek and he will give you the tools.\nGive the note to Kellek in the next room and he gives you a Coldain Toolset. Take the toolset to Sojon in Iceclad (Gnome Igloos). Fatties will need an Ant Potion in order to enter the igloo or get someone to pull Sojon outside.  Sojon will give you a receipt for Wenglawks that when returned will yield the Engraved Bone Pauldrons.\nThere are no faction effects for this quest.\nNeed all dialogues (these are transcriptions), /loc of quest mobs, quest items required.Submitted by: Kabal UDLRewards:\n- Engraved Bone Pauldrons [item=4207]\n[",
