      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "**Time:** 10 hours\n**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\n/loc of Wenglawks Kkeak?  Minimum faction required to get quest?\nYou say, 'Hail, Wenglawks Kkeak'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Greetings, I have heard of you.  My name is Wenglawks Kkeak. Welcome to my humble home. My sources tell me you are a mercenary. Is this true?'\nYou say, 'I am a mercenary.'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Well then, I suppose you might be looking for work. Are you?'\nYou say, 'I am looking for work.'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'I have been looking for a few good people to deliver goods for me. I have several deliveries to clients which must be made soon. My last delivery person ended up dead, unfortunately.'\nYou say, 'Dead?'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Yes, I do not know who did it, as there is not much competition in this city for trade. He was found stabbed in the back and gutted, just outside the city.'\nYou say, 'I will deliver goods for you.'\nThis no longer works.  What response currently works?\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'Are you sure you will be up to this journey? It will take a hardened person to survive the trip. Let alone find my client. Do you really want to go out into the dangerous lands in the west?'\nYou say, 'You can trust me.'\nWenglawks Kkeak says 'I will curse your immortal soul if you fail. In the depths of the icy waters of the cobalt scar lives an outcast siren who preys upon her own kind. We have a deal, I will provide her with an excellent hunting net and she will provide me with a giant cloak made of the scales of her kind. Take this voucher to Kellek and deliver the net. Do whatever it takes to get my cloak.'\nGive the note to Kellek in the next room and he gives you a Mechanical Net. Take that net to the outcast siren in Cobalt Scar and she will give you an idol.  She then asks you to find her three excellent siren scales (very rare drops from any siren). Return the idol and the three scales to her and she will give you back a cloak.\nTake this cloak back to Wenglawk and he will reward you with a very nice container.\nNeed all dialogues (these are transcriptions), current faction hits, /loc of other mobs, missing quest items.Submitted by: Kabal UDLRewards:\n- Wenglawks Manly Purse [item=4590]\n[",
