      walkthrough = "**Level:** 27\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nErgrez Shortpaw may be found at 1071.65, 2417.22, 35.11.\nErgrez Shortpaw makes armor for his village and is willing to make some for you if you bring him twice what it takes to make the armor.  Each piece seems to take a combination of two animal pelts and two of some other item.\nI don't yet know the combinations or the rewards.  If you discover one and find out the reward, please hit the send a correction button and e-mail in the combination and the reward.\nOnce I know the reward, I will split off each piece into its own quest description.\nThese are the ones I think are valid so far:\n- Low Quality Cougar Fur and Fatty Walrus Meat\n- Medium Quality Cougar Fur and Cutting Shells\n- Dire Wolf Fur and Dark Bindings\nThis one I know the result of:\n- High Quality Cougar Fur and Mammoth Meat -- See the quest Cougarskin Mask under Iceclad Ocean Quests.\nNeed /loc of quest mob, all dialogues, faction hits if any, quest items involved, rewards, etc.Submitted by: Lexandra PathfinderRewards:\n[",
