      walkthrough = "**Level:** 50\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler may be found at -805, -400, +76.\nYou say, 'Hail, Qarrgy Scallopgobbler'\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler sets down several large crustacean shells covered in foreign runes, then extends his large, coarse hands in a gesture of friendship. 'I am pleased to see friendly visitors to our villages. I am the head craftsman of the village. The crustacean shell armor worn by the warriors of our village was crafted by me and by my apprentices. I will craft other materials as well when they are available.'\nYou say, 'What other materials?'\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler says 'I am able to craft dragon scale armor but it has been a long time since I have had the opportunity to do so for my people. What kind of scales do you wish for me to craft?'\nYou say, 'Emerald Dragon Scales.'\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler says 'I will craft an emerald dragonscale tunic for emerald dragon scales, ulthork tusks, and an unstained fine plate breastplate.'\nEmerald Dragon Scales drop from Wuoshi in the Wakening Land.  Ulthork Tusks drop from various ulthorks in Siren's Grotto and Eastern Wastes.  The unstained Fine Plate Breastplate is crafted.  Hand in the three items:\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler says 'I'm sorry strange one. That is not a sufficient barter.'\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler says 'I'm sorry strange one. That is not a sufficient barter.'\nQarrgy Scallopgobbler skillfully crafts the Emerald Dragon Scales into a tunic then hands it to ______ and claps enthusiastically.\nYour faction standing with Othmir has been adjusted by 5.\nYour faction standing with Ulthork has been adjusted by -1.\nYou gain experience!!\nYou receive an Emerald Dragonscale Tunic.Submitted by: new write-up by TemperanceRewards:\n- Emerald Dragonscale Tunic [item=4204]\n[",
