      factions = {
        { name = "Claws of Veeshan", change = 15 },
        { name = "Yelinak", change = 3 },
        { name = "Kromzek", change = -7 },
      },
      walkthrough = "**Level:** 45\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nNote: You can do turn-ins for this quest as low as dubious (he just won't talk to you).\nFind Lieutenant Milven at the zone in from WL, go through the first gate, turn right, go up the stairs, he's right there.\nYou say, 'Hail, Lieutenant Milven'\nLieutenant Milven says 'Hmm, the guards at the gate sent a _____ to assist with the rampant problems? They shall have to be replaced with functional sentries so this does not occur again, but that is another matter for later.'\nYou say, 'What rampant problems?'\nLieutenant Milven says 'I trust that what is said here will not be repeated to outsiders, yes? Good. For some time now, we've been fortifying our position in the shrine to fend off giant attacks as they come. Though there hasn't been a major engagement between the shrine and the giants for quite some time, there have been strafing runs done by them in an attempt to test us. If you're up for it, I have a mission I need someone new to the shrine to complete.'\nYou say, 'What mission?'\nLieutenant Milven says 'We've been looking for someone that isn't from the shrine to find some of the giants that have been on these strafing runs and have them eliminated. You're of the perfect ilk because they will not recognize you as a friend to the shrine. Once you pry their steel-plated helms from their cold, dead heads and bring them back to me, your worth will be proven and you may show promise as an ally to the shrine.'\nUpon turning in a Giant Warrior Helmet:\nLieutenant Milven says 'Well done, _____. You are proving to be worth the risk of sending a new recruit out on a mission such as this. If you feel this is the type of mission you're best suited for, feel free to slay more of these beasts and return their helmets to me. The fewer giants there are out there, the less chance they can continue their random attacks against us. I also may have another assignment for you if you're interested.'\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan has been adjusted by 15.\nYour faction standing with Yelinak has been adjusted by 3.\nYour faction standing with Kromzek has been adjusted by -7.\nYou gain experience!!Submitted by: Neathon InamortoRewards:\n- Faction\n[",
