      walkthrough = "**Level:** 55\n**Maximum Level:** 125\n**Monster Mission:** No\n**Repeatable:** Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** No\n**Quest Type:** Quest\n**Group Size:** Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** 1\n**Max. # of Players:** 1\n\nTelkorenar is at /loc -1350, -182 in the western halls of the Temple of Veeshan.\nYou say, 'Hail, Telkorenar'\nTelkorenar says 'The strong seek me out, for one reason or another. It seems you have come here in peace. Perhaps you wish to prove yourself a mighty fighter? I respect only might, ______.'\nYou say, 'How can I prove my strength?'\nTelkorenar says 'For the mighty I have four tests. The test of the tooth, the test of the flame, the test of the fire storm and the test of protection. Which test do you wish to undertake?'\nYou say, 'What test of the fire storm?'\nTelkorenar says, 'Become like a fire storm and bring your wrath upon the inhabitants of the halls of testing. Return when you have the tear of poison and the serrated tear along with the a symbol kissed by flames and a ruby symbol.'\nAfter handing Telkorenar a Ruby Symbol, a Flame Kissed Symbol, a Poison Tear and a Serrated Tear:\nTelkorenar says 'You have done well, ______. You have proven that you are strong, but do you dare enter those halls again?'\nYour faction standing with Claws of Veeshan could not possibly get any better.\nYour faction standing with Yelinak could not possible get any better.\nYour faction standing with Kromzek could not possibly get any worse.\nYou gain experience!!\nSubmitted by: AyamaRewards:\n- Cloak of the Fire Storm [item=6311]\n[",
